window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4801,"title":"Chapter 4801 Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes","paragraphs":["4801 Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes","Chen Qing was horrified and almost opened his mouth subconsciously, but Jian Wushuang covered his mouth with his hand.","“Don’t make a sound.”","Cheng Qing nodded and did not dare to make a sound.","The wine pot that Yang Jun kept was filled with wine. After fighting for so long, there was still more than half of it left.","Yang Jun removed the cork and drank to his heart’s content with the other three Emperors.","Di Qing woke up from his coma. When he saw the four Emperors drinking, he was shocked and quickly moved to Jian Wushuang.","“Hurry, let’s go!” Di Qing said in a low voice, his eyes full of panic.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Although Emperor Liu Ya and Emperor Yang Jun were old acquaintances, it did not mean that they were safe.","After all, they were the ones who first had the idea of entering the Heavenly Court to search for treasures. It was already very fortunate that they could safely withdraw now.","Immediately, the five figures prepared to leave the Heavenly Court while the four Emperors were drinking.","“Stop there.” Emperor Liu Ya’s eyes shot out a cold glint. “You want to leave just like that after coveting the people of my Heavenly Court?”","Cold sweat trickled down from everyone’s temples. The pressure from the Emperor was too vast, making them feel like they had fallen into an ice cave.","“Liu Ya, you can kill them, but not that Little Friend,” after taking a big gulp of wine, Yang Jun pointed at Jian Wushuang and said.","“Why?” Emperor Liu Ya asked.","“It’s because that Little Friend has an affinity with us and bears great responsibilities,” Yang Jun said mysteriously.","Emperor Liu Ya did not refute him. He looked away from Jian Wushuang and at Di Qing, Chen Qing, and the others.","At that moment, they all looked at Jian Wushuang in the face of death.","“Senior, you can’t kill any of them.”","Just as Emperor Liu Ya was about to attack, Jian Wushuang’s calm voice was heard and he stood up slowly.","He had lost an arm and had not fully recovered. His body was shaking, and his face was pale.","“We’ve been hunted down by the outside world before, and we accidentally entered the Heavenly Court by chance. We didn’t come here on purpose to covet it. Besides, we didn’t do anything to harm the Heavenly Court. It’s too unreasonable to kill us just like that.”","In the hall, only Jian Wushuang’s calm voice echoed.","When Emperor Liu Ya heard this, he laughed coldly. “If he doesn’t have any coveting thoughts, then why did he touch my True Body?”","“I, I...” Di Qing looked at Jian Wushuang for help as if he had fallen into an ice cave.","He frowned slightly and quickly thought of countermeasures in his mind.","After a while, Jian Wushuang raised his head and said, “Senior, it was indeed our fault. We wanted to see the Emperor’s real face, but we couldn’t help but touch the Emperor’s True Body. We are guilty.”","At this point, he turned to Di Qing and said calmly, “Di Qing, cut off an arm.”","Di Qing was stunned at first, but then he nodded without any hesitation.","This was the way out of death that Jian Wushuang had found for him. At the price of one arm, he could exchange it for a way out.","He did not hesitate to swing his palm at his arm, but he soon realized that he could not cut it down at all.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank when he saw that. It meant that Emperor Liu Ya did not intend to let them live!","Emperor Liu Ya who was suspended in the air snorted coldly, “You want to settle this matter with just one arm?”","From Emperor Liu Ya’s cold tone, it was obvious that he was not going to let them go. However, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were calm and he said, “Yes, just one arm.”","Whoosh!","An unparalleled Emperor’s pressure swept out and almost crushed them into dust in an instant.","Then, Emperor Liu Ya raised his arm and dragged Jian Wushuang up in the air.","The indescribable feeling of suffocation brought him close to death.","“You’re not afraid of me?” Emperor Liu Ya’s emotionless voice resounded.","Jian Wushuang looked straight at him and said in a hoarse voice, “I’m afraid, but nothing can be solved by fear. Instead of being afraid, it’s better to find the best solution.”","The Heavenly Court was deathly silent, so silent that one could hear the sound of breathing.","After an unknown period of time, the stone-like Emperor Liu Ya moved. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “This kid is not bad. I have my eyes on him.”","The three Imperial Emperors looked at each other and pouted. “Don’t give me that. We’ve even a liking to him before you.”","“Stop bullsh*tting. You guys can’t even save yourselves. What help can you give him?” Emperor Liu Ya’s face was filled with disdain. He then looked at Jian Wushuang.","“You’re just to my liking, Kid. I want to give you a great opportunity.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was a little dizzy, but he reacted immediately and shook his head, “I’m not talented enough... I’m afraid I can’t take it. It’s best to forget it...”","The atmosphere froze. Everyone was shocked, even the three Emperors.","An Emperor, even if it was the obsession of an Emperor, would personally give an opportunity that was enough to plunge countless Heavenly Regions into chaos and countless Grand Yan Immortals into madness. It was a supreme and unattainable existence.","But now, he was actually rejected!","Everyone was puzzled, but Jian Wushuang was thinking about it. There was no such thing as an opportunity without a reason. If one wanted to get it, he had to pay a corresponding price.","If he were to receive the great opportunity from Emperor Liu Ya, there would definitely be a corresponding trust waiting for him.","Emperor Liu Ya was stunned when he heard his rejection. However, he immediately shouted angrily, “You don’t know how to appreciate my kindness. You have to agree to it today even if you don’t want to!”","With that, his virtual shadow suddenly dimmed. Then, countless wisps of dark green brilliance surged out from his body and directly entered Jian Wushuang’s body.","The Heavenly Court trembled and was collapsing rapidly.","“Listen up, Kid. My last obsession is about to be completely destroyed. The great opportunity I’m giving you is not something that ordinary people can endure or sense.”","“Now, I’ll give you my final obsession and Comprehension. Try to Comprehend it well.”","Emperor Liu Ya’s final obsession was collapsing and dissipating. He looked at Jian Wushuang with his golden eyes. “If you reach that point, don’t forget to stab old man Zhen Wuyang for me. Consider that my ask.”","“Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes can be comprehended and used, but it can’t be used according to my path.”","Jian Wushuang could no longer speak. It was as if a heat that could even burn his divine soul was exploding in every cell of his.","Strands of irresistible external force poured into his body, leaving indelible marks in his mind and divine sense.","His broken arm was growing rapidly with the terrifying force.","The five dark green words ‘Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes’ turned into a secret pattern. Along with the momentum, it carried the aura of the ancient Emperor and lit up in Jian Wushuang’s divine sense."]},{"number":4802,"title":"Chapter 4802 An Enemy Sneaks In","paragraphs":["4802 An Enemy Sneaks In","This was the Supreme Enlightenment of the Emperor. No one knew how powerful these runes would be.","However, the word ‘Emperor’ was enough.","An Emperor represented the supreme, and the Emperor’s Comprehension was naturally supreme.","As the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes continued to flow into Jian Wushuang’s mind, he gradually became clear and understood some truths, especially his understanding of the cultivation realm.","He knew that in the Great Yan Domain, the Yan Immortal had the meaning of transcendence, and above the Yan Immortal was the so-called Grand Yan Immortal realm.","However, if one wanted to enter the Grand Yan Immortal realm, one had to comprehend the Immortal Style in the Grand Yan Immortal realm.","The so-called Immortal Style was equivalent to a bridge, and once the construction was completed, it would lead to the Grand Yan Immortal.","After entering the Grand Yan Immortal stage, it was further divided into three small realms, which were the Three Revolutions, Five Revolutions, and Nine Revolutions.","Of course, what shocked Jian Wushuang the most was that the Emperor was also in the Grand Yan Immortal realm!","The extremely mysterious Emperor who controlled thousands of Heavenly Regions did not exceed the Grand Yan Immortal realm. This was something that Jian Wushuang had not expected.","Each of Grand Yan Immortal’s three transcendent Revolutions was a heavenly chasm.","A Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could use Immortal Styles proficiently, while a Five Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal carried the Yan power light wheel and completely crushed any Grand Yan Immortal below Five Revolutions.","Above Five Revolutions was Nine Revolutions, which was golden crow Di Qing’s current cultivation realm, his strength was unfathomable.","After obtaining Emperor Liu Ya’s comprehension and obsession, Jian Wushuang knew about the Emperor’s fate energy and that the Emperor’s power was at the peak the Grand Yan Immortal realm.","Even though the Emperor had not transcended the Grand Yan Immortal realm, he was clearly a different existence from the regular Grand Yan Immortal.","Even Di Qing, who was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, could only bow down in the face of the Emperor Liu Ya’s obsession.","In the end, it all came down to the existence of the Emperor’s fate energy.","An Emperor was a title, the condensation of the common fate energy of countless Heavenly Regions. It had endless changes and had long exceeded the scope of the Grand Yan Immortal, but they were still within the cultivation realm of a Grand Yan Immortal.","In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, Grand Yan Immortal was the peak of all realms, and Emperor was the peak of that.","After clearing up the problem between the cultivation realms, Jian Wushuang understood. At the same time, he no longer resisted the opportunities and obsessions that Emperor Liu Ya Lord had given him.","“My request isn’t too much. Even if you don’t want to be enemies with Zhen Wuyang in the future, you can live on with my understanding and open up a territory in the Great Yan Domain.”","As the last comprehension was teleported away, the lingering will of Emperor Liu Ya’s apparition was extremely dim and could dissipate at any moment.","Jian Wushuang looked at the emotionless Emperor and bowed. “I will.”","Emperor Liu Ya’s obsession finally dissipated completely. On his deathbed, he left behind one last curse for Zhen Wuyang’s entire family.","He wanted the Emperor’s death.","After that, everything was silent.","Perhaps he had died dozens of years ago, and it was because of his obsession that he had been able to hold on until today.","The three Emperors seemed to be indifferent to the death of their old friend. They poured all the wine in their wine gourds into the Heavenly Court to comfort themselves.","Endless life, countless bloody battles, and their brothers and friends had long passed away. They had all experienced it and were sure that one day in the future, they would follow in their footsteps, so there was no need to be pretentious.","The entire Heavenly Court was silent, as calm as it was before they arrived.","The three Emperors’ True Shadows smiled at him, then they turned invisible and returned to the Boyang Bottle.","Slowly exhaling a mouthful of turbid breath, Jian Wushuang fell from the sky and sat on the ground as if he had collapsed.","Cheng Qing quickly came over, the excitement on his face could not be concealed, ” Brother Jian, your future cultivation path can be considered to be without worry! That was a personal gift from the Emperor!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile. The words Emperor Liu Ya were still ringing in his ears.","The Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes could be Comprehended and used, but it would definitely not be able to follow his path.","This was a comprehension that belonged to an Emperor. If he were to use it in the future, it would definitely affect his mind. This was also why Emperor Liu Ya had said those words.","Jian Wushuang knew the stakes, so he did not intend to Comprehend it at the moment.","The right arm that he had condensed was already intact, but if one looked closely, under the skin of the entire arm, a dark blue bird-like totem was drawn by the meridians, and it quickly disappeared.","This scene in the Heavenly Court completely shocked them, especially Di Qing, who still could not believe it.","However, soon, he came back to his senses and looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression, “Thank you for what you did just now.”","“No need to thank me. I’ve already repaid your kindness.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Di Qing was slightly stunned, but he soon understood that the kindness he was talking about was that he had stopped Emperor Liu Ya’s obsession at the most critical moment, giving Jian Wushuang a chance to escape.","Di Qing smiled embarrassedly and then said no more.","Jian Wushuang also did not say anything more. Di Qing had changed a lot from his initial resentment, vigilance, indifference, and today’s talk.","Just from the scene that had happened at the critical moment, Jian Wushuang felt that this guy was not as bad and untouchable as he had thought.","He should be able to try to befriend him.","After sorting out this relationship, he turned his attention to Heavenly Court.","Now that the obsession of Emperor Liu Ya, who was in charge of the Heavenly Court, had dissipated, the entire Heavenly Court had truly become an ownerless object.","Just as Cheng Qing and the others were about to make a move, a series of bell-like voices rang out outside the Heavenly Court.","“Trespassers of the heavenly court shall die!”","That familiar voice came from the three Immortal bone guards in front of the heavenly court.","Jian Wushuang immediately became alert.","Cheng Qing immediately frowned and said, “It can’t be. We haven’t been in here for long, and someone has already discovered this place? Could it be that some random Yan Immortals accidentally barged into this place?”","Very quickly, a large amount of aftershocks from Yan power battle spread from outside the Heavenly Court. It indicated that the situation was not as simple as they had thought.","“Let’s go out and take a look.” Jian Wushuang stood up and there was a surge of Yan power.","His Yan power and cultivation level had been restored to their peak. As long as the enemy was not a Grand Yan Immortal, he was confident that he could annihilate them.","Chen Qing and the others nodded and followed Jian Wushuang to the outside of the Heavenly Court.","At this moment, outside the Heavenly Court, under the chaotic and lightless sky, everything suddenly became extremely bleak.","The broken True Sword, the dead body of Yan Immortal, and the violent Yan power astral wind were all scattered in the abyss.","The three Immortal bone guards that had re-formed from the abyss were also heavily injured."]},{"number":4803,"title":"Chapter 4803 42 Friends","paragraphs":["4803 42 Friends","More than half of their Immortal bones had been shattered, and the flowing treasure light had also been damaged.","Even the sky seemed to be falling.","Originally, there were close to 100 Yan Immortals fighting the Immortal bone guards, but now, more than half of them had been killed.","Even though he had already died, Grand Yan Immortal’s final obsession was still extremely terrifying.","The explosion caused by their battle almost shattered the Heavenly Court and Heavenly Region that had been silent for countless years.","This was a huge battle, and as Yan Immortals continued to fall, the three Immortal bone guards were finally unable to hold on.","The Immortal bone guard that received the most attacks finally dispelled his obsession and his Immortal bones were torn to pieces by Yan power.","The half-dead Yan Immortals finally stopped their casualties and began to use their immense Yan power to suppress the Immortal bone guard.","A total of 42 Yan Immortals separated and linked, forming 42 formation points. Unparalleled Yan power flowed around them, condensing into a sky-covering formation, and completely sealed down.","The two Immortal bone guards in the array were constantly being weakened. The lustrous glow on their bodies was disappearing. In the end, they turned into dust and fell into the abyss again.","The last three obsessions of the Heavenly Court had also dissipated.","When the obstacles disappeared, the formation disappeared, and the 42 mysterious Yan Immortals landed on the broken square.","In front of the 42 Yan Immortals, there was another Yan Immortal who stood alone. He had a mature look and had the aura of a superior.","“I didn’t expect to finally find an ancient Heavenly Court after searching for several years.”","Looking at the vast and silent boundless Heavenly Court, the mature-looking Yan Immortal revealed a kind of excitement and infatuation.","A thin, slightly wretched Yan Immortal stepped forward and said respectfully, “Congratulations to Young Master for obtaining this. You will definitely be able to ascend to the position of Grand Yan Immortal in the near future.”","“The position of Grand Yan Immortal...” The mature-looking Yan Immortal repeated in a low voice, as if he was very satisfied with this flattery. “Now that I’m here, if I can obtain the lost inheritance, the position of Grand Yan Immortal is nothing. Perhaps I can even grasp the Emperor’s fate energy.”","“When the time comes, which of those trash can stop me? Who else can I be controlled by?”","“Your Excellency is right. We pledge to follow Your Excellency to the death,” the short and vulgar Yan Immortal bent over and smiled.","Yan Immortal, who had regained his senses, waved his hand and looked at the silent Heavenly Court. “Enter!”","43 powerful figures with Supreme force surging around them strode into the Heavenly Courts like stars surrounding the moon.","“All of you, be on your guard. We can’t let anything happen,” the mature-looking Yan Immortal said in a deep voice. Then, facing the Heavenly Court’s palace gate, which was more than 10,000-feet-tall, he slowly retreated, letting the rest of the Yan Immortals walk in front.","Facing such an ancient Heavenly Court, he was also nervous. After all, more than half of the 100 Yan Immortals he brought with him were killed when they were dealing with the Immortal bone guards.","If there were any more dangers in the Heavenly Courts, it would be extremely bad.","The remaining 42 Yan Immortals were all elites. He was confident that even if something terrifying were to happen, he would be able to escape before all of them died.","Under the combined efforts of the dozen leading Yan Immortals, the 10,000-feet-long palace gate of the Heavenly Court slowly opened.","There was no danger. It was as if everything had been silent for countless years.","Seeing this, Yan Immortal, who was surrounded, quickly pushed aside the group and rushed in first.","As far as the eye could see, the interior of the hall was dark green in color. It was like an ink painting of the heavens that was full of artistic conception, full of a vast and mighty aura.","All of the Yan Immortals were shocked as they looked at the Heavenly Court in disbelief.","Even though it had been silent for countless years, the Heavenly Court was still the Heavenly Court, an existence that they could not touch.","Although they were all Yan Immortals, a Heavenly Court was the supreme hub of countless Heavenly Regions, and only the Emperors could control it.","Not to mention them, even Grand Yan Immortal wanting to ascend to the Heavenly Court and have an audience with the Emperor was a luxury.","Unless there was a grand banquet of the Heavenly Courts that was held once every Hua Year, they would not have any fate with the Heavenly Courts.","“Is this the Heavenly Court?” All of the Yan Immortals ‘gazes were dull, as if the destiny of directly advancing to the Grand Yan Immortal had appeared before their eyes in the next moment.","Their leader was performing much better than them, but he was no longer calm. His eyes were full of passion.","“Let’s go!” He ordered in a deep voice and strode forward in the Heavenly Courts.","Compared to the Heavenly Realm outside, the Heavenly Court was much darker. Even Yan Immortal could not see more than 100 feet away.","With a wave of his hand, a Yan power light beam appeared to illuminate the area. The leader of the group frowned slightly. He felt that something was observing him in the dark, and he felt uncomfortable. For a moment, he shrank back into the group.","In the entire boundless Heavenly Court, on the mountain and river pillars on both sides, there were strange birds that looked like they wanted to swallow people, which also exerted a layer of pressure on the Yan Immortals.","However, they could only brace themselves and move forward. An immeasurable amount of heavenly fate energy and fortune was waiting for them.","Just as the older Yan Immortal was nervously checking if there was any danger in the dark, the perverted Yan Immortal beside him subconsciously took in a cold breath.","“My Lord, there’s someone in front!”","Everyone was stunned and immediately assumed a fighting stance.","Yan Immortal looked over and saw several figures standing in the deepest part of the Heavenly Court through the dim light. In the center of these figures, there was a huge Emperor’s throne.","An indescribable heavy pressure was surging.","“You’re acting mysterious!” He gritted his teeth and said. “Follow me!”","42 rays of light lit up and instantly lit up the surroundings. Even the position of the Emperor’s throne could be seen at a glance.","When everything was clear, the air froze.","On both sides of the Emperor’s throne, there were four burly men.","The shortest among them was nine feet tall, and the tallest one was more than three meters tall. Just by standing there, he looked like a divine peak.","And in the middle of the four divine mountains, on the Emperor’s throne, sat an Emperor dressed in a black feather robe!","Although there was no sound, this scene was extremely shocking.","All of the Yan Immortals held their breaths, not even daring to breathe.","“They... Are they dead or Alive...”","At this moment, even the mature Yan Immortal was confused, his heart was restless.","“They should be dead. They couldn’t have survived that great battle. No one could have survived.” He began to convince himself in his heart.","“Even if they’re not dead, after so many years, they must be extremely weak...”","In the next moment, the supreme Emperor’s body, which was sitting on the majestic Emperor’s throne, opened its golden eyes.","The mature Yan Immortal took in a cold breath and cursed.","“Damn, he’s alive!”"]},{"number":4804,"title":"Chapter 4804 Meeting Prince Yu Again","paragraphs":["4804 Meeting Prince Yu Again","The Emperor’s body, which he had thought was just an empty shell, opened its eyes at this moment. He was so shocked that his eyeballs almost popped out. His body went soft and he almost fell to the ground.","All of the Yan Immortals were shocked and took a step back, trembling.","That kind of existence was not something they could imagine. Naturally, they did not have any desire to fight.","As the figure in the Emperor’s robe opened his golden eyes, the four figures around him also opened their eyes in unison.","The general trend surged!","The air seemed to have frozen. The four divine peak-like figures were unsmiling as they stared ahead.","“My Lord, let’s retreat and leave...”","The vulgar Yan Immortal’s legs trembled, his head was already heavy.","In fact, the four figures were Chen Qing, Di Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing. Even the Emperor’s True Body sitting on the Emperor’s throne in black feather Emperor robe was Jian Wushuang’s disguise...","The reason why he did this was because he had no other choice.","Originally, Jian Wushuang had planned to kill some Yan Immortals who had barged in by accident. However, he saw the previous scene as soon as he stepped out of the palace.","The battle of close to 100 Yan Immortals was filled with energy, even if more than half of them were killed, they would still be a huge effort.","Other than Jian Wushuang, who had recovered to his peak after receiving Emperor Liu Ya’s Comprehension inheritance, the rest of them had not fully recovered.","Di Qing, who had recovered 60 percent of his strength, was confused, so Jian Wushuang did not count him in.","If they fought with the team of more than 50 Yan Immortals, even if they won, it would be a pyrrhic victory and not worth fighting.","That was why he came up with this plan to drive away these Yan Immortals.","But what he did not expect was that even though the group of Yan Immortal galls were about to burst from fear, they did not have any thoughts of running away.","Jian Wushuang frowned and secretly glanced at Chen Qing, who was standing beside him.","Chen Qing immediately understood. He took a step forward and shouted, “Those who trespass the Heavenly Court will die!”","The sound of thunder completely destroyed Yan Immortal’s mental defense.","“Milord, retreat and leave. If you don’t leave, we’ll all die here!”","The vulgar Yan Immortal said in a trembling voice, he was obviously planning to escape without a care.","Yan Immortal gritted his teeth and did not speak. He was unwilling to give up on the Heavenly Court that he had only found by chance after so much hardship.","Cheng Qing, who was like a divine mountain, saw that they had no intention of leaving. He took a step forward and prepared to give them another warning.","However, because he was too big, he snagged the wine gourd hidden at his waist, and more than ten black mountain crystals fell to the ground.","The wine gourd drew an arc on the jade floor and rolled to the feet of the old Yan Immortal.","The air was suffocating.","The older Yan Immortal looked down at the wine gourd by his feet, then at the black mountain crystals scattered on the ground, and he seemed to have understood something.","“Are you all imposters?”","Chen Qing was embarrassed and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Fight!” As the simple word rang out, Jian Wushuang suddenly stepped up from the Emperor’s throne and an Invisible Sword had already formed in his hand.","“Kill them!”","Yan Immortal, who had recovered from his shock, shouted in anger, “Leave no one alive!”","In an instant, 42 Yan Immortals, 42 rays of Yan power, surged and directly pressed down on Jian Wushuang and the others.","Cheng Qing directly slapped the True Sword at his waist, bringing with it a tremendous amount of sword intent as he brazenly advanced.","Chun Qiu also summoned his eight-armed Arhat and charged forward.","Cui Jing, who was the weakest and did not have any trump cards, was blocked by Chun Qiu.","“Lowlives.”","Di Qing also made his move. A black crow appeared behind him, chirping with its head held high.","With such power, he was able to directly deal with the combined attack of 42 Yan Immortals.","“Clang! Whooosh...”","The blade of the sword was extremely sharp, and it directly tore apart the boundless Yan power.","Di Qing’s black crow, Chen Qing’s Sword Intent, Chun Qiu’s eight-armed Arhat, all of them exploded in the crowd of Yan Immortals.","After destroying a Yan Immortal’s Immortal source with one strike, Jian Wushuang turned back to take a quick glance at Di Qing before continuing to fight.","Even though he had only recovered less than 60 percent of his strength, the fearsomeness of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was still revealed.","The treasured image form of the black crow shattered, immediately shattering the Immortal Source of the ten Yan Immortals.","However, after this battle, the original 43 Yan Immortals were reduced by 20.","The Yan Immortal, who was the leader, almost had his neck cut off by Jian Wushuang.","“Your Excellency, please retreat...”","This time, the vulgar Yan Immortal did not finish his sentence. He looked at the Invisible Sword in his chest with his eyes wide open.","Jian Wushuang did not stop after killing him. He held the hilt of the sword with both hands and slashed down with 3,000 Sword Intents.","The older Yan Immortal’s shocked eyes were filled with anger. Then, he shook his arms and the space around him suddenly changed. At this moment, it seemed to reflect a diamond-shaped seven-colored light, which was beautiful and fierce.","At the same time, there were needle-like lights emerging from each diamond-shaped brilliance and all of them rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","It all happened so fast that Jian Wushuang could not dodge in time. Almost 1,000 rays of reflected light passed through his body!","The indescribable pain of being cut seemed to have also shredded his consciousness.","However, this only stopped Jian Wushuang for a moment. The Invisible Sword in his hand, due to inertia, finally hit the shoulder of the mature Yan Immortal.","With a ‘swish’ sound, the sharp Sword Intent almost cut him in half.","He let out a blood-curdling screech as his shoulder blades shattered into pieces, and divine blood gushed out.","Jian Wushuang retreated at the same time. He clutched his chest and divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth.","After coming to the Great Yan Domain, he had already cut off his mortal past. All his Ancestor fate energy and divine power had been returned to the Divine Power Universe, so he did not have the so-called Immortal Source.","It was precisely because he did not have the most important Immortal Source that he managed to escape.","He had a feeling that the mature Yan Immortal’s move could destroy any Immortal Source.","The older Yan Immortal, who was also heavily injured, staggered back. The Yan energy that was surging around him dimmed.","Perhaps it was due to Yan power’s rapid dissipation, the mature Yan Immortal’s face began to change rapidly.","The rather mature and square ordinary face disappeared and was replaced by a handsome face full of heroic spirit.","After seeing the face clearly, Jian Wushuang’s eyes became serious.","That face belonged to none other than the Third Prince, Prince Yu, who had participated in the fight for the Immortal Peach in Zhen Wuyang’s Heavenly Realm.","However, his sudden arrival was obviously beyond Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","As the Third Prince of Zhen Wuyang, how could he appear here at this time?"]},{"number":4805,"title":"Chapter 4805 Di Qing’s Request","paragraphs":["4805 Di Qing’s Request","After the incident in the northern heaven celestial Prefecture, the fifth son of Zhen Wuyang, Prince Mo, was killed by Zheng Ying under the Fusang Tree.","It had been less than ten years since then, and the entire great si domain was probably in chaos. The other six sons would definitely be interrogated by Zhen Wuyang, and they would not act rashly.","However, Prince Yu was leading his Yan Immortals to travel through the territory of the Great Si Region at this time. Wasn’t he afraid of Zhen Wuyang’s suspicion?","And how did he discover this place?","There was no answer to all his questions. Looking at the familiar face, Jian Wushuang had no intention of killing them all.","Cheng Qing also saw Prince Yu’s face at this moment. He cast a surprised and suspicious look at Jian Wushuang.","“We can’t kill him. It’s Prince Yu.”","Jian Wushuang’s secret voice was heard by Chen Qing and the others.","When Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu heard this, they stopped fighting.","Di Qing, who had originally planned to cook all of the 20 Yan Immortals in one move, stopped in time and let them go after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, although he still wanted more.","The situation of this great battle came to an end, and the entire Heavenly Court fell into a strange dead silence.","Such a destructive situation made the remaining Yan Immortals tremble.","After these few exchanges, there were less than 20 Yan Immortals left.","Prince Yu, who had stopped his injuries, did not have the courage and intention to continue fighting. Now, he only wanted to escape from this nightmare-like Heavenly Court.","“Let’s go!” Prince Yu’s voice trembled. Then, with the support of more than 10 Yan Immortals, he left the Heavenly Court and disappeared.","Looking at the Heavenly Court, which had fallen into silence again, Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath of air.","He had achieved his goal of driving Prince Yu away. He would never step into this place again before he grew to a certain level.","He could not kill Prince Yu because he was the third son of Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","If he killed them by mistake, Uncle Yu, who was powerful enough to kill Di Qing with a single palm strike, would probably come here with his men.","Jian Wushuang, who had cultivated for millions of years, knew that it was best to be careful before he was strong enough.","Since the three of them had been in disguise since they left the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, they did not have to worry that Prince Yu would recognize them.","At this point, everything had come to an end.","He fell into an unknown Heavenly Region from the coma in the Nothern Heaven Celestial Prefecture and was captured back to the Sand Demon Cave by Cui Jing. After several great battles, he brought out the mysterious Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm and accidentally fell into this former Heavenly Court, where he obtained the supreme Emperor’s Enlightenment inheritance.","Everything was like a dream.","Jian Wushuang was growing bit by bit, but he was also moving forward involuntarily.","He randomly picked a jade step and sat on it, indicating for Cheng Qing and the others to quickly search.","After all, Emperor Liu Ya had already fallen completely. It would be a pity if his collection were to remain in the dust.","Chen Qing and the others could not wait to search. Only Di Qing did not move, but sat down next to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not ask about it. In his opinion, they would leave soon. By then, even if Di Qing completely occupied the Heavenly Court, he would noot have any objections.","But Di Qing’s next words shocked him.","“Can I stay by your side?” Di Qing smiled awkwardly, looking a little embarrassed.","Jian Wushuang remained silent. He knew what had happened to Prince Mo.","Perhaps guessing his inner thoughts, Di Qing hurriedly said, “Don’t worry. From now on, with me around, no one can touch you.”","“...”","In the end, Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked, “Is it because of the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes?”","Di Qing was stunned and finally said, “Yes, but not...”","Jian Wushuang understood what he was thinking and continued to say, ” I can tell you the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes word for word, but not now, because I haven’t understood it yet.”","“If that’s the reason you want to stay by my side, then I’ll understand it as soon as possible and tell you everything without leaving out a single word. Please leave quickly. I don’t want to place an uncertain danger by my side.”","After saying this, Jian Wushuang slowly walked out of the Heavenly Court with his hands behind his back.","Looking at his back, Di Qing’s eyes revealed a strange look. Then, as if he had made up his mind, he quickly followed.","“Are you planning to make me your slave?” Di Qing came to his side and asked.","Jian Wushuang glanced at him and said, “I’ve never thought about that. What’s the use of having a slave?”","“You approached me because of the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes, so I will naturally give you what you want. Before that, you can choose to stay by my side, but we have no relationship.”","After Di Qing heard this, he could not help but ask, “But you don’t plan to ask for equal benefits?”","“I’m too lazy to ask for it,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “I can give it to you, but I hope you know, whether it’s now or in the future, don’t do anything that will harm me.”","After a moment of silence, Di Qing said solemnly, “I understand.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He looked around the dark Heavenly Region with his hands behind his back.","Three days later, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the others ran out of the Heavenly Court, their faces full of joy.","Although the Heavenly Court was broken and silent, without any fate energy of the Great Dao, the Emperor’s treasures were still unimaginable.","There were countless rare treasures, Yan Immortal techniques, and even a mental cultivation technique of Emperor Liu Ya, which was taken out by Cheng Qing, filling up an entire storage ring.","Even Cui Jing, who had been in a state of sorrow and confusion from the beginning to the end, was a little excited. He returned to his unruly look.","He was just a small Ancestor realm cultivator, but he had experienced such a big scene. How could he suppress his excitement?","However, after collecting such a rich collection, it was already on the agenda for Chun Qiu and Cui Jing to advance to the Yan Immortal realm.","“Let’s go,” Jian Wushuang said. He looked back at the crowd and took the lead to leave the ancient Heavenly Court.","After passing through the mysterious vortex, five figures stood in the air.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to release Yan power and completely sealed the upturned corner of the void.","The Heavenly Region of the past, which should not have been exposed, would continue to sleep until time immemorial.","After doing all this, everything was done. He turned his eyes to Cui Jing, who was by his side.","Cui Jing subconsciously took half a step back and looked a little timid. He felt an inexplicable pressure when facing Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4806,"title":"Chapter 4806 A Thousand Things","paragraphs":["4806 A Thousand Things","Even his big sister, Sha Qing, and those Grand Yan Immortal monks who easily destroyed the Sand Demon Cave did not possess that kind of pressure.","The indescribable breath was as deep as the abyss and as tall as the mountains, it was impossible to grasp.","Jian Wushuang did not try to guess what Cui Jing was thinking. He did not hate the last person from the Sand Demon Cave, who was also full of Karma and killing tribulation. However, he could not say that he liked him either.","“You’re free now. You can go wherever you want to go,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","Cui Jing was stunned when he heard this, and his eyes revealed a touch of bitterness.","The Sand Demon Cave was destroyed, and he was sick and injured. Where in this vast Heavenly Region could he find a place to stay?","He had nowhere to go, but he did not dare to go against Jian Wushuang’s words. He could only stand there blankly.","Chun Qiu saw through Cui Jing’s thoughts and nudged him discreetly, then gave him a look.","Cui Jing understood what he meant and hurriedly looked up at Jian Wushuang, “Brother Jian, I can’t go anywhere. Can I just follow you? From now on, I’ll obey you.”","Jian Wushuang did not agree. He just said, “We’ll make plans after you’ve recuperated. It’s too early to say anything now.”","After saying this, Jian Wushuang stopped driving him away.","When Cui Jing heard this, he was overjoyed. He hurriedly cupped his hands and said, “Thank you, Big Brother Jian.”","After taking one last look at the sealed Heavenly Court, Jian Wushuang turned around and disappeared into the vast void with the four figures.","In this battle to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, Prince Mo had died, and the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture had been destroyed. The Heaven-patterned Bone Armor, which had been almost in his hands, had also completely disappeared.","In fact, there were many suspicious points about the great turmoil in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture this time.","From the moment Jian Wushuang and the others entered the Celestial Prefecture, there were mysterious top cultivators and Yan Immortals selling black mountain crystals on the streets.","Then, the mysterious seven swordsmen appeared and completely disrupted the situation. They wanted to kill Prince Mo in the hall of the small Celestial Prefecture.","What puzzled Jian Wushuang the most was that Zheng Ying, the absolute beauty he had saved during the great voyage, had also beheaded Prince Mo and crushed his Immortal Source at the last moment under the Fusang Tree.","In just a few days, a Prince had been killed.","All the killing intent seemed to be at the same time, but it also seemed to have been planned.","There were so many things that even Emperor Zhen Wuyang would find it hard to find out how complicated the situation was.","However, there was one thing that Jian Wushuang could be sure of now. Zheng Ying was definitely not on the same side as the seven swordsmen.","She was like a ghost, approaching with a strong purpose. Once she succeeded, she would disappear completely.","However, if they were not working together, it would be too much of a coincidence for them to attack Prince Mo on the same night.","Now, only one of the seven swordsmen was left. It was the heroic-looking woman who had disguised herself as a man. She had once hung on the wall of the Sand Demon Cave together with them, but now, she had long disappeared.","He was afraid that only by finding her would he be able to ask what had happened in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","Lady Yin Ling, who was wearing the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor, the heroic-looking woman who was the last one of the seven swordsmen, and Zheng Ying, who had cut off Prince Mo’s head.","Now that all three of them had disappeared without a trace, they added a few more mysteries to the already-destroyed Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","Even if the surface of the water was calm, no one knew what kind of undercurrent was stirring under the water.","When he came, he only had Chen Qing and Chun Qiu with him, but when he returned, he had Di Qing and Cui Jing with him.","Jian Wushuang did not know what to say about the two guys he kept by his side, so he could only wait and see.","They were deep in the boundless void, and countless Heaven Regions and planes were like stars in the universe.","However, this was only within the Great Si Region. To the entire unknown Great Yan Domain, it was just a drop in the ocean.","After some thought, Jian Wushuang decided to return to the Six Heavens Realm.","No matter what, that was the place where he was currently staying. It was also the closest place to the supreme Heavenly Court of the Great Si Region, and perhaps he could obtain more ancient secrets.","Jian Wushuang had already made up his mind. After he returned to the Six Heavens Realm to recuperate, he would do his best to search for the whereabouts of Lady Yin Ling.","Then, he would head to the so-called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm to see if he could resolve his own Karma and great killing tribulation.","Jian Wushuang felt that the unknown Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm was definitely not simple. Kong Tong and Kong Ji, the two Grand Yan Immortals, were too murderous and did not have any understanding of the monk.","“Perhaps there will be more monks like Kong Lun in the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","The five figures shuttled through the void and continued to fly toward the vast void.","When he came, he carried a shoulder full of broken snow, and the world was vast.","When he returned, there was nothing in his hands, but it was silent.","Those who had already become Yan Immortals avoided the mortal world, but with Chen Qing, this wine barrel, it was destined that their return journey would not be so peaceful.","After all his pleading, Cui Jing’s eyes lit up and he finally managed to convince Jian Wushuang.","Then, he stopped at a Heavenly Region with abundant Yan power to rest and drink.","This Heavenly Region was vast and had more than a dozen continents. It could be considered a super Heavenly Region in the Great Si Region.","And in the past, Yan Immortals were not rare. There were Yan Immortals who were still reluctant to cut off the mortal world, like Chen Qing, who descended to the mortal world to drink.","However, Yan Immortals were in the minority, and there were not many peak cultivators.","They went to a random restaurant in a continent and entered it.","Jars of aged wine were brought up one by one, and there were more than 100,000 tons of wine.","Cui Jing, who had the same bad taste as Chen Qing, began to compete with each other in drinking.","Jian Wushuang was holding an exquisite wine pot in one hand and sitting by the window. He looked at the street outside the window with his deep eyes and seemed to be thinking about something.","Di Qing, who was not interested in the vintage wine, was secretly sizing up the guy sitting opposite him.","Di Qing always felt that he carried a lot of secrets, but he was very clear and clean, which was an unspeakable contradiction.","‘Who cares? It won’t be too late for me to leave after I get the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes,’ Di Qing thought so and then looked out of the window leisurely.","He had been silent on the Fusang Tree for many years and was curious about everything. If it was not for Jian Wushuang’s restraint, he probably could not wait to destroy a few Heavenly Regions for fun.","Just as everyone was lazily walking, the streets, which had many top cultivators hurrying along, suddenly became empty. Then, the sky darkened.","Boom!","Several extremely powerful auras descended like dark clouds."]},{"number":4807,"title":"Chapter 4807 Chase","paragraphs":["4807 Chase","For a moment, all the top cultivators within thousands of miles were silent.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Then, he waved his hand and the Yan power boundary protected the entire restaurant.","Rumble!!!","It was the sound of the earth being torn apart.","Following that, one pavilion after another collapsed and shattered.","In the center of the violent explosion, only a restaurant remained standing. It did not even suffer the slightest damage.","Cui Jing, who was drinking, could not help but tremble when he saw the scene outside. However, when he saw Jian Wushuang sitting by the window, still looking lazy, he inexplicably felt at ease and continued to drink.","“Brother Jian, do you need me to investigate?” Chun Qiu asked in a low voice, already prepared to fight.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “No, the troublemakers are here.”","As his voice fell, the sound of a heavy object falling to the ground was heard.","“Run! Why aren’t you running anymore?!”","A thunderous roar resounded.","Outside the broken street, two extremely thin figures fell into the rubble.","A Yan Immortal that looked like a Vajra threw two figures into the ground.","An irrepressible muffled groan sounded.","Behind this Yan Immortal, there were another five Yan Immortals, all of them with sinister expressions.","“Damn you, aren’t you good at running?”","Pulling back his feet, the Vajra-like Yan Immortal clenched his fist in the air and directly grabbed the thin figure’s neck, lifting him up from the ground.","“Ah...” His dirty hair covered his face, but it could not hide his pain.","Sticky blood flowed out of the wounds on his skin.","“B-Brother, I’m scared.”","Another even thinner figure was lying on the ground, his hands helplessly pushing away the gravel, as if he wanted to use it to stand up.","The thin figure who was being strangled slowly calmed down, and his bloodshot eyes were lifeless.","“Let my brother leave, I’ll go with you.”","When the Vajra-like Yan Immortal heard this, it was as if he had heard the funniest joke. He laughed, “A piece of trash like you dares to discuss conditions with me? Come back with me, no one will be able to escape.”","With that, he waved his other hand and grabbed the two thin figures in his hand as if he was pinching ants.","“Trash like you are only fit to be medicinal catalysts.”","When the thin figure heard this, his originally lifeless eyes suddenly narrowed. Then, like a wild beast, he opened his mouth and bit Yan Immortal’s ear.","Bang!","A powerful palm smashed into his face. Blood gushed out of his seven orifices, and he fainted in an instant.","The Vajra-like Yan Immortal laughed in disdain. He picked up another figure and was about to leave.","In the next moment, an extremely cold female voice resounded through the shattered earth.","“Release them.”","Jian Wushuang looked toward the source of the voice and was surprised.","The one who spoke was a woman in a gray robe. Her face was not gentle and beautiful, but she was full of heroic spirit and exuded a sense of majesty.","This heroic-looking woman was one of the last seven swordsmen who had wreaked havoc in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","They met several times in the Sand Demon Cave, but he did not know where she went.","But now, they actually met again in this Heavenly Region, it was simply unbelievable.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and wanted to see what she would do next.","After shouting that sentence, the heroic-looking woman was not afraid at all. A powerful Yan power was already circulating around her body.","The Vajra-like Yan Immortal, who was carrying a thin figure in each hand, stopped in place and slowly turned his head.","When he saw that it was a woman, his violent eyes were filled with desire.","“I was wondering who it was, so it’s a little girl,” the Vajra-like Yan Immortal threw the two figures in his hands to the Yan Immortal behind him. Then, he rubbed his palms and walked toward her without any fear.","A look of disgust flashed in the eyes of the heroic-looking woman. Then, with a thunderous momentum, a long sword shot out without any warning.","Yan Immortal’s eyes focused, and his neck subconsciously tilted to the side, barely dodging the terrifying attack.","However, there was a long and narrow wound that almost cut his neck in two.","It was just that in this one exchange, he had been severely injured.","This made him both shocked and angry, and at the same time, he waved his hand to suppress it.","The sky suddenly caved in, and an invisible giant palm smashed toward the heroic-looking woman.","She frowned, and like a ghost, with an unimaginable speed, she rushed to the front of the Vajra-like Yan Immortal.","The Vajra-like Yan Immortal was shocked. He took a few steps back and shouted, “Crush her!”","As he shouted, the five Yan Immortals behind him moved.","With the combined power of six Yan Immortals, an unparalleled Yan power prison appeared. The terrifying force once again caused the ground to crack.","The heroic-looking woman, who was originally moving at an extremely fast speed, was also affected. It was as if she was in a quagmire, and she found it difficult to move.","To fight six Yan Immortals alone was impossible even if she was at her peak, let alone in this state.","The six unparalleled forces descended and made her spit out blood. Even if she wanted to, she was powerless to reverse the situation.","“Little Girl, you actually dared to hurt me. Today, I will make you beg for death!”","A roar came from the Vajra-like Yan Immortal’s mouth. Yan power chains surged from his palms as he once again tried to capture the heroic-looking woman.","However, at the next moment, a lazy voice suddenly sounded.","“You’re really noisy,”","He subconsciously turned his head to look at the source of the sound, only to see a pitch-black urn smashing straight at him.","Bang!","An extremely muffled sound rang out, and the thick fragrance of the wine spread in all directions.","The jar directly tore apart the combined attack of the six Yan Immortals and heavily exploded on the face of the Vajra-like Yan Immortal.","Then, he fell to the ground with his head raised and fainted.","With just a casual strike, he made a Yan Immortal lose the ability to resist. What kind of outlandish means was this?","With an exquisite wine pot in one hand and a three-foot sword in the other, Jian Wushuang walked forward slowly, free and unrestrained.","The five Yan Immortals took a few steps back at the same time, looking at him with vigilance.","The heroic-looking woman clutched her chest and slowly stepped back. She looked at Jian Wushuang with shock and disbelief.","“Who are you? It’s best if you judge the situation and do not have any more conflicts with my Li Fire Sect. We will let bygones be bygones for the matter just now.”","One of them, a clean-faced Yan Immortal, was shocked by Jian Wushuang’s power, but his words were not polite.","After all, in his opinion, no matter how powerful Jian Wushuang was, he could not possibly fight against five of them alone.","However, very quickly, he swallowed this thought into his stomach, and his eyes widened to their maximum.","This was because he saw four figures that were as tall as divine peaks walk out of a restaurant not far away and stand behind this young man in order."]},{"number":4808,"title":"Chapter 4808 Young Man","paragraphs":["4808 Young Man","Each figure was as deep as the abyss and as tall as the mountain, filled with an overbearing aura.","In particular, the aura exuded by the luxuriously dressed figure with eight noble feathers in his hair had already exceeded his imagination.","“A conflict? Li Fire Sect?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and raised his eyebrows slightly. “You think you’re worthy?”","Immediately, the five Yan Immortals were humiliated.","The Li Fire Sect, which they were proud of, had taken in disciples across several Heavenly Regions.","Although it was nothing much in the Great Si Region, the top cultivators in the surrounding Heavenly Regions were all proud of being able to enter the Li Fire Sect.","But now, he was being humiliated without any regard for his face.","The clean-faced Yan Xian suppressed his urge to attack and said in a low voice, “Juniors, it’s best if you don’t act too rashly. We might meet again in the future.”","Jian Wushuang gave him a sidelong glance and then attacked. An unparalleled Yan power rose and crushed the Yan Immortal lying on the ground into powder, leaving no Immortal Source behind.","All the Yan Immortals were shocked. They never thought that Jian Wushuang would kill a Yan Immortal without any warning.","“Leave the two boys here, and I’ll let you go,” Jian Wushuang looked at them and said indifferently.","The clean-faced Yan Immortal suppressed the anger in his heart, knowing that he had met a tough opponent today. He immediately left the two thin figures behind and turned to leave.","The five Yan Immortals were like five beams of light, ready to leave this world without any hesitation.","However, things did not always go as he wished.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and threw the True Sword to Chen Qing.","Cheng Qing understood tacitly. The corner of his mouth revealed a trace of a sinister smile, and his figure disappeared.","To cut the weeds and eliminate the roots to prevent future troubles, this was his principle of doing things.","After a short while, screams could be heard from the sky.","Jian Wushuang did not care about that. He carried the wine pot and slowly walked forward. Finally, he stopped in front of the two thin figures and squatted down.","“Raise your head and look at me,” he said in a low voice.","The dead fish-like figure moved with great difficulty. Then, as if he had exhausted all its strength, he raised blood-stained head.","“Thank, thank you, Your Excellency...”","After he said that, he passed out.","Shaking his head helplessly, Jian Wushuang stood up and looked at the heroic-looking lady who was standing not far away with a complicated expression.","“Let’s leave together. I have a few questions for you. Don’t even think about running away. You can’t run away.”","...","With Jian Wushuang’s protection, there was only one restaurant left on the vast land.","At this moment, in the main hall of the huge restaurant, eight figures were sitting around a round table.","Jian Wushuang sat in the middle, and Di Qing and the others sat beside him.","The heroic-looking woman had also taken her seat, and she would glance at him from time to time.","The two emaciated figures were sitting opposite Jian Wushuang, staring at the dishes on the table.","“Let’s eat,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","After receiving the order, the two figures did not care about anything else and directly started to swallow.","“These two kids, it looks like their hair hasn’t even fully grown, right? What are you doing out here?” Cheng Qing looked at the two with some surprise.","Jian Wushuang was also a little curious. The two boys in front of him did look a little immature.","Moreover, their faces were almost identical, as if they were twins.","“Hehe, Brother, it’s delicious...” The one with the most tender face, who was also a little silly, was holding a plate of food in his hand and laughing foolishly.","Another kid with a determined look and a bit of honesty nodded his head and quickly stuffed all kinds of food into his mouth.","These two skinny kids had finished all the dishes on the table like a tornado.","However, more and more dishes were presented to them, and there was no limit to their appetite.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He just watched the two of them eat with interest.","Although these two were not even Ancestor realm cultivators, they both had some foundation in their realms and should not be so dependent on food.","However, looking at the way they ate, it was as if they had never had a full meal.","After an unknown period of time, the two guys who were feasting like crazy finally stopped.","He subconsciously touched his stomach and stood up hurriedly. He cupped his hands at Jian Wushuang and said, “Thank you for your good fortune. We have never had a full meal. Today is the first time. We are very grateful.”","The other kid with a silly look chuckled at his brother, then repeated what he had said.","“You haven’t had a full meal since you were born?” Cheng Qing was slightly surprised.","The skinny figure nodded and said frankly, “We brothers are all alone. Since we could remember, we only had each other to rely on. Naturally, we couldn’t have a full meal.”","Cheng Qing asked again, “Then why didn’t you guys stay at your original place? why did you run around?”","The skinny man scratched his head and said, “My brother is a fool with a chaotic mind. I really want to get his brain checked for problems.”","Such childish words made everyone present smile.","“Hehe, Brother said I’m an idiot, so I’m an idiot.” The kid with the silly look started to laugh foolishly again.","As his brother had said, this kid was indeed a fool with a chaotic mind.","The thin figure scratched his head again and finally said solemnly, “My name is Song Wuxin. My brother’s name is Song Wuyan. I would like to thank you for saving my life, and I will never forget it.”","“Where are you going to take him to check?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked.","The thin figure named Song Wuxin shook his head and said, “There was an experienced and knowledgeable old cultivator in the place where I used to live. He said that my brother’s mind had yet to develop its spiritual wisdom and there was no way to change it. However, I didn’t believe him. I have to find an Immortal and ask him to treat my brother.”","The Immortal that Song Wuxin was talking about was Yan Immortal.","Looking at his hopeful face, Jian Wushuang could only sigh in his heart.","The innate spiritual intelligence had yet to develop and was in a state of chaos. In other words, such a life should not have appeared in the first place, but it was born due to various opportunities. It was an extremely pure white paper.","This white paper that should not have been born was innately missing, and it was probably very difficult to make up for it.","Even if he used some kind of supreme secret technique to make up for it, it would still cover up the original memory.","However, at least for now, even Di Qing, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, was helpless.","In the end, Jian Wushuang still said, “What if I say that the Immortal can’t cure your brother?”","Song Wuxin was stunned. A hint of disappointment flashed in the corner of his eyes. However, he soon grinned and said, “If one Immortal can’t cure him, I’ll find another Immortal. I’ll keep looking until I find an Immortal who can cure my brother.”"]},{"number":4809,"title":"Chapter 4809 Imparting the Sword Dao","paragraphs":["4809 Imparting the Sword Dao","Jian Wushuang asked again, “Are you going to continue without a goal?”","Song Wuxin nodded. “That’s right. Keep walking forward until you find it or until you can’t move anymore.”","“Are you not afraid of death?” Cheng Qing asked.","Song Wuxin grinned again. “For people like us, it’s a blessing to be able to live one more day. Life and death are not things we can consider. Besides, sometimes, death is not necessarily a bad thing.”","Cheng Qing immediately shook her head. “See that? Two idiots.”","The two of them appeared extremely ill at ease in front of this group of figures with strength as deep as the abyss. They clutched the corners of their clothes and did not know what to say.","In the end, it was Jian Wushuang who said, “This journey is not as simple as you think. If you can’t even protect yourself, your end will not be any better than what you have today.”","“If it wasn’t for us, you and your brothers would have lost your lives long ago. Would you still be alive now?”","“If you don’t even treasure your own life, then I advise you not to bring your own brother to die with you.”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Song Wuxin trembled and his eyes were filled with bitterness.","“I also want to live with him, but I’m born with a dull talent, and my control of Yan power is weak to the extreme. I can’t deal with the possible crisis at all.”","Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “Since you’re not talented enough, you’ll have to make up for it later or change it in other ways.”","“Do you want to practice the sword?”","When Song Wuxin heard this, he hurriedly took out the short sword that looked like a fire Stick from his waist. He scratched his head in embarrassment and said, “I’m not particularly proficient in the way of the sword. I picked up this sword a long time ago for self-defense.”","Jian Wushuang picked up the short sword and pulled it out of the scabbard. The blade was so worn out that it might not even kill some ordinary beasts in ordinary Heavenly Regions.","“Let’s just throw this sword away.” He did not even raise his head as he spoke. Then, he looked at Chun Qiu and said, “Chun Qiu, see if there are any True Swords.”","Chun Qiu nodded and began to rummage through his storage ring.","When Cheng Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing were in the Heavenly Region, they had almost emptied out Emperor Liu Ya’s Heavenly Court’s treasures. They had almost filled up an entire storage ring.","Soon, Chun Qiu took out a black True Sword without a scabbard from his storage ring and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","The True Sword was warm and not cold. The body of the sword was black, and only the words ‘Tianji’ was engraved on the hilt. It was a true treasure sword that was not weaker than Chen Qing’s sword.","“Catch,” Jian Wushuang threw the True Sword, Tianji, to Song Wuxin.","He was shocked. Even if he was slow-witted, he knew the weight of the True Sword in his hand. For a moment, he was speechless.","“If you want to cure him, you must first make yourself strong.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him with golden light in his eyes.","Song Wuxin swallowed his saliva and hugged the True Sword tightly.","...","Since then, they had not left this Heavenly Region for seven days.","The reason was that Jian Wushuang had been teaching Song Wuxin the most basic sword moves and comprehending Sword Intent.","“Brother Chun Qiu, I thought that Brother Jian was unapproachable, but now it seems that he’s rather approachable. Do you think he’ll tell me if I ask him about any cultivation problems in the future?”","On the roof of the restaurant, Chun Qiu looked at Cui Jing and smiled. “I’ll tell you about this kind of problem. You’ll know after getting to know him for a long time. Brother Jian is not a cold person. He will take care of the people around him.”","Cui Jing nodded and looked thoughtfully at the imposing figure who was just standing there. The light in the depths of his eyes became more and more determined.","Seven days passed by in a flash.","When the thin figure was surrounded by wisps of mist, he slowly opened his eyes.","“Let’s go,” he said. Jian Wushuang was concise. After saying these two words, he turned around and prepared to leave.","Song Wuxin kneeled on the ground and kowtowed more than ten times to his back.","Song Wuyan, who had a dazed look and only knew how to smile foolishly, saw his brother kneel down and quickly knelt down as well. He also kowtowed more than ten times.","“My Lord, I, Song Wuxin, have been wandering for half my life. No one has ever done me any favor or made my brother suffer all kinds of hardships.”","“I have received your kindness of a meal, a sword, and a thought. Song Wuxin has nothing to repay you with. I hereby swear that in 10,000 years, no matter what the result is, I will rush to your side. I am willing to be your pawn for life. Heaven and earth will be my witness.”","Jian Wushuang did not turn around. He just released the Yan power breeze to lift the two brothers up.","“Don’t think too much about it. I only did it on a whim, and I don’t expect anything in return.”","“As for you guys, let’s talk about it after you survive.”","With that, Jian Wushuang left slowly without stopping.","Song Wuxin subconsciously took a few steps forward, but he stopped in his tracks.","Then, he bent down and carried Song Wuyan on his back, and flew towards the corner of the sky.","...","Although he had stayed in this Heavenly Region for 10 days, it was just an instant.","During this time, the heroic-looking woman had slightly recovered from her injuries and was about to escape.","However, with Di Qing, Chen Qing, and the others guarding her, she was unable to escape.","“Tell me, why did you go to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture?” Jian Wushuang asked calmly with his hands behind his back.","The heroic-looking woman’s expression was cold, but there was inexplicable anger in her eyes.","“You’d better answer honestly, or else you won’t end up any better than the previous Yan Immortals,” Cheng Qing coldly threatened.","The heroic-looking woman snorted. Even in the face of Jian Wushuang, Di Qing and others, she was not afraid. “If you want to fight, do it quickly. There’s no need to waste your breath. This is not your style not long ago.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned.","“If you answer me honestly, I’ll let you off this time. Did you seven swordsmen go to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture to kill Prince Mo? ”","She said coldly, “Don’t you think that you’re asking a stupid question? Do you think I’ll answer?”","“Motherf*cker, I’m going to teach you a lesson,” Cheng Qing shouted angrily and raised his hand to teach her a lesson.","But then, Jian Wushuang stopped Chen Qing and said to her, “I’m not interested in whether your goal is to kill Prince Mo or not. I’m more interested in the power behind you. How strong can it be that your goal is to kill the Prince?”","The heroic-looking woman’s body trembled, and a trace of panic flashed through her eyes.","“You can leave now,” Jian Wushuang said and then signaled her to leave.","She was stunned, obviously not expecting him to let her go so easily.","However, the heroic-looking woman did not hesitate too much. Her figure flashed as she prepared to leave."]},{"number":4810,"title":"Chapter 4810 Returning to Little Lonely Heaven","paragraphs":["4810 Returning to Little Lonely Heaven","Just as she was about to leave, a voice made her stop in her tracks.","Jian Wushuang suddenly realized something and asked, “Have you seen a girl with bells all over her body?”","As soon as she said that, a trace of anger flashed in the eyes of the heroic-looking woman. “Isn’t that b*tch with you?”","“You’ve seen her before?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, I have. Not long ago, she tried to kill me. She thought I was dead and disappeared after taking my things.”","“Where did she go?” Jian Wushuang asked, his heart beating like a drum.","This time, she did not stay any longer, and her figure disappeared.","It was impossible for Jian Wushuang to remain calm when it came to the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor. Just as he was about to give chase, a soft but clear voice rang in his ears.","“Great Mi Heaven.”","The three words were imprinted in Jian Wushuang’s mind, causing him to frown.","It was another unknown place.","And was Yin Ling there with the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor?","It was simply wishful thinking to search for a person aimlessly in the vast Great Si Region.","However, with a possible location, all the goals were shortened.","Although he could not confirm whether the heroic-looking lady’s words were true, Jian Wushuang had already made up his mind to go to the so-called Great Mi Heaven to investigate.","After all, the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in Yin Ling’s hands was extremely important to him.","In the endless Great Yan Domain, the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was the closest clue to Xuan Yi so far, and it was likely to hide a big secret.","Therefore, he had to collect as many bone armors as possible.","After making up his mind, Jian Wushuang did not stay there any longer. He took everyone back to the Six Heavens Realm.","The Great Si Region, which was opened up by Emperor Zhen Wuyang, had gone through countless years of battle and swallowed up several Emperors from ancient times and their territories. It had become so vast that few Emperors’ territories could compare to it.","Even for Yan Immortals, traveling through the Heavenly Regions was a time-consuming task.","Therefore, there were some arrays set up between some super Heavenly Regions, which could lead them to the designated place through the power of the Immortal marks.","However, this kind of formation had the flaw of instability, so it was rarely used by Yan Immortals. They relied on their own power to travel.","After several years, the familiar Six Heavens Realm came into Jian Wushuang’s sight.","He looked back at the four godly figures behind him and then stepped into the Six Heavens Realm.","Perhaps it was because of the great changes in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, the Heavenly Regions controlled by the Young Emperor was completely clean. There were almost no signs of any living beings.","Looking in the direction of Big Lonely Heaven, Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment and finally decided to return to Little Lonely Heaven first.","However, when he entered Little Lonely Heaven, the small purple-robed companion of the Young Emperor seemed to have been waiting for a long time and directly came to greet him.","“Master Jian, the Young Emperor has been waiting for you for a long time. Come with me,” he nodded at Jian Wushuang and then walked forward to receive him.","A group of five figures rushed towards the central hall of Little Lonely Heaven.","As the clouds and mist dispersed, Jian Wushuang arrived in front of the hall and looked at the square in front of the hall.","There, a thin and weak figure was sitting cross-legged.","The Young Emperor, who was extremely pale, opened his eyes as if he had sensed something. When he saw Jian Wushuang, he stood up to welcome him.","However, before he could take two steps, he fell back to the ground.","The skinny purple-robed man hurriedly helped him up.","“Brother Jian, I knew you would come back,” he said weakly.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Are you okay?”","The Young Emperor shook his head. “I’m fine. I’ve been whipped too many times. They’re just some superficial wounds.”","The skinny purple-robed man added, “Because of the Fifth Prince’s matter, the Emperor was furious and investigated thoroughly. The other Princes were whipped thousands of times for various reasons.”","The Young Emperor looked at him and said in a low voice, “Brother Jian, Prince Mo is dead.”","Jian Wushuang nodded silently, “I know. I was there.”","He was slightly stunned. “Brother Jian, do you know who killed him?”","Jian Wushuang replied, “I don’t know. It was a mysterious person who destroyed his Immortal Source.”","“Then, Brother Jian, have you found the ‘Heaven-patterned Bone Armor’ that you need?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “The clue disappeared again.”","“Let’s not talk about this for now. You’ve been rushing all the way, go into the palace and rest first.” The Young Emperor looked at the two unfamiliar figures behind Jian Wushuang and asked, “Who are these two?”","“They are two like-minded friends I met on the road. They are temporarily staying by my side.”","The Young Emperor did not ask any more questions and led Jian Wushuang and the others into the hall.","“Prince Mo’s death has caused more than half of the Great Si Region to fall into a grave atmosphere. Although Imperial Father has not carried out a thorough investigation, I’m afraid that there will be no peace in the Heavenly Regions for a long time.”","Sitting beside Jian Wushuang, the Young Emperor analyzed, “Brother Jian, if the news or clues of the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor are cut off, it’s better to be idle for a while. It’s the safest.”","What the Young Emperor said was true. On the way back to the Six Heavens Realm, the atmosphere in the Heavenly Regions was heavy and there was a sense of undercurrent.","However, Jian Wushuang could not wait. Once Yin Ling left the so-called great Great Mi Heaven, the clue of the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor would really be cut off.”","He had already decided that after resting for a period of time, he would go to the Great Mi Heaven to find Yin Ling.","The Young Emperor’s voice rang out.","“Not long after Prince Mo’s death, Imperial Father summoned all of us to the Heavenly Court to investigate everything about Prince Mo.”","it was also at that time that there were irrepressible rumors that I was the one who killed Prince Mo, because a lot of black mountain crystals appeared in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture before it was destroyed.”","“Because of this, I was whipped 4,000 times!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was moved. He thought of the group of top cultivators who were peddling black mountain peak crystals in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture when he first entered.","Even Chun Qiu had almost died at the hands of a mysterious Yan Immortal.","The black mountain crystal that was flowing in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was definitely being sold by someone on purpose.","There was only one possibility for the Heavenly Court and Zhen Wuyang to know about this — someone had spread it on purpose.","In the end, they had obviously achieved their goal. All the blame for killing Prince mo was now on the Young Emperor.","Jian Wushuang did not intend to hide anything. He immediately told the Young Emperor what he had seen and heard in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","“In other words, as soon as you entered the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, there were already people setting up a situation to frame me? What a good plan.”","The Young Emperor’s eyes were cold, and he was really angry."]},{"number":4811,"title":"Chapter 4811 The Secret of the Past","paragraphs":["4811 The Secret of the Past","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “I’m sure that those guys have been planning this for a long time.”","“It seems that after failing to kill me, you’ve turned to kill the other Princes,” he sneered. “What a good plan.”","The Young Emperor asked again, “Speaking of which, you just said that Prince Mo died in the hands of a mysterious woman?”","Jian Wushuang nodded, but he did not say Zheng Ying’s name.","“To have such power to kill Prince Mo so easily, Brother Jian, why don’t you make a guess? Who sent these people?” the Young Emperor looked at him and said meaningfully.","In fact, after the complete destruction of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, he had some doubts. There was only one possibility that could mobilize two Grand Yan Immortals and seven peak Yan Immortals and set up a situation where the disaster was directed to the East.","It was the killing between the Princes.","The Young Emperor smiled. “It seems that you’ve guessed it, Brother Jian. However, without evidence, no one can guess which of us it is.”","“The only thing I’m pissed off about now is why the one who died wasn’t Prince Jiu.”","This kind of confusing situation could not be explained with just a few words, let alone a final conclusion. Otherwise, the Heavenly Court would have found out who the real murderer was.","Jian Wushuang did not intend to continue the topic. After all, it was meaningless.","After thinking about it for a while, Jian Wushuang made up his mind. He looked at the Young Emperor and said, “Do you know who is in charge of the Heavenly Region in the Great Mi Heaven?”","The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and looked a little strange. “Brother Jian, why do you ask?”","Jian Wushuang said, “Because I got the news that the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor is very likely to be in the Great Mi Heaven.”","He said profoundly, “You must be familiar with this Great Mi Heaven. It’s the Heavenly Region under the Second Prince, Prince Jiu’s jurisdiction.”","“Great Mi Heaven is under the control of Prince Jiu?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","The second Prince, Prince Jiu, was the one who had been defeated by Jian Wushuang in the fight for the Peach in the Heavenly Realm.","From a certain perspective, it would be a very troublesome matter to have an opponent like Prince Jiu.","From his style of doing things, as well as his extremely meticulous personality, he was a very difficult opponent.","More importantly, he had an endless stream of methods. Whether it was light or dark, he could inadvertently deal a heavy blow to his opponent.","Originally, Jian Wushuang had planned to reduce the conflict with him after the fight for the Immortal Peach. But now, he knew that the place that Yin Ling might go to was the Heavenly Region that was under the control of Prince Jiu.","It was even more troublesome now. He was afraid that he would be killed immediately if he appeared in Prince Jiu’s Heavenly Region.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang felt strange. Yin Ling was Prince Mo’s woman, so why did she escape to Prince Jiu’s Heavenly Region?","Seeing that the heroic woman did not seem to be lying when she left, the news about the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was very likely true.","“Brother Jian, are you planning to go to the Great Mi Heaven? No, I don’t agree to this,” the Young Emperor frowned and said. “At this point, even if you can reach Great Mi Heaven safely, it’s very likely that Prince Jiu will discover you immediately.”","“Once he finds out, I’m afraid...”","Jian Wushuang was also worried about this. Prince Jiu was definitely not an easy person to get along with. He might even be terrifying.","If they were discovered in the so-called Great Mi Heaven, it would definitely be a situation where they would fight to the death.","However, he had no way out.","One of the main reasons why he had come to the great Yan domain was to find Xuan Yi and Old Master. He had to untie the secret that had been binding him.","At the same time, there were also secrets about Taichu Divine World and the Divine Power Universe.","As his own realm grew, the Divine Power Universe, which he had thought had no secrets, actually had some secrets.","Why did the gods that he had met in the Land of Sorrows, who had existed for an unknown amount of time, fight?","Who was the old man, Shi Ting, who appeared like a graceful swan and guided Jian Wushuang forward? Why did he disappear without a trace?","And the Polar Sea that did not belong to the Divine Power Universe. Why was Old Man in the Divine Power Universe?","The most important point was what kind of existence divine power was, and whether the universe he had once been in was a reincarnation.","He could only find out about this after he found Xuan Yi and Old Master.","The Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was his only clue, and he could not let it go.","Even if the person in charge of the Great Mi Heaven was Emperor Zhen Wuyang, he had to go.","“I’ve already decided. No matter what, I’m going to go,” Jian Wushuang looked at the Young Emperor and said.","“You really want to go?”","“I really have to go.”","“Then I’ll go with you this time no matter what.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “IIn order to avoid being exposed, I plan to travel alone. It will be a waste of time if there are too many people.”","“But isn’t it more dangerous if there’s no one to take care of each other?” the Young Emperor frowned.","“We’ll talk about it when the time comes. I plan to rest for a while,” Jian Wushuang said. “But no matter what, you can’t go with me. If we are discovered, the problem will be more troublesome.”","The Young Emperor also knew the pros and cons of this. In the end, he sighed helplessly, got up, and patted his shoulder. “Brother Jian, take a good rest. I’ll discuss some things with you later.”","As the Young Emperor and the others left, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others, who had been eavesdropping outside the hall, rushed into the hall.","“Brother Jian, you’re going to that Great Mi Heaven? If you take me, Cheng Qing, with you, I’m sure you’ll be fine. Even if Young Master asks me to come, I’ll have to bow my head,” Cheng Qing grinned and said excitedly.","“Brother Jian, I’ll go with you too. We can look out for each other,” Chun Qiu added.","“Since you’re all going, I’ll follow,” Cui Jing agreed.","Jian Wushuang was helpless. “Calm down first. This time, it’s not like the time in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. I’m going to face Price Jiu. Besides, I’m going to look for something, not for revenge.”","“Cheng Qing, your figure is too prominent. Chun Qiu, if I’m not wrong, there’s an Immortal Source between your brows. You should be breaking through to the Yan Immortal realm soon. Just stay in Little Lonely Heaven.”","At this moment, Di Qing, who had been silent all this time, suddenly said, “This time, I’ll go with you.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him as if Di Qing was the most suitable candidate.","As a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan immortal, he could easily crush any ordinary great Yan immortal.","With Di Qing’s guarantee, only the Heavenly Court could touch him.","Then, Jian Wushuang nodded and confirmed the candidates who would go to the Great Mi Heaven this time."]},{"number":4812,"title":"Chapter 4812 Comprehending the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes","paragraphs":["4812 Comprehending the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes","He had decided that Cheng Qing would stay in the Six Heavens Realm.","As Chun Qiu and Cui Jing had eaten quite a number of supreme grade pills sealed by Emperor Liu Ya along the way, they had advanced to different degrees. It was only a matter of time before they became Yan Immortals, so the two of them were left to guard.","Jian Wushuang only decided to bring Di Qing along with him on this trip to the Great Mi Heaven controlled by Prince Jiu.","After making his decision, he went to the square outside the hall to recuperate and recover.","Chen Qing and the others also went into meditation to regulate their breathing. Ever since the destruction of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, they had suffered extremely serious injuries, so much so that they had not fully recovered their strength even after returning to the Six Heavens Realm.","If Jian Wushuang had not obtained Emperor Liu Ya’s comprehension inheritance, his power would definitely not have recovered to its peak.","Although he said that he was recuperating and recovering, he was actually starting to examine the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes that was sealed in his body and in his divine sense.","Di Qing followed him closely, the desire in his eyes almost overflowing.","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. He did not care about Di Qing and started to investigate the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes.","Di Qing also became nervous and concentrated, even more nervous than him.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang, who had looked like an old monk meditating, suddenly said slowly, “What is your relationship with Prince Mo?”","“Ah.” Di Qing was stunned for a moment, and then he responded after a moment of contemplation.","“Actually, we can be considered to have some kind of beneficial relationship, but we are far from being friends. After all, we are both taking what we need.”","At this point, Di Qing touched his nose awkwardly. “He wants my protection, and I just want some of his Imperial Father’s fate energy.”","“Prince Mo’s Imperial Father? Why do you need the fate energy of Zhen Wuyang?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and said.","Di Qing did not hide anything. “Every one Hua Year, Prince Mo will give me a wisp of Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s fate energy for me to comprehend, but the effect is minimal. I’m still stuck at the rank nine and can’t comprehend the mysterious Imperial Emperor’s fate energy.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang said, “Above the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal is the Emperor?”","Di Qing shook his head. “Emperors belong to the Grand Yan immortal realm, but the Grand Yan Immortal is by no means equal to the Emperor. It can even be said that they are two completely different existences.”","“To become an Emperor, one has to comprehend and derive one’s own Imperial Emperor fate energy. Only then can one create the Heavenly Court and control the Daos of countless Heavenly Region.”","“I’ve been trapped as a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal for a long time, so long that I’ve almost forgotten the past.”","Fatigue flashed across his eyes. “If I didn’t tell you, you probably wouldn’t have believed me. I’m actually from the same era as the Great Si Region’s Emperor, Zhen Wuyang.”","“But when he was a Five Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he comprehended and derived Imperial Emperor’s fate energy, while I have been trapped in Nine Revolutions for countless years, but I have still been stagnant and have not been able to sense even a trace of fate energy.”","He sighed as he said this.","Jian Wushuang understood a little after hearing it. He said slowly, “In the end, the cultivation is about the comprehension and control of the way of heaven and fate energy. These mysterious things can’t be comprehended by talent. The only thing you can do is to comprehend and be appropriate. Although what I said is a little empty, it is the truth.”","“Your Dao and your fate energy might appear in your heart one day in the future.”","Di Qing was silent. He began to reflect on the meaning of Jian Wushuang’s words, as if he was thinking about something.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He fell into deep thought and started to work on the Emperor Liu Ya’s runes in his divine sense.","Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes were the last Comprehension inheritance of Emperor Liu Ya. It was impossible for Jian Wushuang to not be tempted.","He had a feeling that even if he comprehended just a little bit, it would be an earth-shaking change for his current situation.","However, Comprehension was not like treating a guest to a meal. It was only natural for a guest to have a meal, and there were unknown variables involved.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had come into contact with a Great Dao that belonged to an Emperor. Naturally, he was extremely nervous.","In his divine sense, the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes showed a unique brilliance, making people feel a sense of respect and pilgrimage, and even more revealing an ancient aura.","Jian Wushuang turned into a phantom and walked in his consciousness.","After tens of millions of years of cultivation and growing step by step from insignificant to present, his consciousness had long reached perfection at Ancestor-realm, becoming a constantly changing sky sea.","With his vast and boundless divine sense, he could go to any corner he wanted in an instant.","The Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes occupied more than half of the space in his divine sense, and it looked like a sleeping bird in the clouds.","The closer he got to the comprehension, the more unbearable the heat swept over him. It burned the clothes that Jian Wushuang’s shadow was wearing, revealing his solid chest.","After the arm that was severed by the Liu Ya Imperial Emperor was remade, a terrifying aura surged out from the skin of his entire arm, as though dark green blood was flowing.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang also felt that the Ancestral Phoenix blood that Feng Qi, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, had left in his body in the divine power universe, had become full from its original weak state.","Everything seemed to have been done by the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes.","Jian Wushuang’s chest was bare, and his long hair that was tied behind him had been untied. It was flying in the air, and the brilliant divine patterns were flowing in his hair.","He walked forward slowly, facing the dormant cloud with the power of the ancient world, and reached out a finger to touch it.","In an instant, the mountains and seas were destroyed, the great sun withered, and the entire divine sense was set off with a great momentum.","Then, the hazy cloud materialized into a flying bird.","The dark green bird had six horns on its head, each of which was a different color, beautiful and mysterious.","It opened its eyes and its pure golden pupils seemed to see through Jian Wushuang in an instant.","Their eyes met, as if they were separated by an entire era. There was a desolate and ancient aura that he could not bear. He felt that every cell and pore in his body was under a heavy pressure and began to break apart.","“Return to where you’ve come from. This is not fate that you can control now. You can only have it when the great catastrophe is coming,” the bird with six horns and millions of feathers looked at Jian Wushuang and said.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang could be considered to be suffering in silence. He stood still on the spot and could not move at all. His entire body was completely captured by the aura.","Wisps of comprehension aura that were like wisps of mist all wanted to enter his body without caring about anything. At this moment, he could not run even if he wanted to."]},{"number":4813,"title":"Chapter 4813 Opening an Auction House","paragraphs":["4813 Opening an Auction House","At the same time, Jian Wushuang’s real body suddenly emitted an unimaginable and terrifying fate energy.","Di Qing, who was sitting beside him, was shocked.","Then, Di Qing came back to his senses, and his eyes were burning.","At that moment, there was an unknown aura surging around Jian Wushuang. It was extremely intimidating and it was the same aura as the Emperor Liu Ya’s aura in the Heavenly Court!","Di Qing was trying to suppress the restlessness in his heart, but soon the desire in his heart forced him to reach out to Jian Wushuang.","“Just one aura, just one wisp of aura...” he mumbled and then approached Jian Wushuang’s True Body.","The next moment, his face turned purple as he felt the True Power in his meridians being absorbed by an unknown force!","At the same time, his meridians could not withstand the tearing and were collapsing.","As a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, his Immortal body was almost at the peak, but he could not withstand this power. This power could only be the aura of an Emperor!","“Jian Wushuang... Quickly wake up!” Di Qing roared, and divine blood gushed out of his pores.","Jian Wushuang, who was in his own divine sense, was also suffering at the moment. He could not control his body at all and could only let all kinds of auras enter his body.","The six-horned bird could not stay calm either. Its golden eyes shot out a brilliant golden power and instantly cut off the strange suction force on Jian Wushuang’s True Shadow.","After that, the bird opened its beak and spat out a power, directly driving him out of the divine sense sky...","When Jian Wushuang’s True Shadow completely disappeared, the flying bird fell silent again. The flowing light that was emitted by the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes slowly circulated.","After leaving the divine sense sky, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and swallowed the Yan power. He felt a sharp pain in his deified soul and then he passed out.","Beside him, Di Qing’s breath was extremely weak. “S-so unfortunate...”","This coma lasted for a full year before he woke up.","Jian Wushuang, who originally thought that there would be future trouble, woke up and found that he had not suffered any injuries. Instead, he was full of Yan power, and his cultivation realm had fallen to the peak of the Yan Immortal realm.","However, Di Qing’s aura was a little weak, as if he was slowly recovering from a serious injury.","Jian Wushuang did not care. Since the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes were not something he could touch at the moment, he might as well not touch it. Instead, he prepared to go to the Great Mi Heaven.","“Are you alright? How did you end up like this?” he looked at Di Qing, who was in low spirits, and asked curiously.","Di Qing shook his head repeatedly. “I’m fine. I’m just slightly injured.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and stopped asking. He spent the next few days preparing.","Chun Qiu selected a total of 1,000 supreme-grade pills from the Emperor Liu Ya’s collection and placed them into his storage ring.","“Brother Jian, you must take these with you. They are all the best items that the three of us have selected from our collection. Every single one of them has heaven-defying effects.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and accepted it. This trip to the Great Mi Heaven where Prince Jiu was located would definitely be a hundred times more dangerous than the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture where Prince Mo was.","According to Prince Jiu’s calm and cautious character, he would have probably surrounded the entire Great Mi Heaven like an iron bucket.","These supreme-grade pills from Emperor Liu Ya’s collection might play a critical role at some point in time.","“Also, brother Jian, since we can’t follow you to the Great Mi Heaven this time, we won’t be idle either.”","Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and Cui Jing chatted with Jian Wushuang.","“The three of us are planning to set up an auction house outside the Six Heavens Realm.”","“An auction house?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. “What? You guys still need money to spend? Can you guys finish spending all those black mountain peak crystals?”","Chun Qiu scratched his head, “Opening an auction house in these Heavenly Regions to sell some things is just one of the aspects.”","“More importantly, it’s bartering. We’ve found too many precious treasures in that ancient Heavenly Court, but rather than keeping nearly half of them, we might as well exchange them for some treasures that can benefit you, Brother Jian.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang finally understood that the auction house that Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and Cui Jing wanted to set up was all for him. He shook his head and said, “Chun Qiu, I have no problem with you setting up an auction house, but remember not to take out too many treasures at one time, in case you get involved in unnecessary trouble.”","“Also, there’s no need to do it for me. You can use the treasures that you’ve obtained through bartering. The most important thing now is to improve your own strength.”","Chen Qing grinned. “Brother Jian, don’t worry. I will be in charge of the construction of the auction house this time. It will not rely on any Heavenly Region. When the time comes, I will call some of my old brothers over to guard it. Even if Emperor Zhen Wuyang comes over, he will have to pay the fee for his entry!”","Chun Qiu chuckled and added, “Brother Jian, no matter what, you’ll be the owner of our auction house from now on.”","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry. “Alright, alright. I’ll do as you say.”","...","Ten days later, Jian Wushuang left for the Great Mi Heaven with Di Qing.","When he was about to leave the Six Heavens Realm, the Young Emperor gave him a ring of gold and jade.","Then, he exhorted, “Brother Jian, you must remember that the Great Mi Heaven is not like the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. Prince Jiu has always had the heart of a mighty Lord, and his means are a hundred times more powerful than Prince Mo’s.”","“I’ve also heard that there’s a Grand Yan Immortal under him. Even if the situation is urgent, you must not fight with him in the Great Mi Heaven.”","Jian Wushuang took the ring and nodded. “Okay, I’ll keep it in mind.”","The Young Emperor took another step forward and said in a deep voice, “Brother Jian, if anything happens to you in Great Mi Heaven, I will definitely bury Prince Jiu with you!”","Jian Wushuang felt a little uncomfortable and said, “Don’t worry, I’ll be fine. I’ll come back as soon as I find it.”","The Young Emperor nodded. “That ring will be of great use at critical moments. Try not to use it unless it’s absolutely necessary.”","He nodded, and then, with Di Qing, they turned into two streaks of light and flew into the void.","“Your Highness, we should go back,” the skinny purple-robed man nodded.","The Young Emperor did not answer. His eyes were solemn. After a long while, he said, “My companion, who do you think the person beside him is?”","“I don’t know. However, I’m sure that those who can coompany Jian Wushang are definitely not ordinary people.”","“Is that so... Why do I feel like he’s so familiar? It’s really strange.”","...","Violent squalls roamed in the void, capable of even tearing apart stars.","Only Yan Immortals could withstand the astral winds for a long time and travel around the universe.","There were two figures that crossed billions of miles of void space in an instant and wandered in the boundless territory.","They were Jian Wushuang and Di Qing."]},{"number":4814,"title":"Chapter 4814 Demons Snatching the Bride","paragraphs":["4814 Demons Snatching the Bride","Jian Wushuang was completely at a loss about the entire Great Si Region.","Di Qing was obviously not much stronger than him. Although he lived in the same era as Zhen Wuyang, he had experienced something that made him not understand the entire Great Si Region at all.","This time, without Chen Qing leading the way, Jian Wushuang only knew the general location of the Great Mi Heaven but did not know where the shortcut was.","“Why don’t we try the so-called teleportation array?” Jian Wushuang looked at Di Qing and said.","“A teleportation Immortal array? Could it be a formation that Zhen Wuyang built before the War of Annexation?” Di Qing pondered for a moment and said. “Yes, I believe in that kind of Immortal array. It was once used as a hub to communicate with the military forces of various Heavenly Regions. As long as the Immortal pattern is complete, it can carry nearly 10,000 cultivators.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, “Then let’s give it a try.”","In order to hide their whereabouts and not be suspected, they traveled at high speed from the Six Heavens Realm for nearly half a year before they arrived at a remote heaven domain with a teleportation Immortal array.","Looking at the ten or so top cultivators who were guarding the Immortal array formation and sleeping soundly, Jian Wushuang stomped his foot in the void. Suddenly, Yan power’s power rose and lifted the ten or so top cultivators up.","“Who is it?” A young top cultivator, who was the leader of the group, woke up from the void with a dusty face.","“Hey, Kid, where can your Immortal array reach?” Di Qing asked in a deep voice.","Because Di Qing’s facial features were too three-dimensional, even if he did not release Yan power, he only needed to frown to reveal a terrifying aura.","The top cultivators, who had originally planned to suppress the two of them with their numbers, had inexplicably become well-behaved.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang threw a small bag of black mountain peak crystals to him.","The young leader’s eyes immediately brightened, and the unhappiness on his face disappeared.","“Yes, My Lord. Our Vast Sea Immortal Array was built by the Grand Yan Immortal under Emperor Zhen Wuyang. It has a long history and I guarantee that you can go anywhere you want. You can go to the Heavenly Regions such as Tianyi Heavenly Region, Luohai Heavenly Region, and the Great Pure Silence Heavenly Region...”","“Stop, stop, stop. Tell me if you can reach the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region.”","The Upper Desolate Heavenly Region was a Heavenly Region that was close to the Great Mi Heaven, but no one made any connections with it. Jian Wushuang had asked the Young Emperor and the others during the trip, so he naturally knew it by heart.","“The Upper Desolate Heavenly Region, that’s a place that no cultivator has been to for a long time...” a short top cultivator reminded him, but he was immediately glared back by the young top cultivator.","Then, the young top cultivator quickly stuffed the black mountain peak crystal into his pocket and nodded. “If you want to go there, of course we can go. Don’t worry, My Lords. Just stand in the center of the Immortal array and you’ll be there as soon as yoou open my eyes.”","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and then walked into the Immortal formation.","This Immortal formation was close to the Heavenly Region in the form of a formation eye. It stood in the void and gave off an ancient halo.","In the formation eye of this Immortal formation, there were close to 100 thick Immortal runes flowing. It was not bad.","“My Lords, stand firm!”","The young top cultivator in the lead shook his arms, and a powerful force turned into a stream of light and poured into the Immortal array.","With the combined power of ten top cultivators, the ancient Immortal formation rotated and the Immortal marks flowed. Then, Jian Wushuang and Di Qing disappeared.","“Pant, pant...” The young top cultivator panted heavily.","“Boss, I’m afraid it’s a little difficult to go to Upper Desolate with this array. The Immortal patterns shouldn’t be able to hold on...” the short top cultivator said with a worried look.","The young top cultivator continued, “Nonsense, they definitely won’t be able to reach the Upper Desolate. The Immortal array’s Immortal pattern is already half broken. Can we teleport that far?”","“If that Immortal formation breaks in the middle, I’m afraid they’ll all be seriously injured.”","“I knew it. I threw them to the nearest Heavenly Region. They can’t stand it. They will get lost. And I don’t think they know the Upper Desolate is in a mysterious place. I can’t sleep and eat well if I don’t make a profit from them.”","...","As the flowing light in front of them dissipated, the two figures stood in a rather mysterious mountain and water.","“So fast? I don’t think it’s even been ten breaths,” Jian Wushuang was a little shocked. “The Immortal formation was too fast...”","Di Qing was also a little surprised. Such speed was really good.","Jian Wushuang came back to his senses and looked at the mountain forest in front of him, which was full of Yan power and had a mysterious landscape, in confusion.","According to the Young Emperor, the Upper Desolate, which was close to the Great Mi Heaven, was a barren land with endless flying sand and stones. The weather was terrible, and even Yan Immortals were unwilling to stay there for long.","It was the main battlefield where Emperor Zhen Wuyang fought with another Emperor. The power of the Emperor turned the entire Heavenly Region into a desolate place.","In the end, the victorious Zhen Wuyang rebuilt the Heavenly Region and named it Upper Desolate.","However, this Heavenly Region was completely different from the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region that the Young Emperor had described.","“Could this really be the Upper Desolate?” Jian Wushuang was a little confused, but no one could answer him, because Di Qing was also confused.","“It seems like the environment here is quite good. There should be peak cultivators or Yan Immortals living here. Let’s find some cultivators and ask them first,” Jian Wushuang made up his mind and then asked Di Qing for directions.","“The four wild mountains and rivers blend well together, the water and grass were abundant, it was a rare secluded Heavenly Region.”","Just as Jian Wushuang was searching for traces of cultivators, the clouds in the sky suddenly darkened.","At the same time, the forest that had been like a paradise suddenly dimmed due to the changes in the clouds, and a cold wind blew.","“What’s the situation?” Jian Wushuang frowned and then signaled Di Qing to hide his aura.","Not long after they concealed their auras, strange laughter rang out from all directions and finally gathered in the forest.","“Hehehe...”","As this strange laughter resounded, a moment later, more than ten strange figures appeared in the forest.","Each of these strange monsters was tall and burly, each of them was several feet tall, ugly, and black all over, with eyes and thick canine teeth turned out at the same time, like a skinned monkey.","These ten or so ugly figures were all jumping forward. Even their ugly faces could not hide the smug smiles on their faces.","If one looked carefully, they would see that the reason these ugly figures were jumping forward was because they were carrying a wedding carriage in the middle.","The wedding carriage was as red as blood, appearing extremely strange in the dark forest.","Jian Wushuang, who had completely hidden his aura, saw this scene and could not help frowning slightly. Then he looked at Di Qing.","Di Qing understood and immediately released a great burst of Yan power.","At this moment, a whimpering sound that seemed to be struggling rang out from the wedding carriage."]},{"number":4815,"title":"Chapter 4815 Nightmare Demon Lord","paragraphs":["4815 Nightmare Demon Lord","The whimpering sound was obviously made by a woman. At the same time, it was accompanied by the sound of kicking, which caused the entire wedding carriage to shake.","However, the giant-like figures with ugly faces did not care at all and continued to jump forward happily.","“Help me... Sob, sob...”","A muffled voice came from the carriage.","“Was the bride kinapped?” Jian Wushuang looked at the ugly figures and frowned.","“I’ll kill him directly. I’ll find out what’s going on later,” Di Qing said.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He could tell that these ugly figures were not good people almost immediately. The special power that they exuded was not like Yan power, but it also had an aura that made people uncomfortable.","Then, Di Qing stretched out his hand and waved it, and an irresistible Yan power spread out.","The dark forest around them brightened up in an instant under the impact of the gilded Yan power, and even the gloomy sky cleared up.","The dozen or so ugly figures were only at the ancestor-level, so how could they resist Di Qing’s Yan power? before they could even react, they were burned into smoke.","The palanquin fell to the ground with a bang and fell silent.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing immediately revealed themselves from the forest.","The ugly figures that had been directly burned into green smoke condensed from the ground again, as if the sand had gathered into a tower.","They were puzzled and scratched their heads. Then, they looked around with their big eyes and happened to meet the eyes of the two people who had just appeared.","All of a sudden, all of the ugly figures roared in rage, and their thick canine teeth grew several times longer. Even their bodies, which were more than ten meters long, began to be surrounded by a dark aura.","They were furious and strode over to crush Jian Wushuang and Di Qing.","However, Jian Wushuang did not even look at them. He pointed his finger forward and Yan power, as heavy as the mountains and seas, flowed out from his finger. It turned into thousands of magnificent silk ribbons and strangled them all.","“Strange, why didn’t I kill them just now?” Di Qing was puzzled.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to speak, he heard another sound from the ground. Wisps of black smoke rose from the ground and formed a tower of sand, then transformed into more than ten ugly figures.","There were 12 figures in total, and none of them were missing.","One should know that Jian Wushuang’s attack was enough to suppress a Yan Immortal to the point where he could not even lift his head!","However, it did not affect them at all.","The 12 ugly figures were even more furious, and they rushed over with a terrifying force.","Jian Wushuang frowned and pointed his finger again. Yan power, which was several times more terrifying than before, surged out and cut them into pieces again. Not even a trace of aura was left.","“What are these things? They’re even harder to kill than Yan Immortals?” Di Qing also frowned.","Although these guys were so vulnerable, their continuous resurrection still made the two of them curious.","As expected, the 12 ugly figures condensed again, but this time they were a little dim.","At this moment, a head popped out from the curtain of the bridal carriage. It spat out the ball of red thread in its mouth and shouted in a hurry, “They are all Nightmares. You can’t kill them. Run!”","“Nightmares? This is getting interesting...” Jian Wushuang laughed as he had already thought of a countermeasure.","This time, he did not kill them directly. Instead, he released Yan power to form a cage and trapped the 12 figures inside. He kept pulling them away and consuming them.","The so-called Nightmare was an extremely special energy. They were born without a physical body, because they were imagined by people in their sleep, and they only existed by relying on some mysterious medium.","This was also why Jian Wushuang and Di Qing had not been able to kill them.","However, Jian Wushuang could tell that there was a limit to their power. As long as they were trapped, the Nightmare would naturally dissipate.","As expected, the nightmare tapir that was trapped in Yan power’s cage became even dimmer. They were no longer alive after repeatedly gathering and dispersing.","The eyes of the girl who had poked her head out of the bridal carriage lit up when she saw the scene of so many Nightmare terrors being killed.","Even though her hands and feet were tied up by the red rope, she still jumped out of the carriage and fell heavily on the ground.","“Aiya...” She felt the pain, her brows furrowed slightly, and her thin lips pursed.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and then walked towards her.","It was said that a woman’s most beautiful day was when she got married and put on makeup.","The woman in front of him was even more so. She was dressed in a bright red silk dress, her eyebrows were like distant mountains, and her lips were like a little bun. Although her cheeks were flushed, it was still difficult to hide her heroic spirit.","In particular, there was a sesame mole on the corner of her mouth, which added a little liveliness and agility.","As soon as she saw the two of them walking towards her, she immediately nodded excitedly.","“Miss, is this place called Upper Desolate?” Jian Wushuang, the leader of the group, asked. At the same time, he waved his hand and untied the red rope on her.","The girl saw the light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes and quickly saluted, “Thank you for saving me, Sir.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and repeated his question.","“Upper Desolate? This is Qingzhou...” the young lady said, somewhat puzzled.","“Qingzhou? What is this place? Is this a Capital in the Upper Desolate?” Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other, and a vague intuition came to their minds that they seemed to have been tricked...","After another round of urgent questioning with the woman, he finally came to a real conclusion.","They had really been scammed.","The woman in front of him was not an ordinary woman. She was the only daughter of the biggest sect in the Qingzhou. She had visited several Heavenly Regions before and naturally knew some of their names.","The Heavenly Region that Jian Wushuang and Di Qing were in was actually called the green domain. It was a completely different Heavenly Region from the Upper Desolate, which was close to the Great Mi Heaven ...","“Damned thing, they actually dared to scam me,” Di Qing was furious, and a terrifying Yan power spread out.","“Alright, at most, we’ll just look for it again. It won’t take long,” Jian Wushuang comforted him.","The girl’s bright eyes rolled and then she looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Master, are you going to Upper Desolate?”","Jian Wushuang nodded without hiding anything.","“That’s great. I just happen to know...”","Before she could finish her sentence, the surrounding mountains, rivers, and forests suddenly trembled.","The earth was torn apart and the mountains collapsed. It was a scene of destruction.","At the same time, the sky darkened, and he could not see the palm clearly.","The lady’s expression changed. “It’s the Demon Lord! Nightmare Demon Lord is here!”","As her voice fell, there seemed to be some kind of unknown suppression falling from the sky, quickly swallowing and covering everything.","Even the thick ancient trees could not withstand the heavy pressure and were shattered on a large scale."]},{"number":4816,"title":"Chapter 4816 Xi Qingchi","paragraphs":["4816 Xi Qingchi","It was as if something that had been sleeping for ages had awakened.","As the canopy that covered the sky shattered, a lustrous dark sky was revealed.","At the same time, the wailing of a bugle horn resounded in the wilderness.","“Sir, let’s go. This Demon Lord is devouring a cultivator’s mind. His intelligence is the most powerful. If we are not careful, we will become his slave.”","In the hazy gray darkness, a lady in a red silk dress urged them, “I know the way. Please leave with me, My Lords.”","Jian Wushuang stood still and looked at the sky.","The aura was quite special and thick, surrounding the three of them and blocking all their escape routes.","Then, two huge eyes as bright as the moon appeared. They were so clean and clear that they could reflect all things.","A moment later, the two giant eyeballs suddenly produced hundreds of millions of pitch-black threads, and at the end of the threads, they finally condensed into an extremely strange shadow.","That shadow was extremely hazy, as if it was formed from a mixture of various unknown substances, looking extremely strange.","It had two huge and clear eyes, which looked like two round wings.","Such a so-called Demon Lord was only in the Yan Immortal realm, so Jian Wushuang was naturally not afraid.","“You’re just pretending to be mysterious. Are you afraid of showing your face?” Jian Wushuang was already in a bad mood, so he released Yan power and struck out with his palm.","A full-power attack belonging to a peak Yan immortal was unleashed without holding back, smashing towards the strange shadow in the air.","“Lowly slaves, all of you must submit to me!” The shadow spoke the truth. In the face of Di Qing’s attack, it obviously did not bother to dodge.","In the next moment, a shocking scene appeared. The shadow with an overbearing aura was slapped down from the sky by Jian Wushuang’s palm and smashed into the ground, stirring up dust.","The lady was shocked. She covered her mouth with one hand and looked at the scene in disbelief.","The Nightmare Demon Lord that had made more than half of the Qingzhou submit and tremble had been slapped into the ground by this young man who was extremely handsome?","That was a Demon Lord in the Yan immortal stage!","However, Jian Wushuang did not think that way. The so-called Nightmare Demon Lord, other than using some kind of bewitching method to erode the state of mind of ordinary top cultivators, his real body was even worse than an ordinary Yan Immortal.","What was even more unfortunate was that Jian Wushuang’s divine soul had already reached perfection when his Divine Power Universe reached Ancestor realm. It was far beyond Nightmare Demon Lord’s level.","Even if he stood still and let the demon eat away at his Heart Realm, he would only return empty-handed.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang did not bother to use any other tricks and directly destroyed it with one palm.","The extremely dense black gas in the sky instantly dissipated, and the two huge moon-like eye wheels were blinded by Di Qing.","“Lowly servant, how dare you, how dare you...”","Before he could finish his sentence, Jian Wushuang slapped Nightmare Demon Lord again and sent him into the ground.","“You’re noisy,” Jian Wushuang frowned. It was just a Nightmare that was born from greed. It was not worthy of his time.","Since they knew that this was not the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region, he and Di Qing did noto plan on staying any longer. They turned around and prepared to leave.","“My Lords, please wait!” A cry rang out. It was the girl wearing the dress who was trying ask them to stay.","When she saw him turn around, her cheeks became even redder. She reached out to tie her hair and bowed stiffly. “My name is Xi Qingchi. Thank you for saving my life. I can’t repay you, I hope...”","Jian Wushuang did not want to wait for her to finish. He waved his hand and planned to leave.","“Hey, can you listen to me... I’ll finish my words,” The girl called Xi Qingchi said in a sweet voice.","“I know about the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region that you guys are talking about.”","Jian Wushuang stopped and looked at her again. He said with uncertainty, “Do you really know?”","Xi Qingchi raised her eyebrows proudly. “Of course! My father is the Sect Master of the number one sect in Qingzhou. He has countless resources. I traveled to various Heavenly Regions with my father back then!”","He pondered for a moment and then said, “In that case, can you tell me the approximate location of Upper Desolate?”","“Is it important for you to go to Upper Desolate?”","“I guess so.”","“That’s good. Since you saved me... For the sake of this little girl’s life, I’ve decided to take you there personally.”","“... There’s no need for that, the journey is dangerous.”","“No, I have to bring you there. That place is extremely desolate and hidden. Even if I tell you the general location, you won’t be able to find it.”","“...”","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and could not make up their minds.","Right at this moment, the illusory shadow that was almost shattered by the two slaps crawled out from the ground and prepared to escape.","Xi Qingchi saw this clearly and hurriedly said, “My Lord, you can’t let him escape. He’s a great danger!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and with a wave of his hand, he took the demon into his hands and squeezed it into the size of a pellet with Yan power.","Xi Qingchi was once again shocked by this method. The Demon Lord, who was on par with her father, was actually being toyed with by this man.","“Let go of me, you lowly servants! You will regret this!” The Demon Lord, who had been compressed into the size of a pellet, was furious. He seemed to know no fear and kept shouting.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to put it out, Xi Qingchi suddenly stretched out two hands and caught his palm. Her eyebrows curved into crescents, “Master, can you give this to me? I plan to feed it to my Dream-Eating Tapir.”","Jian Wushuang pulled back his hand and threw the Demon Lord to her.","“Thank you, My Lord,” Xi Qingchi said happily. Then, she untied the red ribbon on her hair and tied up the Demon Lorod, who was the size of a pellet.","“Are you going to take us to the Upper Desolate?” Di Qing interjected and asked.","Xi Qingchi nodded repeatedly. “Of course. You won’t be able to reach the Upper Desolate without my guidance.”","“Shall we leave now?” Jian Wushuang said.","“There’s no rush. You guys follow me back to the sect first. I plan to bring some things with me before we set off,” Xi Qingchi said. Then, she changed her previous attitude of a little girl and began to run in the forest with large strides. “You guys, quickly follow me.”","“How troublesome. I’ll catch those damn things sooner or later and skin them alive.” Di Qing said angrily.","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly, then followed Xi Qingchi with Di Qing.","As the mysterious mountains and rivers were left behind, the number of cultivators gathered on the surrounding land also began to increase."]},{"number":4817,"title":"Chapter 4817 Going to Upper Desolate","paragraphs":["4817 Going to Upper Desolate","After traveling for less than half a day, the Sect Elders and a group of disciples who had come to find Xi Qingchi appeared in front of them.","“Uncle Li, you guys are finally here!” Xi Qingchi’s face was filled with anger. “If you had come a little later, were you planning to go to the demon’s lair to find me?”","The Elder known as Uncle Li had a calm expression and held a jade staff in his hand. After hearing her complaints, he smiled bitterly. “My Little Ancestor, we’ve all been trying our best to find you. We’ll definitely find you in less than half a day.”","Xi Qingchi snorted, then picked up the red ribbon tied to the Demon Lord and shook it. “I’ve already caught this guy. Let’s return to the sect!”","Uncle Li was stunned. Before he could calm down, the figure in Xi Qingchi had already swept into the distance like a graceful swan.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing followed him.","On a misty mountain, there were more than 100 chains that cut across the mountains, connecting the sects on each peak together. It was a majestic sight.","This was the most famous sect in the entire Qingzhou. It was called the Shangqing Pavilion. Almost half of the cultivators in the Qingzhou Yeavenly Region were proud to cultivate in the Shangqing Pavilion.","This was because the Sect Master of the Shangqing Pavilion was a powerful Yan Immortal, and he had more than a dozen powerful disciples who had entered the Yan stage. No matter which Heavenly Region he was on, he was an existence that dominated.","The great Mountain-Guarding Formation that enveloped the entire Shangqing Pavilion also showed its transcendent status.","Although the Mountain-Guarding Formation could be easily destroyed by Jian Wushuang, he still restrained his aura and prepared to enter the mountain gate of Shangqing Pavilion with Di Qing.","However, immediately after, more than ten disciples who were guarding the mountain flew out from the dark and stopped them.","“Shangqing Pavilion is an important place, outsiders are not allowed!”","“A bunch of stupid things, can’t you see that this lady invited an important guest?” Xi Qingchi turned around and scolded angrily.","“It’s alright, Miss Xi. We won’t go in. We’ll wait here for a day. If it’s really inconvenient for Miss Xi, we’ll take our leave,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently. He took a few steps back and waited quietly.","“Hmm, okay. I’ll go with you after I get my things.” Xi Qingchi said hurriedly. Then, her figure flashed and she directly entered the mountain gate.","Looking at her figure, Jian Wushuang had a premonition that something was off.","...","“Why can’t I go? I must go today!”","Inside the Shangqing Pavilion.","Xi Qingchi stood on a mountain rock and shouted angrily with her hands on her hips. She had already changed from her red makeup to a plain shirt.","“You dare ask me to lure out the Nightmare Demon Lord? And now, you don’t dare let me travel outside our Heavenly Region? ”","“Nonsense! Qingchi, hurry up and come down!” a middle-aged man in a white robe, who had a myriad of brilliance hidden within him, shouted angrily. His every move was surging with Yan power.","Xi Qingchi still had her hands on her hips. “I won’t. Xi Qinghua, do you agree or not?”","“I don’t agree!” The middle-aged man was furious. “You wretched girl, do you know your place? Do you know what a Heavenly Region is? A little girl like you, you couldn’t even get out of the Heavenly Region before you were torn apart by the astral wind!”","“Don’t give me that. I’ve heard this kind of lie a lot. Don’t try to lie to me, I’m leaving this time, no one can stop me!” Xi Qingchi shouted.","The middle-aged man clearly had no intention of tolerating this unruly and willful girl. With a wave of his hand, thousands of wisps of light immediately firmly wrapped around Xi Qingchi and dragged her down from the mountain rock.","“Just you wait, girl. You can forget about getting out even if you miss 1 year out of 100 years of confinement!”","“Ah! No, Father, I don’t want to be confined!” Xi Qingchi screamed and struggled, but she was only at the peak of the Entry Yan stage. How could she break free from the restraints of a Yan Immortal?","Right at this moment, a stream of light instantly shot down from the mountain rock, directly cutting off the light in the middle-aged man’s hand. Then, he directly carried Xi Qingchi on his back and ran.","Due to its extreme speed, by the time he reacted, the stream of light had already fled more than a hundred miles away.","It was a strange beast that was completely snow-white and looked like a fox but also like a mystic tiger. It was so fast that it carried Xi Qingchi and escaped from the mountain gate of Shangqing Pavilion in a flash.","“All Elders and disciples of the Shangqing Pavilion, listen up. Capture Xi Qingchi alive. I’ll bethroth her... to whoever that catches her!”","For a moment, all the sects of the Shangqing Pavilion were in an uproar. A total of more than 60,000 disciples were all dispatched to capture Xi Qingchi alive!","Jian Wushuang, who had been waiting outside the mountain mate, raised his eyebrows slightly when he heard the warning that resounded through the sky.","A moment later, a gust of fragrant wind swept out from the mountain gate. Xi Qingchi, who was riding on the back of the strange beast, was excited. “My Lord, my father has agreed. Let’s run!”","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and then shook their heads helplessly.","In this originally misty and aloof mountain gate, a grand chase was staged.","Three figures broke through the clouds and flew up, followed by tens of thousands of disciples. They were quite frightened.","However, with the help of Jian Wushuang and Di Qing, the tens of thousands of disciples could only watch the three figures disappear into the sky like stars.","The middle-aged man rushed over after a while, but when he saw that the clouds had already been emptied, there was no sign of his daughter.","He was in despair and roared, “Who is it? Who took my daughter away!”","In the distance, the sound of Xi Qingchi seemed to come from the heavens, “Father, don’t worry. I will be safe and sound. Maybe I will find mother in the process of my travels in the future...”","“You’re gonna anger me to death...”","The clouds and smoke dispersed, and the blue sky disappeared. In its place was an endless void.","Countless suns and stars decorated it, and many Heavenly Regions and planes also entered her eyes.","“It’s so beautiful. No wonder my mother left my father to travel in the void!” Xi Qingchi muttered.","Jian Wushuang did not want to ask about her family’s private affairs. He also knew that the girl had snuck out without her father’s permission, so he planned to send her back once he knew the exact location of the Upper Desolate.","Then, he asked, “I say, Miss Xi, do you know where the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region is?”","Xi Qingchi regained her senses and blinked her lively eyes. Then, she said with certainty, “I know, I definitely know. It’s there.”","With that, she stretched out her slender palm and pointed to a desolate void where even the sun and stars were rare.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing were on their last legs. They did not care if she was telling the truth or not. After confirming it again, they moved forward.","With his Yan power’s protection, even though Xi Qingchi was only at the peak of Entry Yan cultivation realm, she could still deal with the terrifying void astral winds with ease."]},{"number":4818,"title":"Chapter 4818 Strange Movement","paragraphs":["4818 Strange Movement","The ten-feet-long strange beast that was originally under Xi Qingchi had now shrunk to the length of an arm, and was lying on the back of her neck with its eyes closed in comfort.","The man and beast did not feel that traveling through the void was a dangerous thing. Instead, they were very relaxed.","Jian Wushuang was helpless. This girl was simply an extra-large burden. If he really took her to the Great Mi Heaven, he was afraid that there might be trouble.","Di Qing’s face was cold. Perhaps he was in a bad mood because he was tricked by those guys who were guarding the Immortal array not long ago, so he naturally did not have a good impression of Xi Qingchi.","In his opinion, the lower the cultivation level of a person, the more sinister and cunning they were, and this included the woman in front of him.","“Are you leading the way correctly?” Di Qing still did not believe her and asked.","Xi Qingchi held little beast in her arms, and she dodged his gaze. “O-of course it’s right. I-I went with my father back then...”","He snorted coldly again. “If you dare to lie to us, you’ll end up like them!”","With that, Di Qing clenched his fist and several ancient stars exploded. An unimaginable doomsday scene appeared in the void, and a black hole was formed in the void.","“Gulp...” Xi Qingchi swallowed hard, and the corners of her mouth twitched involuntarily.","Even her father could not do such a destructive thing.","The little beast in her arms seemed to feel threatened and bared its teeth at Di Qing.","“Alright, let’s continue our journey,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently. His peaceful aura calmed Di Qing down and he was no longer troubled by Xi Qingchi.","After recovering from the chill just now, Xi Qingchi was already regretting leaving the her Heavenly Region.","She shouted in her heart, ‘Who knows where that damn Upper Desoalte is... I was just saying it casually, do you have to be so serious?’","‘The Upper Desolate, the Upper Desolate, as its name suggests, must be a desolate and broken Heavenly Region. It must be right to think about it this way. God bless me that I didn’t point me in the wrong direction, God bless...’","There was no turning back. Xi Qingchi had already decided to be stubborn to the end. Since there was no way out, she might as well let go. In order to increase her credibility, she waved her hand from time to time to correct the way forward, running toward the more remote and desolate depths of the void.","Jian Wushuang nodded to himself. From the route she pointed out, it was basically in line with the environment of the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region.","As they moved forward, there were very few Heavenly Regions and Heavenly Realms in the boundless void. Even the great sun and stars were very rare.","Everything in sight was deathly silent and cold.","This extremely boring journey, accompanied by the cold and dry void, made the initial excitement of Xi Qingchi turn into fatigue.","This journey was completely different from what she had imagined, where she would be independent with a sword, dressed in fresh clothes and riding a horse.","However, there was no turning back now that she had chosen this path...","The journey in the void seemed to be never-ending, and Xi Qingchi was already dizzy and muddled.","Jian Wushuang finally smelled the aura of a restriction in the void.","Di Qing naturally felt it as well, and he opened his golden eyes to investigate.","The aura of the restriction was ancient, silent, and extremely secretive. It was obvious that the Almighty who set up this kind of aura restriction did not want to be detected by others.","Jian Wushuang was the most sensitive to aura comprehension. Soon, he locked his eyes on the deep void in front of him.","In that place, there was an ancient Heavenly Region that had been silent for countless years and no cultivators had ever stepped into it.","“is that place the Upper Desolate?” Jian Wushuang murmured but quickly denied it. The Upper Desolate was a barren land. The scorching dark red was like a purgatory. It was completely different from this Heavenly Region.","However, to be on the safe side, he still decided to go and find out.","The three figures flew toward the unnamed Heavenly Region like flowing lights.","The ancient and silent power of the restriction covered the entire Heavenly Region like a layer of sticky water.","As soon as they entered, they felt an unparalleled pressure.","Xi Qingchi grunted and the aura around it immediately weakened.","Even Jian Wushuang felt the pressure, let alone her.","As far as the eye could see, the entire Heavenly Region realm was made up of rugged dark red rocks.","Other than the mountain rocks, there were no other existences.","The restrictive aura was even more obvious, but he didn’t know where it came from.","“Are you sure this is Upper Desolate?” Di Qing asked Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked around and finally looked at Xi Qingchi.","With his Yan power’s protection, Xi Qingchi quickly recovered from her daze. However, when it saw the two of them looking at her, she broke out in a cold sweat.","“It looks like... Probably... Probably not...”","“Is it or not?” Di Qing shouted in a deep voice.","“Why are you so fierce...” In the end, Xi Qingchi did not dare to finish her sentence. She only shook her head. “No, definitely not.”","Jian Wushuang said, “Since this is not the place, let’s leave. We can’t delay our journey.”","Di Qing nodded. When Xi Qingchi was about to leave, she suddenly screamed. The little beast that had been sitting on her neck seemed to be pulled by some unknown force and fell straight down.","“San Qing!” She cried out in alarm and then rushed to the ground without a care.","Jian Wushuang frowned and rushed down with a flash.","Perhaps it was because of the restrictive spell, the gravity in this area was millions of times heavier, and the falling speed was extremely fast.","After that, a bunch of brilliant rays caught the falling little beast and Xi Qingchi, and finally let her land safely.","Xi Qingchi held the little beast and sat on the ground, looking at Jian Wushuang gratefully.","“Don’t be so reckless next time. Leave quickly,” he said indifferently, then turned around and prepared to leave.","At this moment, the ancient aura seemed to wake up from the ancient times and gushed out.","“Emperor, is that you?!”","An excited and ancient voice resounded throughout the entire Heavenly Region.","The voice contained order, the Great Dao, and the blessing of fate energy. It was extremely complicated and rare.","Xi Qingchi was so shocked that she stood up in an instant and jumped behind Jian Wushuang like a rabbit.","“Emperor, is it you? Are you here to welcome us?”","The voice was deep and filled with excitement and uncertainty as it carefully inquired.","Di Qing was also shocked. Facing the aura of the voice, he felt like he was facing a great enemy.","Jian Wushuang remained silent. At the same time, he retreated slowly, ready to escape at any time.","Now that things had come to this, he understood that this Heavenly Region that he had accidentally barged into was likely to seal an ancient almighty existence."]},{"number":4819,"title":"Chapter 4819 The Imprisoned Great Yan Immortal","paragraphs":["4819 The Imprisoned Great Yan Immortal","Furthermore, it was very likely that this ancient mighty figure was sealed when Zhen Wuyang opened up the Great Si Region, and they were in a hostile state.","Xi Qingchi squatted behind Jian Wushuang and looked around with her beautiful eyes in horror.","“The Emperor? Emperor, why aren’t you saying anything?”","The voice that could intimidate Di Qing was extremely careful, showing a sense of submission.","Jian Wushuang, who was originally a little nervous, calmed down because he could hear the respect and rich feeling in the voice. It was definitely not a treacherous villain.","“Wushuang, quickly leave this place,” Di Qing said cautiously.","Jian Wushuang looked at him and then said, “No hurry. Let’s wait here for a while.”","With that, he slowly walked forward.","“Wait for me,” he said. Xi Qingchi quickly followed, afraid that she would fall behind.","Di Qing frowned and eventually followed without saying a word.","The reason why Jian Wushuang did not leave but walked forward slowly was that the calls gave him an inexplicable sense of familiarity, which was strange.","The further they went, the clearer the sound became.","“Your subjects pay their respects to the Emperor!”","An ancient cry seemed to come from the earth’s core, respectful and pious to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang was moved. Then he looked at the craggy rocks under his feet. The sounds obviously came from the core of the earth.","After a moment of silence, he said, “Everyone, I’m just a passer-by, not your Emperor.”","The voices disappeared and then resounded again. “That’s impossible. You have the aura of an Emperor around you. How can you not be a subordinate Emperor?”","“Emperor, are you going to give up on your subjects?”","The voice suddenly sounded sad and lonely.","“I’m really not your Emperor. I’m just a passerby who accidentally entered this place.” Jian Wushuang was helpless. At the same time, he asked, “What’s the name of your Emperor?”","Those voices suddenly became alert. “Are you all the lackeys of Zhen Wuyang?”","Jian Wushuang replied, “No, don’t worry.”","The voice fell silent for a moment before it finally said, “This is the Emperor’s True Name. Emperor Liu Ya.”","The thought in his heart was like a thunderclap.","Wasn’t the name ‘Emperor Liu Ya’ the owner of the former Heavenly Court that Jian Wushuang and the others had unintentionally entered earlier?","It was impossible for the Emperor’s True Name to be repeated. Combined with the excitement and piety of these voices, they were definitely once the Emperor Liu Ya’s subjects.","However, this was too much of a coincidence...","He had accidentally entered a Heavenly Region and the almighty being sealed inside was actually related to the Emperor Liu Ya.","“Since you said that you’re a passerby, why do you have the aura of Emperor Liu Ya on you?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang said, “This matter can’t be explained in a few words. Please show yourselves.”","The world was silent for a long time before the voice sighed. “It’s not that we don’t want to show ourselves, but we’re really powerless. Our Immortal Source has been imprisoned by the men under Zhen Wuyang. Our divine bodies are bound and we can’t move at all.”","Jian Wushuang was moved. From the direction of the sound, he had already determined that the place where they were imprisoned was the divine mountain in front of them.","He leaped up and faced the divine peak. His fingers were like blades, and thousands of Sword Intents rose up, cutting the divine peak in half with great momentum.","Swish!!!","The entire divine peak was split into two. At the same time, Jian Wushuang released his Sword Intent continuously and cut the divine peak like a sculpture.","In the end, the entire divine peak was cut off, leaving only a base that was thousands of feet tall.","Then, with a wave of his hand, stone chips kept falling off, and finally, chains as thick and long as True Dragons were revealed.","There were more than a thousand chains, and at the end of the chains, 18 figures were bound.","The clothes on their bodies were already in tatters, and their bound limbs were twisted in a rather strange posture. It was obvious that they had been broken.","Just like that, a total of 18 figures were imprinted in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Xi Qingchi covered her mouth with her hand, afraid of making a sound.","Di Qing also frowned and was always on guard.","18 figures, 18 Grand Yan Immortals.","However, Jian Wushuang did not expect them to be in such a miserable state.","In the face of such a huge movement, the 18 figures naturally noticed it, but they were all at a loss. No one looked at Jian Wushuang and the others, as if they did not exist.","Jian Wushuang looked at them and quickly found the reason.","These 18 Grand Yan Immortals had their eyeballs dug out, leaving only empty eye sockets. Naturally, they could not see the outside world.","“Are you still there?” The leader of the group, an old man with long eyebrows, asked carefully.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “I’m here.”","“If that’s the case, can you tell me why you have the Emperor Liu Ya’s aura on you?” the long-browed old man said.","“Of course, I can tell you.” Jian Wushuang did not intend to hide anything. He immediately told them in detail about how he had unintentionally entered Emperor Liu Ya’s Heavenly Court and how he had obtained Emperor Liu Ya’s Comprehension.","Di Qing was cautious. He immediately released Yan power and wrapped it around Xi Qingchi, who was perking up her ears and ready to listen. Di Qing made sure that Jian Wushuang’s words could not be heard by anyone other than them.","After all, this was a matter of life and death. If word got out, the consequences would be disastrous.","Time passed by.","When Jian Wushuang’s voice finally stopped, everything fell silent.","The 18 Grand Yan Immortals were silent, as if their hearts had died.","As their eyes had been dug out, they naturally could not cry out in grief, and could only remain in a daze.","Finally, the long-browed old man asked, “Are they all dead?”","“That’s right, none of the Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals survived.”","Jian Wushuang’s words were like a sharp knife that cut them ruthlessly.","Lowering his head, the long-browed Elder mournfully said, “I was incompetent. In the end, I couldn’t protect the Heavenly Court and the Emperor.”","Jian Wushuang’s heart was as solid as a rock after all the cultivation, but a perfect state of mind did not mean that he was cold-blooded.","He had seen countless Immortal bones in the Heavenly Region. Every one of them was a Yan Immortal who dominated a Heavenly Region, but they were all killed in the war between the Emperors.","The reason why they resonated with each other was because they had seen each other before. Naturally, they could feel the death of their hearts.","Jian Wushuang’s state of mind seemed to have cleared up after he said this.","In the end, the long-browed Elder slowly raised his head and looked in Jian Wushuang’s direction. He said slowly, “Since the Emperor has given you his inheritance and Comprehension, you should live well.”","Although I want to kill Zhen Wuyang all the time, I want to tell you that you should never fight with him. Leave him and live on with Emperor Liu Ya’s last wish.”","“Why?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked."]},{"number":4820,"title":"Chapter 4820 18 Observers","paragraphs":["4820 18 Observers","The long-browed Elder’s voice was filled with sorrow and despair.","“There’s no reason. Zhen Wuyang has an unknown fate energy. Even the Emperor can’t kill him. As long as he doesn’t want to die, no one can kill him.”","“If you were to face him one day, you’d only end up dying in vain.”","“Rather than sending yourself to death, why don’t you take Emperor Liu ya’s last wish and leave Zhen Wuyang far away?”","Jian Wushuang did not comment on his words because with his current cultivation realm and power, fighting with an Emperor was still too far away for him.","Then, Jian Wushuang said, “I will consider what you said. But before that, may I ask what kind of tasks you once served under Emperor Liu Ya and why you were trapped here?”","When the long-browed Elder heard this, his sorrowful expression slowly disappeared. He said, “The 18 of us once worked under the Emperor Liu Ya. We controlled the flow of the entire Heavenly Court’s fate evergy and the changes of the constellations. We were also conferred the title of the 18 Observers by the Emperor Liu Ya.”","“The reason why wer’re sealed here is because it’s part of Zhen Wuyang’s plan!”","“Before the war started, he made an oath that as long as the 18 of us found the most suitable place for him to build the Heavenly Court, he would not start a war with us.”","“I didn’t expect that this was all a plot he had planned. After he controlled the 18 of us, he attacked Emperor Liu Ya’s Heavenly Court.”","“But we didn’t know about this. After we were controlled by Zhen Wuyang, we chose a place for him to build the Heavenly Court.”","“In the end, he completed the creation of the Heavenly Court, and then our Immortal Source was destroyed, our Immortal body was broken, and our eyes were chiseled out by his lackeys. We were trapped under this gloomy Heavenly Region until today.”","The long-browed Elder looked calm as if he was recounting someone else’s story. However, Jian Wushuang knew that they were definitely not calm.","Their Immortal Source was destroyed, their Immortal bodies were broken, their eyes were gouged out, and they were trapped in the cold dead zone until now. This was the ultimate punishment. Who could have such a heart to endure it until now?”","But even so, the 18 Grand Yan Immortals had waited bitterly until now, hoping that Emperor Liu Ya would bring them back.","What they received was the despairing news that even the Emperor had passed away.","“Your Excellency, the 18 of us have a presumptuous request, and we hope you can agree to it,” the long-browed old man said.","“The Emperor and the warriors of the Heavenly Court have all passed away. We are the only 18 pieces of trash left. We are of no use to them anymore. So, I would like to ask you to spare no effort and execute us. It would be a relief for us.”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. It was absolutely impossible for him to kill them.","Just the fact that the Emperor Liu Ya was his benefactor made it impossible for him to kill them, not even with good intentions.","After thinking for a moment, he flew forward and arrived in front of them.","“I owe the Emperor Liu Ya a debt of gratitude, and you are the last 18 of the Heavenly Court. I can’t do anything to you, so after thinking about it, I can only bring you away.”","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished speaking, an Invisible Sword condensed in his palm and was about to cut off the chains around them.","“Your Excellency, you can’t!” The long-browed Elder seemed to have expected Jian Wushuang to do this. He said hurriedly, “There is a restriction placed on the chain by Zhen Wuyang. Once it is damaged by external forces, he will definitely notice it at once. By then, none of us will survive.”","Jian Wushuang stopped in time and frowned. He took a closer look and saw that there was indeed a restriction on the chain. That was to say, as long as the chain was damaged, Zhen Wuyang would definitely notice it at once.","“We’ve observed the phenomenon for 18 years. We only wish to die. Please grant us our wish.” This time, the 18 Grand Yan Immortals spoke at the same time.","“It’s impossible for you to die. At the very least, don’t even think about dying by my hands, ” Jian Wushuang said. “Only the 18 of you are left alive in the entire Heavenly Court. If you die as well, then the Heavenly Court of Emperor Liu ya will truly be destroyed.”","“If you let me live well, you can also live well.”","“But we...” The long-browed Elder could not bear to say that it was far better for them to die than to live with this appearance.","“Listen, you guys will continue like this. When I’m strong enough or can avoid being discovered by Zhen Wuyang, I’ll come and save you. How about it? ” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","None of the 18 figures spoke this time.","“Your Excellency, why do you have to do this...”","“There’s no such thing as suffering or not. I’ll just treat it as I’ve received Emperor Liu Ya’s kindness and repay him bit by bit.”","After a long while, the long-browed Elder said solemnly, “Forget it. What’s the point of waiting any longer? If you have enough strength in a year and can still think of us, then come. At that time, we, the 18 Observers, will be at your command.”","“There’s no need for that. You just need to remember that I’m here to return the favor. I don’t think that day will be too late. Just wait for me,” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said.","“I’m also searching for something right now, so I can’t stay here for too long. Please forgive me.”","The long-browed Elder nodded. “Go ahead, Sir. There’s no need to worry about us.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at them and then slowly retreated.","Just as he was about to leave, he turned around and said loudly, “Everyone, remember that my name is Jian Wushuang.”","“Alright, we’ll remember that!”","...","In the end, the divine peak condensed again and sealed the 18 Observers again. Along with it, the unbearable memory was sealed.","Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart and then left the Heavenly Regioon he had entered unintentionally with Di Qing and Xi Qingchi.","To those Grand Yan Immortals who had already lost all hope from the bottom of their hearts, endless longevity was like a deep and cold cage, an extreme punishment.","They could not change the current situation and could only rely on the unknown.","What Jian Wushuang could do was to improve his cultivation realm as much as possible so that they could get out of purgatory.","All living things were miserable. Even the powerful Grand Yan Immortal was like a lonely boat, silently or tragically dying in the torrent that was about to rise at some point.","The vast and boundless Great Si Region was like a cage without a door. There might be some changes every generation.","If the Great Si Region, which was merely a speck of dust in the extreme Great Yan Domain, was so cruel, what kind of existence was the Great Yan Domain?","When the entire Great Yan Domain was revealed to Jian Wushuang, what would it be like?","Xuan Yi, his master.","Old Master, his teacher.","What role would they play here?","He was full of anticipation. Fear was never his way of solving problems. From the beginning to the end, there was no fear in his eyes.","There was a mountain in front of him, but there was no path, so he had to forcefully open up a Great Dao!"]},{"number":4821,"title":"Chapter 4821 Fusang Waterway","paragraphs":["4821 Fusang Waterway","Jian Wushuang’s body was surging with pride, an unprecedented surge.","He probably did not even know that it was because of this special quality that he had made so many ancient powerhouses submit to him.","Ever since he entered the Great Yan Domain, he had ended his life in the mortal world.","However, after reading the ultimate of all things, who could feel that they could cut off the past?","Everything was unknown, and everything was like the first rays of the sun.","Xi Qingchi that followed him would sneak a glance at him from time to time, then quickly pretend that nothing had happened and look in other directions. She did not feel tired at all.","Di Qing, on the other hand, had been frowning. Finally, he could not help but say, “Wushuang, you were too reckless just now. If it was a trap, I’m afraid we wouldn’t even have the chance to escape now.”","“I’m sorry. I was too impulsive just now. I just felt that the voice was too familiar, like an old friend I haven’t met yet. That’s why I went into danger,” Jian Wushuang said apologetically.","Di Qing looked at him and said, “Even if it’s like this next time, you’d better not take any risks. Every strange Heavenly Region in the Great Si Region is full of Immortal bones. The massacre that Zhen Wuyang caused in the pioneering war is far beyond your imagination.”","“The current Great Si Region is formed from the Heavenly Regions of nearly eight Emperors. From what I know, four Emperors have fallen at his hands.”","“Don’t try to go against him. He’s very scary.”","At this moment, Di Qing’s eyes became extremely serious.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “He has no enmity with me. I will definitely not confront him.”","Di Qing looked at the void in the distance, “Is that so? The Great Yan Domain is very complicated. Even if there’s no enmity between the two of you, it doesn’t mean that you won’t rest until one of you is dead.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and did not say anything else.","Xi Qingchi felt that the conversation between them was both simple and complex and difficult to understand. It was like an explanation of some foggy thing, full of uncertainties.","But very quickly, she became nervous again, because the two of them looked at her again.","“Young lady, it’s time to point the way.”","“Mmm... You just need to keep walking forward, I’m familiar with...”","Xi Qingchi wailed in her heart. She could only continue to lie, and there was no turning back.","She believed that as long as she told the truth, Di Qing would probably crush her to death on the spot.","Under the guidance of Xi Qingchi, Jian Wushuang flew along with Di Qing. In every breath, they crossed several cold and dead Heavenly Regions.","The journey to the Great Mi Heaven where Prince Jiu was at had left the void with only dead silence and desolation. Every Heavenly Region was like a wasteland, as if no top cultivators had ever set foot in it.","However, gradually, the further they advanced, the void that was originally only illuminated by weak and aging stars began to brighten.","It was as if the blood-like setting sun was shining on it, and it was dim and hazy.","Jian Wushuang did not feel anything strange, but Di Qing’s eyes showed doubt and caution.","He smelled something familiar.","Soon after, when the first ray of dim light entered his eyes, he finally knew where that sense of familiarity came from.","It was the Fusang Tree, an endless number of Fusang Trees.","Each leaf seemed to be made of bronze, and they bloomed in the void. The dim light that illuminated the void was coming from the leaves.","The void in front of them had become ethereal, replaced by an unimaginably vast sea.","The endless Fusang Trees grew in this sea area. They were arranged in two rows and extended into the endless distance along the sea area.","This scene shocked Jian Wushuang. It was like an immortal’s miracle. It was beyond his imagination.","None of them would have thought that the path in the void would be replaced by a sea with unknown latitude.","After a moment’s hesitation, Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and then leaped forward, flying over the sea.","The Fusang Trees on both sides of the road were tall and straight, like the ruins of an Immortal. The halo emitted from the magnificent branches and leaves shone on the body, giving off an indescribable warmth.","Each of the Fusang Trees growing in this region was several times larger than the only Fusang Tree in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","The Golden Crow Di Qing, who had the blood of his ancestors flowing in his body, was proud. He would only reveal his true appearance on the Fusang Tree and then rest.","At this moment, he was already extremely relaxed. Golden patterns were flowing on his skin that was exposed outside of his luxurious clothes.","However, Jian Wushuang did not let his guard down. The more unusual a place was, the more unexpected things would happen.","For example, when he first entered the Great Yan Domain during his great voyage, no one would have thought that there would be a terrifying giant Sea Sky Octopus under the sea.","Therefore, he was always on guard.","As for Xi Qingchi that was holding the little beast, her eyes were already moving as she exclaimed in surprise.","This was an extremely fantastical place that was like a Celestial Realm, and she could not help but lose herself in it.","Jian Wushuang used Yan power to knock her down at the right time so that she would not lose her way.","The three figures shuttled through the fusang waterway and moved forward.","“Do you think the end of this waterway is connected to the Great Mi Heaven?” Di Qing asked. “We’ve been traveling for a while now. Logically, we should be arriving soon.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak but looked at Xi Qingchi beside him.","The corners of her mouth turned up stiffly. “D-don’t worry. We’ll be there soon. I have a feeling.”","“I hope so!” Di Qing’s voice was deep and cold. He did not even look at her and continued to fly forward at a constant speed.","After an unknown period of time, a white boat suddenly appeared on the vast sea in front of them, floating leisurely.","Jian Wushuang immediately became alert. At the same time, he secretly used Yan power to deal with the possible situation that might arise.","The lone white boat was at ease. No matter how Jian Wushuang and the other two ascended, it would always hang in front of them, neither far nor close.","“Fellow travelers, the journey has been long, why don’t you come to the boat and chat for a while to relieve your fatigue.”","A deep and aged voice came from the boat and entered Jian Wushuang’s ears.","Di Qing looked at him and shook his head, indicating him not to go.","However, in the next moment, something strange happened. Seeing that they did not go over, the white boat actually sailed back.","In the blink of an eye, it stopped in front of Jian Wushuang and the others.","This speed had shocked them all, and they were all prepared to fight.","“Travelers, there’s no need to worry. Board the ship, I’ll give you a ride.”","On the boat, an old man in a green Daoist robe turned to look at them with a smile. He held a chess piece between his index and middle fingers, but he had yet to put it down."]},{"number":4822,"title":"Chapter 4822 The Lucky Daoist","paragraphs":["4822 The Lucky Daoist","Looking into the boat, there was only a chessboard and the two figures in red and blue Daoist robes.","However, Jian Wushuang did not move. Instead, he cupped his hands and said, “Old Sir, thank you for your kindness. However, we are on a different path, so we will not bother you.”","“It doesn’t matter. Although the destination is different, we can travel together for the time being. It’s been a long time since the two of us have chatted with outsiders.” The old man in the green Daoist robe laughed and placed the chess piece between his fingers on the chessboard.","Jian Wushuang was a little wary of the repeated invitations.","“With a boat, it’ll save some energy to deal with the possible situation that might happen next, right?”","After saying this, the old Daoist stopped talking and focused on playing chess with another old Daoist.","Jian Wushuang, who was originally vigilant, was relieved. Then, he landed on the boat.","The kind old Daoist was so focused on fighting with the other serious old Daoist that he did not have time to chat with Jian Wushuang and the others.","“My Lord, this place is so beautiful,” Xi Qingchi behind him could not help but exclaim softly.","However, Jian Wushuang did not talk to her. After he came to the boat, his eyes were all on the chessboard.","This was a strange game of chess.","There wasn’t a single black piece on the entire board, and the two old Daoist priests only held white pieces.","Half of the game had already passed.","He was puzzled. They were all white pieces, so how did the two old Daoists recognize who was the enemy?","Could they be like the Fengtian Patriarch from the Divine Power Universe? Were they just terrible at chess?","Even though Jian Wushuang’s chess skill was worse than that of Fengtian Patriarch, he was still unaware of it. Instead, he was carefully observing the chess game.","Very quickly, he was shocked.","Because he could not understand anything. The White pieces on both sides stopped, and he could not even tell friend from foe...","However, Jian Wushuang knew very well that the two old Daoist’s chess skills were definitely not as wild as his. They were also not like Fengtian Patriarch, who only knew how to block holes after several chaos cycles. They were not mediocre players, but true experts.","Even though Jian Wushuang could not distinguish between friend and foe, he could clearly see the attacks of the two old Daoists.","The seemingly kind-looking old Daoist’s chess moves were as fierce as a tiger, and he liked to besiege and conquer pieces.","On the other hand, the old Daoist who had not spoken or smiled from the beginning to the end had a gentle chess move. He was neither anxious nor impatient as he slowly planned.","Moreover, the game was only halfway through. When the stern old Daoist stopped with a piece, the kind old Daoist suddenly became extremely vexed.","“How could it be? How could he lose like this?”","At this time, she looked at Xi Qingchi and could not help but say, “It’s strange. The chess pieces should be black and white. How can you tell when you use the same color chess piece?”","When the amiable old Daoist heard this, his originally vexed expression also eased. He turned to look at Xi Qingchi. “You’re an interesting girl. Your heart is true and sincere. You’re a good seedling for cultivation.”","“My pieces don’t distinguish between black and white. There’s only one color. That’s because I’m waiting for a fated person to come and try with a black piece.”","Xi Qingchi pursed her lips and laughed. “Don’t tell me I have to prepare my own chess pieces when I play chess with you.”","The kind old Daoist shook his head with a smile and stopped talking. Instead, he turned around and messed up the chess pieces on the board. “Quick, let’s play another game, another game.”","The other old Daoist who had been silent the entire time finally spoke, “Again? You don’t have anything else to bet on me, you know?”","“Stop it. We don’t know who will win this round. Let’s hurry up.” The kind old Daoist took a stance and started a new round of fighting.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything and just stared at the new round of chess.","But soon, a similar scene played out again. The friendly old man was defeated again.","“That shouldn’t be the case. Why am I the one who lost again?” He scratched his head, his expression anxious.","A smug look appeared on the cold-faced old Daoist’s face. “You lost again, old man. Tell me, what are you going to give to me?”","The kind old Daoist looked dejected. He reached out and touched his body. Soon, he looked at Jian Wushuang for help, “My Young Friend, can you lend me something to pawn to that old thing? I will get him to compensate double when I beat him.”","“...”","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and finally said, “What kind ofo item?”","“Anything is fine. It’s just to form a good relationship,” the kind old Daoist looked at him and said.","Since any item would do, Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and took out a pill with a strong aura from the Interspatial Ring.","“I’ll have to trouble Little Friend to stretch out your hand and rub the pill,” the kind old Daoist said with a smile.","Although it was a little strange, Jian Wushuang still did as he was told and handed him the pill that he had rubbed.","The kind old Daoist bowed and threw the pill to the cold-faced old Daoist. “Get lost.”","The cold-faced old Daoist caught the pill and stuffed it into his arms, then stood up and gave up his seat.","“Little Friend, while there’s still some time, why don’t we have a round?” The kind old Daoist also got up and made an inviting gesture.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the side with his arms crossed, was a little stunned.","This kind of invitation was like a public punishment for a lousy chess player like him, whom the even the Fengtian Patriarch could easily defeat.","“Umm, I’m not good at playing chess. It’s better if I don’t come forward and embarrass myself,” Jian Wushuang smiled embarrassedly and waved his hands.","The amiable old Daoist smiled and said, “It’s alright. The worst case scenario is just getting stuck. I’ll help you with some moves when you’re stuck.”","Under such an invitation, Jian Wushuang could not refuse and could only brace himself to take a seat.","“Little Friend, although this chess piece only has one color, it has its own changes. Only the player can see it.” He smiled and pointed at the chess pieces in the chessboard.","Slowly exhaling, Jian Wushuang put his finger into the chessboard and took out a white chess piece. He then placed it on the star position.","The white piece did not change, it was as white as jade.","The kind old Daoist’s gaze was fixed on the chess piece that had been placed. When he saw that there was no change, a touch of desolation and disappointment flashed in the depths of his eyes.","However, he returned to normal very quickly, and Jian Wushuang started fighting.","The outcome of the chess game that could be predicted before it even started naturally ended with Jian Wushuang’s defeat after a while.","“I’ve lost.” Jian Wushuang smiled helplessly.","“It’s fine, Little Friend. If you work hard in the future, you’ll definitely be able to compete with us.” The kind old Daoist stroked his beard and smiled.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and did not say anything. They had met by chance and traveled together. It was unlikely that they would see each other again after they left.","The kind old Daoist continued, “I owe you something. If we meet again in the future, I will return it to you in double.”","Although the pill was a Supreme Treasure, it was no different from an ordinary item to Jian Wushuang. It was really nothing, so he did not intend to take it back one day."]},{"number":4823,"title":"Chapter 4823 The One Being Chased","paragraphs":["4823 The One Being Chased","After sharing his thoughts with the kind old Daoist, he stroked his beard and smiled. “My Young Friend, don’t joke around. Once you lend, you must return. It’s unfair if I don’t return it to you.”","Jian Wushuang knew that there was no point in arguing, so he just laughed it off.","This sea area was originally vast and unfathomable, but after playing a few games of chess on the boat, there were signs of reaching the end.","They watched as the border of the Heavenly Domain start to appear on the horizon of this sea area. Jian Wushuang looked at the kind old Daoist and asked, “Sir, if I may ask, do you know where the Upper Desolate Heavenly Region is?”","Xi Qingchi’s expression immediately tightened, and her slender palm smothered the little beast in her arms to death.","‘It’s over, it’s over. I’ve been completely exposed. Please don’t kill me...’ She was crying in her heart.","“The Upper Desolate is not far from here,” the old Daoist said. “You just need to cross over ten Heavenly Regions and you’ll be able to reach the Upper Desolate.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for your guidance.”","Xi Qingchi was stunned. She could noot believe it, but then she let out. long breath and said proudly, “How is it? I told you we were almost there, but you didn’t believe me...”","Before she could finish, Di Qing glared at her.","After the chess game, the trip to the sea area also came to an end.","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said goodbye. Then, he continued to move forward with Di Qing and Xi Qingchi.","At the end of the ocean, under a huge Fusang Tree, the kind old Daoist stood on the bow of the ship, looking at the place where he had disappeared.","The cold-faced old Daoist also walked out and stood beside him.","“The item you asked him for has a lot of fate energy attached to it,”","“I know. It’s because I used a small trick to borrow 200 years of fate energy from that Young Friend.”","“You have to think clearly. When the time comes, you have to pay him back double.”","“Shut up, you old fogey. I don’t need you to teach me.”","...","After leaving the Fusang Waterway, Jian Wushuang followed the old man’s words and passed through more than ten dead silent Heavely Regions. He finally saw a dark red Heavenly Region.","This used to be the main battlefield between Imperial Emperors, the unimaginable power of the Emperors burned countless Heavenly Regions and void, killing countless living beings.","After Emperor Zhen Wuyang successfully annexed this place, he created a Heavenly Region that was like a purgatory to commemorate the great war.","The Heavenly Region was also known as the Upper Desolate.","It was impossible to fake or cover up such an iconic Heavenly Region. This also meant that they would reach the Great Mi Heaven where Prince Jiu was located after advancing 100 Heavenly Regions.","The confrontation this time was probably even fiercer than the previous one in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","It was still a question mark for Jian Wushuang whether Yin Ling, who was wearing the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor, had escaped to the Great Mi Heaven in the end.","He had to take such a risk just because of a sentence from that heroic-looking woman. It was truly a little crazy.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang looked at Xi Qingchi beside him and said softly, “We will reach the Great Mi Heaven in 100 Heavenly Region. Your task has been completed.”","Xi Qingchi swallowed. “No, don’t tell me you’re going to leave me here.”","“I won’t leave you here. I’ll send you to a more prosperous Heavenly Region later. After we’re done, I’ll go pick you up.”","When she heard this, she shook her head like a rattle-drum. Then. she pursed her lips and said, “No, no, I want to follow you all the time, even if I die. Otherwise. if you leave me in a Heavenly Region and don’t care about me anymore, I won’t be able to go back...”","“The place we’re going to is very dangerous. We don’t have time to take care of you.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Xi Qingchi hurriedly shook her head. “You don’t have to worry about me. Just take me with you. My San Qing will protect me.”","Jian Wushuang wanted to say something, but Di Qing said, “Take her with you. We don’t need to be responsible for her life or death.”","“You’ve thought it through?” Jian Wushuang looked at her and said.","Xi Qingchi nodded. “Don’t worry. I won’t cause you any trouble.”","As they advanced, many Heavenly Region appeared in the cold and dead void.","However, these Heavenly Regions were like the Young Emperor’s Six Heavens Realm, they were all on high alert.","The death of a Prince was a huge matter for the entire Great Si Region. Hence, Emperor Zhen Wuyang naturally ‘took care’ of the other six Princes.","It was already very difficult to see Yan Immortals in the void, so they had to be more cautious and not be discovered when they entered Great Mi Heaven.","Nearly 100 vast Heavenly Region were left behind by Jian Wushuang. In front of him, the Great Mi Heaven slowly appeared.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to figure out how to enter the Great Mi Heaven, dozens of murderous intents suddenly burst out from the dark void in front of him!","He immediately became alert and wanted to escape with Di Qing and Xi Qingchi, but the killing intent came so fast that he ran into it in just a few breaths.","However, Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","In front of the dozens of figures that pierced the void and carried heavy killing intent was a woman who was on the verge of death.","Moreover, he was very familiar with that woman. She was one of the seven swordsmen who had tried to assassinate Prince Mo. She was tthe heroic-looking woman who had informed him that she had come to Great Mi Heaven.","The battle in the void was coming to an end. How could she escape from the battle of more than 10 Yan Immortals and more than 20 Ancestor realm cultivators?","“The Prince has ordered that to kill everyone. Attack!” The leading Yan Immortal shouted in anger. At the same time, he shook his arms and released thousands of rays of Yan power, trying to kill him on the spot.","The void was illuminated by Yan power, and all kinds of Yan power were like an irresistible cage, pressing down on her.","The heroic-looking woman’s mouth was dripping with blood. At the last moment, she stopped her escape and stood still, coldly looking at the Yan Immortals.","In the next moment, the situation changed drastically!","A figure broke through the air and faced the countless terrifying Yan power. His expression was calm as he raised his hand.","Suddenly, the void shattered, and countless black flood water gushed out from the void, devouring the interweaving and falling Yan power.","There were seven tiny stars surging between his brows, exuding an intimidating aura.","As soon as the stars appeared, it was the Immortal Style.","Only by mastering an Immortal Style could one directly crush a Yan Immortal of the same level.","Jian Wushuang’s Immortal Style was called a Little Mountain River.","In the mountains and rivers, everything was under his control, and he could destroy all enemies.","Facing so many Yan Immortals and top cultivators, he was not afraid at all and easily devoured their Yan power moves.","Then, he looked at the heroic-looking woman who was covered in wounds and frowned.","Their eyes met, and her eyes were filled with disbelief. She had not expected him to come so quickly and so swiftly."]},{"number":4824,"title":"Chapter 4824 Sneaking Into Great Mi Heaven","paragraphs":["4824 Sneaking Into Great Mi Heaven","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang raised his palm and countless rays of terrifying Yan power light shot out. They formed a huge net and blocked her head.","The astral winds raged, and several Yan Immortals did not have time to dodge. They were turned into sieves and their Immortal Sources were completely destroyed.","In just a single exchange, the pursuing team had lost four Yan Immortals and over ten Ancestor-level cultivators.","The remaining Yan Immortals were all shocked by the sharp technique. Their eyes were filled with panic and they had the intention to retreat.","However, they did not retreat. Instead, they stood still and were in a stalemate with Jian Wushuang.","Because behind them was the Great Mi Heavenly Region, they could advance or retreat. Moreover, they had not completed their master’s death order, so they could not go back.","With this in mind, the leader, a middle-aged Yan Immortal, gritted his teeth and said in a deep voice, “Guests at the front, this is the Great Mi Heaven, a Heavenly Region under the Second Emperor. We are following the Emperor’s orders to hunt down the remaining evildoers. I hope you don’t stop us.”","Jian Wushuang shifted his gaze from her to the top Yan Immortal cultivators.","It was the best plan not to get into a conflict with the entire Great Mi Heaven and Prince Jiu. However, the sudden turn of events had made the matter more difficult to handle.","He had already killed several Yan Immortals, which meant that it was impossible for him to have a good ending.","Jian Wushuang didn’t speak, but looked at Di Qing and nodded slightly.","Di Qing also nodded and slowly took a step forward. Yan power swept forward like the night sky.","He just slowly raised a palm and clenched it in the air. The void was instantly shattered.","A huge palm covered in pitch-black scales and clear veins came pressing down.","All the Yan Immortals and top cultivators were so angry that their eyes were about to pop out. They did not even have the time to channel their Yan power before they were all killed by that palm!","Di Qing, who had once fought against two Grand Yan Immortals at the same level, had reached the peak of his control over Yan power. His attack was like a dark cloud covering the sky, but it did not stir up any violent Yan power. Instead, it directly crushed the Immortal Sources of those Yan Immortals.","Then, Di Qing withdrew his palm and retreated behind Jian Wushuang.","In the hazy void, only the raging squall was left. It was as if nothing had happened.","The heroic-looking woman subconsciously took a few steps back and looked at Jian Wushuang and the others in horror.","Dispersing Yan power, Jian Wushuang walked quickly to her and said, “Long time no see.”","After calming down slightly, she said, “You, how did you get here so quickly?”","“Because I believe that you didn’t lie to me, so I came,” he said. “Now it seems that I came at the right time.”","Wiping away the blood at the corner of her mouth, the heroic-looking woman looked at him and said, “Thank you for saving my life. I will definitely repay you in the future.”","“No need. It’s not good for me if you die in front of me. I have my reasons for saving you,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice. “Now, we are going to enter the Great Mi Heaven.","There was a hint of astonishment in her eyes. Then, she gritted her teeth and said, “You’re going in to assassinate Prince Jiu? ”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “He has no enmity with me. Why would I kill him? I’ve entered the Great Mi Heaven to find that Yin Ling and take back something.”","The heroic-looking woman exhaled slowly and said, “I’m afraid that it won’t be easy for you to get close to the current Yin Ling. She’s already under Prince Jiu’s command.”","“It seems that she really escaped and got into this Great Mi Heaven.” He furrowed his brows.","She continued, “She and Prince Jiu are now inseparable. If you want to get close to her, you can only get close to Prince Jiu.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and was already thinking of a solution, “Is there the most secure way to enter the Great Mi Heaven?”","“The Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture has been destroyed, and Prince Mo has been killed. I think the other six Princes will be grounded to varying degrees. I’m afraid it won’t be easy to enter the Great Mi Heaven at this time,” the heroic-looking woman said. “The dozens of Heavenly Regions in the entire Great Mi Heaven have been cordoned off.”","Jian Wushuang frowned, “Is there no safe route?”","After a moment of silence, she said, “Of course there is, but I’m afraid you won’t get involved easily.”","“Where?”","“North Sky Heavenly Region, Desolate Ancient Spirit Altar.”","...","Among the seven Princes under Zhen Wuyang, the Heavenly Regions controlled by the Second Prince, Prince Jiu, was the most vast.","The entire Great Mi Heaven included a total of 23 super Heavenly Regions. It was so vast that even the Six Heavens Realm of the Young Emperor, Prince Yan, could not compare to it.","The entire Great Mi Heaven had four Heaven Gates in the East, West, South, and North. One could enter from the heaven gates and meet Prince Jiu.","Although there were four Heaven Gates, there were actually only three. The other North Heaven Gate, which was the North Sky Heavenly Region, was a completely silent grave.","The entire North Sky Heavenly Region was completely made up of tombs, and those tombs that had been silent for countless years were left behind from the era of Zhen Wuyang. They were all experts who had died in battle.","Although their Immortal Source was scattered, their Immortal bones still contained terrifying energy, and ordinary Yan Immortals could not even step into it.","Naturally, there was no Yan Immortal guarding the North Sky Heavenly Region.","He had learned all of this from the heroic-looking woman.","After hearing the news, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate at all. He took Di Qing and Xi Qingchi and went straight to the North Sky Heavenly Region.","The North Sky Heavenly Region of Great Mi Heaven was located in the extreme north, and the deathly aura was enough to permeate half of the void. No Yan Immortal or top cultivator would come to this place.","“We’re here, the North Sky Heavenly Region is up ahead.”","In the boundless void, the heroic-looking woman stood still and looked into the distance.","It was a dark Heavely Regioon that could not be seen easily. Who knew how many years had passed? The Yan power that used to be owned by the mighty powers had become ownerless, wreaking havoc in the void.","“Only by entering the Great Mi Heaven from here will we not be discovered by Prince Jiu and the guards. However, don’t think that this is the safest place. From a certain perspective, this place could possibly be the most dangerous place?”","“For example?”","“What do you mean, for example? My identity is not high enough. I know nothing about the North Sky Heavenly Region. I only know that it is dangerous and I can’t step into it easily.”","Jian Wushuang held his chin and said while thinking. “That can’t be. I think your status should be quite high in the Great Mi Heaven. Otherwise, Prince Jiu wouldn’t have asked you to carry out that assassination mission, right?”","The heroic-looking woman glared at him angrily. “Don’t bring up the past. If you continue to talk about it, aren’t you afraid that I’ll be angry and inform Prince Jiu?”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said calmly, “If he really wanted you to live, the previous scene would not have happened. You should know who wants you dead the most.”","The heroic-looking woman fell silent. She then raised her head and said, “Let’s go. As long as I don’t die, I’ll bring you all into the Great Mi Heaven.”","“Alright, thank you.” Jian Wushuang lowered his eyes and nodded."]},{"number":4825,"title":"Chapter 4825 Dream-Eating Tapir Devouring Spirits","paragraphs":["4825 Dream-Eating Tapir Devouring Spirits","Then, he seemed to have thought of something and asked, “By the way, I’m a little curious. What did Yin Ling take from you?”","“Prince Jiu gave me the Golden Seal. After she took it, she used it to open the way to the Great Mi Heaven.","Jian Wushuang nodded. If what she said was true, then it was very likely that Yin Ling had not left them after the destruction of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. Instead, she had been following them and hiding in the dark, waiting for a certain opportunity.","However, what Jian Wushuang couldn’t figure out was how Yin Ling could guess that the heroic woman was sent by the Great Mi Heaven and then take the Golden Seal to the Great Mi Heaven.","“By the way, do you have any connection with the group of Yan Immortal who were selling black mountain crystals in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture?”","The heroic-looking woman said coldly, “I can’t tell you anything about what happened before.”","Jian Wushuang continued, “Also, how should I address you?”","“Zhao Ting.”","...","As soon as he stepped into the North Sky Heavenly Region, an ancient and desolate aura greeted him. At the same time, there was an invisible force pulling and devouring the Yan power around him.","The tombs were as quiet as mountains, stretching into the distance that could not be seen.","Rather than saying that these Immortal tombs were built in the North Sky Heavenly Region, it would be better to say that the North Sky Heavenly Region was completely made up of Immortal tombs.","As the tombs that had existed since ancient times were extremely dense, there was almost no space for them to land on. Hence, Jian Wushuang and the others flew at a low altitude above the North Sky Heavenly Region and advanced slowly.","Although the masters within each Immortal tomb had died, the former Yan power still existed. Although they were dying in an irreversible way, they were still strong today.","Moreover, the almighties in these Immortal tombs were at least Yan Immortal, and there were many existences at the level of Grand Yan Immortal.","No one spoke. Everyone raised their Yan power to the peak, already prepared for all the possible situations that might occur.","Xi Qingchi followed Jian Wushuang closely. Whether it was intentional or not, it forced the heroic-looking woman, Zhao Ting, to make way for her.","The little beast in her arms seemed extremely excited, as if it was very interested in the dense aura in the Immortal graveyard, and kept sniffing.","“San Qing, you better behave yourself. If you continue, I’ll throw you down,” Xi Qingchi threatened in a low voice.","Little beast restrained itself a little when it heard her words, but it was still restless in her arms.","Jian Wushuang looked at the small beast in her arms and asked, “What’s the use of this small beast?”","Xi Qingchi nodded. “I picked up San Qing in the deep mountains when I was young. It’s a Dream-Eating Tapir that can swallow bad nightmares and dispel bad luck. Therefore, I have always carried it with me. It will bring me good luck.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and continued to fly forward.","The entire North Sky Heavenly Region could be considered as one of the larger Heavenly Regions in the Great Mi Heaven and it would take a long time to cross it.","And the danger that Zhao Ting mentioned should be the chaotic Yan force that was surging in the Immortal graveyard.","As they continued to move forward, the nightmare tapir in his arms became even more restless. There was only excitement in its clear eyes.","At the next moment, the little beast suddenly jumped out of the body of Xi Qingchi. Like a fish, it plunged into the group of Immortal tombs below with great speed and ferocity.","“San Qing!” Xi Qingchi was shocked.","Jian Wushuang also saw this unusual scene. He waved his arm and the Yan power radiance shot out.","Thousands of rays of the Yan power fell like a knot. The tapir turned its head around, opened its mouth, and swallowed all the Yan power’s brilliance into its stomach. Then, it plunged into the group of Immortal tombs without stopping.","Jian Wushuang frowned and had a bad feeling.","The Dream-Eating Tapir that landed in the group of Immortal tombs screeched at the sky and raised its four claws before it started to fly.","The surrounding Yan power, which was already in an extremely chaotic state, went berserk and instantly triggered the entire North Sky Heavenly Region.","“Damn thing, I’m going to skin it alive!” Di Qing was furious, and he raised his palm to release Yan power.","“No, you can’t,” Jian Wushuang lowered his voice and stopped him from using Yan power, which was about to leave his hand. “You can’t do anything. The aura here is not right.”","As if to confirm his words, the entire North Sky Heavenly Region’s ownerless Yan power was completely chaotic and violent.","As the initiator, the Dream-Eating Tapir was devouring some unknown aura while it was running.","Pitch-black patterns began to appear on its snow-white body, and its body, which was originally as long as an arm, grew to more than a hundred feet in size.","It was devouring spirit!","Although those ancient mighty figures were in a deep sleep and the Immortal Source was broken, their Dao and aura would not dissipate so easily. They would only dissipate in the long years and eventually return to the heaven domain.","The Dream-Eating Tapir was devouring the ownerless Dao to strengthen itself.","Zhao Ting was equally shocked. With such a disturbance happening in the originally silent North Sky Heavenly Region, Prince Jiu would definitely notice it. Once they were discovered, it would be difficult for them to escape!","“Let’s go quickly. I’m afraid that Prince Jiu will soon find out about the turmoil here,” Zhao Ting urged.","“I’ll go and capture San Qing.” Xi Qingchi was already shocked out of her wits.","Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the Dream-Eating Tapir that was still devouring spirits.","...","Almost at the same time, in the middle state of Great Mi Heaven.","On the celestial platform that was situated above the clouds, a lazy figure dressed in a white robe quietly opened his eyes and looked toward the North.","He was the Second Prince of Zhen Wuyang, Prince Jiu.","Very quickly, several figures with powerful auras ascended the celestial platform.","“Your Highness, there’s a commotion coming from the North Sky Heavenly Region, I’m afraid ...","“Afraid of what? Can the dead come back to life?” Prince Jiu did not even lift his eyelids. “You don’t have to report the North Sky Heavenly Region’s matter. You may leave.”","“Yes,” the shadows replied and then retreated.","“By the way, send Yin Ling over. I want to see her.”","...","The palm came down, and the unparalleled Yan power almost bound the Dream-Eating Tapir, but it still managed to escape.","Jian Wushuang had obviously lost his patience and started to prepare to kill it.","The Dream-Eating Tapir was greedy. Its stomach was like a bottomless pit. It was devouring the spirits even when it was running for its life.","As it devoured, its body underwent a huge change.","Especially its eyes. Below its original eyes, there were two cracks, and a pair of eyes had grown out. It looked extremely strange.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing joined forces to kill it. The overwhelming attacks gradually forced it into a dead end.","However, at this moment, something happened. The Dream-Eating Tapir that was running away seemed to have hit a transparent barrier. It stopped for a moment before it fell to the ground and wailed."]},{"number":4826,"title":"Chapter 4826 Netherworld Old Daoist","paragraphs":["4826 Netherworld Old Daoist","At the same time, the ground started to collapse and crack.","Jian Wushuang and the others, who were in pursuit, also stopped and looked forward.","Among the countless Immortal tombs, the one in the center was several times larger than the ordinary Immortal tombs. It was like several divine peaks stacked together, revealing an unpredictable pressure.","The Dream-Eating Tapir fell in front of this Immortal graveyard.","At this moment, with the collapse of the ground, cracks began to appear on the Immortal graveyard. It was obvious that it was about to collapse.","“Let’s go!” Zhao Ting was extremely nervous.","Looking at the unpredictable scene, Jian Wushuang did not want to be involved and wanted to escape immediately.","“I’m afraid we won’t be able to leave,” Di Qing said in a deep voice and looked behind him.","The originally silent Immortal graveyard began to crack open as one after another, unconscious Immortal bones walked out of the graveyard and flew shakily up into the void, sealing off their path of escape.","“How is that possible?” Jian Wushuang was in disbelief.","The owners of these Immortal bones had died countless years ago. Whether it was from the Immortal Source or the Immortal body, they had all dissipated and did not meet the conditions for resurrection.","Even those who guarded Emperor Liu Ya’s Heavenly Court, the three Immortal bones of Grand Yan Immortals were only able to continue guarding them because of a certain obsession.","But now, these Immortal bones that had been dormant in the Immortal graveyard had all awakened and gathered together. There were no less than thousands of them.","“We can only kill our way out,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice as an Invisible Sword formed in his hand.","Di Qing was also ready to deal with it, and his golden eyes began to surge with power.","Zhao Ting sighed and took out a long and thin blade from her waist, preparing to deal with it.","More and more Immortal bones crawled out of the Immortal graveyard. They were unconscious but all of them gathered together.","Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated. He swung his sword and an unparalleled Sword Intent burst forth, directly sweeping into the Immortal bone.","The Sword Intent swept out and instantly cleared a large area.","The Immortal bones, which had no Immortal Source and no consciousness, could be easily damaged.","“Pathetic!” Di Qing also gave a deep shout, and a black image emerged from his back, crashing into the mountain-like Immortal bones.","The North Sky Heavenly Region was shaking and countless Immortal tombs were destroyed. Immortal bones fell to the ground like rain.","However, this was only the beginning.","The largest Immortal tomb in the center finally shattered. At the same time, thousands of treasure lights burst out from the tomb, causing the sky to change.","A figure that was dozens of feet tall and wearing a tattered Daoist robe walked out of the Immortal graveyard.","He had a horsetail whisk stuck on his back, and in his skinny and black Hand, he held a real sword that was emitting a precious light.","His cheeks were rotten, and his bones could be seen from his broken gray skin.","His eyes were shriveled and also grayish-white, without the slightest sign of life.","All the signs indicated that this old Daoist who carried a horsetail whisk and held a precious light true sword had long since perished.","After clearing hundreds of Immortal bones in front of him with the Ancestral Skill, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate, Jian Wushuang looked at the figure walking out of the Immortal graveyard with a serious expression.","The old Daoist’s figure gave him an extremely dangerous aura. He could naturally sense the surging aura of death around the old Daoist, but the more it was so, the more vigilant he had to be.","Once there was an obsession, even if one’s body turned into white bones, it would still be quite terrifying. This old Daoist who had died many years ago was definitely several times stronger than the white bones that guarded the Heavenly Court of Emperor Liu Ya.","Di Qing’s eyes were also solemn, because he had also sensed the dangerous aura.","The North Sky Heavenly Region, which was originally as chaotic as a battlefield, suddenly became deathly silent. Everyone looked forward.","The old Daoist with the horsetail whisk on his back and the glowing True Sword in his hand stepped forward and then reached out to remove the horsetail whisk on his back.","The ancient voice resounded, “I have walked out of the Netherworld. I raise my flag and summon my old troops to destroy all enemies in front of me!”","As he spoke, he waved the horsetail whisk in his hand and the entire North Sky Heavenly Region became restless and chaotic again.","The horsetail whisk seemed to carry a demonic sound as it scattered toward every Immortal tomb.","At this moment, the Immortal bones that were originally crushed and shattered slowly squirmed and gathered together again. At the same time, thousands of Immortal tomb armor cracked open and Immortal bones walked out.","There were a total of 5,000 Immortal bones, ones that belonged to Yan Immortals when they were alive. Even though they were dead, they still carried an unparalleled momentum.","The old Daoist held the horsetail whisk and the treasure light true sword in his hand. His shriveled and grayish-white eyes gradually filled up with a ferocious scarlet color.","“Wherever the sword points, my old subordinates will be suppressed!”","He pointed his sword forward and the sharp edge of the sword was pointed at Jian Wushuang and the others.","In an instant, the unconscious Immortal bones seemed to have received some kind of response. They flooded in from all directions.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword and used the first move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, Star.","The Sword Intent slashed forward with an unparalleled force that tore the Immortal bone apart. At the same time, the sword will’s pillar of light exploded completely, clearing an area in an instant.","Di Qing was not weak either. With the strength of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he could easily crush the Immortal bones. His strength had reached its peak.","With the two of them working together, none of the Immortal bones could move forward, let alone get close.","When the old Daoist saw this scene from afar, his scarlet eyes flickered and he waved his horsetail whisk again.","With a wave of the horsetail whisk, the countless shattered Immortal bones began to reform. They mixed together and gradually formed an Immortal bone formation that stretched for thousands of miles!","The mighty magic formation had already taken shape and wrapped Jian Wushuang and the others in it.","Countless ownerless forces, wild and chaotic, rose up from the Immortal bone array like giant white bone palms, pulling at them.","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of danger. Without thinking, he slashed at the magic formation below him.","However, the Sword Intent that had always been successful was like a clay ox entering the sea. It was silent and ineffective.","The more Immortal bones it devoured, the stronger the Immortal bone array became.","At the same time, the old Daoist holding the horsetail whisk and the True Sword appeared in front of the formation. Then, he raised the True Sword in his hand, which was surrounded by Yan power, and suddenly stabbed it into the formation.","This sword strike went straight for Di Qing.","His golden eyes turned serious as he moved to block.","Swish!","With a deep sound like a great bell, Di Qing took a step back. At the same time, Jian Wushuang took action. He retaliated by slashing forward with the Invisible True Sword in his palm to resolve the terrible sword strike!","The two swords clashed and the Sword Intent that Di Qing had neutralized was then eliminated by Jian Wushuang.","The Immortal bone array fell silent.","Di Qing’s right palm trembled slightly as he retreated, and his right palm was covered in divine blood!"]},{"number":4827,"title":"Chapter 4827 The Netherworld Dharma Formation","paragraphs":["4827 The Netherworld Dharma Formation","The might of the old Daoist’s sword strike had actually injured him!","One must know that Di Qing was already a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, ranked at the peak. Even great Yan Immortals of the same realm could hardly injure him.","However, the old Daoist who claimed to have walked out of the Netherworld had injured him with just a casual sword strike.","Di Qing was not the only one. After Jian Wushuang destroyed the sword strike, the undisguisable Sword Intent also made his qi and blood boil.","This casual strike had injured them to varying degrees. Netherworld Old Daoist did not stop at all. He stabbed forward with his treasured True Sword again!","“Chengqi!” Di Qing chanted the incantation in a deep voice, and a huge beam of light that could not be covered surged from his back.","A pure-white crow appeared, and its eyes, which were as holy as a snow lotus, had a divine charm. Then, it crashed into the Netherworld Old Daoist.","As if sensing the threat, he took a step back and swung the horsetail whisk in his left hand forward.","In an instant, hundreds of millions of white threads of the horsetail whisk danced like long snakes and came down on the white crow.","The two collided, and before the celestial form of the White Crow could even release its power, it was already entangled by the countless white threads of the horsetail whisk.","Jian Wushuang frowned and immediately looked at Zhao Ting and Xi Qingchi, who were both pale. “When we fight later, I’ll use all my strength to tear a hole in the magic formation. Then, you can go as far away as you can.","Zhao Ting looked at him and opened her mouth, but she did not say anything.","Xi Qingchi’s eyes were slightly red as it said, “My Lord, I’m sorry. It’s my fault.","“Good luck,” Jian Wushuang took one last look at her and walked forward with the Invisible Sword in his hand.","Di Qing’s expression was solemn as he said in a deep voice, “Although this old Daoist has already died, the energy contained in his body is extremely abundant. I’m afraid his Immortal Source has not been consumed.”","Jian Wushuang looked forward with a serious expression. If his judgment was correct, old Daoist Huang Quan was likely to be a peak Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, the same realm as Di Qing.","Moreover, old Daoist Huang Quan was not fighting alone. More and more Immortal bones were tearing apart the Immortal graveyard and walking out of it, waiting for his orders.","The first battle after entering the Great Mi Heaven would probably be quite tricky.","After Di Qing’s attack was offset by the white silk of the horsetail whisk, Netherworld Old Daoist stopped fighting. Instead, he retreated quickly and waved the horsetail whisk in his hand.","The horsetail whisk seemed to have some kind of bewitching demonic sound, and the Immortal bones once again flew over from all directions.","“Don’t let these things get close to me. I’ll go and take that old Daoist’s head,” Di Qing looked at Jian Wushuang and said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and his palm released unparalleled Yan power. Each wisp was enough to break a set of Immortal bones.","Di Qing did not stay any longer. A pair of wings with golden patterns on them suddenly appeared on his back, and he flew up into the void.","Facing the Netherworld Old Daoist, he did not release his celestial form, but flapped his wings.","In an instant, the endless Yan power burst forth like the mountains and seas!","Hundreds of millions of golden feathers, carrying an unimaginable aura, fell down like a divine punishment from the heavens!","Every golden feather was destructive, and the dead air in the sky was devoured. They also burned large, shocking holes, and everything was illuminated.","This was Di Qing’s full-strength move, a move without any reservation.","Boom!!!","Netherworld Old Daoist looked up at the destructive golden feathers and waved the horsetail whisk in his hand.","The white threads of the horsetail whisk instantly extended for thousands of miles, turning into a barrier to protect himself.","At this moment, the earth was torn apart. Countless Immortal bones were burned by the golden feathers, and even the earth was burning.","No matter how strong the boundary of the horsetail whisk that the Netherworld Old Daoist had set up with one hand was, it was still unable to resist the golden feathers that carried the power of mountains and seas.","When the boundary of the horsetail whisk was torn open, the golden feathers that filled the sky were like locusts, bombarding the Netherworld Old Daoist.","The indescribable explosion with him as the center directly tore the North Sky Heavenly Region from the middle, and the plane was about to be torn apart.","No one below the Yan Immortal realm could withstand the energy that was being released. Jian Wushuang extended his hand to protect Xi Qingchi and Zhao Ting behind him. Then, he prepared to break the formation below him without stopping.","In the next moment, an old voice that was like a large bell rang out.","“Freeze!”","Jian Wushuang, who was holding an Invisible Sword and was about to push forward, felt that his body was shackled and his control of Yan power was interrupted!","Even Di Qing, who was in the void, was affected. His body trembled and he fell to the ground uncontrollably.","The world was silent, and only the raging fire spread!","The white magic barrier of the horsetail whisk faded away, revealing the figure of the Netherworld Old Daoist.","At this time, he was in a sorry state. His gray-white skin had been burned with large holes, revealing his ghastly bones. One of his two eyeballs had also exploded, making him look even more ferocious.","“Bandit, how dare you insult me?”","He was so furious that his tattered Daoist robe and the horsetail whisk in his hand turned into ashes. “Today, I’ll definitely turn you into nourishment for my Netherworld Dharma Formation!","The deafening voice stopped. The Netherworld Old Daoist held the sword in his right hand and his left hand, which had turned into a ghastly white bone, kept making hand seals.","Immediately, the Immortal bone formation that trapped Jian Wushuang, Di Qing, and the others began to rotate slowly.","Countless shattered Immortal bones floated and surged within it, carrying an extremely ferocious killing intent and death aura.","Even the Immortal bones of the countless Yan Immortals who had died in this place had been refined and turned into nutrients for the formation.","This was a fearsome array formation!","As the Netherworld Old Daoist conjured a series of hand seals, the Netherworld Dharma Formation began to fluctuate like a swamp.","The ground beneath their feet began to turn muddy. At the same time, pairs of white bone palms reached out and grabbed at Jian Wushuang and the others.","Thick divine blood gushed out and instantly surged up.","“We are all nourishment to pay tribute to the souls of my dead subordinates.” Netherworld Old Daoist chanted in a low voice. With his voice, the divine blood in the Netherworld Dharma Formation completely devoured Jian Wushuang and the others and then began to boil.","There were still Immortal bones that walked out of the Immortal graveyard. They rushed towards the formation without hesitation and integrated into it, becoming one with it and strengthening the formation.","The boiling and viscous divine blood was like a heavenly river that fell from the sky, ferocious and ugly.","Netherworld Old Daoist looked at this scene with his only remaining eye. He seemed to be very satisfied, then he moved forward.","In the next moment, the river of blood in the Netherworld Dharma Formation trembled and a figure appeared.","There was not a single blood stain on his body. He held an Invisible Sword high in his hand and drew the bow and arrow as if he was shooting the sun. The tension in his arm was at its maximum.","The next moment, the Invisible Sword was suddenly thrown out like an arrow shot from a divine bow, with an indomitable force!","Heaven and earth trembled, and the void shattered wherever the sword passed."]},{"number":4828,"title":"Chapter 4828 Small Heavenly Abode","paragraphs":["4828 Small Heavenly Abode","The river of blood was cut into two. The Invisible Sword eventually pierced through the boundary of the Netherworld Dharma Formation and stabbed into the Netherworld Old Daoist’s heart, which exploded with a loud bang.","The unparalleled radiant light shone and brightened the dark North Sky Heavenly Region for a moment.","The explosion continued. The barrier of the Netherworld Dharma Formation was pierced through and it was collapsing at an extremely fast speed.","Standing on the blood river that was about to wither, Jian Wushuang slowly spat out a mouthful of turbid breath. A hidden red light flashed in his left hand.","The river of blood was formed by the condensation of killing intent and death aura. It could easily contaminate the soul and cause the besiegers to lose their way.","However, there was one thing that allowed Jian Wushuang and the others to easily avoid being devoured by the blood river.","It was the palm-sized blood-red skull that Sha Qing, the master of the Sand Demon Cave, had given to Jian Wushuang before she died.","The bloody skull’s ability to absorb and sense Blood Qi was beyond his imagination. Even though it was sealed in the Boyang Bottle, it still flew out uncontrollably, swallowing the endless killing intent and Blood Qi in the blood river.","Jian Wushuang did not expect that the river of the Netherworld Dharma Formation, which was originally very difficult to deal with, would be destroyed so easily.","After stuffing the skull back into the Boyang Bottle, Jian Wushuang looked forward.","Di Qing, who was standing in front of him, looked at him in surprise. He had destroyed the formation by himself and killed the Netherworld Old Daoist, who was a Grand Yan Immortal. How could he not be surprised?","A small cultivation realm was already an impassable chasm, not to mention the gap between Yan Immortal and Grand Yan Immortal.","However, it happened. Jian Wushuang killed a Grand Yan Immortal with the power of a Yan Immortal!","“It seems that my knowledge is still only the tip of the iceberg,” Di Qing looked at him and sighed slightly.","Jian Wushuang could not explain too much, so he just said, “It’s just a coincidence.”","Xi Qingchi was still in a state of shock, and Zhao Ting looked at his back with a complicated expression. No one knew what she was thinking about.","The thick smoke from the explosion slowly dissipated, and then a body that almost no longer had a human shape appeared.","Under Jian Wushuang’s attack, the entire left half of the Netherworld Old Daoist’s Immortal body was completely destroyed. In his shriveled chest, there was indeed a mass of Immortal Source that was about to be destroyed. However, at this point, it had not been destroyed!","He did not die. Although the Immortal Source was about to shatter, it still provided him with unimaginable power.","The Netherworld Old Daoist was furious. With the last of his strength, he threw out the treasured True Sword in his hand.","The True Sword that carried boundless dark Blood Qi slashed at him at a speed so fast that it was impossible to dodge!","Heaven and earth changed color. Everything happened in an instant, and even Di Qing did not react in time.","Jian Wushuang saw it the most clearly. When the True Sword broke through the clouds, he almost subconsciously pushed Di Qing away.","Swish!","The treasured True Sword, which carried boundless Blood Qi and killing intent, accidentally stabbed into Jian Wushuang’s left chest and came out. Divine blood gushed out.","“My Lord!” Xi Qingchi cried out in alarm.","Di Qing was also completely shocked, but he reacted in an instant and released the most terrifying force in front of Netherworld Old Daoist.","A total of black, white, and red, three Natal Forms, all representing Di Qing’s full-force attack, crushed forward.","Netherworld Old Daoist, who had already shattered his Immortal Source, was finally exterminated by this blow.","He was completely annihilated, and the entire North Sky Heavenly Region was dead silent. Countless Immortal bones that walked out of the Immortal graveyard fell to the ground one after another without any guidance.","The entire North Sky Heavenly Region was dead silent.","Jian Wushuang leaned back slowly as he was held by Xi Qingchi and Zhao Ting at the same time. Divine blood with faint golden patterns flowed from his back, and his pupils gradually enlarged.","“It’ll be fine, it’ll be fine...” Xi Qingchi murmured, and divine blood flowed out through the gaps between her fingers.","Di Qing, who had already destroyed Netherworld OOld Daoist, looked at Jian Wushuang with a serious expression and placed his palm on his broken chest.","Strands of Yan power with vigorous power tried to repair his chest.","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes and said slowly, “Leave this place as soon as possible and rush to the realm of Great Mi Heaven.”","After saying this, he passed out again.","Di Qing nodded, took Jian Wushuang from the two women, and ran straight to the North Sky Heavenly Region.","Zhao Ting and Xi Qingchi also followed.","After leaving the North Sky Heavenly Region which was full of Immortal tombs, they finally entered the Great Mi Heaven.","The originally dark and gloomy sky disappeared and was replaced by a bright and vigorous Heavenly Region.","That intense battle almost destroyed the entire North Sky Heavenly Region. In the end, it still attracted nearly a hundred top cultivators to investigate the North Sky Heavenly Region.","Di Qing’s face turned serious as he passed by the guards of the Yan Immortals and top cultivators. Jian Wushuang was so seriously injured that he had to find a secluded cave to recuperate in order to avoid any permanent injuries.","Then, Di Qing found a relatively thin and undetectable Heavenly Abode nearby and flew up.","The clouds gradually thinned, and a total of seven lotus-like celestial mountains came into view.","Di Qing, who was carrying Jian Wushuang, directly chose the largest and most magnificent celestial mountain among the seven lotus peaks and stepped on it.","Boom!!!","He waved his palm and opened up a small heavenly passage at the side of the lotus peak.","They then turned around and entered.","Di Qing, who was carrying Jian Wushuang, was the first to enter the Heavenly Abode, but he was soon stunned.","Zhao Ting and Xi Qingchi also stopped on the spot.","In front of them, in the depths of the small Heavenly Abode, a young man in a tattered long robe was sitting on the ground with his legs crossed in fear. He was looking at them in horror.","Beside the young man, there were some high-grade treasures scattered around. It was obvious that they had just been scattered.","Di Qing soon understood what was going on. It turned out that the lotus peak was not without an owner. It was obviously a blessed place for the young man to cultivate.","However, even if this lotus peak had an owner, it had changed owners the moment he entered.","Killing intent flashed in Di Qing’s eyes. It was a piece of cake for him to crush a guy who was only in the Yan Immortal realm.","Just as he was about to make a move, Jian Wushuang, who had passed out, opened his eyes slightly and said, “You can’t kill him.”","Although Di Qing did not understand what he meant, he still restrained the killing intent in his heart. He looked at the down-and-out young man and said in a deep voice, “Get out in three breaths.”","When the ashen-faced young man heard this, he felt as if he had been pardoned. He did not care that this was his Heavenly Abode to begin with, and he hurriedly nodded. At the same time, he quickly picked up the high-grade treasures that had fallen to the ground and prepared to escape."]},{"number":4829,"title":"Chapter 4829 Wei Liujia of Dagu Mountain","paragraphs":["4829 Wei Liujia of Dagu Mountain","The young man hurriedly stuffed the treasures into his arms and was about to rush out of the Heavenly Abode.","But then, Xi Qingchi did open her arms and block his way. “You can’t let him go, or else His Excellency’s safety can’t be guaranteed.”","When the young man heard this, he hurriedly closed his eyes. “Don’t worry, I didn’t see anything. I won’t say a word.”","Di Qing also realized something. He immediately released the rope of Yan power and tied him up, then threw him into the depths of the small Heavenly Abode.","The young man, who had fallen heavily to the ground, was like a frightened rabbit. He started to speak incoherently in panic. “My Lords, I, Wei Liujia, am a good man. I have been working diligently on Dagu Mountain without slacking for a single day. I have not even missed out on the offerings I receive every Hua Year. The heavens can see my sincerity. I am loyal to the Second Prince... Mmm, mmm...”","Too lazy to listen to his nonsense, Di Qing blocked his mouth again and whipped him several times with his Yan force before he finally became obedient.","The Heavenly Abode suddenly fell silent. Di Qing placed the unconscious Jian Wushuang on a flat ground and began to check his condition.","Di Qing was surprised to see that Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body, which was originally fragmented and almost emptied of internal organs, had almost recovered. The shocking wounds were also healing at a rapid pace.","Moreover, his aura had gradually calmed down from its previous fluctuations. It was only a matter of time before he completely recovered.","“What kind of a freak is this guy?” Di Qing murmured in disbelief.","Xi Qingchi also stepped forward at this moment, his eyes still slightly red. “The Lord’s situation...”","“He’s fine. There’s nothing serious with him for now,” Di Qing said coldly. He was obviously more disgusted with this woman who was almost the culprit.","“Then can I take care of My Lord?” she said in a low voice.","“You can’t,” Di Qing replied coldly. “He doesn’t need to be taken care of. He will recover soon.”","Xi Qingchi agreed and returned dejectedly.","As time passed, the cave in the celestial mountain became silent.","After an unknown amount of time, a faint and excited cry sounded from outside the heavenly passage.","In the blink of an eye, a figure that was more than three meters tall suddenly rushed into the Heavenly Abode. Its extremely white fur was dotted with dense black patterns that were difficult to understand.","It was the Dream-Eating Tapir, and also the culprit who awakened all the Immortal bones in the North Sky Heavenly Region’s Immortal graveyard.","At this moment, it leaped into the Heavenly Abode. Its four pitch-black eyes immediately saw its master and it was so excited that it wanted to pounce over.","However, it was met with a powerful kick in response.","Xi Qingchi used almost all of her strength to kick it away.","At the same time, before Zhao Ting could react, she pulled out the knife from her waist and was about to slash at the Dream-Eating Tapir.","In the end, the long saber with Yan power flowing on it did not land. Instead, it hovered above the Dream-Eating Tapir’s head.","Xi Qingchi’s eyes were bloodshot. It looked at it and said coldly, “Get out. From now on, I’m no longer your master.”","The Dream-Eating Tapir sobbed softly and scratched the ground uneasily with its front paws. It did not understand why its master was so cold to it all of a sudden.","It whimpered in a fawning manner, then crouched down and moved forward. However, this time, what responded to it was a sharp long knife.","The saber slashed down and tore a bloody wound on the Dream-Eating Tapir’s neck.","“Get lost!” Xi Qingchi said coldly as she pointed the long saber in her hand towards the outside of the Heavenly Abode.","The Dream-Eating Tapir sobbed and lay on the ground without moving.","At this time, a tired voice slowly rang out, “Forget it. What’s in the past is in the past. It’s reasonable for a small beast to not have developed its spiritual intelligence.”","Jian Wushuang sat up slowly and coughed lightly.","“My Lord, you’re awake!” Xi Qingchi was surprised. The long saber in her hand dropped onto the ground, but she immediately became a little uneasy.","“It’ll be bad if I continue to sleep.” He shook his head helplessly.","Di Qing, who had been sitting beside him, looked at him carefully, then raised his eyebrows slightly and said, “You’ve recovered quite well.”","Jian Wushuang laughed, “Fortunately, my Life Source was not injured. My recovery is quite smooth.”","After he finished speaking, he slowly looked around. “Where are we now?”","Di Qing replied, “The interior of Great Mi Heaven. We’ve already left the North Sky Heavenly Region.”","“It seems like it’s going smoothly. This little Heavenly Abode is not bad. Although the Yan power is a little thin, it’s still a good place to meditate.” Jian Wushuang looked around and nodded.","This Heavenly Abode hid wind and water, and although the decoration was a little cold, it was still considered elegant. The owner obviously had style.","Just as he was about to look away, he suddenly caught a glimpse of a figure that was almost tied up like a dumpling in the corner of the wall.","The dumpling was staring at them in horror.","“This is?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","Upon hearing this, Di Qing reached out and clenched his hand. The figure that was wrapped like a dumpling rolled over, and at the same time, he removed the Yan power chain from his mouth.","Seeing this, the disheveled young man hurriedly closed his eyes and mumbled, “I didn’t see anything, I didn’t see anything. I don’t know anything. Please, My Lords, let me go.”","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry. “It’s nothing. Open your eyes and let me see.”","The young man finally opened his eyes slowly.","“You’re the master of this Heavenly Abode?” he asked.","The young man nodded and said with a trembling voice, “I am the Second Mountain Lord of Dagu Mountain, Wei Liujia...”","“Wei Liujia? It’s a good name.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile and said. “How many Mountain Lords like you are there in the Heavenly Region of the Great Mi Heaven?”","The disheveled young man named Wei Liujia spilled the beans. “There are dozens of Heavenly Regions in the entire Great Mi Heaven, but there are only 17 Heavenly Abodes like mine. There are only 17 Mountain Lords, and the Mountain Lords are hereditary and can not be led by others.”","Jian Wushuang touched his chin, “17 Heavenly Abodes and 17 Mountain Lords. It seems that your status should be considered relatively high in the Great Mi Heaven, right?”","When Wei Liujia heard this, a hint of embarrassment flashed across his face. “The position of the Mountain Lord of Heavenly Abode is indeed high, but my father died in battle when I was young. He only left me the position of the Mountain Lord of Dagu Mountain.”","“Although I’m the Heavenly Mountain Lord, I’m the only light rod in the entire Dagu Heavenly Abode. In addition, I have to go there every Hua Year to offer offerings. My father never left any treasures behind, and I really can’t get any treasures to offer. Therefore, after a few times, I became the existence at the bottom of the 17 Heavenly Abodes and was not liked by any cultivators...”"]},{"number":4830,"title":"Chapter 4830 Wei Liujia’s Court Tribute","paragraphs":["4830 Wei Liujia’s Court Tribute","The entire cave of Dagu Mountain was filled with an awkward atmosphere.","Jian Wushuang looked at the extremely simple Heavenly Abode again. Except for a few tattered futon that were almost patched up, all the other feng shui and scenery were pure natural. Only then did he confirm that he was not lying and that it was really poor.”","“It can’t be, you are a Yan Immortal and you are this poor?” Jian Wushuang unconsciously added another blow.","Wei Liujia was very hurt, and the expression on his face was almost embarrassed. “Well, because I’m just a little Yan Immortal and don’t have much ability to accumulate wealth, I can only live on this Dagu Mountain, which is why my life is so difficult... In addition, the prince has ordered that the Mountain Lords are not allowed to leave their respective areas of jurisdiction without permission, which is why they are so poor.”","“I had previously asked for some precious spiritual treasure seeds from other Yan Immortals. I was prepared to plant some and when the Hua Year was coming, I would bring the harvest to the court as tribute. However, my Dagu Mountain is a land of evil. Nothing can grow here, only some ordinary things can grow here. Thus, after a few times, it became the situation you see now.”","At this point, Wei Liujia raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang nervously, “My Lords, you can see that I’m really poor. Even if I strip off my clothes, I won’t be able to squeeze out any treasure. Please show mercy.”","Jian Wushuang finally understood that the young Yan Immortal named Wei Liujia had inherited his father’s position and received the title of Mountain Lord.","However, due to his bad luck and various other reasons, he was so down and out that he could not even recruit talents. He could only stay in his own territory.","“Don’t worry, we won’t covet anything of yours. We’ll only be borrowing this treasured land for a short rest before leaving.” After Jian Wushuang finished speaking, he motioned Di Qing to release the rope on his body.","When the rope was untied, the things that Wei Liujia had hidden in his arms were scattered all over the ground.","Upon closer inspection, they were all treasures of various sizes. There were dozens of them, and they were shimmering with all sorts of treasure lights. They could barely be considered decent.","The air froze. The corners of Wei Liujia’s mouth twitched, and cold sweat seeped out of his temples.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Put it away quickly. We’re just taking a short break here. We’re not bandits who want to steal someone’s treasure.”","“Yes, My Lord!” Wei Liujia responded and hurriedly stuffed the treasures back into his arms.","While he was putting away the treasures, Jian Wushuang thought back to the previous conversation and quickly realized something. He asked, “You just said that you have to go to the court every year. You go to the court to see the Second Emperor, Prince Jiu? ”","Wei Liujia nodded. Jian Wushuang’s warmth had unknowingly closed the distance between them. In addition, there were almost no top cultivators who came to visit Dagu Mountain on normal days, so he had no one to talk to. Thus, he unconsciously opened his mouth and said, “Yes, I have to go to the Heavenly Palace to offer an official tribute every one Hua year.”","Jian Wushuang was moved by his words. After exchanging a glance with Di Qing, he asked again, “Then, has the offering ceremony for this Hua Year begun or not?”","“Not yet. Wei Liujia shook his head and said, “Every Hua Year’s tribute starts after the Second Prince returns from the Heavenly Court’s feast. For some reason, the current year’s tribute has been delayed for some time, but it will start in three years.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes brightened. This was simply great timing. Originally, he was still having a headache over how to get close to Prince Jiu. Now, this problem was immediately solved.","As the saying goes, a lean camel is still bigger than a horse. Even if Wei Liujia was ostracized by the other Mountain Lords, he was still able to go straight to the Heavenly Palace and meet Prince Jiu.","This was what Jian Wushuang urgently needed.","If he went to the Heavenly Palace with him to get close to Prince Jiu, he would have a rather legitimate and undetectable identity. As long as Yin Ling was by Prince Jiu’s side or nearby, he would definitely be able to find her whereabouts!","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang said, “If we want to go to the Heavenly Palace with you and meet Prince Jiu, can we?”","Wei Liujia was stunned, but his expression quickly changed. “I’m afraid that’s not a good idea. The Heavenly Palace is heavily guarded, and every person who goes to pay tribute will be thoroughly investigated. What if...”","He did not say the second half of his sentence, but Jian Wushuang knew what he was thinking. If he took them to the Heavenly Palace, the consequences and problems that would arise would definitely not be something that a little Yan Immortal like him could bear.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to persuade him again, Zhao Ting, who had been silent all this while, slowly walked forward.","Wei Liujia subconsciously raised his head to look, and his entire body trembled at the sight. He hurriedly stood up straight and cupped his hands in salute to Zhao Ting. “Your humble servant, Wei Liujia, the Mountain Lord of Dagu Mountain, greets... greets Heavenly Official Zhao.","“You recognize me?” Zhao Ting came in front of him and asked indifferently.","“O-of course, you’re the Heavenly Official serving the Second Prince. I’ll definitely remember that,” Wei Liujia said, embarrassed.","Zhao Ting nodded and said, “I also know you, and you’re the one who left the deepest impression. I can still remember you even now.”","His eyes brightened. “Thank you, Heavenly Official Zhao, for remembering my position.”","“Of course I remember. You are the most unique individual among the 17 Mountain Lords,” Zhao Ting said with a smile.","“Ahaha... Is that so?” Wei Liujia’s expression turned awkward, and he naturally understood what Zhao Ting meant.","This once-in-a-year court tribute had made him embarrassed every time, so of course he would leave a deep impression.","If there were no accidents, he would make a fool of himself again in the Heavenly Palace.","Zhao Ting naturally did not know what he was thinking. She continued, “They are all my colleagues. I have important matters to attend to, so I can’t go to the Heavenly Palace. Can you take them to the Heavenly Palace to pay their respects?”","Although Zhao Ting was asking, her tone did not allow any room for discussion.","Although her words were full of loopholes, Wei Liujia did not dare to disobey. He cupped his hands and said, “Replying to Heavenly Official Zhao, the Mountain Lord of the Dagu Mountain, Wei Liujia, will obey your orders.”","Zhao Ting nodded and then looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang gave her an affirmative look and then walked toward Wei Liujia.","“Brother Wei, did you prepare any gifts for the Second Prince?”","When Wei Liujia heard this, he immediately broke out in cold sweat again. His expression was extremely uneasy. “Yes, I have prepared, but whether it will satisfy the Second Prince is another matter...”","“Then can I have a look?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Alright, alright.” He had a complicated expression on his face as he slowly reached into his arms.","A moment later, some of the treasures he had hidden in his arms were taken out one by one and carefully suspended in the air.","When he saw the treasures that were prepared for the Second Prince, Jian Wushuang finally believed that Wei Liujia was really poor!"]},{"number":4831,"title":"Chapter 4831 Heading to the Heavenly Palace","paragraphs":["4831 Heading to the Heavenly Palace","There were as many as four cultivation techniques and Dao books that even ordinary top cultivators could find and look down on. They occupied 40 percent of the treasures.","He had a total of 13 treasures in his collection, and each of them could only be said to be tragic...","Other than the cultivation technique Dao book, there were also some treasures that he could not name.","However. Wei Liujia introduced them to Jian Wushuang one by one. “This is the Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile, the Gold Jade Ring...”","Of the 13 treasures, only the Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile had some value. It could nourish the meridians and had a good use for recovering Yan power.","However, even so, the effect of this Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile was probably not as good as the crystal at the top of the black mountain...","Wei Liujia wiped the cold sweat from his forehead. “These are all treasures I got in exchange for selling the True Swords my father left me. I hope I won’t make a fool of myself in this court session.”","“...” Jian Wushuang did not know what to say anymore. These items could barely be considered treasures. If he were to bring these items to the Heavenly Palace or to the Second Prince, Prince Jiu, then Wei Liujia’s ridicule and humiliation would be inevitable.","With this in mind, he looked at Wei Liujia. With a flip of his palm, a small black wooden box appeared. He handed it over and said, “Fate has brought us together. Today, I’ll give you a little toy.”","Although Wei Liujia was puzzled, he still reached out and took the small black wooden box.","The next moment, he gently opened the box, and thousands of gentle white rays of light escaped from the box. They carried an extremely strong medicinal fragrance, illuminating the entire small heavenly passage for a moment.","“Gulp.”","A clear gulping sound reverberated in everyone’s ears.","Wei Liujia’s eyes were wide open as he stared at the pill in the black wooden box.","Jian Wushuang smiled as if he had expected his reaction.","These pills were taken out from Emperor Liu Ya’s Heavenly Court by the three of them. They were the Emperor’s collection and were considered a top-tier treasure. Even ordinary Grand Yan Immortals might not even be able to take a look at them.","Every single one of them was an existence that could steal the fate energy of heaven and earth.","The Emperor’s Treasury Pills in front of him had a miraculous effect on stabilizing his foundation and comprehending Immortal Styles. Even Jian Wushuang liked this pill.","In the end, Wei Liujia reluctantly retracted his gaze and closed the box. He shook his head and said, “The value of this pill is simply too valuable. I’m afraid that even if I sell my Dagu Mountain, I won’t be able to buy it. I can’t accept it.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Take it. Don’t you want to use this pill to gain some face when you go to the Heavenly Palace?”","His words struck Wei Liujia’s sore spot in the deepest part of his heart. It made him recall all the humiliation he had suffered since he became the Mountain Lord.","In an instant, his outstretched hand clutched the box tightly again, his knuckles turning white.","“Yes, I do.”","“It’s good that you want to. If there’s an opportunity, you must seize it,” Jian Wushuang patted him on the shoulder with a smile. “Then let’s go to the Heavenly Palace together in three years.”","Three years, to Yan Immortal, was just a blink of an eye.","In the past three years, Jian Wushuang, Di Qing, and the others had not left the small Heavenly Abode on Dagu Mountain. They had all been recuperating and adjusting their strength to the peak.","There was only one Yan Immortal who had not closed his eyes for a moment in the past three years, and that Yan Immortal was Wei Liujia.","For three years, he had been caressing the box that Jian Wushuang had given him. He was extremely careful even when he opened it, for fear that it would be damaged.","Looking at Wei Liujia who was about to go crazy, Jian Wushuang could not stand it anymore and gave him four Emperor’s Treasury Pills of the same grade but with different effects.","Therefore, Wei Liujia was so excited that he almost passed out. The first thing he did after waking up was to bow his head, but he was stopped by Jian Wushuang. After a simple reminder, he finally suppressed his crazily fluctuating Immortal Source.","Three years had passed, and a unique loud sound of the morning bell and evening drum resounded from the corner of the sky.","In the small cave on Dagu Mountain, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes.","“My Lord, we should set off.” Wei Liujia seemed to have been waiting for a long time, and he could not hold back the joy on his face.","Jian Wushuang nodded, then stood up and walked forward. Di Qing followed behind him.","The candidates who would go to the Heavenly Palace to meet Prince Jiu had been decided long ago. They were only Jian Wushuang, Di Qing, and Wei Liujia.","As for Zhao Ting, Jian Wushuang decided not to let her go with him. Instead, he stayed with Xi Qingchi in the Heavenly Abode on Dagu Mountain.","He had made this decision because, on one hand, the more people there were, the easier it would be for her to be exposed in Prince Jiu’s Heavenly Palace. On the other hand, it was because Jian Wushuang did not trust her.","To be able to become a Heavenly Official and be sent to assassinate Prince Mo, how could she be a simple Yan Immortal?","“My Lord, can I go with you?” Xi Qingchi nervously rubbed the corner of his clothes and said uneasily.","Jian Wushuang looked back at her and said, “Don’t worry. I’ll come back to pick you up and send you home after I’m done.”","At this point, the three figures left the Heavenly Abode and turned into three streams of flowing light that flew up.","As his body shot up into the clouds, Jian Wushuang also noticed that at the same time, there were extremely strong auras rising from various Heavenly Regions and flying in the same direction.","It was the center of the entire Great Mi Heaven, where Prince Jiu’s Heavenly Palace was located.","As the Mountain Lord of a celestial mountain, which was different from the Heavenly Region, his status in the Great Mi Heaven was quite high. Every Mountain Lord was at least in the Yan Immortal stage, which was equivalent to Prince Jiu’s last trump card.","In other words, no matter how poor Wei Liujia was, he would still have some face in front of Prince Jiu.","The 17 celestial mountains and 17 Mountain Lords were the closest to the Heavenly Palace, other than the Lords of the Blessed Lands.","There were 17 Mountain Lords and only 6 Lords of the Blessed Lands. Their status was even more transcendent. Only Yan Immortals who had made great contributions to Prince Jiu could obtain this title. It was also like the Mountain Lord position, it was hereditary.","In less than half a day, Jian Wushuang and the others arrived at the Heavenly Palace in the center of the Great Mi Heaven.","In the midst of the clouds and mist, a 10,000-feet-tall Heavenly Gate stood among the clouds, towering and majestic.","At that moment, hundreds of figures fell outside the Heavenly Palace like the sun and stars.","Under the escort of their subordinates, dozens of noble figures strolled forward arrogantly.","The moment Wei Liujia saw them, he subconsciously lowered his body, trying to avoid them.","However, the more he hid, the more he was discovered. Among the 10 or so luxurious figures, the richest middle-aged Yan Immortal recognized Wei Liujia with a glance.","“Oh, so it’s Brother Wei. It’s been a Hua Year since we last met. It seems you’ve had some good fortune.”","That stout Yan Immortal dragged his tone and strode over.","Although he had the Emperor’s Treasury Pills that Jian Wushuang had given him as his foundation, Wei Liujia still felt that he was inferior, and his face turned slightly red."]},{"number":4832,"title":"Chapter 4832 Head Held High","paragraphs":["4832 Head Held High","That stout Yan Immortal was obviously one of the 17 Mountain Lords. His small eyes were constantly looking at the clothes on his body, and from there, he said what he had just said.","The clothes that Wei Liujia was wearing at the moment were also given to him by Jian Wushuang.","The tunic was given to Jian Wushuang by the Young Emperor, Prince Yan, earlier on. Every single thread had taken the effort of countless embroiderers. It was a rare treasure, and he had given it to Wei Liujia.","The stout Yan Immortal could also see the extraordinary clothes on his body, his eyes rolled. “Eh, Brother Wei, where is the True Sword that you always carry around? Don’t tell me you sold it to buy this outfit?”","As his voice fell, the remaining 10 or so luxurious figures roared with laughter, making the hall extremely lively.","Wei Liujia’s face flushed red, and he was about to rush forward to argue.","However, Jian Wushuang, who was beside him, pulled him back and said in an undetectable voice, “Why would you want to argue with a barking dog?”","“Kid, what did you say?!”","Jian Wushuang did not hide his voice, so the Yan Immortal could hear him clearly. The Yan Immortal’s expression changed.","Wei Liujia felt an inexplicable peace of mind, and his mentality had also changed without him realizing it. Facing the incoming stout Yan Immortal, he fearlessly faced him.","“Wei Liujia, get lost! I’m going to destroy that Kid’s Life Source!” the stout Yan Immortal said angrily.","When Wei Liujia heard this, the corners of his lips slowly curled up. “Ding Chunshan, have I always been too kind, allowing you to ride on my head and sh*t all the time? Don’t forget that I’m also a Mountain Lord!”","The stout Yan Immortal was stunned, looking at Wei Liujia in disbelief.","The area outside the Heavenly Palace fell silent.","“What a Mountain Lord,” Yan Immortal sneered. “Are you going to make a great contribution to the entire Great Mi Heaven? I’m afraid you can’t even afford the court tributes. Isn’t it because of your father that you got your position?”","“Why do you care how many contributions I’ve made? Even if I lie down and sleep every day, I’m still the Mountain Lord,” Wei Liujia sneered as well. “How about we make a bet? I’ll win the court tribute this time. How about you take off my shoes and massage my legs?”","“As long as you can beat me, I’ll even lick your shoes, let alone rub your legs!” the stout Yan Immortal said coldly. “If you’re not as good as me, then you’ll automatically remove yourself from the position of Mountain Lord and run three laps around the Heavenly Palace naked. What do you think?”","“I’ll agree to that.” Wei Liujia gave him a sidelong glance before turning around and striding into the Heavenly Palace.","Having suffered such a loss, Yan Immortal, who knew that he had lost face, wanted to swallow him alive.","“Wei Liujia, just you wait!”","In the vast scaling ladder, Wei Liujia’s face was flushed with excitement. “Damn it, I’ve never felt so good before. I’ve returned all the humiliation I’ve suffered in the past. I didn’t know it was so satisfying!”","After he finished speaking, he looked at Jian Wushuang and said sincerely, “It’s all thanks to you that I can hold my head high today. I thank you.”","Jian Wushuang smiled, “Actually, even without the foundation I gave you, you can still hold your head high.”","“You’ve always been stuck in your own opinion. You don’t know that to deal with that kind of person, you have to return the favor ruthlessly.”","“Destroying him physically is far inferior to destroying him mentally and physically.” After Jian Wushuang said this calmly, he did not speak again.","Wei Liujia was also mulling over the meaning of his words, and for a moment, he was even more in awe of him.","There were 9990 steps on the steps, and the magnificent gate of the Heavenly Palace only appeared when he stepped on the last step.","The Heavenly Palace that Prince Jiu was in was grand and magnificent, filled with a sense of majesty. Compared to the palace in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture of the late Prince Mo, it was less mysterious and ingenious, and more majestic.","This made Jian Wushuang feel that Prince Jiu was the real Young Emperor.","After the Heavenly Court’s grand banquet, the Prince had set up the rules for the opening of the court offering every one Hua Year. It was meant to firmly rope in the Mountain Lords of Great Mi Heaven and the Lords of the Blessed Landss to prevent disloyalty.","The door of the Heavenly Palace had been opened for a long time, and a fragrant scent drifted out of the palace, calming the mind of those who smelled it.","A peak cultivator guard walked out of the hall and led them in.","In order to show off their appearance and style, every Mountain Lord who came to the Heavenly Palace was followed by five or six top cultivation subordinates. Each of them was hugging a huge box, which was obviously a gift from the court.","This was especially so for the stout Yan immortal who was confronting Wei Liujia outside the Heavenly Palace. He was followed by eight top cultivation subordinates, and there were no less than twenty boxes in his arms.","Wei Liujia, on the other hand, was very straightforward. He took his seat with a palm-sized Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile in his hand.","This scene was taken in by the stout Yan Immortal and he almost laughed out loud. He had read countless treasures and naturally could see that the Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile in Wei Liujia’s hand was not even as good as the clothes he was wearing.","“I’d like to see how you’re going to compete with me. Just wait for your butt to be naked and run three laps around the palace!” the stout Yan Immortal glared at him and sat down.","Long before the Mountain Lords entered the hall, Jian Wushuang had already noticed that there were six Elders sitting at the lower end of the throne. They were all peak Yan Immortals with rather mature looks and should be the Lords of the Blessed Land.","Sitting beside Wei Liujia, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were fixed on the empty throne.","He was hoping, hoping that the figure with the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor would appear in the next moment.","“My Lord, are you waiting for the Second Prince to appear?” Seeing the fluctuation in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, Wei Liujia lowered his voice and said. “The Second Prince will only move from the Immortal Platform to the Heavenly Palace after the morning bell rings three times.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and waited with great concentration.","When the sound of the bell, which seemed to have come from an ancient distance, reverberated, the entire Heavenly Palace fell silent in an instant. All the Mountain Lords sat upright and still. Even the Lords of the Blessed Lands, who had closed their eyes to rest, opened their eyes.","Outside the hall, there were the cries of Immortal cranes and at the same time, thousands of Immortal clouds rose.","Under the guidance of hundreds of cranes, a figure dressed in the son of the Emperor’s court uniform slowly walked into the Heavenly Palace with his hands behind his back.","At this moment, the 17 Mountain Lords , the 6 Lords of the Blessed Lands, many Yan immortals and top level cultivators all cupped their hands and said, “Your humble servant greets the Second Prince!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at his back. Compared to the grand banquet in the Heavenly Court a few years ago, Prince Jiu had a more subtle calmness. It was as if he knew everything in his heart. He gave off a feeling that he was as calm as water.","This was a very strong opponent, and you would never be able to guess his thoughts.","Up until now, Jian Wushuang still did not think that what he had seen in the fight for the Peach was Prince Jiu’s true strength."]},{"number":4833,"title":"Chapter 4833 Fighting to Present the Treasures","paragraphs":["4833 Fighting to Present the Treasures","There were hundreds of pairs of eyes watching from the Heavenly Realm’s Heavenly Court of Zhen Wuyang. Judging from Prince Jiu’s performance, that was definitely not the last of his strength.","Even when he was suppressed by Jian Wushuang in the end, he definitely had several ways to escape. However, Jian Wushuang guessed that Prince Jiu might not be able to display his skills as to why he was defeated in the end.","After all, from the Immortal Style he had used in that contest, it was very dark and fierce.","Jian Wushuang had classified him as a dangerous person, so he naturally would not start a conflict with him.","The scene of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture killing Prince Mo would also never happen in the Great Mi Heaven.","As he sat on the throne, Prince Jiu nodded his head slowly. He glanced at every Yan Immortal in the Heavenly Palace with a warm expression.","Beside him was a white-robed Yan Immortal.","“All of you! please take your seats,” Prince Jiu waved his hand and smiled. “It’s been a Hua Year since we’ve last met. Let’s drink 300 cups of wine on this grand occasion! I am satisfied with the fine wine.”","With that, laughter rang out in the Heavenly Palace, and the atmosphere was extremely harmonious.","In the face of these Mountain Lords of the Celestial Mountains and the Lords of the Blessed Lands, Prince Jiu did not reveal his identity. Instead, he lowered his status to give others the feeling that he was on equal footing.","Even Jian Wushuang could not find any flaws in the conversation, so he naturally did not feel uncomfortable.","Immediately after, a servant boy began to present bottles of exquisite wine. Although it seemed to be a small bottle, it contained more than a thousand tons of wine.","Wei Liujia picked up the fine wine and poured a cup for Jian Wushuang, then Di Qing, and finally for himself.","This kind of unnoticeable small detail was naturally seen by the fat Yan Immortal, Ding Chunshan, who was sitting next to him. He was a little shocked.","No matter how unbearable Wei Liujia was, he was still the Mountain Lord of a Celestial Mountain. His personality was like a stinky rock in a latrine pit. He was poor, but at the same time, he was also so stubborn that did not listen to anything.","And the two guys who could make him pour wine, weren’t they his followers? Instead, they were reinforcements?","When he thought of Wei Liujia’s uncharacteristic behavior outside the Heavenly Palace, Ding Chunshan suddenly lost his confidence.","“Could it be that this guy is really hiding some treasure in his hands?” Ding Chunshan was secretly nervous, but he quickly calmed down.","Even if Wei Liujia had some treasures in his hands, did he not have any? Not only that, but the quantity and quality of the offerings far exceeded that of the previous ones!","For the sake of this magnificent Hua Year’s court tribute, Ding Chunshan had brought almost all of his family’s belongings with him. He just wanted to leave a good impression in front of Prince Jiu.","The reason why he brought all of them here was because Ding Chunshan had a hidden meaning that he did not reveal.","This was the first time that the Hua Year court tribute ceremony had come late. There was no precedent. Moreover, he was well-informed that he had vaguely learned that something had happened to Prince Jiu’s Fifth Brother, which had led to a state of martial law in all the Heavenly Regions.","Therefore, Ding Chunshan made a bold guess that the Second Prince, Prince Jiu, was very likely to send down the fate energy of the Blessed Land at this critical moment to strengthen the stability of the Great Mi Heaven!","The 17 Mountain Lords of the Celestial Mountains and the 6 Lords of the Blessed Lands were basically Prince Jiu’s hired thugs and bodyguards.","Only when the fate energy of the Blessed Lands descended again would they have a common benefit.","Whether or not he could be promoted from the Mountain Lord of the Celestial Mountain to the Lord of the Blessed Land would depend on this opportunity.","Hence, Ding Chunshan had to take first place this time!","He raised his head and finished the wine in the glass. Then, he looked around with a smug look in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting at the side, frowned slightly and did not take a sip of the wine in his cup.","Three rounds of wine had passed, but Yin Ling still had not appeared in the Heavenly Palace, which made him a little restless. He began to think about getting out and taking advantage of this opportunity to explore the surroundings of the Heavenly Palace.","Just as he was thinking about how to escape, the atmosphere in the Heavenly Palace began to change subtly.","All of the Mountain Lords’ followers began to organize their boxes. Although the Mountain Lords were still drinking, they seemed to be secretly competing with each other.","Prince Jiu loved the precious treasures born from the heaven and earth, and Prince Mo liked men. In the Great Si Region, almost all Yan Immortals who had heard of him knew about this.","This also led to the scene of treasures being presented now. Every Mountain Lord and even the Lords of the Blessed Lands began to offer their own treasures.","The first person to present the treasure was the Lord of the Blessed Land who was sitting next to the Prince. He stood up and took out a black and white Ruyi scepter from his arms.","Your Highness, this item is called the Clear Avoidance Ruyi Scepter. It was forged by the divine craftsman Xu Tuo in the Sancun Mountain. It contains two extremely rich traces of innate fate energy and is a rare treasure.","“This object has a black and white bone bud. You only need to twist the black one to avoid evil spirits and clear your spirit platform. If you press the white one, you can absorb most of the evil thoughts and Blood Qi.”","The dual-colored Ruyi scepter that the older Lords of the Blessed Lands first threw out was still valuable. If this item was used, it could avoid some Yan Immortals who had special cultivation techniques.","Prince Jiu, who was sitting at the head of the table, nodded his head in acknowledgment, not revealing any expression.","After the Lords of the Blessed Lands handed the Clear Avoidance Ruyi to the escort boy, he sat back down.","Since then, the competition for treasures had begun.","This was an invisible battle without smoke.","An endless stream of rare treasures appeared, and they were of extremely high quality. Some of the treasures even tempted Jian Wushuang.","As long as the Immortal Source was not destroyed, the Dove Myriad Immortal Grass could instantly form a peak Immortal body.","There was the heaven-defying Multi-Treasure Gourd that could easily kill a Yan Immortal with just a drop of blood.","There was even a True Sword made of Heaven-Hanging Wood with a strong life aura!","The Heaven-Hanging Wood was an Immortal wood that would only grow with the help of the Emperor’s fate energy. It would wither and die once it left the Emperor’s fate energy. It was an indispensable item in the construction of the Heavenly Court.","A True Sword made from Heaven-Hanging wood that contained a strong life force and showed no signs of withering and death was unprecedented!","The value of this sword could no longer be measured by the value of a treasure. This True Sword had completely become the most eye-catching existence!","Even Prince Jiu, who had countless treasures, was extremely fond of this True Sword.","The person who had offered up the Heaven-Hanging Wood True Sword was the Mountain Lord of the 13th Celestial Mountain. He had only brought one treasure this time, but it had become an existence that could suppress everyone.","According to him, he had found the True Sword of the Heaven-Hanging Wood in an ancient battlefield. It was very likely that it was forged by an Emperor with supreme fate energy and given to his right-hand man.","Ding Chunshan, who was sitting in his original position, could no longer remain calm. He could clearly sense that the treasures presented this time were incomparable to the ones presented in the past, be it in terms of quality or quantity."]},{"number":4834,"title":"Chapter 4834 Flaunting Wealth","paragraphs":["4834 Flaunting Wealth","The quality of the treasure this time was simply too high.","With the Dove Myriad Immortal Grass in front and the Heaven-Hanging Wood True Sword behind him, it was no longer easy to stand out.","Ding Chunshan gritted his teeth and thought to himself, ‘I’ll see how many treasures you have?!’","In just half a day, dozens of treasures appeared like flowing water.","When it was Ding Chunshan’s turn, he stood up arrogantly and took a few steps forward. With a flip of his palm, two black pearls that were slowly rotating appeared.","Your Highness, this item is called the Sky Setting Pearl. It is divided into the Thunder Pearl and the Cloud Pearl. The Thunder Pearl has the power to forge, while the Cloud Pearl has the power to destroy.","“One is to forge a small Heavenly Region, one is to destroy a small Heaven Region.”","As soon as Ding Chunshan’s Sky Setting Pearl appeared, all the Mountain Lords started whispering to each other.","To be able to seal two extreme powers in such a small bead was already amazing, and its power was also extraordinary.","Prince Jiu, who was sitting at the head of the table, opened his mouth, which was a rare occasion. “Not bad.”","When Ding Chunshan heard this, he was overjoyed and quickly cupped his hands. “It’s a blessing for me, Ding Chunshan, to have your Highness like it.”","When the other Mountain Lords heard this, their lips twitched subtly. When it came to flattery, this guy was definitely an expert, and no one could beat him.","After handing over the Sky Setting Pearl to the guide boy, Ding Chunshan felt that he was in a good mood. Everyone was more pleasing to the eye.","Next, it was Wei Liujia’s turn to pay tribute, and the atmosphere in the entire Heavenly Palace suddenly became somewhat cheerful.","There was a hint of a smile in Prince Jiu’s eyes. He had a deep impression of the Mountain Lord of the Dagu Mountain, Wei Liujia. Every time he was offered an official tribute, he would wear a plain Daoist robe and looked extremely poor. Naturally, the treasures offered during the court session were like those sold at a roadside stall. They could not even be considered treasures.","However, Prince Jiu did not care about these things. Thanks to his father’s influence, Wei Liujia was still qualified to enter the Heavenly Palace and become the Mountain Lord of a Celestial Mountain. After all, his father was once from the Wei County, which was known as the God of War.","Slowly exhaling a mouthful of turbid breath, Wei Liujia and Jian Wushuang looked at each other and then walked forward with the Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile.","“Your Highness, this is an item presented by Wei Liujia. It’s called the Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile. It has the effect of nourishing meridians and recovering Yan power. It’s a treasure.”","As soon as he said that, the entire Heavenly Palace burst into laughter. Even the white-robed Yan Immortal behind the Prince laughed in disdain.","Ding Chunshan, who laughed the fiercest, said, “It seems that the Second Prince has suffered a loss this time. He hosted a banquet, but in the end, he received a piece of junk. It seems that it is time to raise the qualification to enter the Heavenly Palace.”","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting at the side, looked displeased. If they were not in the Heavenly Palace, he would have wrung Ding Chunshan’s head off based on the noise.","Prince Jiu’s expression was calm. He smiled and said, “Alright, I’ve received your kind intentions. Go back to your seat.”","Wei Liujia agreed. After solemnly handing the Supreme Jade Tree Glazed Tile to the guide boy, he took out a small, exquisite black wooden box the size of a palm. “Your Highness, Wei Liujia also has a pill to offer.”","The Heavenly Palace was silent. All the Mountain Lords were craning their necks, waiting to see what else he could make a fool of himself.","Prince Jiu’s interest was piqued. He stroked his chin and said, “Open it and take a look.”","Wei Liujia nodded, then reached out and gently opened the box.","Immediately, thousands of seven-colored rays of light scattered out. The medicinal fragrance that was so thick that it was almost impossible to dissolve was like a painting scroll, instantly filling the entire Heavenly Palace.","Prince Jiu, who had been moving casually, sat up straight in an instant. His eyes were fixed on the item in the box.","All the Mountain Lords, including the Lords of the Blessed Lands, stood up involuntarily. They wanted to see what exactly the pill was to be able to produce such a strange phenomenon.","Ding Chunshan’s fat face was extremely nervous. He could smell something unusual!","“This, this pill, what’s its use?” Prince Jiu asked in a deep voice.","“Your Highness, it can allow a peak Entry Yan Immortal cultivator to have an Immortal root.”","The short words were like thunder that exploded in the Heavenly Palace. The effect was ten times more powerful than the True sword made of the Heaven-Hanging Wood!","Even the usually calm and steady Prince Jiu could not help but take a deep breath. “Is this true?”","“Your Highness is wise.” As Wei Liujia spoke, he handed the black wooden box containing the pill to the guide boy.","Prince Jiu hurriedly took it into his hand and looked at the dark golden pill in the box, which was shimmering with a rainbow shadow. After a while, he raised his head and said solemnly, “Liujia, what reward do you want?”","The entire Heavenly Palace was in chaos again. This was something that had never happened before in the many years of worship. Prince Jiu had never mentioned the word ‘reward’. He had set a new precedent.","Wei Liujia then slowly shook his head. “I don’t want anything. Consider it as me paying back what I owed you for the past few centuries.”","Prince Jiu opened his mouth, but he had no reason to reward him.","The appearance of this pill meant that it could directly cultivate a Yan Immortal! A Yan Immortal was the foundation of a strategic plan!","It was equivalent to Wei Liujia giving him a Yan Immortal, so its importance was self-evident.","Ding Chunshan’s chubby face turned pale. He suppressed the uneasiness in his heart and stood up to Wei Liujia’s side. He cupped his hands and said, “Your Highness, I still have a treasure to offer!”","After he finished speaking, he flipped his hand and presented a copper bell.","“Your Highness, this item is called the Nine-Rotation Withered Bell. Every rotation is a sound, and there are nine rotations in total. Each rotation is stronger than the previous one. With just a slight shake, it can capture people’s souls and seal their souls. Even Yan Immortals can’t escape from it!”","After he finished speaking, all the Mountain Lords nodded their heads secretly.","The Nine-Rotation Withered Bell was indeed a treasure of the highest quality, and it was indeed terrifying that it could consume Yan Immortals. However, compared to the pill that Wei Liujia had given him, it was still slightly inferior.","Ding Chunshan looked at him with a cold smile, as if he was trying to vent his anger. His eyes seemed to be hinting that he still had many treasures that he had not taken out. How could he compete?","However, Wei Liujia only gave him a sidelong glance. He reached into his pocket and pulled out two small black wooden boxes.","The atmosphere was so suffocating that even Prince Jiu could no longer remain calm.","Your Highness, these two pills have the same effect as the one just now. They can help ordinary cultivators at the peak of the Entry Yan stage to grow Immortal roots.","The Heavenly Palace was in an uproar. All the Mountain Lords stood up and looked at Wei Liujia’s hand in disbelief.","The muscles on Ding Chunshan’s face trembled violently, and he subconsciously took half a step back.","Prince Jiu clenched his fists tightly on the throne, and his eyes were gleaming.","Following that, Wei Liujia looked at the dazed Ding Chunshan beside him and smiled faintly. “Mountain Lord Ding, do you still have any treasures that you have yet to offer? I’m in a hurry, and I can’t wait to offer up the rest of my collection.”","This guy was clearly showing off his wealth.","All the Mountain Lords and the Masters of the Blessed Lands looked at him in disbelief. This Mountain Lord of the Dagu Mountain, who had made a fool of himself in the treasure presentation for several Hua Years, had actually defeated 16 Mountain Lords and 6 Masters of the Blessed Lands by himself."]},{"number":4835,"title":"Chapter 4835 Blessing of the Heavenly Palace","paragraphs":["4835 Blessing of the Heavenly Palace","Three supreme-grade pills that could allow ordinary top cultivators to develop Immortal roots had already exceeded the scope of rare-quality pills.","Not to mention these Mountain Lords, even the Prince, Prince Jiu, had never seen such a mysterious pill.","One of them was enough to crush them, but Wei Liujia had just given up three of them. Naturally, no Mountain Lord would be able to block or break his position!","A total of three supreme-grade pills were sent into Prince Jiu’s hands, establishing Wei Liujia’s current unshakeable position in one fell swoop.","Wei Liujia laughed again. “Mountain Lord Ding, are there any treasures you have yet to offer?”","Ding Chunshan. who already knew the situation, turned pale, but he still gritted his teeth and said, “I still have...”","Before he could finish his sentence, Wei Liujia took out another box from his arms. “I’ll offer another pill. This has the same effect as the three previous pill pills.”","The Heavenly Palace was deathly silent, and Ding Chunshan’s face was ashen.","Four supreme-grade pills, that was like giving away four Yan Immortals, how the f*ck could he play? Since when could even Yan Immortals be mass-produced?","The Yan Immortal was the Dao of truth, not child’s play. Having an Immortal root meant that one had sensed the Dao of the future. If one were to rise above others, the subsequent effects would be unpredictable!","The four supreme-grade pills had completely defeated Ding Chunshan, or rather, crushed him.","The remaining 16 Mountain Lords and 6 Lords of the Blessed Lands all took the initiative to accept the gifts from their Imperial Tributes so as not to embarrass themselves.","Looking at this scene, Jian Wushuang smiled slightly. The five pills in Wei Liujia’s hands had been selected by him. They were all average, but they could indeed help ordinary top cultivators to grow Immortal roots. As for whether they could become Yan Immortals, it could only be said to be up to fate.","For the first time, Ding Chunshan felt an unsurpassable fear. All the things he had prepared were completely useless. He had been completely defeated.","Wei Liujia, who should have made a fool of himself, had been in the limelight because of his court tribute this Hua Year.","After taking a deep breath, Prince Jiu said slowly, “Liujia, tell me what reward you want. I can give you anything within my ability.”","Wei Liujia laughed when he heard this. He laughed in an extremely carefree manner. “Your Highness, I really do have something that I want.”","“What is it?”","“I want Ding Chunshan to take off my shoes and massage my feet.”","This rather jesting sentence stunned Prince Jiu and the group of Mountain Lords for a moment, but they soon understood the meaning behind it.","Wei Liujia was returning an eye for an eye, returning the favor for the difficulties he had suffered in the past few years.","Every time, it was Ding Chunshan who made him perform an impromptu sword dance, and the scene was quite embarrassing.","And now, it was time for a counterattack.","Ding Chunshan was in disbelief. Then, he looked at Prince Jiu for help.","Prince Jiu coughed once and waved his hand.","Wei Liujia agreed and then looked at Ding Chunshan with a faint smile.","This was a complete humiliation. Once he did it, he would have to endure the ridicule of all the Mountain Lords.","However, he had to do it. Since Prince Jiu had already acquiesced, he could not disobey.","Ding Chunshan’s face was ashen. His lips were pursed as he squatted down. Just as his hands were about to reach for his boots, Wei Liujia took half a step back. After staring at him deeply, he returned to his original position.","“Hurry up and go back.” Prince Jiu said in a deep voice and chided Ding Chunshan.","This time, he received four supreme-grade pills from the annual tribute. His mood was extremely good. Now that the forces of the Princes had formed, it was quite difficult to recruit four Yan Immortals out of thin air, even though the Great Si Region was vast.","For Prince Jiu, these four pill pills improved his abilities by another level.","With this in mind, he looked at the white-robed Yan Immortal.","The white-robed Yan Immortal understood tacitly, but he immediately lowered his body and said, “Your Highness, isn’t this too rash?”","“It’s not hasty. Announce it,” Prince Jiu said indifferently.","The white-robed Yan Immortal acknowledged and took a few steps forward, facing all the Yan Immortals in the palace.","with the special permission of His Highness, Wei Liujia, the Mountain Lord of the Dagu Mountain, has made a great contribution. Wei Liujia is hereby promoted to a small heavenly Official, and the Dagu Mountain under him will be promoted to a Blessed Land. He will enjoy all the blessings and luck of the Lord of the Blessed Land. This will take effect immediately.”","All the Mountain Lords and the Lords of the Blessed Lands were shocked. Even Wei Liujia was so shocked that he almost fell from his seat.","Dagu Mountain had somehow become a Blessed Land, and it was enjoying its good fortune, while he had been promoted to a small Heavenly Official?","All of this was because of the four supreme-grade pills.","Everything happened so quickly that Wei Liujia felt like he was in a dream.","It was only when he knelt down to report that his mind gradually cleared up. It was true that he had become a small Heavenly Official, but it was also true that he had enjoyed the blessing of the Lord of the Blessed Land.","He turned around and saw Jian Wushuang smiling at him.","Wei Liujia had never felt so excited before. If not for the many Yan Immortals watching, he would have gone to Jian Wushuang.","After the appointment of ministers, the number of Mountain Lords had increased from 17 to 16, and the number of Blessed Land Lords had increased from 6 to 7.","At the end of the banquet, Jian Wushuang still did not see Yin Ling, which made him a little anxious.","When the offering banquet was over, he did not want to stay any longer. He took Di Qing and prepared to explore the Heavenly Palace.","“My Lord, will we meet again?”","Outside the Heavenly Palace, among the misty clouds, Wei Liujia asked with some reluctance.","Jian Wushuang turned around and said, “If fate allows it, we will meet again. By the way, if you return to Dagu Mountain, take good care of the two ladies and don’t let them wander around.”","Wei Liujia nodded his head vigorously and cupped his hands solemnly as he looked at his back.","Everything seemed to have happened a lifetime ago, but he knew that a new age was coming.","After walking out of the Heavenly Palace and bidding farewell to Jian Wushuang, Wei Liujia prepared to return to Dagu Mountain first to see the fate energy of the Blessed Land.","However, just as he was about to leave the Heavenly Palace, several white-robed Yan Immortals caught up to him.","“Heavenly Official Wei, His Highness would like to invite you back for a chat.”","Wei Liujia’s heart skipped a beat, but he did not show it on his face. After nodding, he returned to the Heavenly Palace.","At this moment, there was only Wei Liujia in the hall where the fragrance of agarwood was rising.","He and Prince Jiu sat face to face. Other than Prince Jiu, there was no other Yan Immortal.","“Liujia, how many Hua Years has it been since your father passed away?” the Prince asked with a smile after pouring him a cup of tea.","“Your Highness, I can’t remember clearly. I think it’s been dozens of Hua Years, Wei Liujia responded indifferently.”","He nodded his head. “It’s been about that long. When I was young, I saw your father Wei Jun’s heroic bearing in front of my Imperial Father in the Heavenly Court. He was very breathtaking and was worthy of being called the God of War.”","Wei Liujia cupped his hands. “I thank Your Highness for your praise on behalf of my father.”","Prince Jiu chuckled. “I don’t lack anything, but I do lack one thing, and that is the fighting spirit of the God of War, Wei Jun.”"]},{"number":4836,"title":"Chapter 4836 Entering the Heavenly Prison","paragraphs":["4836 Entering the Heavenly Prison","WeiLiujia sat where he was, not quite understanding the meaning of his words.","His father, Wei Jun, had died in battle dozens of years ago. Now that Prince Jiu was talking about it again, he was afraid that there was some other meaning in his words.","After a moment’s thought, WeiLiujia raised his head and looked at him. “Your Highness, what do you mean?”","Prince Jiu chuckled and patted his shoulder. “It’s nothing. Wei Jun, the God of War, is no longer here, but I need someone to replace him. I can’t do without a capable Heavenly Official by my side.”","“How about this? Go back and make some preparations. You can become a Great Heavenly Official in the Heavenly Palace.”","WeiLiujia was taken aback and immediately shook his head. “Your Highness, this is too hasty. I’m definitely not up to the task.”","For example, Zhao Ting, who was by Prince Jiu’s side previously, was the Great Heavenly Official. The so-called Great Heavenly Official was almost the one who controlled the entire Great Mi Heaven aside from Prince Jiu. He had great power.","These words were like a series of thunder that exploded in his mind.","Prince Jiu smiled again. Then, he took out a small black wooden box from his chest pocket and placed it on the desk between them.","“Liujia, these pills are very precious to me. I need them.”","WeiLiujia looked at him. He already understood the meaning of his words. Without the slightest hesitation, he took out the last box of pills from his bosom.","“Your Highness, this is my last box of pills. Different from the first four boxes, it can help Yan Immortal to understand the Immortal Style and deepen it.”","The short sentence made Prince Jiu’s expression change a little.","To help Yan Immortal understand and deepen his Immortal Style, this meant that he had completely opened up Yan Immortal’s path to being a Grand Yan Immortal.”","This effect could no longer be described as heaven-defying, even the Immortal Peaches he obtained in the Heavenly Court could not compare.","Restraining the sharp light in his eyes, Prince Jiu looked at him and asked, “Liujia, where did you find these pills?”","“Your Highness, it was left behind by my father. I found it by accident in the cave of the Dagu Mountain,” WeiLiujia said without the slightest hesitation. “I’ll present the remaining five to Your Highness today.”","Prince Jiu reached out and took the last box of pills from him. He closed the lid gently and stood up with his back facing him.","“Liujia, don’t lie to me. These pills can’t have been left for you by Wei Jun. I’ve been by his side since I was young, and I know him the best. He’s never kept anything to himself in his entire life.”","“My Imperial Father doesn’t like pills, so he naturally wouldn’t have given them to Wei Jun.”","“Only the Emperor would have such a pill.”","At this point, Prince Jiu slowly bent down. “Tell me, where did you get these pills from? or who gave them to you?”","Wei Liujia did not expect this to happen, but he quickly calmed down. He cupped his hands and said, “Your Highness, it was indeed left behind by my father.”","“I’ve said it before. It’s impossible. It’s impossible for Wei Jun to have left behind such things!” the Prince raised his high pitch and said coldly. “You must have found these pills somewhere, or someone gave them to you.”","His voice softened. “Now, all you have to do is tell me everything, and the position of the Great Heavenly Official will be yours. I will give you anything you want.”","After taking a deep breath, WeiLiujia said, “Your Highness, everything I’ve said is true. There is no Treasure Land, and no one has given it to me.”","Prince Jiu’s expression gradually turned cold. “You’re really not going to tell me?”","“It’s not that I don’t want to tell you. I’ve already told you everything, Your Highness.” Wei Liujia’s voice was somewhat nervous.","“Do you know the consequences of not reporting what you have done?”","At this moment, Prince Jiu’s expression had turned completely cold.","As his voice fell, more than a dozen figures suddenly appeared in the originally empty Heavenly Palace.","Every figure was enshrouded in dense Yan power, they were all Yan Immortals.","They walked over and slowly surrounded Wei Liujia.","“This is your last chance,” Prince Jiu said indifferently with his back to him.","His eyes revealed a look of disbelief, and finally returned to calmness from nervousness. “There is no Treasure Land, and no one has given it to me.”","As Wei Liujia finished his sentence, a total of 12 Yan Immortals released their Yan power chains at the same time, binding him.","“Send him to the Heavenly Prison.” Prince Jiu turned around and looked at him.","Wei Liujia’s body trembled slightly. He asked in confusion and puzzlement, “I’ve given you the best things without holding back. Why are you still treating me like this?”","Before he could get a reply, he was captured and sent to the Heavenly Prison.","“Liujia, don’t blame me. My power has been weakened to the extreme. If I don’t think of a way, I will always be in a passive situation...”","Within the clouds formed by Yan power, there were Immortal Platforms.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing had already searched dozens of Immortal Platforms, but they still could not find any trace of Yin Ling.","For a moment, even Jian Wushuang began to doubt whether Yin Ling was in the Great Mi Heaven.","Just as he was about to search again, ten figures shot through the clouds like streams of light, speeding into the distance.","“How did that kid get caught?” Di Qing just glanced in that direction and said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. “Wei Liujia? Shouldn’t he have been sealed and returned to the Dagu Heaven?”","Di Qing said, “I’m afraid it’s not that simple. Those Yan Immortals just placed their bets on him.”","“Could it be because of those pills?” His heart skipped a beat, and he quickly determined that Prince Jiu must have attacked Wei Liujia.","However, he had never expected that Prince Jiu would fall out with him so quickly.","“Don’t bother with those trivial matters. Rather than wasting too much energy, it’s better to finish things quickly and return early,” Di Qing advised.","However, Jian Wushuang had already made up his mind. Wei Liujia was bound this time. If he did not rescue him, he would most likely die in the hands of Prince Jiu.","Moreover, he had already roughly guessed that Prince Jiu had captured Wei Liujia because he suspected that the pill was not made by him but by someone else.","For now, suspicion was just suspicion. If they could save him during this time, they would still have time to control him.","This matter had started because of him, so there had to be a solution.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang turned to Di Qing and then flashed to follow that team of Yan Immortals.","Di Qing had obviously guessed his intention, but he shook his head helplessly and followed him.","Lightning snakes as thick as pythons were rolling in the inky-black clouds, exuding a terrifying aura.","At the same time, there was a Heavenly Prison that was extremely eerie.","There were very few guards in charge of the heavenly prison in the Great Mi Heaven. There were only three top cultivators patrolling.","After some time, a gust of wind blew into the Heavenly Prison, but it did not attract any attention."]},{"number":4837,"title":"Chapter 4837 Another Confrontation","paragraphs":["4837 Another Confrontation","In the depths of the Heavenly Prison, it was extremely dark.","A figure that was bound by Yan power chains was suspended in one of the spaces.","His originally thin Immortal body was now covered in wounds, and divine blood dripped from every wound.","His long hair was also disheveled, covering his face.","The white-robed Yan Immortal, Prince Jiu’s companion, was holding a long whip that emitted a dark luster. Every ten breaths, he would lash out with the whip, cutting off a piece of flesh.","Even an Immortal body that had transcended the shackles of the Great Dao could not resist it.","“Tell me. The reward remains the same, and you can even become a Great Heavenly Official. What reason do you have to reject such a great blessing?” the white-robed Yan Immortal warned as he waved his whip.","Divine blood gushed out continuously, and the tortured figure slowly raised his head. Through the messy hair, a blood-red eye was revealed.","The white-robed Yan Immortal’s heart skipped a beat. After he calmed down, he began to whip even harder.","There was a ripple in the air. Prince Jiu walked out slowly. “You’ll feel better if you tell me.”","“I’m so stupid.” A cold laugh sounded.","“I didn’t keep a single one of the five pills. I gave them away without any thoughts, but now I’ve ended up like this.”","“I’ve given you the best things without holding back, so why are you still treating me like this?”","Wei Liujia bellowed in rage. His pair of cold eyes stared straight at Prince Jiu.","“Impudent!” the white-robed Yan Immortal roared as the whip in his palm lashed toward his face, leaving a long, bloody gash!","The divine blood gushed out, but Wei Liujia did not make a sound. He only stared at him.","Prince Jiu waved his hand to stop him. Just as he was about to speak, the entire Heavenly Prison suddenly trembled. Then, rays of extremely powerful Yan power began to stir restlessly!","“Your Highness, there is a change in the Heavenly Prison!” The white-robed Yan Immortal’s expression changed drastically. As his voice fell, a violent explosion occurred!","The entire space shook, and the invisible barrier seemed to be unable to withstand the pressure and burst.","All kinds of extremely ferocious Yan power filled the space.","As all sorts of unknown and terrifying Yan power filled the space, an ugly Yan Immortal with three heads appeared. It jumped around excitedly, as if it had been trapped for a long time.","Right now, it only wanted to devour all living things in front of it!","It roared excitedly, but the three pairs of eyes could only see a few figures before they exploded.","Prince Jiu did not even spare it a glance. He reached out his hand and crushed its Immortal Source, crushing its Immortal body.","However, this was only the beginning.","In the next moment, an arm that was more than 100 feet wide, like a giant python, suddenly tore the space apart and smashed over with an indescribable force.","Some of the Yan Immortals were slightly slower and were sent flying.","Prince Jiu’s expression turned cold as he started to fight with him on the spot.","The Heavenly Prison was breaking apart. Countless Yan Immortals who had been trapped here for an unknown amount of time were released and began to cause the greatest destruction.","“Damned thing!”","Prince Jiu was furious. A river of blood appeared on his outstretched palm, and he crushed the arm that was more than 30 meters wide.","“All of you, follow me to investigate!” he said, then disappeared with the group of Yan Immortals.","The Heavenly Prison was shaking more and more. Not long after the Prince left, two figures wrapped in black robes appeared quietly.","“Wei Liujia, come with us,” the leading black-robed figure said in a low voice as he extended his hand to destroy the Yan power chains around him.","Wei Liujia, who had almost fainted, raised his head with great difficulty. When he saw the person in front of him clearly, he said in surprise, “Your Excellency!”","“Don’t say anything. Leave this place with us,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","An indescribable emotion welled up in his heart, and Wei Liujia nodded heavily. However, he soon realized that after enduring the punishment, his meridians had long lost all their energy. It was difficult for him to even perform the simplest movements, let alone run.","“My Lord, you should leave. I’m not worth saving,” he said.","Jian Wushuang saw through the reason and immediately released several rays of the Yan power to pull him out of the prison.","It was Jian Wushuang who had caused the chaos in the Heavenly Prison. He and Di Qing had destroyed more than half of the prison and released the Yan Immortals to cause chaos.","The truth was just as he had expected. Prince Jiu had been sent away, and there was no danger.","Looking at Wei Liujia, who was covered in blood, Jian Wushuang sighed softly. This guy had not revealed a single word about him to the Prince at the last moment. His determination was evident. He was worth saving.","However, just as Jian Wushuang was shuttling through the chaotic and broken Heavenly Prison, he suddenly felt a great sense of danger!","The next moment, a great light that seemed to pierce through the chaos and dispel the extreme darkness shot over at an unimaginable speed!","However, at this moment of danger, Wei Liujia, who was behind Jian Wushuang, suddenly stood up without any warning and directly faced the great light.","However, he only managed to block it for a moment before the light went through his body and shot toward Jian Wushuang without losing momentum!","However, the moment Wei Liujia blocked it, Jian Wushuang had a chance.","He turned around instantly and pressed down with his finger. The Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate, which he had not used for a long time, once again exploded with a huge amount of potential energy.","The two collided, and the shock wave instantly cleared all chaos.","Jian Wushuang used the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate to neutralize the light. He did not stop and pulled back Wei Liujia’s broken Immortal body.","Soon after, Prince Jiu’s figure appeared. His pair of heroic eyes shot out a brilliant light as he stared straight at Jian Wushuang.","He had a feeling that this middle-aged man with an unkempt beard had a familiar aura.","Jian Wushuang did not intend to get into a conflict with Prince Jiu. Therefore, he tried to escape after holding Wei Liujia.","However, the tens of Yan Immortals that appeared blocked their way.","Di Qing frowned. He waved his palm, and an indescribable force smashed the two Yan Immortals in front of him into meat patties.","“Let’s go!” he said in a deep voice. Taking advantage of the gap, he reached out and directly killed two more.","In Di Qing’s hands, the Yan Immortals could not even resist, and six of them were killed in an instant!","Jian Wushuang nodded. Without any hesitation, he carried Wei Liujia and took the lead.","On the other hand, Prince Jiu, who was hovering in the void, was completely shocked by the scene just now.","To be able to kill Yan Immortal with a wave of his hand, what kind of strength did he have to be able to do it so easily?","Could this guy be a Grand Yan Immortal?","A ghastly chill gushed from the bottom of Prince Jiu’s heart. At the same time, his eyes revealed a hint of ruthlessness.","“Even if you’re a Grand Yan Immortal, don’t even think about running amuck in my Great Mi Heaven!”","When the entire Heavenly Prison was destroyed, Prince Jiu was still standing in the distance. He flipped his palm and a palm-sized white jade item appeared."]},{"number":4838,"title":"Chapter 4838 The Hundred-Headed Strange Child","paragraphs":["4838 The Hundred-Headed Strange Child","The white jade object looked like a round mirror. It was completely white and densely covered with complex fine patterns. It looked extremely strange and ancient.","With the appearance of this mirror-like object, the prisoners who were screaming in the Heavenly Prison all quieted down and ran away in a frenzy.","Prince Jiu’s expression was cold. He reached out his hand and touched the mirror without any expression.","Suddenly, the atmosphere in the surrounding void dropped to the freezing point, and a cold and evil aura escaped from the mirror.","Then, a strange laughter that sounded like Yin Ling rang out, and then the originally ivory-white mirror suddenly reflected a red-eyed and red-haired baby’s head.","“Your Highness, long time no see ...”","Prince Jiu cast a sidelong glance at the strange baby in the mirror in his hand, then threw the mirror into the air.","The void stagnated like a swamp, trapping all the prisoners who wanted to escape, including Jian Wushuang and Di Qing, who felt a touch of uneasiness.","A ray of red light that illuminated hundreds of millions of miles shone down from the mirror hanging high in the sky, making everything seem as if it was soaked in a sea of blood. It was unspeakably strange.","Jian Wushuang, who was carrying Wei Liujia, frowned slightly. Then, he looked at Di Qing and said quickly, “Take him away from here. I’ll be in charge of bringing up the rear. We’ll meet at Dagu Mountain later.”","Di Qing looked at him again and pouted. “You should take him and leave first. I’m not at ease with you bringing up the rear.”","Jian Wushuang no longer declined. A Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal covering the rear was more reliable than a Yan Immortal.","Seeing him leave, Di Qing looked away and frowned slightly at the mirror that was emitting a demonic blood-red light.","“You’re just pretending to be a ghost!” He said disdainfully and waved his hand to throw out a ray of Yan power.","The white light pierced through the blood space, but just as it was about to hit the mirror, it disappeared like a clay ox entering the sea.","Then, a lotus-like tender white arm suddenly emerged from the mirror!","Following the appearance of the arm, a red-eyed and red-haired head of a baby appeared.","The baby had a mouth full of sharp teeth and let out a strange laugh.","The mirror floating in the void was like a separate space, constantly revealing body parts.","Di Qing, who was originally indifferent, frowned even more after seeing this scene, not because of nervousness, but because of disgust...","The red-haired child that came out of the mirror could no longer be described as strange.","In front of him was a pocket-sized infant with a dark red apron around his waist. He looked normal.","However, behind his head, there were hundreds of identical heads, hanging behind him like a bunch of grapes. From a distance, it looked like he had the body of a centipede. It was extremely disgusting!","Even Di Qing, who had seen all kinds of things and experienced countless battles, could not help but raise his eyebrows.","It was simply too disgusting. What kind of thing could look like this? They were pieced together, right?","After releasing the extremely hideous infant, Prince Jiu immediately retracted the mirror in the air and fled into the distance.","At this moment, Di Qing and the ugly child were the only two figures left in the ruins of the prison.","“Hehe... Food, powerful food.”","The countless heads behind the ugly child all stared at Di Qing at this moment, drooling without hiding it.","“I advise you to get lost, don’t dirty my eyes,” Di Qing said coldly. “Otherwise, I’ll make sure you die.”","When the ugly child heard this, it was as if he had heard a joke. He grinned in unison. “Who do you think you are? Can you kill me? Even if you can kill me once, I still have 99 lives. What can you do to me?”","Di Qing did not speak, but pointed a finger at him.","An extremely fast Yan power shot out like an arrow and instantly shattered the head of the infant who was still laughing.","“With my absolute strength, even if you have 10,000 lives, I will still kill you without hesitation.”","He took a head from his back and placed it on his neck. The ugly child was completely furious. “Food! You deserve to die!”","With that, his lotus-like arms suddenly shook, and the blood space with infinite pressure descended again, even the void was crushed.","However, Di Qing just smiled disdainfully. He raised his palm and shook it directly. The blood space that was about to descend exploded from the middle, causing a rain of blood.","The infant did not wait helplessly even though his attack had missed. He roared, and the hundreds of heads that looked like grapes and centipedes on his back opened their mouths at the same time, spitting out palm-sized blood-red bubbles.","Di Qing obviously did not want to waste any more time. His eyes began to surge with golden light, and his palm had already condensed a full-power attack.","When the tens of thousands of blood-red bubbles descended, he directly released a full-force attack.","However, a strange scene appeared. Di Qing’s unstoppable attack did not destroy the bubbles. Instead, the bubbles attached to it and began to devour it.","“Hehe, it’s really delicious!”","The ugly infant’s body also expanded rapidly.","At the same time, the heads behind him also changed their shape and formation, becoming a long snake, whistling and winding over.","Because of Jian Wushuang’s warning not to use any highly recognizable Immortal Styles in the Great Mi Heaven, Di Qing could not release his Golden Crow form and could only rely on Yan power to resist.","Right now, this ugly child was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal realm, but he gave Di Qing a feeling of extreme difficulty.","Ordinary Immortal Styles had no effect on him and would be devoured. Even though Di Qing had crushed more than ten of his heads, the ugly child was not affected at all.","On the contrary, he seemed to be in a passive situation.","Every head was devouring the Yan power that was escaping from his body and constantly strengthening himself, which made Di Qing very unhappy.","Just as he was about to disregard everything and directly release the crushing power of his image form, an extremely sharp Sword Intent that swept across a hundred miles slashed over!","A total of more than 20 heads were completely chopped off, making Di Qing feel that his body was lighter.","Then, a mysterious figure covered in a loose black robe stepped in the air with an Invisible Sword in his hand.","Di Qing raised his eyebrows and said, “Didn’t you go to send that guy back to Dagu Mountain? why are you back so soon?”","The unshaven Jian Wushuang shrugged his shoulders, “I met an acquaintance on the way. After I threw him to the acquaintance, I quickly rushed over.”","Di Qing nodded. With Jian Wushuang’s company, he felt a little safe.","“This big guy doesn’t seem to be a single individual. It seems to have been forcibly glued together. He’s very powerful,” Jian Wushuang took a step forward and analyzed.","“I don’t care what he is, I’m done,” Di Qing said in a deep voice."]},{"number":4839,"title":"Chapter 4839 Killing the Enemy","paragraphs":["4839 Killing the Enemy","There was no fear in the eyes of the two figures as they faced the ugly child that almost covered half the void.","Thick Blood Qi that was almost impossible to dissolve all spurted out from the hundreds of heads of the ugly child.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang and Di Qing had been surrounded by hundreds of heads.","In the center of this Blood Qi, he smelled a hint of unrest.","After going through the Sand Demon Cave, Jian Wushuang, who was burdened with Karma and a major killing calamity, had reached an unprecedented level of understanding of Blood Qi and killing intent.","He felt that the Blood Qi of this ugly child was very strange and complex. It was definitely not something that an individual could possess, but something that had been forcibly piled together.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and released 3,000 Sword Intents, which destroyed more than half of the Blood Qi.","Di Qing moved as well. Without using his precious form, he reached out his hand and smashed dozens of approaching heads.","With the two of them working together, they managed to kill over 100 of the infant’s heads in the time for dozens of breaths, along with its body.","However, before Jian Wushuang could stop, the residue in the broken blood space suddenly gathered together again and formed the ugly baby.","He laughed excitedly. “I have 100 lives, how can you kill me? The more you struggle, the deeper you will sink into this Blood Qi. In the end, you will still become my nourishment!”","“Damn it!” Di Qing cursed in a low voice. Then, he took a step forward and shook his arms. Thousands of golden feathers appeared, each of which shot down with great momentum.","The blood space was pierced, and a shocking crack appeared.","The ugly child’s smile disappeared. Looking at the descending golden feather, he hurriedly controlled the grape-like head behind him to resist.","But he had obviously underestimated Di Qing and overestimated himself.","The golden feathers with a destructive aura burned blood void into nothingness and turned him into a sieve.","Another life was destroyed!","However, this was only a temporary solution. As expected, in just a moment, the ugly infant’s figure appeared again and he roared angrily.","After such a short confrontation, Jian Wushuang obviously did not intend to continue fighting.","If it was really as he had said and they had to be killed nearly 100 times, it would be quite troublesome. The time that was left for Prince Jiu could allow him to do many things. By then, it would be very difficult for them to escape again.","After all, to be able to send five peak Yan Immortals and two Grand Yan Immortals to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture to assassinate the mastermind behind the scenes of Prince Mo, his foundation would definitely not stop here.","After exchanging a glance with Di Qing, Jian Wushuang took the lead and left.","Di Qing also waved his hands and condensed a golden light barrier to block the Blood Qi before flying away.","The ugly child roared in anger, but he did not dare to move forward. He could only control the thick Blood Qi to erode the void.","Just as Jian Wushuang felt that he had escaped from danger, the void suddenly turned red again.","The bone mirror reappeared, and as the extremely dense red light descended, dozens of figures rushed out of the mirror!","The white-boned old Daoist, who was dressed in a tattered Daoist robe, pointed his halberd finger and shouted angrily. A huge amount of Yan power gushed out from the bag on his waist.","There was also a two-headed Yan Immortals who held two heavy hammers and threw them at Jian Wushuang.","Ten strange and ugly Yan Immortals walked out of the mirror and blocked their way.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold. He raised his palm and clenched it in the air. Suddenly, the giant hammer stopped in the void and then shattered.","“I’m afraid you can’t leave now,” he said in a deep voice, and a total of 11 figures surrounded him.","These Yan Immortals that walked out of the bone mirror were far more powerful and cunning than ordinary Yan Immortals. They had all kinds of techniques and most likely mastered Immortal Styles.","As he had fought with Prince Jiu in the Heavenly Court, Jian Wushuang had to hide his signature Immortal Style as much as possible.","Although he had no idea where Prince Jiu was at the moment, Jian Wushuang could sense that he was hiding in the dark and could appear at any time.","The 11 Yan Immortals, who were extremely ugly and gave off a strange Yan power, charged at the two without stopping.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate any longer. The long sword in his hand exuded great momentum and endless Sword Intent.","The Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent bloomed!","The butcher-like fat Yan Immortal at the front was the first to collide and was directly swallowed by the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent!","The remaining white bones old Daoist, the lantern-carrying old woman, and the other Yan Immortals did not have time to dodge and were all sucked into it.","As Jian Wushuang’s strongest Sword Dao and strongest Sword Intent, it was fully displayed at this moment!","Even if these Yan Immortals were strange, they were still within the range of Yan Immortals.","Jian Wushuang was invincible below the Grand Yan Immortal.","This Sword Intent was as thick as the sky River, which made Di Qing look at him from the side. This guy was only at the peak of the Yan immortal realm, but he gave him an inexplicable threat.","When the Sword Intent dissipated, the 11 strange and ugly Yan Immortals all disappeared, not even a trace was left.","Under the broken void, the body of an ugly child slowly condensed. Other than him, the other Yan Immortals were all dead.","In just a short period of time, he had lost several lives and no longer dared to go forward.","Obviously, Jian Wushuang did not want to engage in such a meaningless and murderous fight, so he left quickly with Di Qing.","The void shattered and the Heavenly Prison collapsed. Everything was shrouded in the Blood Qi and everything was distorted.","The void rippled, and Prince Jiu walked out of it. The bone mirror that was hanging in the sky fell back into his hand.","Seeing this, the ugly child subconsciously took a few steps back and looked at him in horror. “M-my Lord ...”","“Useless trash,” Prince Jiu said indifferently with his hands behind his back. “Have you arranged everything?”","“My Lord, the Blood Qi must have already blinded their eyes and thrown them into confusion.” The ugly child grinned.","Prince Jiu cast a glance at him. “Well done. When this matter is over, you can choose a few more Immortal bones to nourish yourself.”","“Thank you for your grace, My Lord.” He grinned, and the desire in his eyes could not be concealed.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing both heaved a sigh of relief after escaping from the blood-red prison.","No Yan immortal followed them. The gloomy sense of oppression disappeared soon after. Moreover, Prince Jiu did not follow them.","“Let’s leave this place first. We’ll make plans later,” Jian Wushuang made his decision.","Since Prince Jiu had already discovered their existence, the entire Great Mi Heaven would definitely be in a state of martial law for a period of time. It would be even more difficult to find Yin Ling, who was wearing the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor."]},{"number":4840,"title":"Chapter 4840 Bizarre and Absurd","paragraphs":["4840 Bizarre and Absurd","He did not know if it was an illusion or the discomfort after the battle, but Jian Wushuang felt that the Heavenly Region in front of him was covered with a layer of faint red muslin, and even his vision was slightly distorted.","This was not a good sign. He did not stay any longer and left the Heavenly Prison dimension with Di Qing, away from the Heavenly Palace. He went to Dagu Mountain to rest.","However, what he saw in the next moment shocked him.","All the Heavenly Regions were shattered, the mountains collapsed, and the heavenly river that was like a silver ribbon in the clouds was cut off.","The sky was extremely dark, and endless flames fell, burning everything in sight. There was no intact Heavenly Region in sight!","More than 20 Heavenly Regions, 17 Celestial Mountains, and 6 Blessed Lands formed the vast Great Mi Heaven, but it was now being destroyed.","After a while, Jian Wushuang came back to his senses. He still could not believe the scene of destruction.","He murmured softly, “Who has such energy to cause such a degree of destruction to Great Mi Heaven in such a short time?”","Di Qing, on the other hand, revealed a meaningful expression. it seems that none of the disciples of Zhen Wuyang are ordinary people.","Jian Wushuang began to feel uneasy when the Great Mi Heaven suddenly suffered such a degree of destruction. Yin Ling would definitely leave Great Mi Heaven, and it would be almost impossible to find her again.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang hurriedly flew in the direction of Dagu Mountain.","With the support of the mountains and rivers in a single thought, he returned to Dagu Mountain in a few breaths.","But at this moment, Dagu Mountain had already been destroyed. The entire mountain had been cut in half and countless lotus flowers had been destroyed by the fire.","Furthermore, a thick, ink-like black gas was spurting out from the small Heavenly Abode.","Jian Wushuang knew that something was wrong and he came to the broken Heavenly Abode in a flash.","Within the black mist of the hollow, there was a huge man in golden armor. He was several feet tall, and even Cheng Qing looked small in front of him.","Black smoke surged around this giant man, revealing his strength at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage. He sat in the depths of the Heavenly Abode like a small mountain.","Furthermore, the entire Heavenly Abode was filled with crunching sounds, which was extremely strange.","Perhaps sensing something strange, the giant man slowly turned his head, and a huge wild boar head came into Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The huge man had the head of a wild boar, and there were two ferocious-looking long teeth in his mouth. The long teeth on the left had a delicate thigh hanging from it, and the long teeth on the right had pierced through a head with wide eyes!","And all around him were broken remains of a corpse!","Wei Liujia’s head was already gone, and his head was skewered on his long teeth. Moreover, more than half of Zhao Ting’s head had already been eaten!","None of them survived.","Looking at the ghastly remains of the dead bodies on the ground, Jian Wushuang was furious. He directly condensed an Invisible Longsword and slashed at the giant man.","The huge man sitting cross-legged on the ground was not afraid at all. He was even a little surprised. “Ninth Brother, you’re back so soon!”","A strange scene happened. Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent passed him and cut into the wall, completely shattering the Heavenly Abode.","Throwing away the half-eaten Zhao Ting’s head, the huge man quickly stood up and walked toward Jian Wushuang.","“Ninth Brother, why have you returned so quickly? Have you completed the task Big Brother gave you?”","Jian Wushuang took a few steps back and pointed his sword at him. He asked in a deep voice, “Who are you? Why did you kill them?”","“Ninth Brother, you must be muddled from the fever. I’m your Third Brother.” The huge man with the wild Boar’s Head scratched his head and said. “Kill them? They’re just a bunch of little Yan Immortals, our goal is far more than that. Big Brother and the others have already attacked the city. I think it won’t be long before this place will be ours!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned. He was not sure for a moment. Was there something wrong with this guy’s brain? why did he call a stranger ‘Ninth Brother’?","“You know me?” he probed.","“You’re my Ninth Brother, of course I know you,” the huge man said. “Have you completed the mission Big Brother gave you?”","At this point, Jian Wushuang was still a little confused, but he continued to say calmly, “I’ve done what I should.”","“That’s good. Let’s go and meet up with Big Brother and the others now.” With that, the giant man stuffed the thigh on the pig’s tooth and Wei Liujia’s head into his mouth. He chewed as he walked out.","Jian Wushuang turned his head and saw Di Qing, who had been beside him, had long disappeared. He was the only one left.","Looking at the wreckage of the Heavenly Abode, he sighed softly and then waved his hand to bury everything.","Stepping into the broken sky, the destruction continued. The Heavenly Fire with a destructive aura burned all living things.","Everything seemed so unreal and bizarre.","The living beings in every Heavenly Region were wailing in pain before they were annihilated. Clouds of black Qi covered everything.","The huge man in charge of guiding them chewed with big mouthfuls as he mumbled, “Ninth Brother, what are we here for? Isn’t it to create a world that belongs to us?”","“Look at this, it’s all going to be ours.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change. He began to feel that something was wrong. All the Yan power around him fluctuated and showed a unique gray-white color.","Everything before his eyes seemed to be some sort of illusion, or perhaps a dream.","“Ninth Brother, why are you in a daze? We’re going to build a world of our own here, and with this as a foundation, we’ll continue expanding!” the giant man spoke with fervor and assurance.","Jian Wushuang suddenly felt a little dizzy. The surrounding scenes were jumping and changing from gray-white to rainbow-colored light at an extremely fast speed. Everything was constantly enlarging and jumping.","“My Lord, why are you here? You’ve really made Liujia search for you.”","All of a sudden, Wei Liujia’s head, which had been chewed up, emerged from the giant man’s mouth and looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange smile.","Immediately after, the heads of Xi Qingchi and Zhao Ting popped out at the same time and shouted at him, “Sir, help! Sir, help!”","Jian Wushuang’s head ached even more and he could not even think about it in the simplest way.","The huge man reached out his palm and pressed the heads back into his mouth. He asked with concern, “Ninth Brother, are you alright? I could tell that something was wrong with you when you came back just now.”","Everything was so bizarre and absurd.","“Don’t come near me!” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice. He was enduring the increasingly explosive pain in his head.","But then, the bizarre scene suddenly changed again."]},{"number":4841,"title":"Chapter 4841 Seeing Through","paragraphs":["4841 Seeing Through","The broken sky and the destroyed Great Mi Heaven disappeared.","In its place was a vast palace.","The explosive pain in Jian Wushuang’s mind suddenly disappeared and everything became clear.","The only thing that did not change was the huge man with the head of a wild boar standing beside him.","This time, besides the pig-headed giant, there were seven other figures standing beside Jian Wushuang. All of them had ugly and twisted faces, and their bodies were either fat or strong.","There were a total of eight figures, each holding a tray covered with red cloth.","“Ninth Brother, you’ve made a great contribution in this war. Just wait for your Big Brother’s reward!” the boar-headed giant nudged Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang did not pay attention to him. Instead, he looked at the square tray that had appeared out of thin air in his hand.","The tray was covered with a red cloth, and there was a fist-sized bump in the middle that was slightly moving.","He subconsciously reached out to open it but was interrupted by a deep voice.","“All of you, come in.”","As soon as he finished speaking, it was as if there was an irresistible force pushing Jian Wushuang forward.","He frowned but was shocked to find that he could not resist it and could only let the force push him forward.","Jian Wushuang walked into the hall and the scene in front of him made him frown!","This was an evil hall.","The center of the vast hall was concave, and countless corpses of gods were piled up inside. There were no less than 100,000 broken and clean corpses.","And on top of these divine corpses sat a figure that was like a giant mountain. It had no face, and it could not even be described as a living being. It was like the outline formed by all kinds of living beings being squeezed together, and it was extremely terrifying.","“Greetings, Big Brother,” the other seven figures shouted in unison as they reached out with their trays.","The mountain-like figure did not respond. It kept silent, as if waiting for something.","The giant man closest to Jian Wushuang looked around and then lifted the red cloth on the tray in his hand, “Brother, please enjoy. This Yan immortal’s taste is different from the ones we’ve eaten before.”","The red cloth was lifted, and a head with tightly shut eyes was revealed.","Jian Wushuang was stunned to see that the head was Di Qing’s head, which had disappeared!","He then looked at the tray in his hand and slowly lifted the red cloth covering it.","A bright heart was beating weakly, it was Di Qing’s Immortal Source.","‘No, how could he die so mysteriously? This must be an illusion.’ Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","At this moment, the giant mountain that was sitting on the countless divine corpses moved. He waved his hand and directly took Di Qing’s head, stuffed it into his mouth, and began to chew.","The space seemed to be frozen, and the mountain stopped moving. A moment later, it raised its arms and rolled up Di Qing’s body on the other trays one by one.","However, when it was Jian Wushuang’s turn, he suddenly grabbed Di Qing’s Immortal Source in his palm and was not swept away.","“Ninth Brother, what are you doing? This is for the Boss!” the giant man said in a hurry and reached out to snatch the Immortal Source from his hand.","Jian Wushuang sneered and retreated several feet. He said coldly, “How long are you going to pretend? ” It’s time to break this illusion, right? Do you want me to destroy it?”","The giant men were all stunned.","“Ninth Brother, what are you talking about? What illusion? I’m your Third Brother!” the huge man with the wild Boar’s Head looked anxious and surprised.","At this moment, the space suddenly trembled, and the dome of the palace shattered.","Hundreds of millions of rays of light shone from the broken gap. At the same time, a giant golden-scaled claw appeared and covered Jian Wushuang’s head.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang let out a long breath and followed the golden-scaled giant claw.","However, at this moment, the giant mountain moved. He suddenly swung his arm and smashed over with power that surpassed the Yan Immortal realm!","He was greatly alarmed. If this attack hit, he would definitely be severely injured.","The scene that he had imagined did not happen. The golden-scaled giant claw had completely wrapped around Jian Wushuang and blocked the blow.","The entire palace instantly shattered, and all the images began to collapse.","“Ninth Brother!”","...","When Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again, he saw a familiar scene.","The Heavenly Prison had completely caved in and the void was covered by a blood-red veil. However, he was still standing at the same spot, just about to escape.","Di Qing was standing side by side with him, looking at him with raised eyebrows.","Jian Wushuang gulped subconsciously, “I think I had a dream just now?”","Di Qing slowly explained, “Strictly speaking, it wasn’t a dream. It couldn’t even be considered an illusion.”","“Um, what was that place just now?” He was a little puzzled.","Di Qing slowly raised the corners of his mouth, “What if I tell you that it’s a situation that might happen in the future?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. “That means what I experienced just now wasn’t fake, but real and it might happen?”","“You can say that, but it’s not correct. It’s a bit complicated, and even I can’t fully explore it.”","Di Qing said, “But one thing I’m sure of is that everything I just experienced was based on an illusion. It’s a world that shouldn’t have appeared, but it was created and is about to become real.”","Jian Wushuang frowned. Di Qing’s explanation was very complicated and contained a lot of information. It was equivalent to explaining the psychedelic scene from the source.","However, he did not believe that the scene just now would happen in the future.","“Actually, we were confused from the beginning,” Di Qing said faintly. “That Blood Qi has a hallucinating effect. If it were an ordinary Yan immortal, I’m afraid they would not be able to escape.”","“But he obviously underestimated us. That’s why he was so careless to leave an opening.”","As he spoke, he waved his hand and cleared the Blood Qi around him.","The hundred-headed infant child quietly appeared and kept retreating.","Following his appearance, another wave of ripples appeared in the void. Prince Jiu, who was dressed in a capable and experienced long robe, walked out slowly.","“Very powerful indeed. It seems that those who can come to my Great Mi Heaven as guests are all first-class experts.”","“I wonder if I have done something wrong that has caused dissatisfaction between the two of you, that’s why you have come to Great Mi Heaven as a guest?”","Jian Wushuang did not want to confront him, so he said in a low voice, “We’re just passing by. We don’t mean to make enemies. We’ll leave in a moment.”","Upon hearing this, the corners of Gong zijiu’s mouth curled up slightly. Oh, just passing by? I believe the pills in the hands of our Mountain Lord Wei Liujia have nothing to do with the two of you, and the destruction of the Heavenly Prison has nothing to do with the two of you?”","Jian Wushuang did not speak anymore. He had already condensed sword essence in his palm and was waiting for the young master to make trouble. He would attack immediately."]},{"number":4842,"title":"Chapter 4842 One Battle","paragraphs":["4842 One Battle","However, Prince Jiu did not seem to have any intention of making things difficult for Jian Wushuang. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","Then, he slowly stretched out his palm. “Give me 50 pills and I’ll let you go.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly. 50 Emperor-grade pills were nothing much to him. Even if it was 500, he could still take them out. After all, before he came, Chun Qiu had prepared nearly 1,000 elixirs with different effects in his storage ring.","Jian Wushuang could easily hand out 50 pills, but he did not intend to hand over any of them.","Based on Prince Jiu’s character, it was impossible for him to let them go once they handed it over. On the contrary, he would get himself into trouble.","Hence, Jian Wushuang was ready to fight. “I don’t know what pills you are talking about, so I can’t give it to you.”","It was obvious that Prince Jiu had expected this answer. His tone was neither hurried nor slow, as if he had already made up his mind. “My Great Mi Heaven has already been heavily guarded. It’s almost impossible for outsiders to enter. I think you must have come in from the North Sky Heavenly Region.”","“Now that the North Sky Heavenly Region has been sealed, I’m afraid you have no way out.”","As he spoke, extremely strong lights came from all directions and surrounded Jian Wushuang and Di Qing.","With just a glance, Jian Wushuang guessed that there were nearly 100 Yan Immortals, and his face turned grave.","Nearly 100 Yan Immortals were probably all the forces under Prince Jiu. It was an unimaginably terrifying force.","Even Jian Wushuang, who had comprehended an Immortal Style, could not resist such a force.","However, with Di Qing’s help, he believed that it was still possible for him to escape unscathed unless Prince Jiu had a Grand Yan Immortal under him.","As if to confirm Jian Wushuang’s guess, 2 mysterious figures, wrapped in large black robes and without any aura of Yan power, descended.","His eyes narrowed. The two mysterious figures in front of him had the same aura as the 2 Grand Yan Immortals who had fought with Di Qing in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","2 Grand Yan Immortals!","“My guests, if you insist on leaving without leaving anything behind, I’m afraid you won’t be able to bear the consequences.”","Prince Jiu shrugged his shoulders slightly. His gaze suddenly turned sharp. At the same time, an extremely dark True Swords condensed in his palm.","With a total of close to 100 Yan Immortals, 2 Grand Yan Immortals surrounding them was unimaginable.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had faced such a tyrannical situation since he came to the Great Yan Domain. It also made him realize how terrifying Prince Jiu’s foundation was.","Then Di Qing’s voice was transmitted into his divine sense, “Fight or retreat, I’ll with you no matter what.”","“I understand.”","A huge burst of Yan power suddenly burst out. As his black robe fluttered, Jian Wushuang raised his arm and a vast Heavenly Gate broke the chaotic sky like a brilliant sun.","The Heavenly Gate slowly opened, and a giant finger fell from it.","All the Yan Immortals were stunned. Even Prince Jiu’s eyebrows twitched. He had never expected that the two of them would dare to make the first move in such a situation.","“Hmph, you really don’t know how the word ‘death’ is written!” he said coldly as he pointed the pitch-black sword forward. “Cut off their limbs and capture them alive!”","All of the Yan Immortals moved, but they did not charge forward. Instead, they dodged the attack from the sky.","The Transcendence Heavenly Gate was an Ancestral Skill. As Jian Wushuang’s comprehension became deeper, his exploration of the Ancestral Skill also reached its peak.","Although the Ancestral Skill was still effective, it was already showing signs of fatigue against Yan Immortals. If the user was not Jian Wushuang, the effect would be greatly reduced.","The first form — Transcendence Heavenly Gate caused the four Yan Immortals who tried to resist to explode their Immortal Source and die, while a number of them were seriously injured. It successfully caused some chaos in the encirclement.","Di Qing immediately rose to his feet and faced the two black-robed Grand Yan Immortals directly. His palms seemed to be pushing forward, but they contained the full power of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Seeing this, the two black-robed Grand Yan Immortals also moved to block.","In an instant, hundreds of millions of rays of light burst forth from the confrontation, and an unparalleled explosion swept out.","Di Qing still stood in the same place, but the two Grand Yan Immortals took a step back at the same time, their eyes under the black robe showing disbelief.","His hands, which were hidden under the black robe, were trembling uncontrollably!","Prince Ji, who was originally watching the battle, was also shocked when he saw the scene. “He managed to hold back two Grand Yan Immortals with just one strike. Who is he?”","Di Qing’s face was filled with disdain. Two mere Grand Yan Immortals actually dared to resist him?","“All of you, stay. It’s been a while since I killed a Grand Yan Immortal.” He stretched his muscles and looked ahead indifferently.","The battle had completely erupted!","With one sword attack, Jian Wushuang was like a ghost. His body was extremely sharp. With the Invisible Longsword in his hand, he seemed to enter no man’s land. Even when he was surrounded by nearly 50 Yan Immortals, he was not afraid.","He carried 10,000 tons on his shoulders, and his sword pushed back 1,000,000 tons!","He was proud. With the support of the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, he could recover in a very short time no matter how serious his injuries were.","There was one thing about his Immortal body that Jian Wushuang had never told anyone, which was that he had no Immortal Source.","The so-called Immortal Source was similar to the Dantian. It was the foundation of the myriad bodies and the Great Dao of cultivation. It was condensed after the top cultivation achieved the position of Yan Immortal. It was extremely important.","However, Jian Wushuang did not have the so-called Immortal Source. The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body that was transformed from a Perfect Life Form had nothing in it.","This had its advantages and disadvantages.","The good thing was that he had nothing important to guard against. The bad thing was that he was extremely insensitive to the Great Dao of the Great Yan Domain due to the lack of an Immortal Source, so he could only explore slowly.","After destroying a Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source, Jian Wushuang struck out with his palm again, expanding the encirclement.","At this point, the encirclement formed by nearly 100 Yan Immortals and 2 Grand Yan Immortals was actually showing signs of collapse!","Prince Jiu pressed on the hilt of his sword and frowned. He had never thought that these two uninvited guests would have such terrifying strength.","“Damn things, whose messengers are they?!”","“Could it be that they were sent to kill me?”","Prince Jiu’s heart trembled as he suddenly thought of Prince Mo, who had died a tragic death in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","After he thought of this layer of connection, he became even more unsettled.","The 2 Grand Yan Immortals, who were originally regarded as trump cards, were now being forced to retreat. It was only a matter of time before they were defeated.","“Since you’re here to kill me, then be prepared to face the consequences.” The look in Prince Jiu’s eyes grew even colder.","The void began to collapse under the pressure of this battle. After the initial panic, the first group of Yan Immortals began to work together and counterattack."]},{"number":4843,"title":"Chapter 4843 Changfu Is at the Foot of Changfu Mountain","paragraphs":["4843 Changfu Is at the Foot of Changfu Mountain","In this way, Jian Wushuang’s decline was obvious.","The combined strength of dozens of Yan Immortals was terrifying. The killing intent that was as deep as water engulfed the sky and covered the earth. He was tired of dealing with it, and his physical strength had reached a slight critical point.","While Di Qing was dealing with two Grand Yan Immortals, he also had to withstand nearly half of Yan Immortal’s attacks, so he was also having a hard time.","Prince Jiu took a deep look at the two of them. Then, he said in a deep voice, “Everyone, let’s go to Changfu Mountain together!”","With that, he took the lead and disappeared into the vast void.","Jian Wushuang felt that something was wrong when he heard this, but he could not get away.","A total of tens of Yan Immortals could still hold him back.","Di Qing was also blocked by the two Grand Yan Immortals and was trapped.","Just like that, the two of them were intentionally led forward.","The shattered void shattered inch by inch as they fought.","Zhangfu Mountain.","Connecting heaven and earth, it was the most ancient existence in the entire Great Mi Heaven. It had already existed before the concept of Great Mi Heaven.","The endless black clouds and smoke surged around Changfu Mountain, which was extremely terrifying.","Prince Jiu, who was the first to arrive, heaved an obvious sigh of relief. Then, the corners of his lips slowly curled up.","Other than himself, no other Yan Immortal knew the secret hidden at the foot of Changfu Mountain.","This place was his final trump card.","Jian Wushuang also realized that something was wrong as he was being carried forward, but he could not break free at all. He could only move forward with Di Qing.","One of the two Grand Yan Immortals was also killed by Di Qing’s terrifying attack.","The remaining rank Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal also severely injured his arm at the last moment, at the cost of completely destroying his Immortal Source foundation.","With the death of the Grand Yan Immortal, the threat had disappeared. Facing the situation where there were less than 70 Yan Immortals left, Di Qing carried out a massacre.","With Yan Immortal’s death, the Great Dao in this area was in chaos.","Jian Wushuang was also shocked at this scene. Di Qing’s strength was too great. The only one who could subdue him was Uncle Yu, who had destroyed the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture with one palm strike.","Even though the two of them were inevitably brought to Changfu Mountain, none of the 100 Yan Immortals who held them hostage survived!","When the last Yan Immortal fell under Jian Wushuang’s sword, there was only dead silence in the broken void. A large pile of Immortal corpses remained.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to get rid of the divine blood on his hand and slowly spat out a mouthful of turbid breath.","Killing over 30 Yan Immortals was a huge consumption for him.","However, he did not let his guard down because there was a unique aura in the Heavenly Region.","The entire Heavenly Region was a unique water-white color, like a splash-ink landscape painting, full of unpredictable and unique beauty.","Especially in the middle of the black and white clouds, there was a vast green mountain.","Di Qing frowned slightly. “What is this place? why do I have a familiar feeling... It can’t be one of those old guys who haven’t died yet, right?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked at him and said, “Those old guys who haven’t died, are they from the same era as you?”","“Of course, but come to think of it, other than those who hide from the world, I’m afraid that there are very few who can survive the war,” Di Qing said.","As the two of them conversed, Prince Jiu’s figure, which had disappeared earlier, reappeared silently.","At this moment, his eyes were filled with cold killing intent and rage.","As his last trump card, the death of nearly 100 Yan Immortals and 2 Grand Yan Immortals was an irredeemable loss, and it had burned down his many years of accumulation.","Looking at Jian Wushuang and Di Qing, he was already filled with killing intent.","“The crimes you’ve committed can’t be atoned for even if you die 10,000 times!”","“I’ll make you suffer 10,000 times over!” Prince Jiu shouted in anger.","As soon as he finished speaking, Changfu Mountain, which was located between the dark clouds, suddenly trembled.","Wisps of water-white light shot out from the center of the mountain.","It was as if 10,000 suns had descended from the sky. All the clouds were dispersed, revealing the dark and ancient mountain.","Along with the illumination of the light, an aura that transcended the era and the primordial filled every inch of space.","This aura was extremely unique, causing the spectators to feel as if they were in a trance.","Di Qing’s brows furrowed tighter and tighter. He had smelled a familiar scent.","When the billions of lights converged into one spot, a figure wearing a flowing cloud mountain robe slowly appeared.","It was a clean-faced, beardless old man. His face was thin and rugged, like the deep and lofty mountains.","Jian Wushuang focused his eyes. He felt that the old man’s aura was far beyond that of an ordinary Grand Yan Immortal, giving him an unknown feeling.","After seeing the old man’s face clearly, Di Qing slowly curled his lips and said loudly, “I was wondering who was playing tricks on me. It turns out to be the number one lackey of Zhen Wuyang, Elder Changfu!”","Such an earth-shattering curse reverberated throughout the entire Heavenly Region, the entire Changfu Mountain.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. Obviously, he had understood a lot of hidden meanings from his words.","It seemed that Di Qing and Changfu had known each other for a long time, and there seemed to be a grudge between them.","On the other hand, Prince Jiu was startled when he heard the curses. Then, he turned around and looked at the old man.","The old man who was called Changfu seemed to treat Di Qing’s curses as farts and did not care at all.","He looked at Prince Jiu and said slowly, “Didn’t I tell you not to wake me up unless it’s a matter of life and death?”","“Prince Jiu knows, but Elder Changfu, the entire Great Mi Heaven is on the brink of death,” Prince Jiu said painfully. “My last trump card has been completely wiped out by them. If I don’t ask you to come out now, I’m afraid I won’t be able to protect myself.”","Hearing this, the old man did not say anything more. He looked at Di Qing, who was not far away, with his slightly turbid eyes.","“Di Qing, you can go back now. This era no longer belongs to us, and I have no intention of engaging in a meaningless battle with you.”","When Prince Jiu heard this, he frowned and said, “Elder Changfu, you can’t let them go just like that! Otherwise, I can’t let my dead subjects die in vain!”","Di Qing sneered, “Changfu, where did your aura go? How did you become so old? You look like an old dog with a broken back that is no longer loved by its master.”","Jian Wushuang thought to himself, ‘Oh no. With such a sarcastic remark, it would be difficult to control the situation.’","As expected, the calm expression of Elder Chanfu changed. The long robe on his body began to flutter, and an ancient aura burst out.","“Since the Second Prince has given the order, then Changfu will take this last trip.”","He said these words calmly, carrying the determination of his era as he slowly moved forward."]},{"number":4844,"title":"Chapter 4844 A Life for a Life","paragraphs":["4844 A Life for a Life","Di Qing’s mocking expression also disappeared, and his golden eyes became serious.","The reason why he had said those mocking words was because of some unresolved issues from their era.","Changfu, who was under Zhen Wuyang, was very strong. He was so strong that he had left a good reputation during the chaotic era.","Although he was very strong, Di Qing was not afraid of him at all. Unlike the old look that Changfu was showing now, his breath was vigorous, like a ball of fire that was burning forever, making people unable to look at him directly.","Di Qing, who had endured the baptism of time and persisted to this day, was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Changfu was also a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","The battlefield was condensing.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze locked onto Prince Jiu soon after.","He did not want to fight, but he could not back out now.","With the black sword in his hand, the Prince pointed it at Jian Wushuang.","Their battlefield had also been opened up.","At this point, an earth-shattering battle had begun on Changfu Mountain!","The sword slashed out, and the Sword Intent that could even cut the void came down.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his index and middle fingers and dispelled the Sword Intent.","Prince Jiu’s figure arrived immediately, and an indescribable scarlet scroll surrounded him.","It was his Immortal Style. Jian Wushuang had experienced it during the fight for the Peach in the Heavenly Realm. It was extremely powerful.","If Jian Wushuang had not comprehended the Immortal Style from the stone bead, he would most likely have been defeated by him.","“Damn you, none of you can leave Great Mi Heaven today,” Prince Jiu said coldly. As the scarlet scroll was unfurled, an unknown devouring aura was nibbling away at his Yan power.","As he could not use his Immortal Style, Jian Wushuang was struggling, but he could barely resist it.","On the other side of the battlefield, Di Qing and Changfu’s battle was filled with an aura that could destroy the world.","The seemingly old Elder Changfu’s strikes were so powerful that even Di Qing could not do anything to him.","“Pathetic!”","An image form of a black crow appeared and charged toward Changfu with a similarly imposing aura.","The clouds and smoke between heaven and earth were cleared.","“You’re still as sharp as before, and you haven’t changed at all,” Changfu looked at him and said after the clouds and smoke dissipated.","Di Qing said proudly, “Why should I change? Who can change me?”","“So many years have passed, and you’re still searching?” Changfu looked at him and said.","“What does it have to do with you?” Di Qing said coldly. “Your Dao has long disappeared, but my Dao has just begun.”","When Changfu heard this, he smiled and said, “To be able to survive in that era is a blessing in itself. My Dao is also about to be extinguished. Even so, it is enough to cause you serious damage.”","“With your current strength? What qualifications do you have to say such words?” Di Qing said coldly, his eyes full of killing intent.","“You don’t understand me, just like how I don’t understand you,” said Changfu slowly. “Everything here is my Great Dao, my foundation. Even your every breath is under my control. How can you destroy me?”","Di Qing sneered, “Then I will destroy your Dao and your foundation!”","With that, he stretched out his hand and pushed. A total of black, white, and red, three different Natal image forms appeared. They all carried a powerful aura and swept toward Changfu.","However, when Changfu saw this, he did not stop it and allowed Di Qing’s Natal form to break the entire mountain from the middle.","The sound of destruction rang out, Changfu Mountain, which connected the sky and earth, broke from the middle. The sky collapsed and unknown void matter surged wantonly.","“As expected, you never understood me,” Changfu said calmly. “I can survive not because of external objects, but because of myself.”","“As long as I don’t want to be defeated, no one can defeat me completely. Even Emperor Zhen Wuyang is no exception.”","“What a load of nonsense. It’s the best ending for you if you die in my hands today,” Di Qing said.","Changfu looked at him. “Then, just try.”","The vigorous Yan power belonging to a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was unleashed, and he faced him directly with the intention of killing him.","However, their attacks were unable to cause any effective damage to him. The seemingly weak Changfu was like a lonely boat in the wind and rain, extremely tenacious.","The two of them fought like this, causing the heavens to fall and the void to be destroyed.","“I have a question. Why did you surrender to Zhen Wuyang?” Di Qing asked.","Changfu said, “For the Emperor’s fate energy, but later on, I realized that such a thing was simply an extravagant hope.”","“You’ve followed him for such a long time. Don’t tell me you didn’t even gain any Comprehension?”","“No, I’ll never be able to Comprehend that kind of thing.”","An indescribable emotion emerged in Di Qing’s eyes, but it was quickly covered up.","“Then what’s the point of you struggling to survive now?”","“I used up the last of my consciousness just to distinguish the difference between dying and sleeping forever. But now I have some understanding, so you can think that I’m seeking death by living.”","Changfu said, “I’m begging for an expert who is qualified to die with me.”","When Di Qing heard this, he immediately became vigilant. He felt that something was wrong. This old man was likely to drag them down with him.","As if to confirm his thoughts, the aura around Changfu suddenly surged.","Then, an unexpected scene occurred.","He turned around and escaped from Di Qing’s attack. He came directly in front of Jian Wushuang and struck down with his palm without any warning.","The vast Yan power poured down.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang subconsciously turned his head to the side.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was unable to withstand Changfu’s full-force attack. It was instantly shattered and dissipated.","Prince Jiu was shocked. He retreated rapidly as he felt an unknown fear.","Di Qing could not believe what he saw. He could not understand why Changfu would attack Jian Wushuang without any warning.","Then, he was completely enraged. His figure appeared in front of Changfu in an instant, and he also used all his strength to slap Changfu.","“Why did you do that?!”","“Because I want to kill all the unknown that might happen,” Changfu’s face looked even older.","He looked at Di Qing and said, “When I was young, I traveled across the world and saw a mysterious warning somewhere.”","“That warning was very strange and intimidating. It’s not convincing at all.”","“But now, I somewhat believe it.”","At this point, Changfu reached out his hand to hold Di Qing back. “I’m going to do something with my life.”","As he spoke, the Yan power around him began to burn rapidly. The Immortal Source foundation that belonged to a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was also burning.","“Motherf*cker, you old dog, how dare you!” Di Qing’s eyes were about to pop out, but everything fell silent.","The entire Heavenly Region was destroyed by this indescribable light."]},{"number":4845,"title":"Chapter 4845 Rebuilding the Immortal Body","paragraphs":["4845 Rebuilding the Immortal Body","The explosion was too violent. The last thought of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal annihilated the entire Changfu Mountain and several Heavenly Regions.","The ten Heavenly Regions near Changfu Mountain were all affected and turned into dust.","More than half of the territory of the Great Mi Heaven was destroyed. It was the biggest of the Seven Princes. It ruled over 30 Heavenly Regions, 17 Celestial Mountains, and 6 Blessed Lands.","Prince Jiu felt a sharp pain in his heart. After so many years, he had carefully annexed the Great Mi Heaven and the forces under him that controlled it had been destroyed in a day!","Suddenly, he spat out a mouthful of dark red divine blood. The world in front of him was spinning, and then he was swallowed by the aftermath of the explosion of the Immortal Source.","At this point, the entire vast Great Mi Heaven had fallen into dead silence and chaos.","The explosion lasted for ten days, and billions of lives were destroyed without leaving any traces.","The broken walls of the Heavenly Palace floated in the void, and the indescribable smoke blocked everything.","The heavenly river broke, changing the course of the river and causing a water disaster in a lucky Heavenly Region. The violent Heavenly Fire also pierced through the void and dragged everything into purgatory.","This scene was even more tragic than the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, which had been destroyed long ago, because the territory involved was simply too vast.","And all of this was caused by an old Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s last thought. It was too terrifying.","All living things were destroyed.","“Sob, sob... Sob, sob, sob...”","After an unknown amount of time.","A silent and ethereal humming sound echoed in the void.","Immediately after, a three-meter-long, snow-white beast with dense black patterns on its body broke through the smoke and dust, flying forward at high speed while lowering its head and sniffing hard.","On the back of a strange beast, Xi Qingchi looked anxious. The clothes on her body were somewhat tattered, and it was obvious that she had also been affected.","As she appeared, Zhao Ting’s figure appeared as well. She brought Wei Liujia over, who had yet to fully recover from his injuries.","“San Qing, hurry up and smell it. If you can’t find the Lord, I’ll just leave you here!” Xi Qingchi stretched out her hand and pinched the mutated beast’s big ear as she anxiously said.","San Qing repeatedly tried to please her, its eyes curved into a crescent moon.","Zhao Ting’s eyes were solemn. She looked at the Heavenly Region that had turned into ruins and her expression gradually became sad.","Everything seemed to have come to an end.","Wei Liujia dragged his heavily injured Immortal body and searched anxiously. He wanted to find the Lord who had done him a great favor.","“Give up. There’s no way they can survive the impact of this power,” Zhao Ting was dejected. “Leave, all of you. It’s too late to change anything.”","Xi Qingchi glanced at her and did not speak. Instead, it urged San Qing to continue investigating.","Wei Liujia coughed. “Court Official Zhao, no matter what, let’s continue searching. I believe that His Excellency will be blessed with good fortune.”","Sighing, Zhao Ting continued to search.","San Qing had a keen sense of smell. It ran through the broken void with Xi Qingchi and soon came to a place with thick smoke.","It spun around on the spot and turned to look at her as if it was trying to please her.","Xi Qingchi was moved. She hurriedly stood in the air and stared at the place where the smoke was thick. Then, she slowly stretched out her slender palm.","The next moment, a broken arm covered in divine blood suddenly broke through the smoke and grabbed her palm.","Xi Qingchi froze on the spot. Her body trembled violently, and it even forgot to scream.","The smoke slowly dissipated, and a handsome and pale face appeared. It was Di Qing.","At this moment, his Immortal body was shattered and he was on the verge of death. However, his eyes were still open. When he saw that the person in front of him was Xi Qingchi, he could not hold on any longer. He closed his eyes and fainted again.","Suppressing her throbbing heart, Xi Qingchi took a few steps back and patted San Qing, who was beside her.","San Qing understood tacitly. Although it was a little reluctant, it still raised its head and carried Di Qing on his back.","“If he’s fine, then My Lord will definitely be fine as well,” Xi Qingchi consoled herself and continued her search.","However, Zhao Ting was not optimistic. She could feel that Jian Wushuang was only in the Yan Immortal realm. Although he was a little too strong, he would definitely not survive the explosion.","...","In the hazy netherworld, he felt that his body was falling endlessly, and everything was leaving him.","Everything he had experienced seemed to have become a thing of the past.","“Could it be that I’m already dead?”","“No, it’s impossible. I have the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, how can I be destroyed? At least for now, I can’t be destroyed!”","The Immortal body was formed by the thoughts of the heart.","In the dust-filled shattered void, tiny stars rose up from the void and gathered together, forming a magnificent scene.","There were billions of stars that were connected like fireflies, constantly going to the place they should go.","If one looked carefully, they would see a figure with long hair and clothes fluttering in the wind sitting quietly among the magnificent stars. The figure was becoming more and more solid.","This fantastic and magnificent scene naturally attracted the attention of Xi Qingchi and the others.","“M-My Lord is fine! That’s great!” Xi Qingchi was surprised at first, but then she became excited.","Wei Liujia also saw this scene. He was overjoyed and hurriedly ran forward.","His hair fluttered in the wind, and a pure golden light appeared in the eyes of the figure that was gradually condensing.","The scattered memories gathered again and Jian Wushuang absorbed the first ray of Yan power.","His reconstructed Immortal body was a magnificent dark blue color, as if it was formed by the stars.","The galaxy formed by seven bright stars surged between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","“Resurrection? Interesting...” The corners of his mouth curled up slightly, and his eyes were filled with helplessness.","“My Lord, it’s great that you’re still alive,” Xi Qingchi was the first to arrive. Perhaps she was too excited, but her cheeks were flushed.","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a smile. Although he had avoided being completely destroyed by the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body that had transformed from a Perfect Life Form, the situation this time was different. He had been completely destroyed.","Changfu’s attack had completely crushed him into powder without any mercy. It was the most serious injury Jian Wushuang had suffered since he came to the Great Yan Domain.","He was sure that if it was not for the Immortal Immortal body, even if he did not die from that blow, he would not spent countless years in the void before he could wake up.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang was also confused. He could not understand why Elder Changfu would suddenly rise up without any warning and killed him. Wasn’t Di Qing the biggest threat?","Now that Changfu had been completely destroyed, he would probably never be able to answer this question.","Looking at Di Qing, who was lying weakly on San Qing’s back, Jian Wushuang let out a long sigh.","Di Qing was indeed not dead, but looking at his current state, it seemed that he had lost another True Life."]},{"number":4846,"title":"Chapter 4846 Li Shichun","paragraphs":["4846 Li Shichun","Wei Liujia also stepped forward. He was a little uneasy when he faced Jian Wushuang, “Your Excellency...”","“It’s good that you’re alive,” he said with a smile.","At this moment, Zhao Ting took a step forward and said, “More than half of the Great Mi Heaven has been destroyed. I’m afraid it’s not suitable for us to stay here any longer. Let’s retreat quickly.”","Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised, but he looked at the broken heavenly river and the broken Heavenly Region that was burned by the Heavenly Fire. He understood that Zhao Ting was right. Nearly half of the Heavenly Region was destroyed.","However, he did not want to leave this place. He knew that once he left, he might never get any news about Yin Ling again.","Just as Jian Wushuang was hesitating, a huge amount of Yan power suddenly rose around him!","As smoke and dust rose, Prince Jiu, who was holding a pitch-black True Sword, appeared!","At this moment, he was also an arrow at the end of its flight, and his body was covered in divine blood.","“You want to leave alive after destroying my Great Mi heaven? All of you can go to hell!”","With that, the pitch-black sword in his hand slashed forward crazily. A unique and extremely strange Sword Intent shattered the surrounding void and attacked Jian Wushuang and the others.","Jian Wushuang, who had only condensed his Immortal body for half a day and could not even fully release Yan power, had already suffered more than half of the impact. It was obvious that it was difficult to resist.","Xi Qingchi and Wei Liujia fainted immediately. Zhao Ting, who was the only one with a strong foundation, found it difficult to resist this attack.","As the void collapsed, Jian Wushuang and the others fell into endless darkness.","Prince Jiu panted heavily after unleashing this attack. He was like an arrow at the end of its flight, and he no longer had any strength left to pursue and attack.","A moment later, his figure also disappeared.","Following Prince Jiu’s departure, another figure appeared in the void that was initially dead silent and collapsing. Even the loose black robe could not conceal her beautiful figure.","If Jian Wushuang was still here, he would definitely recognize her at a glance. This beautiful figure was Yin Ling, who had not appeared for a long time!","She stood still for a long time before her figure finally disappeared.","...","“Aiyo, it’s amazing. Everyone, come and look quickly. Are the people floating in the water dead?”","Gush...","The sound of a stream flowing like a clear spring resounded in his ears, and then everything returned to calm.","After an unknown amount of time, the slight itch on his nose forced Jian Wushuang to open his eyes.","A ray of sunlight illuminated everything.","Then, a pink and tender face with baby fat came into his eyes.","“Ah, you’re finally awake. I thought you’d continue sleeping,” that pink and tender face opened a pair of lively big eyes and said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang supported his aching body and looked around. He then looked at her and asked, “Little girl, where is this place?”","“Of course this is my home. How is it? Isn’t it pretty?” The little girl’s big eyes curved into crescents, as if she was waiting for praise.","This wooden house, which was completely made of ordinary wood, seemed to have existed for quite a long time. Other than being extremely clean and tidy, there was nothing special about it.","However, Jian Wushuang still nodded and said with a smile, “It’s very beautiful. It’s very similar to the house I used to live in.”","Hearing this, the little girl raised her eyebrows smugly. “Hehe, this is all my brother’s doing. He’s very good.”","He did not know why, but looking at this little girl in front of him, it inexplicably reminded him of his childhood. Then, he subconsciously reached out his hand to stroke her hair bun.","At this moment, a rough and nervous voice sounded, “Shichun, what are you doing? Hurry up and come over!”","A young man in a coarse shirt stood outside the door and looked at him nervously.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his hand and smiled guiltily.","The little girl seemed to be extremely dissatisfied. She turned her head and said, “He finally woke up. Of course, I’m taking care of him.”","After taking a deep look at Jian Wushuang, the young man hurriedly carried her to his side.","“You’re awake, so hurry up and leave,” the young man looked at him and said in a low voice. “I can’t keep too many people here.”","Jian Wushuang understood what he meant and nodded. “Okay, I’ll leave immediately.”","The little girl was immediately indignant. She pushed the young man hard and said, “Li Dachun, how can you be like this? this is the task given to us by the village to take care of him. He hasn’t fully recovered yet, and you want to drive him away? Aren’t you afraid that the people in the village will criticize you?”","The young man named Li Dachun was a little hesitant when he heard that. “I... I... He’s already awake, right? our mission is considered complete.”","“It’s far from complete. Look at the injuries on his body. Listen to me and let him stay!” the little girl patted her chest and promised.","Looking at the mischievous and energetic little girl, Jian Wushuang smiled. “I won’t bother you. I’ve almost recovered. I’ll leave immediately.”","After he finished speaking, he looked around and did not see Xi Qingchi and the others. He asked again, “May I ask if you’ve seen the other people who were with me?”","“Yes,” the young man nodded and said honestly. “Besides you, there were two men and two women, plus a big dog. We fished them all out of the river and gave them to each family to be taken care of.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang got off the bed and cupped his hands in a salute. “Thank you for saving me.”","The young man waved his hand. “You don’t have to thank me. If it was anyone else who fell into the river, I would have saved them too.”","“My brother is a big idiot. He doesn’t understand what you’re saying. You can just tell me,” the little servant girl said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry. “Alright, I’ll tell you.”","Only then was she satisfied. Then, she pretended to be mature and said, “You’ve been unconscious for more than half a year. Now that you’ve woken up, I should take you to the village to find your friends.”","Before he could speak, the young man said, “Let me bring you there. They are not far from here.”","Jian Wushuang did not decline. He cupped his hands and said, “Thank you. Sorry for the trouble.”","The most urgent thing now was to find Di Qing and the others as soon as possible and then leave this place.","“I want to go with you.”","“No, you better stay at home. If you dare to run around, I’ll come back and beat you up!”","...","Walking out of the wooden house, Jian Wushuang gradually relaxed his mind as he faced the afternoon sun.","This was a medium-sized village near the river. There were only about a hundred households, and in front of each household, there were fishing nets and many dried fish. It was a peaceful atmosphere.","The young man named Li Dachun walked in front of Jian Wushuang and acted as his guide.","He turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang from time to time, his vigilant eyes mixed with some curiosity. It seemed that he wanted to say something, but out of some fear, he did not dare to speak."]},{"number":4847,"title":"Chapter 4847 I’ll Give You an Immortal Root","paragraphs":["4847 I’ll Give You an Immortal Root","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile when he saw him trying to hold it in. “Do you have any questions for me?”","“Can I ask? You won’t get angry?”","“Of course you can. I won’t get angry.”","Li Dachun could not hold back anymore after getting the confirmation. He asked directly, “Are you an Immortal? Are you as powerful as those old Daoist priests at Qingting Mountain?”","Jian Wushuang was a little surprised and then he did not know whether to laugh or cry. “I guess so, but we’re all ordinary Immortals.”","“I knew you were Immortals,” Li Dachun said excitedly after getting the confirmation. “We were fishing in the river at that time, and the sky turned dark in an instant, accompanied by lightning and thunder. It could scare people to death. We hid in the boat and didn’t dare to show our faces.”","“We didn’t dare to come out until the sky recovered. Then we saw you guys floating in the water. You guys were all emitting Immortal Qi...”","Li Dachun spoke with fervor and assurance, but when he saw that Jian Wushuang had not spoken, he immediately stuttered nervously, “Er, did I say too much.... I’m sorry, I only said this because I don’t think you’re a bad person.”","“It’s fine. I haven’t spoken to anyone in a long time. It feels pretty good,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Li Dachun quickly nodded and said, “I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to drive you away. I was worried that you were bad guys and would do us harm, but it seems that you’re all good people.”","He looked at Li Dachun and said with a smile, “Why do you think I look like a good person again?”","“Because you don’t put on any airs at all. You’re even more peaceful than the Immortals on our Qingting Mountain who have achieved Dao. You must be a good person,” Li Dachun scratched his head and said.","His view was very simple. He simply judged that Jian Wushuang and the others were good people.","Jian Wushuang smiled but did not say anything. From what he felt, the Yan power in this realm was very sparse. It was probably impossible to provide for an Ancestor-level cultivator.","Therefore, the Immortals and Daoist priests of Qingting Mountain that Li Dachun had mentioned were probably not even top cultivators, but just ordinary cultivators.","“The villagers of our village have lived on the bank of the Wei River for generations. They all eat water and rely on the heavens for their harvest.”","“Although we don’t have any great abilities, we can still fill your stomachs. If you still need a place to stay for the time being, you can continue to stay with us.”","While they were talking, Li Dachun knocked on the door of the first villager with Jian Wushuang.","Zhao Ting had just woken up. When she saw that it was Jian Wushuang, she heaved a sigh of relief.","After a brief conversation, Jian Wushuang took Zhao Ting to the next place.","Wei Liujia and Xi Qingchi did not suffer too much of an impact at the last moment, so they naturally recovered the fastest.","Di Qing, on the other hand, had been in a deep sleep.","In line with Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, the power of Changfu’s last thought had indeed taken Di Qing’s life, which was why he had been unable to wake up.","Since Di Qing could not wake up, their departure time had to be delayed, and they had to stay in the village for a while.","In order not to trouble Li Dachun and the other villagers, Jian Wushuang directly opened up a cave not far from the village for them to rest in.","A few months passed by in a flash.","During this period, Li Dachun and the other villagers delivered fish soup and other fish products on time to ensure that the Immortals would not go hungry, even though they did not know that the Immortals no longer needed food.","The Yan power in the Heavenly Region was so sparse that they could not even absorb it. Zhao Ting and the others naturally were not interested in it. They just wanted to leave as soon as possible.","However, Di Qing showed no signs of waking up, except for his breath becoming more stable.","Time continued to fly by. After Jian Wushuang said that they did not need food, the villagers rarely came to deliver food.","However, Li Dachun’s sister, Li Shichun, was the only one who would visit him every three to four days without feeling tired.","Outside the cave, Jian Wushuang condensed a finger-sized bird with his Yan power and gave it to Li Shichun.","“You’re so pretty. Your acting is much better than the wood my brother made,” the little girl held the flying bird and said with a smile.","“Can you transform an animal for me every day in the future?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the vast Wei River in the distance and said, “I’m afraid I can’t. I’ll have to leave soon.”","“So soon? Can’t you stay?”","“I can’t. I still have a lot of things to do.”","Li Shichun pouted. “Can you teach me then? I’ll look for you and transform for you after I’ve learned it.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head when he heard Li Shichun’s innocent words. He was about to explain patiently when he noticed a slight reaction from Yan power between Li Shichun’s eyebrows.","He reached out his finger and pressed it between her eyebrows.","After a brief investigation, Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Since you want to learn so much, I’ll teach you.”","With that, a wisp of pure Yan power left his palm and quickly entered Li Shichun’s forehead.","Nothing had changed, but everything had changed.","In this Heavenly Region where Yan power was scarce, it would be hard to become a top cultivator. However, in this realm, there was a talented genius who was born with Immortal talent and was sensitive to Yan power.","And such a genius was Li Shichun, who was sitting next to Jian Wushuang.","Before she realized it, Jian Wushuang had secretly activated her Immortal talent and given her an Immortal root.","Even though everything he had done was useless in the face of this Heavenly Region, it was enough to for her to do magic tricks.","In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, Li Shichun only wanted to have the ability to conjure a flying bird trick. He had given it to her, and that was all.","The sun and the moon passed by, and Di Qing only woke up after nearly another year.","His Immortal body was strong, but his life force was weak. It was obvious that he had not fully recovered, but it was enough.","It was time for them to leave.","“You really want to leave? Don’t you want to stay for a few more days?” Li Dachun asked.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and laughed, “No, I’ve stayed here for several years. It’s time to leave.”","“In addition, you and your descendants can hide in the Heavenly Abode I left behind if you encounter a war or a natural disaster. You won’t be discovered by the outside world.”","After giving his instructions, he patted Li Shichun’s head. “Remember to practice hard. I might come back to check on you in the future.”","Li Shichun nodded heavily. “Yes, don’t worry. I won’t let you down.”","Apart from Li Shichun, everyone present knew that these mysterious Immortals would never come here again."]},{"number":4848,"title":"Chapter 4848 Return","paragraphs":["4848 Return","Before he left the Heavenly Region, Jian Wushuang slightly improved the rules of Dao, so that Yan power was derived at a slow speed and developed in a good direction.","After leaving the Heavenly Region and traveling through the void, Jian Wushuang already knew that this was not the territory of the Great Mi Heaven. He had even left far away.","Zhao Ting, who knew the distribution of the Heavenly Region the best, was in charge of leading the way. With her guidance, Jian Wushuang and the others avoided running around like headless flies.","Now that more than half of the Great Mi Heaven she was in had been destroyed, and even Prince Jiu was chasing after her, she had nowhere to go. She could only follow Jian Wushuang.","It was the same for Wei Liujia. From the moment he was locked up in the Heavenly Prison, he had already given up. From then on, he was no longer the Mountain Lord of the Dagu Mountain, but a lone Immortal, Wei Liujia.","As for Xi Qingchi, her task had ended. After a series of life-and-death adventures, she was lucky to be unscathed. Jian Wushuang naturally had to send her back.","Perhaps she had seen through his intentions, but Xi Qingchi became sullen along the way.","Too many unexpected things had happened in the past few years, and the most important thing was that it had not been completed.","He had not even seen Yin Ling’s figure. Even though Jian Wushuang was extremely unwilling, he had no choice but to leave.","They could not stay any longer after such a huge change in Great Mi Heaven. The Heavenly Court of Zhen Wuyang would definitely sense it, so they had to leave.","On the way back, Xi Qingchi, which was sitting on the back of San Qing, had been in a daze, as if she was thinking about something.","In the end, she seemed to have made up her mind. She jumped down from San Qing’s back and came to Jian Wushuang. She said uneasily, “My Lord, can I not go back? I still want to stay by your side...”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head and refused, “No, it was not my intention to bring you out. Now that the matter has been settled, there is no reason for me not to let you go back.”","“But I still have things to do. I still want to find my mother,” Xi Qingchi whispered.","“No, you should go back. There are countless Heavenly Regions out there. Every one of them is unknown and full of unpredictable dangers. Your father has his reasons for not letting you out,” Jian Wushuang’s voice was unquestionable.","The eyes of Xi Qingchi dimmed. She did not dare to refute and could only return to San Qing’s back.","He then looked at San Qing, who had changed greatly. He did not know what would happen after it absorbed so much Blood Qi in the North Sky Heavenly Region, but it seemed very stable at the moment and there were no side effects.","Only the whistling sound of the strong wind could be heard in the void.","To be on the safe side, they stopped using the Immortal formations that could teleport between Heavenly Regions and traveled in the void at a constant speed.","Even though they had taken many detours during this period, they still found Qingzhou in the end.","Jian Wushuang personally sent her back to the sect in Qingzhou.","Outside the misty mountain gate, Xi Qingchi suddenly mustered up the courage to hold him back, and then quickly released his hand. “Will we meet again?”","“If there are no accidents, I probably won’t see you again,” Jian Wushuang turned around and smiled. “This might not be a bad thing. You can continue to be a young lady in the sect and cultivate diligently. Your father’s cultivation is not bad. You can try to ask him to teach you some insights.”","Speaking up to this point, he seemed to have thought of something, and then took out more than ten Emperor-grade pills from his bosom and stuffed them into her hands.","“From now on, you have to take one pill every time you reach a bottleneck. It’ll help you in your cultivation. At the same time, you have to remember not to expose these pills to any cultivators, not even your father.”","“Once they’re exposed, it’ll be a disaster for you and the entire sect.”","“Remember every word I say and follow them,” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn. “I’m not joking.”","Holding the pills in her hand tightly, Xi Qingchi nodded solemnly and said softly, “Don’t worry. I know you’re doing this for my own good. I won’t disobey you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then left.","A black-robed figure tore through the clouds and smoke and disappeared like a shooting star.","Xi Qingchi quickly took two steps forward, but soon she stopped in place. She was lost, and her eyes were filled with tears.","San Qing stepped forward and rubbed its big furry head against her palm.","After a long time, she said in a daze, “San Qing, do you think we will never meet again?”","San Qing raised its head and whimpered. It was unknown what it was trying to express, but the patterns around its body were slowly flowing.","After returning to Xi Qingchi, Jian Wushuang looked back at the peaceful Heavenly Region and said, “Let’s go back to the Six Heavens Realm.”","Di Qing came over at the right time with a smile on his face that looked like he had just recovered from a serious illness. “Wushuang, I see that you’ve been alone until now. Why don’t you want to take that little girl as your Immortal Partner? Even though she hasn’t reached the Yan Immortal stage, she’s still a good seedling.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly and said.","“Looking at the myriad galaxies, the vast sea, and the red moon, I’ve long found that star. I no longer have any attachment to anything.”","After he finished speaking, he took the lead and moved forward.","“He’s truly an enigmatic and infatuated fellow,” Di Qing mumbled to himself and then moved forward with him.","Zhao Ting looked at his figure, and a complicated look flashed in the depths of his eyes.","The four of them spent several months before finally returning to the Six Heavens Realm.","Zhao Ting seemed a little worried when she stepped into the territory that belonged to the Young Emperor, Prince Yan. She was afraid that the Young Emperor would recognize her. After all, she was once a sky official under Prince Jiu and held a lot of power.","Wei Liujia, on the other hand, looked like he had never seen the world before. He looked around the Heavenly Region void with a curious look.","The moment Jian Wushuang stepped into the Six Heavens Realm, he frowned.","He saw that in the past, when the Heavenly Region was still under martial law, there were very few Yan Immortals who passed by. Now, there were at least hundreds of Yan Immortals riding cranes or travelling in groups of three to five. They were all hurrying on their way and seemed to have all gathered in one place.","“Has the Six Heavens Realm been opened?” He was puzzled.","Soon, Jian Wushuang stopped thinking about these things and entered Little Lonely Heaven with Di Qing and the others.","Little Lonely Heaven was calm and quiet as usual, but it was full of energy, making it the best place for meditation and cultivation.","However, what made Jian Wushuang feel strange was that Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing were not in the hall. Even their respective Yan power auras were weak, as if they had been gone for some time.","Jian Wushuang entered the palace to rest after guessing that the Young Emperor must have called for them."]},{"number":4849,"title":"Chapter 4849 Dinner Banquet","paragraphs":["4849 Dinner Banquet","After sitting in the hall and listening to Jian Wushuang’s words, Wei Liujia quickly sat down and recuperated. He had to remove the injuries in his Immortal body as soon as possible to avoid leaving any cracks.","On the other hand, Zhao Ting appeared rather uncomfortable, and his expression was somewhat awkward.","Seeing her uneasiness, Jian Wushuang quickly said, “If you’re not used to staying here, you can leave at any time. I won’t stop you.”","Hearing this, Zhao Ting shook her head. “I don’t mean that. I have nowhere to go now. If you didn’t save me, I’m afraid I would have died long ago. It’s just...”","“Are you worried that the Young Emperor will find out your identity?” Jian Wushuang asked.","She nodded and said, “Several years ago, as a Heavenly Official, I went to the Heavenly Court with you to attend a banquet and met all the Princes. Now that I think about it, Prince Yan might recognize me.”","“This is a little troublesome. I’m afraid you can only continue to change your appearance.”","She sighed. “I guess that’s the only way.”","As they were talking, three streaks of light streaked across the clouds and entered the silent hall.","The leader was a Yan Immortal, his body was well-built like a majestic mountain, his tough face was beaming with joy.","“Brother Jian, I didn’t expect you to return so quickly. It hasn’t even been ten years!”","Then, there were two figures. One of them had a refined figure and a handsome and gentle face.","The other figure was also quite handsome, but his dispirited standing posture made him look extremely handsome.","Three figures, three Yan Immortals.","They cupped their hands at the same time, and their eyes were filled with excitement, “Little Brother Jian.”","“Brother Jian.”","“Big Brother Jian.”","Jian Wushuang had also left his seat a long time ago. He smiled and said, “I also want to congratulate you. You’ve all changed a lot.”","The three of them looked at each other and laughed out loud.","Cheng Qing’s face lit up, “Brother Jian, you don’t know. The two of them eat pills like candy all day. It would be strange if they didn’t break through to the Yan Immortal stage.”","“Brother Chen, you have the nerve to say that. Who was the one who ate 60 pills in one go and almost choked and fainted?” Chun Qiu teased.","Cui Jing added, “If it wasn’t for Brother Chun and I, you would have been done for, right? ”","Chen Qing’s face turned red. “Don’t bullsh*t. I was just trying to control the quality, so I was in a hurry to eat it...”","The originally silent hall became much livelier with these three Jokers.","After teasing each other for a while, Chen Qing was the first to notice that there were two other figures sitting in the hall besides Di Qing.","“Who are these two?” Cheng Qing asked.","Jian Wushuang said, “I brought them back from the Great Mi Heaven. They’ll be staying in Little Lonely Heaven for the time being.”","Wei Liujia stood up from his meditation and hurriedly cupped his hands. “I am an itinerant Immortal. My name is Wei Liujia.”","Zhao Ting did not say anything and just nodded.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing all stopped smiling. They had naturally heard that the Great Mi Heaven was Prince Jiu’s territory.","Then, just as Chen Qing was about to pull Jian Wushuang over to remind him, a Yan Immortal stepped in the air and floated into the palace.","“Lord Jian, the Young Emperor has invited you and the other six subjects to a banquet to welcome you. Please rest for a while before you head to the Big Lonely Heaven.","After he finished, the Yan Immortal took his leave.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Apparently, the Young Emperor had known that he had entered the Six Heavens Realm and even knew that they had returned.","“Make your preparations. After a short rest, we’ll go to the banquet together.”","“Can I not go?” Zhao Ting asked.","“If you don’t want to arouse suspicion, you’d better go with me.”","...","As the Immortal clouds rose, a total of seven figures, led by Jian Wushuang, came to the Heavenly Palace of the Young Emperor in Big Lonely Heaven.","“Lord Jian, the Young Emperor has been waiting for a long time,” Walking out from the side of the palace, the skinny purple-robed Yan Immortal said calmly.","Jian Wushuang nodded and entered the hall first.","“Brother Jian, long time no see,” the Young Emperor, who was dressed in luxurious clothes, greeted him with a faint smile. “Please take your seats.”","The Heavenly Palace was huge, and every Yan Immortal present had their own thoughts.","Di Qing did not like the Young Emperor, so he sat beside Jian Wushuang and closed his eyes to rest.","Although Chun Qiu looked calm, the hatred in his eyes was very strong.","Cui Jing, on the other hand, restrained his suspicious aura and looked nervous.","Wei Liujia was also quite nervous, and he tilted his head to the side, intentionally or otherwise.","On the other hand, Zhao Ting, who had changed her appearance, was quite calm, as if she was a real guest.","Cheng Qing was still carefree. “Young Emperor, we haven’t seen each other for a long time. We won’t leave until we’re drunk.”","The Young Emperor sitting at the head of the table smiled and said, “Alright, since Brother Jian has also returned from Great Mi Heaven, let’s drink till we’re drunk.”","The atmosphere eased up, and the people in the Heavenly Palace began to drink and mingle.","“By the way, Brother Jian, did you find that thing after you returned from the Great Mi Heaven?”","The Young Emperor came to Jian Wushuang with a glass of wine and sat down to ask.","He shook his head. “I haven’t found it. I’m afraid it’ll be difficult to find it in the future.”","“This kind of thing can’t be rushed. Perhaps you’ll be able to come to your side very soon.” As the Young Emperor spoke, he drank the wine in his cup in one gulp. “Tell me, how’s the situation at Great Mi Heaven?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and then told him everything that had happened in the Great Mi Heaven.","When he heard that more than half of the Great Mi Heaven had been destroyed and that Prince Jiu’s forces had almost been completely annihilated, there was a hint of joy in the Young Emperor’s eyes, but it quickly disappeared.","“This is indeed good news for me. Thank you for telling me, Brother Jian,” he smiled and said. “Let’s drink this glass of wine together.”","After finishing the wine in the cup again, the Young Emperor stood up and waved his hand, and a True Sword fell into his hand.","“Brother Jian, your Sword Dao is about to be fully integrated. You’re only a step away from becoming a Sword Immortal. Why don’t we have a discussion today?”","As he spoke, he threw the True Sword in his hand to Jian Wushuang.","“Really?”","“Of course. However, Brother Jian, please show mercy.”","After a simple conversation, Jian Wushuang held his True Sword and stood opposite the Young Emperor.","The atmosphere in the entire Heavenly Palace suddenly froze, and it was filled with a biting cold Sword Intent.","“Brother Chen, you’ve been with the Young Emperor the longest. Who do you think will win?” Cui Jing looked at Cheng Qing beside him and said in a low voice.","“Do you still need to say that? Anyone with eyes can tell that Brother Jian will win.” Cheng Qing glanced at him. “You must know, when we first met and sparred with Brother Jian, I only managed to withstand three strikes from his sword.”","“Damn, Big Brother Jian is so powerful?!”","“Of course, if you learn it well, it might be good for you.”"]},{"number":4850,"title":"Chapter 4850 All Deserve to Die","paragraphs":["4850 All Deserve to Die","Di Qing also opened his eyes and took a look, then sat down calmly and closed his eyes to rest.","He had never been interested in the outcome that had been decided before it even started.","A simple sword duel was held in the Heavenly Palace.","It was easy to imagine the result when a Young Emperor who did not practice Sword Dao fought against Jian Wushuang, who was about to perfect his Sword Dao and could even fight a Sword Immortal when he was at the Ancestor cultivation realm.","In fact, Jian Wushuang only needed to release any move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent to defeat him immediately.","But he did not do that. This was a harmless sword duel, and no matter who won or lost, it was just a spur of the moment.","The Sword Intent rose up like thousands of flying fish, extremely magnificent.","Jian Wushuang held his real sword and focused on blocking.","However, it was unknown whether the Young Emperor was too drunk or could not hold back his strength, but he slashed down with full force, even cutting the Yan power that was scattered in the air.","The atmosphere also became subtle.","What was originally an easy match turned into a fight. As the Young Emperor’s moves became faster and faster, and his killing intent raged, all the Yan Immortals present became serious.","Chun Qiu had already placed his palm on the dagger at his waist and had already activated it. He was waiting for Jian Wushuang to be injured so that he could attack him.","Cui Jing saw Chun Qiu’s breath changing, and he also became serious. He also pressed the black stick on his waist.","Di Qing had been resting with his eyes closed, as if he did not care about what was happening in the outside world.","Zhao Ting’s eyes flickered, as if she was planning something.","Wei Liujia looked even more anxious. In his opinion, Jian Wushuang was being forced to retreat. He was obviously no match for the Young Emperor.","However, Jian Wushuang’s face was calm from the beginning to the end. Even when he was facing a sword move that was filled with killing intent, he could easily resolve it.","When he blocked the 767th sword strike, a change occurred.","The True Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand broke into two without any warning. The Young Emperor’s heavy sword also hit his shoulder heavily, shattering his entire shoulder blade!","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing immediately stood up, but Chen Qing held them down.","“If you don’t want anything to happen to Brother Jian, don’t move!”","The atmosphere was dead silent. The Young Emperor seemed to have sobered up from the alcohol. His eyes were filled with shock. He subconsciously let go of the sword and touched him. “B-Brother Jian, I didn’t mean it.”","Jian Wushuang took half a step back and avoided his palm. His expression remained unchanged, “It’s okay. There are times when I’m injured in a sword fight.”","After he finished speaking, he took out the sword from his shoulder blade and threw it to the Young Emperor.","“It seems I’m overwhelmed, so I’ll leave first.”","Jian Wushuang turned around and left. Drops of divine blood fell from his shoulder and imprinted on the ground.","Di Qing, who had been resting with his eyes closed, opened his eyes and followed Jian Wushuang without looking at the others.","Chun Qiu immediately broke free from Cheng Qing’s grasp and left.","Then, Cui Jing also left.","Zhao Ting and Wei Liujia glanced at the Young Emperor and left as well.","Soon, only Cheng Qing and a few Yan Immortal guards were left in the huge palace.","“Young Emperor,” Cheng Qing stood up and his expression changed slightly, “You’re too impulsive...”","“Get lost,” he said. He looked straight at the open door of the hall.","Cheng Qing sighed and left without saying anything.","The Heavenly Palace was deathly silent.","The Young Emperor’s face turned from pale to ruddy, and the knuckles of his hand that held the hilt of his sword turned white.","“Motherf*cker!”","He was furious, and with the True Sword in his hand, he suddenly chopped at the table where the delicacies were placed, flipping it over.","“Motherf*cker! All of you deserve to die, you all want to rebel against me!”","The Young Emperor was completely furious and almost went crazy. He waved his sword and overturned all the plans, leaving the entire Heavenly Palace in a mess.","The skinny purple-robed man stood behind him the whole time. He didn’t stop him or say anything.","“A bunch of damned things, they actually can’t tell who their master is. Did they forget who I am? I’m the Crown Prince, the future Emperor of the Great Si Region!”","Each roar of anger was louder than the last, and it resounded throughout the Heavenly Palace.","When his voice gradually became weaker, the thin purple-robed man stepped forward and handed him a white silk cloth. “Your Highness, please calm down.”","The Young Emperor coughed heavily and wiped the silk cloth at the corner of his mouth, “Jian Wushuang! Jian Wushuang! You deserve to die!”","“Did you see that? He didn’t even use a bit of his Sword Principle when he was sparring with me. He’s looking down on me! He didn’t even acknowledge me from the beginning!”","“Not just him. Did you see the group of people he brought back? All of you actually dare to oppose me? Especially after I slashed at Jian Wushuang, the group of guys he brought back actually dared to attack me?”","The skinny purple-robed man had been listening quietly. In the end, he said calmly, “Your Highness, have you forgotten that Jian Wushuang is not your subject, but your friend? You should not use the way you govern your subjects on him.”","“Even you want to rebel against me?” The Young Emperor’s voice was slightly angry.","“I don’t dare to. I’m just saying what I should say. Jian Wushuang is not your subject, but your friend.” After the skinny purple-robed man finished speaking, he looked at him meaningfully.","“Friend? I, Prince Yan, don’t even have brothers, so how can I have friends?” There was no emotion in his voice, empty and unknown.","After some time, the Young Emperor turned to look at the thin purple-robed man. “Do you know how Jian Wushuang’s True Sword broke?”","“I did something to destroy the Sword Heart on purpose. I did it on purpose to win against him once. Don’t you think it’s funny?”","The thin purple-robed man said in a low voice, “There’s nothing wrong with what Your Highness did, but this kind of punishment can only be used between subjects.”","The Young Emperor continued, “Did my sword strike completely cut off the connection between us two?”","“Yes and no.”","“I want to make it up to him, but how?”","“Apologize to him.”","...","The atmosphere in the spacious hall was oppressive and heavy.","Jian Wushuang sat quietly in front of a desk with his eyes closed as if nothing had happened.","Chun Qiu’s face was cold, his hand never leaving the hilt of the sword at his waist.","Di Qing was sitting beside him in the same posture, with a playful look in his eyes.","“This doesn’t seem like your style. I’ve been with you all this time and have tried to figure out your personality, but I didn’t expect this scene today.”","“You didn’t attack him. Is it because you’re afraid of Zhen Wuyang behind him, or do you treat him as a friend?”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes, “Zhen Wuyang? I’ve never been afraid of him, so why would I treat him as a friend? I’ve never even thought about it.”","“This sword strike... It’s just returning some of the favors and things he gave me.”","Di Qing nodded to himself. ‘A guy who participated in the assassination of the Fifth Prince, Prince Mo, and fought with the Second Prince, Prince Jiu... I’m afraid he really doesn’t take Zhen Wuyang seriously.’"]},{"number":4851,"title":"Chapter 4851 Eternal Wushuang Auction House","paragraphs":["4851 Eternal Wushuang Auction House","In that case, there could only be another result, which was that Jian Wushuang still remembered the Young Emperor’s kindness.","But now, he had already drawn a line in his heart.","“Brother Jian, no matter what decision you make in the future, I, Chun Qiu, will not have any objections.” Chun Qiu’s voice was stern, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Brother Jian, I, Cui Jing, am the same. You only need to give me an order and my entire life is yours.” Cui Jing leaned against the pillar, his eyes equally solemn and his voice powerful.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and smiled, “Don’t be so serious. Cultivate well. Only by constantly improving yourself can you have a foothold in the countless Heavenly Regions.”","“Also, remember, your lives are your own. Living well is more important than anything else.”","“That’s right, you’re the most reasonable one,” Cheng Qing gave a thumbs up and then changed the topic. “I just remembered that I haven’t told you the most important thing.”","He glanced at Chun Qiu and Cui Jing and said, “Do you still remember when you left the Six Heavens Realm, Brother Jian? We said we were going to open an auction house. It’s already open, we’re just waiting for you to come back!”","“I was going to tell you before, but I was delayed and forgot about it. I just remembered now.” Cheng Qing scratched his head and laughed. “Why don’t you pick a time, Brother Jian? We can open at that time!”","Jian Wushuang did not refuse. “Then let’s do it half a month later. I see that many Yan Immortals are already gathering here.”","“It seems that we can’t hide anything from you, Brother Jian,” Cheng Qing said with a smile. “That’s right. Before this, we’ve released the news of many Supreme Treasures, which naturally attracted many individual Immortals and sects in the Heavenly Region to come here. Let’s wait for the time when we’ll make a fortune!”","At this moment, Di Qing said, “You’re all Yan Immortals, why do you still care about the so-called money?”","“Of course I don’t care. For an auction house like ours, trading with Heaven Crystals is only a part of it. The most important part is trading between top-tier True Treasures, which can only be exchanged with True Treasures of the same level,” Cheng Qing explained.","This time, even Wei Liujia somewhat understood their intentions.","An auction like this seemed to be a way to get commission, but it was actually a trade of Supreme Treasures. It was to collect all the Supreme Treasures scattered in the Heavenly Regions.","It was a big game of chess, so big that even Jian Wushuang began to wonder what kind of colossus such an auction house would grow into in the future.","After the banquet, half a month passed by in a flash.","In this half a month, the Young Emperor had sent Yan Immortal emissaries to invite Jian Wushuang to a banquet many times, but they were all rejected.","After three consecutive visits, no more emissaries came. Jian Wushuang was finally free and had a good rest.","Half a month had passed, and it was time for the clear and turbid to be replaced. They walked out of the giant Hall together, out of Little Lonely Heaven.","A total of seven figures, like seven streams of light, flew into the void.","According to Chun Qiu, the auction house was not built in the Young Emperor’s Six Heavens Realm. Instead, it was built on an entire Heavenly Region!","The Heavenly Region plane where the auction house was built was obtained by the Chun Qiu dynasty from a Heavenly Sect’s territory with an irresistible condition. It contained six mainland planes. In addition to its vast size, it was also rich in energy and was a Blessed Land.","However, there was only one auction house in such a Heavenly Region Plane, which was extremely luxurious.","It was not because Chun Qiu was too arrogant, but because the Heavenly Reggion Realm was too cheap. He only used more than 20 Emperor-grade pills to take over the entire Heavenly Region Plane...","As for the number of precious elixirs they had taken from Emperor Liu Ya’s former Heavenly Court, Chun Qiu had counted them in detail. There were a total of more than 2,400 pills. After giving Jian Wushuang more than 1,000 pills, they still had more than 1,400 left.","This was an unimaginable number, but it was only the tip of the iceberg of Emperor Liu Ya’s collection.","This time, the Heavenly Region auction house’s first opening attracted countless Yan Immortals because Cheng Qing had released some news about the Emperor-grade pills, which caused a commotion.","As he stepped into the Heavenly Region, a wave of energy fluctuations swept past him, and a vast and clean Heavenly Region came into view.","This kind of Heavenly Region was not bad in the Great Si Region and was a good place to cultivate.","There were already thousands of Ancestor-level top cultivators and Yan Immortals gathered in the Heavenly Region. They entered a grand Heavenly Palace one after another, which was quite spectacular.","“I have a premonition that our auction house will definitely make a name for itself on its first day of trading,” Cheng Qing said rather excitedly.","Jian Wushuang, who was walking in front, smiled. “Let’s take a look first.”","It was not until he entered the auction house that Jian Wushuang saw the words clearly.","“Eternal Wushuang Auction House.”","...","“This name is really a little...”","“Brother Jian, don’t mind the details. This is the name we came up with after some discussion. Isn’t it very domineering?”","...","Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised when he was led into the auction house by a maid.","The Heavenly Palace was made up of all kinds of precious jade. It was extremely magnificent and divided into three levels, which were orderly and strict.","The Yan Immortals and top cultivators sent by the ordinary sects were seated on the first level, while some hidden sects or Heavenly Sects that spanned several Heavenly Regions were seated on the second level.","As for the third floor, it was divided into two spaces. One of them was for Jian Wushuang, while the other was for an extremely distinguished guest.","As for the so-called distinguished guest, Cheng Qing did not hide it. He was the son of the Super Sect that sold this Heavenly Region to the Chun Qiu.","Jian Wushuang was not interested in this. The reason he came here was to try his luck and see if he could find any rare treasures.","As more and more Yan Immortals and top cultivators entered and took their seats, the atmosphere in the quiet and grand auction house finally warmed up.","Sitting on the chair made of warm jade, Jian Wushuang looked down at the center of the Heavenly Palace with some awkwardness.","Chen Qing and the other six sat around Jian Wushuang and were ready to start.","The entire hall of the auction house had been built according to the Chun Qiu planning, which made Jian Wushuang look at him in a new light.","As all the invited Yan Immortals arrived, just as the palace door was about to close, another 10 or so light figures barged into the palace, completely ignoring the gazes of the other Yan Immortals.","These 11 figures were all Yan immortals. Like the stars surrounding the moon, they brought out the luxuriously dressed figure in the lead."]},{"number":4852,"title":"Chapter 4852 The Mysterious Jade Head","paragraphs":["4852 The Mysterious Jade Head","The figure in luxurious clothes, the arrogant look on his face, and the extremely lazy standing posture made him look even more unruly than Cui Jing.","After entering the palace, the 10 Yan Immortals controlled their powers and lifted him up to the third level.","Such a scene caused an uproar.","When they reached the third level, the luxuriously dressed figure glanced at Jian Wushuang and the others with a touch of disdain in his eyes before taking a seat.","Cui Jing saw this and spat, “Pfft, that kid so good at pretending. If it wasn’t for this kid, I could have taken this Heavenly Region with 15 pills!”","Cheng Qing also said, “I’m going to teach this kid a lesson sooner or later. He almost embarrassed me back then.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “Alright, let’s focus on the auction. Did you carefully select the items to be auctioned?”","Chun Qiu nodded. “There are a total of 60 items. Among them, there are 20 Emperor-grade pills. The rest of the items are treasures that I picked out that are not too valuable.”","“We have many pills. If some sects in the Heavenly Region have bad intentions...” Jian Wushuang was a little worried.","Chun Qiu smiled. “Don’t worry, Brother Jian. I’ve already settled everything. I’ve unintentionally involved our auction house with the Young Emperor. Even if the other sects are eyeing us, they’ll have to think twice.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not say anything else. He understood what Chun Qiu meant. It was fake that the Young Emperor was involved, but it was true that he was using his name.","The sudden establishment of this auction house with a strong foundation seemed to be related to the Prince of Zhen Wuyang.","As the sounds of discussion gradually died down, a woman with a beautiful face and figure, surrounded by dense and powerful aura, walked to the center of the hall.","“These women I found are all candidates for Fairy Maidens of the Heavenly Court. They are all first-class in their work,” Cheng Qing said proudly.","Following that, just as Cheng Qing had said, the Fairy gave a concise yet full opening speech, completely raising the atmosphere of the entire auction house.","“Ladies and gentlemen, today’s first item is the Six Fate Pill. It has a lot of wonderful effects. It can help the owner to understand the Great Dao in a specific Heavenly Region Plane. However, you must remember that this pill is not for consumption. You have to wear it on your body.”","“The starting price of this Six Fate Pill is 60,000 Black Mountain Crystals. Of course, you can also use Heaven Crystals. The starting price is 60 million Heaven Crystals.”","As the Fairy’s voice fell, a pill with six-colored flowing shadows suspended in the air. Even through the crystal jade box, it seemed to exude a medicinal fragrance.","In Jian Wushuang’s eyes, the so-called Six Fate Pill was of little value. However, for ordinary top cultivators or Yan Immortals, it was a treasure that could only be found by chance! Furthermore, it was not a one-time use treasure, and it could be passed down, increasing its value by several levels.","Immediately after, the sounds of people fighting to be the first to bid rang out.","“60 million Heaven Crystals!”","“70 million Heaven Crystals!”","“90 million Heaven Crystals!”","Each bid was higher than the last, and the price was soon raised to almost 500 million Heaven Crystals!","Jian Wushuang also noticed some problems.","That’s right, these Yan Immortals only used Heaven Crystals, none of them used Black Mountain Crystals.","Perhaps seeing the confusion in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, Chun Qiu quickly explained, “For these Heavenly Sects, Black Mountain Crystals is a kind of cultivation resource. The purity of the derivative skill stored in it is not comparable to Heaven Crystal.”","“Besides, the Heaven Crystal is produced in large quantities. There are impurities in it, so it can be found in almost every Heavenly Region. The Black Mountain Crystal is only found in Prince Yan’s Lower Three Heavens, so the value of the two can’t be compared.”","“To put it simply, the Black Mountain Crystal is a cultivation resource, while Heaven Crystal is considered a common currency. It’s not valuable at all, so they only use Heaven Crystal when bidding.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and understood.","At this moment, the Six Fate Pill was finally sold for 1.3 billion Heaven Crystals.","After the first pill was handed over, the other treasures followed.","These precious treasures were usually hard to come by, but in the unrivaled ancient auction house, they were displayed so quickly that one only had to pay Heaven Crystals to get them!","This was a great benefit!","In an instant, all the Yan Immortals and top cultivators in the hall were bidding with all their might, trying to bring back a Supreme Treasure.","After knowing that all the items were selected by Chun Qiu and the others, Jian Wushuang lost interest.","However, very quickly, under the somewhat crazed atmosphere, the auction moved on to the 20th item. A Fairy ascended to the third level and came in front of Chun Qiu.","“Master Chun, just now a Yan immortal came to visit and offered a treasure for us to bid for, and we can split the commission 50 – 50.”","“There’s such a good thing?” Cheng Qing could not help but ask. “What kind of treasure is it?”","The Fairy looked up and recalled for a moment before saying, “It seems to be a jade head? I can’t see it clearly.”","“Sure, after you confirm the item, you can decide on your own.” Chun Qiu nodded. “By the way, where is that Yan Immortal now? ”","“It’s just below.” the Fairy said as she pointed downwards.","However, there were almost a thousand Yan Immortals and top cultivators sitting below, so he could not tell which one it was. Thus, Chun Qiu only glanced at it and let it go.","When another supreme-grade pill was sold at the price of 6 billion Heaven Crystals, the Fairy in charge of hosting the auction presented a round object wrapped in black cloth.","The huge auction house suddenly quieted down as all the Yan Immortals focused on the item.","The Fairy was obviously told to bid for this item at the last minute. After a moment’s pause, she said, “Uh, this item is also a Supreme Treasure, but it seems that no one has told us about its effects. It should be a very good Supreme Treasure.”","After saying that, she reached out and lifted the black cloth on the round object.","Immediately, a jade-like head with medium-length hair and closed eyes appeared in front of every Yan immortal’s eyes.","This was a head that was sculpted from some kind of warm jade. Other than being extremely lifelike, it was likely that there was no trace of a treasure at all.","“This item is a special item. Only Black Mountain Crystals can be used to bid for it. The starting price is 60,000 Black Mountain Crystals.","“...”","The huge hall fell into an inexplicable silence. After a while, soft boos sounded one after another. All the Yan Immortals booed.","For this treasure auction that was at its peak, the appearance of this useless jade head was like rat sh*t, ruining the appetites of all the Yan Immortals and top cultivators.","There were even some Yan Immortals sent by sects who began to doubt if the next auction item would be as valuable as before."]},{"number":4853,"title":"Chapter 4853 Competing for Bids","paragraphs":["4853 Competing for Bids","The Host was also a little embarrassed. Even in her eyes, this was a useless and weird thing, and it could only be bid with Black Mountain Crystals. Other than a failed auction, no Yan immortal would do something stupid like buy it.","Just as the Jade head was about to be rejected, a calm voice rang out in the hall.","“60,000.”","All of the Yan Immortals, including the host Fairy, subconsciously looked toward the source of the sound.","It was the third floor, the most prestigious floor in the entire Wushuang Auction Jouse.","It was Jian Wushuang who had called out 60,000.","At this moment, he was calmly looking at the jade head. He did not bid on a whim, but after thinking for a while, he had a strange feeling that he could not explain.","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s bid, Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and the others were surprised, but they soon calmed down.","They knew that Jian Wushuang would not shoot aimlessly. Since he wanted to bid for it, it was very likely that he had noticed the beauty of it.","Just as Chun Qiu was about to move, a lazy voice sounded.","“100,000.”","The Fairy, who had just let out a sigh of relief, suddenly became nervous again. This jade head, which had already been left unsold, was suddenly auctioned off, and the bidding began again. This was something that she did not expect. Not only did she not expect this, but over a thousand Yan Immortals and peak Immortals also did not expect this. They all looked up as if they were looking at a fool.","“200,000.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was calm as he directly offered double the price.","But then, that lazy voice also sounded.","“400,000.”","There was a commotion in the hall, and the expression on their faces that they had been looking at fools froze.","Even the Heavenly Sects in the Heavenly Regions would not have such a high bid!","One had to know that Black Mountain Crystals were extremely low in production and were extremely rare even in the Heavenly Regions.","But the next moment, even crazier bids started.","Jian Wushuang’s voice was indifferent as he doubled the price, “800,000.”","“1... 1.6 million!”","The lazy voice sounded like he was gritting his teeth as he blurted out a series of numbers.","The hall was deathly silent and then it was totally chaotic. Everyone raised their heads in disbelief and looked at the third level of the hall!","The dumbfounded expression in their eyes disappeared and was replaced by shock.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Then, a string of numbers floated in the air, causing the hall to fall into a dead silence.","“3 million.”","All of the Yan Immortals and top cultivators gulped, unable to even organize their words.","The Fairy maiden in charge of hosting the event felt her steps falter after hearing this series of unrealistic numbers.","The value of 3 million Black Mountain Crystals was immeasurable, because none of you have ever seen so many Black Mountain Crystals.","Holding back her heart that was about to jump out of her throat, the Fairy subconsciously changed from holding it with one hand to holding it with both hands, afraid that she would accidentally damage this jade head.","“My Lord, this item is a special item of this auction. Only the Black Mountain Crystal can be used to bid...”","Jian Wushuang was still calm, “I know. It’s 3 million Black Mountain Crystals.”","Gulp...","All the Yan Immortals were stunned.","This time, there was no more bidding from the next room. Instead, there was an exasperated voice, “Damn it, I’d like to see if you have the ability to take out so many Black Mountain Crystals. If you don’t, I’ll skin you alive!”","Jian Wushuang’s face suddenly turned cold. Even Chen Qing and the others’ faces changed.","The next moment, a powerful and heavy kick shook the Yan power barrier in the middle. That guy was trying to break through the wall!","“Motherf*cker, I’ll skin you alive right now!” Chen Qing shouted angrily, rolling up his sleeves and preparing to meet the attack.","“Cheng Qing, don’t cause any trouble,” Jian Wushuang said. “The auction house has just been established. It’s not appropriate to start a fight here.”","When Cheng Qing heard this, he also gave up on the idea of rushing over and only glared at the barrier.","After two or three kicks, it seemed that he had vented his anger, and there was no more movement from the other side.","“How noisy. If we weren’t here, I would have crushed that guy with a finger,” Di Qing shook his head in dissatisfaction.","Then, Jian Wushuang looked at Chun Qiu.","Chun Qiu understood tacitly and immediately brought a Interspacial Ring that glowed with black light to her side.","“Lord Chun?”","“There are more Black Mountain Crystals inside. You can just check them.” Chun Qiu placed the storage ring in her hand and left without any hesitation.","With a skeptical attitude, she sent a wisp of her divine sense into the storage ring. By the time she collected her thoughts, she was already completely shocked.","Chun Qiu did not lie to her. The Black Mountain Crystals in her storage ring could no longer be measured by numbers. They were calculated by the number of mountains...","This ordinary-looking jade-like head was finally sold at the sky-high price of 3 million Black Mountain Crystals. It was almost foreseeable that this would be the highest price in this auction, and the treasures that followed would definitely not exceed this price.","This mysterious and high price had left a deep impression in the minds of every Yan Immortal and top cultivator.","After the price of 3 million Black Mountain Crystals had been settled, with a commission of 50 percent, he only needed to pay 1.5 million crystals to get back the jade head.","Chen Qing, who had some understanding of the Black Mountain Crystal, looked pained, but Jian Wushuang and the others were indifferent.","After all, there were too many Black Mountain Crystals in his storage ring and they were almost impossible to consume...","After the sky-high price, the subsequent treasures were auctioned one by one.","It was unknown if it was due to the influence of excitement, but the prices of the following ultimate treasures were all outrageous.","Even an ordinary supreme-grade pill was called for the price of 3 billion Heaven Crystals.","Although Heaven Crystals were produced in large quantities, using a few billion at once was still enough to cause a Heavenly Sect to suffer.","There were a total of 61 Supreme Treasure items. As time passed, the last supreme-grade pill, the Imperial Decree of the Heavens, was sold for 6.7 billion Heaven Crystals. The auction, which lasted for nearly five days, finally came to an end.","Hundreds of billions of Heaven Crystals were accumulated, the height was enough to suffocate Yan Immortals.","The first auction of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House came to a successful end. Only a small number of Heavenly Sects were able to return with the treasures, but most of the Yan Immortals and top cultivators of the sects who did not get the treasures did not feel lonely at all. They were all discussing the grand occasion.","Standing on the top floor, he watched the Yan Immortals leave one after another. His lips slowly curved up.","To them, Heaven Crystals were nothing but trash and had almost no use at all. However, after the entire auction, all the ultimate treasures could be exchanged with Heaven Crystals.","This was just a good temptation to develop a good reputation.","The real treasures would only appear at the beginning of the next auction."]},{"number":4854,"title":"Chapter 4854 The Zhang Family of the Celestial Region","paragraphs":["4854 The Zhang Family of the Celestial Region","Such a grand auction was like a warm-up for a glutton that was about to open its mouth.","Of the two thousand Emperor-grade pills, only two or three hundred had been consumed. Jian Wushuang had 800 or 900, while Chun Qiu and the others still had more than 1,000. Even if they only used a small portion, they could exchange it for many rare Supreme Treasures.","At that time, the treasures and wealth accumulated by the unparalleled auction house would truly be unparalleled.","After the Yan Immortals and top cultivators left one by one, Jian Wushuang, who stood on the top floor with his hands behind his back, looked at the scene calmly.","It was unknown whether the Yan Immortals of the Heavenly Sects could bring back the Supreme treasure. After all, there were many cases of Immortals being killed for treasures.","As the auction ended, the distinguished guest who was also on the third floor flew out and deliberately came to Jian Wushuang.","The 11 Yan Immortals exuded a terrifying aura.","For a time, the two sides confronted each other.","Jian Wushuang was obviously uninterested in him and did not even want to speak.","The arrogant young man in luxurious clothes sized up Jian Wushuang and then said, “Were you the one who bid against me just now?”","“Yes, it’s me,” Jian Wushuang looked at him calmly. “What’s the matter?”","The corners of his mouth twitched, and he placed his hands on the jade belt around his waist. He said, “Give me that jade head. I’ll set the price at 60,000.”","“Are you f*cking sick? Shut up!” Chen Qing shouted angrily and took a step forward. His three-meter-tall figure was extremely oppressive, like a divine mountain looking down from above. “Even if you are the Crown Prince of a Celestial Region, you have to restrain yourself here!”","The young man’s expression turned cold as he looked at Cheng Qing fearlessly, “You think you’re qualified to talk to me like this? Who do you think you are? Even Prince Yan doesn’t dare to talk to me like that!”","Just as Cheng Qing was about to explode and deal the killing blow, a disdainful voice reverberated through the entire hall.","“Oh, really?”","The young man’s figure froze, and he slowly turned his head.","The Young Emperor, who had changed into a plain court dress, slowly walked in the air with his hands behind his back. Behind him were several purple-robed Yan Immortals.","The Immortal clouds swirled, as if they were all submitting to him.","Although his face was extremely handsome, it did not affect his heroic and majestic aura in the slightest. That was the temperament of an Emperor. He did not even deliberately show it, but it was already extremely attractive.","His pupils contracted, and a wisp of cold sweat appeared on the young man’s sideburns.","The Young Emperor just stood in front of him with his hands behind his back. Even with just a gentle gaze, the surrounding space seemed to freeze.","After calming down from his initial panic, the young man immediately bowed and said, “Zhang Chen of the Zhang family of the Celestial Region greets the Young Emperor.”","“Were you the one who said that I wouldn’t dare to talk to you like that?” Young Emperor asked with his hands behind his back.","Before Zhang Chen could say anything, a Yan Immortal behind him who looked like a tactician quickly chimed in, “My Young Master definitely did not mean it that way. He just spoke withoutt hinking ...”","Before he could finish his sentence, the skinny purple-robed man behind the Young Emperor smashed his Immortal body and Immortal Source into pieces!","After killing the Yan Immortal in a breath, the skinny purple-robed man retreated.","“You tell me,” Young Emperor looked at him and said.","Zhang Chen came back to his senses and became terrified. “Young Emperor, I didn’t mean it that way. I really didn’t know how to choose my words, so I said those words. Please forgive me.”","“Because of your good attitude, the Celestial Region has been spared from a disaster. You can go now,” Young Emperor said calmly.","Zhang Chen nodded again and left in a hurry.","Then, Young Emperor came to Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Brother Jian, I’m sorry I’m late. I can’t watch the auction with you.”","“It’s fine. I’m only watching it when I’m free. Sorry, I can’t accompany you.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then left.","Cheng Qing then scratched his head and said, “Young Emperor, don’t think too much. Brother Jian must be in a bad mood right now. After all, he was bitten by that dog. He’s in no good mood at all.”","The Young Emperor nodded. “Because of that Zhang Chen from the Celestial Region?”","Cheng Qing nodded his head and then roughly explained everything that had happened.","After hearing this, the Young Emperor’s face turned cold. “What a bossy and domineering child. The Celestial Region is getting more and more amazing.”","“Da Ban, besides Zhang Chen, how many other sons does the Celestial Region’s Master have?”","The skinny purple-robed man said in a low voice, “Your Highness, Zhang Chen is the only son.”","“Since that’s the case...”","...","After leaving the Young Emperor, Jian Wushuang strolled to the host Fairy. Under her guidance, he went to the side hall to pick up the head.","When Jian Wushuang saw the jade-like head again, even though it was separated by a crystal cover, he felt an inexplicable and strange feeling again.","It was unknown what kind of jade this head was carved from. Although it was extremely exquisite, it seemed to have experienced the destruction of countless years and was now covered in scars.","However, even though he was covered in injuries, the determination and carefreeness in his eyes were still extremely moving. It made everyone who saw it feel like they were willing to bow down.","Jian Wushuang did not know who was carved on the jade head, but he was sure that the person must have been a tyrant in a certain era!","He looked at it carefully, as if he could sense something from the eyes of the jade head.","What he did not realize was that a seven-star system between his eyebrows had started to flow slowly.","One pair of eyes was full of life, while the other gave off a determined light. They seemed to be staring at each other through time and space.","“Why, why do I have a familiar feeling ...”","Jian Wushuang withdrew his gaze and carefully took the jade head. After placing it in the Boyang Bottle, he let out a long breath.","He then left the unparalleled auction house with Di Qing, Zhao Ting, and Wei Liujia.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing had to sort out all the Heaven Crystals that the auction house had obtained today, so they all stayed.","Everything seemed to pass smoothly.","...","“Dammit! Damn trash, you actually dare to kill my right-hand man in front of me! Is he looking down on me and the entire Celestial Region?”","Within the misty Immortal clouds, ten figures that looked like flowing lights were flying up. The one leading them was the Celestial Region’s Zhang Chen. At this moment, he was grumbling and extremely furious.","“Young Master, please be careful with your words. This is still the territory of the Young Emperor,” a middle-aged Yan Immortal behind him wiped the cold sweat off his forehead and reminded him in a low voice.","“Bullsh*t, this is clearly my territory, the territory of the entire Celestial Region!” Zhang Chen gritted his teeth and said. “I never thought that Prince Yan would be the master of this Heavenly Region. It really makes me angry!”"]},{"number":4855,"title":"Chapter 4855 Cutting off Zhang Chen","paragraphs":["4855 Cutting off Zhang Chen","He spat again. “If I knew that it was Prince Yan who wanted to buy this place, I wouldn’t have sold it to him. I’d rather destroy it!”","Then, Zhang Chen seemed to have thought of something. He turned around and glanced at the remaining nine Yan Immortals behind him. “Don’t tell anyone about selling to Prince Yan. If that person finds out, our entire Heavenly Region will be in trouble!”","“I will go back and talk to my father. Let’s see if we can get this Heavenly Region back.”","The middle-aged Yan Immortal hurriedly reminded him, “Young Master, you can’t. We can’t afford to offend that person, and neither can we offend the Young Emperor. As long as he is still the Young Emperor, we can’t confront him.”","Zhang Chen’s eyes flashed with anger, and he immediately turned around and gave him a heavy slap. “Damn it, are you the Young Master of the Celestial Region or am I? Since when can you guys refute the ideas I’ve made?”","The middle-aged Yan Immortal covered his cheek.","Only then did Zhang Chen stop. He fell into deep thought again. I was wondering where Chen Qing and the others got so many supreme-grade pills when they went to buy the Heavenly Region from my father. So it turns out that Prince Yan is the mastermind behind this.","“In that case, I must quickly inform the Second Prince so that he can make a decision.”","He narrowed his eyes and made a decision in his heart.","At this moment, a light sound like the morning bell and evening drum sounded without warning.","“Who do you want to inform?”","Zhang Chen’s eyes suddenly darkened, and he almost instantly circulated the Yan power in his body.","Then, several figures appeared in front of him.","The leader was the Young Emperor!","His pupils shrunk to the size of needles in an instant, and he broke out in a cold sweat that was far more than before.","Now that the Young Emperor had appeared, it was obvious that he had heard everything he had said.","However, Zhang Chen was still making his final struggle. “N-no one will be informed. Young Emperor, you must have heard wrong.”","The Young Emperor smiled, his eyes unreadable. “How could I have misheard? the Second Prince you mentioned should be Prince Jiu, right?”","Zhang Chen’s body trembled and he waved his hands repeatedly. “N-no, that’s definitely not the case. Our Celestial Region is very far away from Prince Jiu’s Great Mi Heaven. How could we possibly know Prince Jiu?”","“I’m also very curious. Your Celestial Region is the closest to my Six Heavens Realm, so why are you willing to have a connection with the distant Great Mi Heaven? And why are you Prince Jiu’s dog?” The Young Emperor walked forward slowly and said lightly.","Zhang Chen was forced to retreat step by step, cold sweat continuously flowing down his face.","“Young Emperor, this is definitely a misunderstanding. Our Celestial Region has never had any contact with the Great Mi Heaven, not even a letter!”","The Young Emperor asked three questions in a row, “Tell me, should I believe you or not? and how should I believe you?”","Zhang Chen was slightly happy in his heart. Since he said so, then there was still a chance for things to turn around.","“Young Emperor, don’t worry. The entire Celestial Region is only willing to follow you. When I return, I’ll definitely mobilize my father to form an alliance with the Six Heavens Realm, giving it eternal dominion. We’ll follow your lead.”","“You’re right, but how can I be sure that you’re telling the truth? What if you go back and still do things your own way?” The Young Emperor shrugged. “So, for safety’s sake, you’d better stay here and don’t go back!”","As his voice fell, Cheng Qing, who was ten feet tall behind him, smiled and slowly stepped forward.","Zhang Chen focused his mind and accumulated the derived force technique in his hand.","“Follow me and kill our way out!” he shouted suddenly, and the vast Yan power light beam shot directly at the Young Emperor.","However, a True Sword surrounded by Yan power directly shattered his attack.","Cheng Qing’s eyes were filled with killing intent. He raised his True Sword high and began to slash down.","At the same time, the four purple-robed Yan Immortals also moved, surrounding Zhang Chen and attacking him.","The nine Yan Immortals he brought could only defend themselves before Chen Qing’s charge broke their formation and they were defeated one by one.","These Yan Immortals had only recently become Yan Immortals, and their Immortal roots had only just stabilized. How could they be Chen Qing’s opponent, who was about to step into the Grand Yan Immortal realm?","In just a few charges, Zhang Chen only had two Yan Immortals left.","After destroying one of the Yan Immortals’ Immortal Source, Chen Qing smiled and walked towards him like a god of death.","Zhang Chen’s face was ashen. He had never thought that the Yan Immortals he had brought with him, who were almost all Elders of the Celestial Region, could not even last ten rounds against the Young Emperor.","He had nowhere to retreat, and the last middle-aged Yan Immortal beside him was shaking like a leaf. He could not even think.","Seeing this, Zhang Chen knelt down in the clouds. “Y-Young Emperor, please let me go. As long as I can go back, the entire Celestial Region will be yours.”","The Young Emperor walked up to him slowly with a soft sword in his hand.","“Stick out your tongue.”","Zhang Chen, who was begging for mercy, was stunned and subconsciously did as he was told.","Then, he felt a chill in his mouth, and divine blood spurted out. Half of his tongue had been cut off.","“There are some things that should be said and some that can’t be said. You humiliated me, but it doesn’t warrant the death penalty. So, I only need half of your tongue to give you a warning.”","Zhang Chen bowed repeatedly, his mouth mumbling.","“But you’ve provoked someone you shouldn’t have, and that’s enough to be fatal.”","As the Young Emperor spoke, he waved his hand, and a head was cut off, along with the broken Immortal Source.","His eyes, which had already turned gray, were filled with confusion. Even in his death, Zhang Chen did not know who he had offended.","Using his sword, he threw Zhang Chen’s head to Chen Qing. The Young Emperor said, “Give this head to Brother Jian and make him happy.”","“That’s right, you have to explain to him that Zhang Chen’s head was personally cut off by me.”","Cheng Qing chuckled and nodded, “I understand, Young Emperor. You’re trying to make Brother Jian happy.”","“Shut up,” the Young Emperor put away his soft sword and said. “Brother Jian is my brother. Humiliating him is humiliating me. I don’t care if Zhang Chen dies. If there’s another one like Zhang Chen, I’ll kill him as well.”","Cheng Qing nodded and said, “That’s right, Young Emperor. Zhang Chen is the only son of the Sect Master of the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect. If you kill him just like that, I’m afraid that the Celestial Region will send someone to question you.”","“They’re just a mere lackey of the Celestial Region. I think it’s only a matter of turning my hand to exterminate them. The reason why I’m keeping them still is because I’m feeling compassionate.”","“If they dare to send someone to inquire about Zhang Chen, it’ll be a good excuse. By then, I’ll definitely exterminate all the Heavenly Sects in the Celestial Region to deter those who want to follow Prince Jiu. I’ll let them understand who’s the Master.”"]},{"number":4856,"title":"Chapter 4856 I’m Going to Shangyang From the Eastern Capital","paragraphs":["4856 I’m Going to Shangyang From the Eastern Capital","He then looked at the Immortal cloud in the distance. Prince Jiu’s Amitabha is in chaos now. It seems that it’s time for me to take action.","...","The Immortal clouds were misty. Although Jian Wushuang had already put the jade-like head into his bag, he was still thinking about where the strange feeling he had felt when he looked at the jade-like head earlier came from.","“Could it be that we’ve known each other for a long time?”","Jian Wushuang quickly shook his head and denied it. He had not even reached ten million years of age and all his old friends were in the Divine Power Universe.","The Great Yan Domain was new and unknown to him. Only Xuan Yi and Old Master were here.","After spending some time in the Great Yan Domain, Jian Wushuang was certain that Xuan Yi and Old Master were in the Great Yan Domain. They could only be here.","This was because the Great Yan Domain was simply too vast and encompassing. It was beyond one’s imagination.","The countless connections that they had left behind all pointed to the only ultimate realm, the Great Yan Domain.","They collected their thoughts, and the four figures steadily shuttled through the clouds.","At that moment, a figure caught Jian Wushuang’s attention.","It was a figure in a loose black robe, moving forward at a constant speed.","Jian Wushuang only took a glance and then looked away. After all, there were many Yan Immortals traveling in ordinary Heavenly Regions, but they were just passing by.","But very quickly, after experiencing a period of continuous ascension, he discovered that something was wrong.","The figure in the loose black robe had been hanging not far away, unable to get close or far away. It was extremely strange.","Then, Jian Wushuang suddenly thought of something.","During the auction, a mysterious person presented a jade head to the auction.","Due to time constraints, no one paid attention to the appearance of the mysterious person who had presented the jade head.","“Could it be that the mysterious person is the black-robed figure in front?” Jian Wushuang pondered and suddenly had a strong intuition.","“It should be him!”","As Jian Wushuang thought of this, his body also burst out and swept away.","Strangely enough, with a single thought, he instantly appeared behind the black-robed figure.","He wanted to reach out to touch him, but he was shocked to find that he could not even touch a piece of his clothes.","“Which small fry dares to touch my remaining power?!”","A thunderous roar reverberated in Jian Wushuang’s ears.","However, Jian Wushuang was not afraid. With a wave of his arm, he threw out hundreds of Yan power ribbons and blocked the black-robed figure’s way out.","Then, the black-robed figure really stopped. With his back facing Jian Wushuang, he said in a low voice, “Small Fry, why are you blocking my way?”","“I don’t want to block your way. I just want to confirm one thing,” Jian Wushuang said in a clear voice. “Is the jade head in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House yours?”","The black-robed figure continued in a deep voice, “So what if I am? so what if I am not? Don’t delay my journey, Little One.”","“If that’s the case,” Jian Wushuang shrugged his shoulders and then without any warning, he burst out, “Then I’ll test your strength first!”","A little light circulated from his fingertips.","Little Mountain River, come forth!","Divine mountains grew out of the clouds and blocked his way. At the same time, countless heavenly flames fell down like meteors.","A turbulent heavenly river swept up and instantly devoured the black-robed figure.","This was an Immortal Style that belonged to Jian Wushuang. As long as he was in the realm that he wanted, he could use all mountains and rivers. After the battle of Great Mi heaven, the Immortal Style, Little Mountain River, had undergone great changes. It could now call out anything he wanted, and its power had increased by many times.","Jian Wushuang stood where he was and watched the changes in the realm. He was extremely calm and did not seem to be worried about the Yan Immortal’s safety.","A moment later, the clouds stopped and the rain stopped. A terrifying suction force like a whale sucked in all the changes in the world.","The black-robed figure was the one who created the vortex.","“Hmph, what a Small Fry.”","The black-robed figure easily fused all the changes into a pellet-sized ball and then shot toward Jian Wushuang.","His gaze focused, and he immediately made a move to resolve it.","In just one exchange, Jian Wushuang could feel that the black-robed man was not simple.","Furthermore, the black-robed figure did not seem to be angered by him and did not make any further moves.","“Small Fry, since you managed to bid for that jade head, it means that you have fate with me. Today, I will give you a few pointers.”","“Some things have gone far beyond the scope of your understanding. It’s a level that you shouldn’t touch. It’s not too late to retreat now, so that you won’t regret it in the future and be powerless to turn things around.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Instead, he fixed his eyes on the black-robed figure, who did not reveal any special features.","“You, who exactly are you? What do you mean by this?”","“I’m sure you already know what I mean. There are some things that shouldn’t be handled by you in the first place, but you’ve already entered the situation and caused everything to fall into the unknown.” The black-robed figure said no more.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned. Then he asked anxiously, “Who are you? who sent you to tell me this? Xuan Yi or Old Master? Xuan Yi or Old Master!?”","The black-robed figure was silent. “You dishonorable man, I have no idea what you mean by those things. Everything I’m doing now has no meaning. It’s up to you whether you want to listen or not.”","“We’ve only met by chance, so there’s no point in talking about it. Don’t waste my time... I’m in a hurry.”","With that, he turned around and prepared to leave.","Jian Wushuang came back to his senses and asked loudly, “Can you tell me where you are going?”","Black robe’s figure stopped in place, his back facing him, and he left behind his last words.","“I’ve going to Shangyang from the Eastern Capital.”","Then, he disappeared. Like a wisp of smoke and dust, he scattered into the Immortal cloud and disappeared.","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, “Shangyang from the Eastern Capital... Eastern Capital, Shangyang, are these the names of Heavenly Regions, or do they have other meanings?”","“What are you daydreaming about? You’ve been mumbling here?” Di Qing’s voice was like a big hand that pulled him back to reality.","“Eh? Something’s not right, why am I still here? We haven’t left?”","He was shocked. He took half a step back and looked straight ahead.","In front of him, the jade-like head was still quietly placed in the crystal cover. The jade-like eyes revealed a firm and carefree light.","In the side hall of the auction house, Di Qing, Chun Qiu, cui Jing, Zhao Ting, and Wei Liujia were all standing behind Jian Wushuang, looking at him with doubt.","“I... Have I never left?”","“Then what happened just now?”"]},{"number":4857,"title":"Chapter 4857 The Envoy From the Celestial Region","paragraphs":["4857 The Envoy From the Celestial Region","Everything was too unbelievable.","It was like a dream, but it was so real that Jian Wushuang could not believe which side was the real world.","“It turns out that I really never left...”","Looking at the real scene in front of him, he suddenly realized that Di Qing and the others were not with him when he was talking to the black-robed figure in the clouds.","“Could it be the eyes of this jade head that dragged me into that illusion?” Jian Wushuang was deep in thought. He reached out his hand and touched the space in front of him. The crystal cover then sank and disappeared.","His fingertips felt a warm touch, but at the same time, it conveyed a deathly stillness without the aura of life.","“Shangyang from the Eastern Capital...”","He murmured softly. The short words were as clear as if they were engraved in his mind.","Who was the black-robed figure in the illusion, and why did he say those words to him?","Could it be that Xuan Yi or Old Master had sent him to warn them?","Jian Wushuang was moved. The more he thought about it, the closer he felt he was to the truth.","Coming to the Great Yan Domain was definitely the right choice! Everything would be known here.","He reached out and retrieved the jade head that did not have any life aura. After carefully putting it into the Boyang Bottle, he breathed a sigh of relief.","In the past few years, he had unknowingly fallen into two grotesque and variegated dreamlands, which made him even more cautious.","The first time was in Great Mi Heaven, where he was inexplicably dragged into a strange illusion. The second time had just happened. Both scenes were extremely real, as if they were foreshadowing something.","Everything seemed to be unrelated, but it was like a cage that was covered in layers.","After that, Jian Wushuang left the auction house with Di Qing, Zhao Ting, and Wei Liujia. Chun Qiu and Cui Jing stayed behind to check on the sales.","The Heavenly Region where the Eternal Wushuang Auction House was located used to be called Zhi Jing, and it was the territory of a Heavenly Sect that included seven Heavenly Regions.","This Heavenly Sect was called the Celestial Region. Although it was not a top force in the vast Great Si Region, it was still a tyrant.","That Yan Immortal named Fujie, who had a horsetail whisk, had once participated in a banquet in the Heavenly Court and was later killed by Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor... He was an Elder in that Celestial Region.","There were even rumors that the Sect Master of the Celestial Region, Zhang Tian, had broken through to the Grand Yan Immortal in a few years.","As a result, the power of the Celestial Region had been growing steadily, and it had even had many conflicts with the Young Emperor’s Six Heavens Realm.","After returning to Little Lonely Heaven in the Six Heavens Realm from the auction house, Jian Wushuang hurriedly took out the jade head from the Boyang Bottle and looked at it on the table, trying to find some clues.","After that, Cheng Qing also returned to Little Lonely Heaven. He was full of joy and was holding a bulging cloth bag in his hand.","“Brother Jian, look at what I brought back for you.” He grinned and put the cloth bag on the desk in front of Jian Wushuang.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","Cheng Qing smiled secretly and opened the cloth bag, revealing a head with disheveled hair and eyes that had long lost any luster.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He recognized the head. It was the fellow who had talked back to him at the peerless auction house.","“You killed them?”","“I didn’t kill him. The Young Emperor did it himself.” Chen Qing scratched his head. “The Young Emperor said that humiliating you was the same as humiliating him, so he cut off his head and sent it to Brother Jian as an apology.”","Jian Wushuang sighed. He understood that although the boy was arrogant, it was not enough to kill him.","However, the Young Emperor had taken this opportunity to kill him and send him here as an apology for what had happened not long ago.","This brat had died unjustly.","After taking one last look at the head that had died with its eyes open, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and sent it to Chen Qing’s hand, “I understand. Find a mountain forest and bury him.”","Cheng Qing nodded, then turned around and flew out of the hall.","Di Qing then sat down, looked at him, and said playfully, “It seems that the Young Emperor treats you well.”","“It’s just an ordinary relationship,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","Di Qing did not say anything more, found a place, and fell asleep.","In the battle between him and Changfu at the Great Mi Heaven, Di Qing had lost another True Life. Both his strength and cultivation realm had dropped a lot, and he would be in a weak state before he fully recovered.","He originally had nine True Lives, but now he only had seven left.","Although Di Qing did not show it, Jian Wushuang could still feel his loneliness and disappointment.","Time passed by slowly.","Dozens of days later, an emissary suddenly came to the Heavenly Palace of the Young Emperor’s Big Lonely Heaven.","The messenger was wearing a green robe, and on his chest, he used golden thread to draw the character ‘Immortal’. His posture was quite extraordinary.","He came to the Heavenly Palace and met the Young Emperor with a neutral expression.","“Your Highness, the son of our Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect, Zhang Chen, was invited to the Eternal Wushuang Auction House half a month ago. It has been half a month since we last saw him. I wonder if Your Highness could tell us where Zhang Chen is so that we can return and give an explanation to the Sect Master.”","The Young Emperor glanced at him and waved his hand. “Get lost. He’s just a son of a Heavenly Sect. How would I know where he is?”","The green-robed envoy’s expression was calm as he cupped his hands and said, “Your Highness, you must know it. Who doesn’t know that the Eternal Wushuang Auction House was established by Your Highness? Zhang Chen’s disappearance in your territory must be related to this.”","Hearing this, the Young Emperor slowly sat up from the bed and his eyes gradually turned cold. “Wo what if the auction house is now under my jurisdiction? Do you think I’ll remember the names of some random person?”","The green-robed envoy’s expression changed slightly, and a hint of humiliation and anger flashed in his eyes. “Your Highness, Zhang Chen is the son of the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect, not some random cat or dog. I would like to ask Your Highness to investigate and let me return to report.”","“Are you threatening me?!” The Young Emperor stood up and his Yan power surged. The indescribable pressure made the green-robed emissary half-kneel in the hall.","The humiliation in his eyes deepened, but he did not dare to show it. “I don’t dare. It’s just that the Sect Master is too eager to see his son. If he doesn’t see Zhang Chen again, I’m afraid he will do something.”","“Do something? Are you going to be a dog for Great Mi Heaven, or are you going to confront me?”","The Young Emperor slowly came in front of him, and the sneer in his eyes became even colder. “Do you think a small sect can put pressure on me?”","“So what if I tell you? I killed him with my own hands, and his head was also chopped off. What can your Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sects do to me?”","The green-robed envoy trembled and his face turned pale. He looked up at the Young Emperor in disbelief."]},{"number":4858,"title":"Chapter 4858 The Temporary Heavenly Official","paragraphs":["4858 The Temporary Heavenly Official","He could not believe that the son of the Celestial Region had already been killed, and the instigator was still so indifferent, not acknowledging Celestial Region at all.","“Y-Your Highness, aren’t you afraid that the entire Heavenly Sect of the Celestial Region will fight you to the death?” the green-robed envoy said with a trembling voice, his eyes revealing a pained expression.","The Young Emperor smiled. “Even if there were ten more of you, I wouldn’t be afraid, let alone one.”","“Alright, alright, since you’re not afraid, then...”","Before he could finish his sentence, he was caught by the thin purple robe in the dark and his Immortal Source was crushed.","Like a handful of ashes, the green-robed envoy died.","“You’re really noisy,” the Young Emperor slowly turned around and sat on the bed again.","With one hand supporting his head, he reached into his clothes with the other hand and took out a pill that emitted a rainbow light.","After a long time, he said, “My friend, how do you think Jian Wushuang got his hands on this pill?”","The skinny purple-robed man walked forward slowly. “Your Highness, everyone has their own secrets. Before he tells you, don’t ask him.”","“I understand. Go and call Wushuang over and we will discuss our plan together. Although I don’t put the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect in my eyes, I think that a bloody battle is inevitable. We must minimize the losses.”","The skinny purple-robed man acknowledged, then turned around and left.","The Young Emperor fell silent as he looked at the mysterious pill in his hand.","“Wushuang, Wushuang, when will I be able to see through your thoughts?”","...","As the misty night approached, Jian Wushuang stepped on the air and his shoulders were soaked in the misty rain.","“Brother Jian, you’ve come.”","The Young Emperor seemed to have been waiting for a long time. He walked towards him with a black cloak in his arms and was about to put it on.","Jian Wushuang stopped him and just took the cloak.","He went straight to the point. “The brat you killed was the son of a Heavenly Sect in a Celestial Region?”","“That’s right,” the Young Emperor nodded. “The power of the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect is not bad even in the Great Si Region. After several years of development, there are many people who have reached the peak of the Yan Immortal stage.”","As he spoke, he told Jian Wushuang about the ins and outs of the matter and the connection between the Great Mi Heaven.","In the end, he looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “If we don’t completely destroy them this time, I’m afraid that Zhang Tian will lead the entire Celestial Region to join Prince Jiu’s Great Mi Heaven.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak. He seemed to be thinking about something. “If we start a war this time, we must be prepared to completely destroy that Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect?”","“That’s right. Once we start a war, it means a declaration of war against everything I do. I cannot and will not tolerate it.” As the Young Emperor spoke, he placed his palm gently on his arm. “Brother Jian, help me.”","“Alright,” Jian Wushuang agreed.","Killing Zhang Chen was the critical point of the war. No matter what the Young Emperor’s thoughts were, it was all for him.","The Young Emperor cupped his hands and smiled. “Thank you, Brother Jian.”","“When?”","“It could take half a year or several months. We need to prepare in advance. He said, “My Yan Immortals have been intercepted again and again. To date, there are less than 100 of them. They can’t take it anymore.”","“That’s why I’d like to ask Brother Jian to take up the position of Great Heavenly Official and crush them all into pieces!”","Jian Wushuang was about to refuse the title, but the Young Emperor stopped him. “Brother Jian, please take up the position of Great Heavenly Official, but it’s only temporary. You’ll be in charge of 60 Yan Immortals, so you must take up the position. After the battle, you can resign at any time.”","“Alright, I’ll be there when the time comes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave.”","“Brother Jian, what happened a few days ago was my fault. I’m here to apologize.”","As the Young Emperor spoke, he suddenly pulled out the soft sword from his waist and slashed at his left arm.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to stop the sword from falling. “If you have the strength, you should deal with the upcoming crisis. Injuries are inevitable. If you continue to stick to this, you will be lacking in bearing.”","After he finished speaking, he turned around and left the Heavenly Palace.","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s back, the Young Emperor’s eyes flashed with an unknown meaning.","After a while, he lowered his head and looked at his right wrist. He had a strange feeling, as if he was sensing something.","...","A few months passed in a flash. The originally peaceful Six Heavens Realm had also fallen into some kind of turmoil. Even Yan power in the void was somewhat restless.","Nearly half a year later, dozens of powerful figures that were like flowing lights swept over from the void.","Then, before the void of the Six Heavens Realm, the dozens of figures began to use Yan power to quickly draw out ripples in the void.","He was building a large-scale teleportation formation!","Standing on the dome of the Heavenly Palace of the Big Lonely Heaven, the Young Emperor stood with his hands behind his back. Behind him stood nearly 60 Yan Immortals with powerful auras, as well as the top army that covered the sky like a black fog.","This was his foundation.","“Invite the Great Heavenly Official over,” he said.","“Your Highness, Heavenly Official Jian has arrived,” the skinny violet-robed man said in a low voice.","The world was silent as five figures broke through the Immortal clouds.","The gazes of all the Yan Immortals and top cultivators were attracted.","The leader was Jian Wushuang, dressed like a black-robed paladin, with a determined and indifferent attitude.","Behind him, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and Wei Liujia stood side by side, each of them with a profound and majestic aura.","“Is this the Great Heavenly Official that the Young Emperor personally appointed a few days ago? Doesn’t she look a little too young and tender?”","“No, there has never been a Great Heavenly Official in the entire Six Heavens Realm. right? The Young Emperor has never done that before...”","“Who cares? we’ll see what happens on the battlefield. How can a Great Heavenly Official be mediocre?”","Jian Wushuang did not pay much attention to the whispers and walked quickly to the Young Emperor.","“Greetings, Heavenly Official Jian!”","Nearly 60 Yan Immortals and countless top cultivators shouted at the same time, their voices shaking the Nine Heavens.","Facing such a formation, Jian Wushuang was calm and composed. He solemnly cupped his hands in greeting.","The Young Emperor smiled and pointed forward. “Brother Jian, take a look.”","Looking over, they saw an Immortal formation forming in front of the void gate of the Six Heavens Realm.","With such an Immortal formation, it was definitely going to be a bloody battle!","As the Immortal formation was completed, a total of 30 Yan Immortals released their Yan force at the same time to activate the Immortal formation!","The pillar of light pierced through the sky, as if a dusty gate to heaven had been opened.","As countless lights rose, the army of top cultivators walked out of the Immortal formation like dark clouds. The killing intent was almost tangible.","The Young Emperor shouted, “From now on, all Yan Immortals here must obey the orders of the Great Heavenly Official. Anyone who disobeys will die on the battlefield.”","“Yes!” all the Yan Immortals acknowledged. The atmosphere in the void was extremely heavy."]},{"number":4859,"title":"Chapter 4859 Fighting Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect","paragraphs":["4859 Fighting Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect","This was a sect that spanned across several Heavenly Regions and had been around for countless years. Its Foundation was extremely terrifying, and it was evident from the fact that it dared to fight against the son of the legendary Emperor.","With the dark cloud-like top cultivators and the continuous appearance of dozens of Yan Immortals, it could be expected that this would be a situation where one would have to die.","“Next, I’ll have to trouble Brother Jian to fight with me,” the Young Emperor said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked forward.","As countless top cultivators and Yan Immortals walked out of the Immortal formation, the void turned into a battlefield.","Just as the Immortal formation was about to close, a towering figure riding on a Heavenly Steed stepped out with a golden spear in his hand!","With his appearance, the indescribable momentum was rising.","“That’s the leader of the Heavenly Sect in the Celestial Region, Zhang Tian. A long time ago, he was at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage,” the Young Emperor said softly.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Then, without any hesitation, he stepped onto the air and rushed forward like a star.","Then, Chen Qing and the others brought all the Yan Immortals and left the Six Heavens Realm.","As soon as he stepped into the void, a violent wind tore and galloped.","The towering figure mounted on the heavenly steed also stepped through the air. Without a word, he made a full circle with the golden spear in his hand, and like an arrow nocked on a bow, he suddenly threw the golden spear!","The golden spear trembled and pierced through the air. Its target was Jian Wushuang, who was a million miles away in an instant!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and his aura suddenly became menacing!","Then, he raised his right hand and pointed with a finger.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River!","It was as if there was an unsurpassable power of a supreme divine peak. In addition to the fierce surging power of the giant water, the green and black colors coexisted and surged at Jian Wushuang’s fingertips, forming a ward.","The two collided, and an unparalleled explosion erupted.","At this moment, both Yan Immortals and the top cultivators covered their eyes with their arms.","The golden spear went berserk and was as unstoppable as a divine dragon. However, after it touched the barrier, it was unable to move forward.","Although there was a sudden explosion, everything was within Jian Wushuang’s control.","As the light faded, the golden spear finally landed in his hand.","The towering figure of the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect Master, Zhang Tian, looked at this scene with a serious expression.","He had underestimated his enemy. He originally wanted to kill a group of Yan Immortals to boost the morale of his side, but he never thought that there would be a Yan Immortal who could catch his attack. Moreover, it seemed that he was not injured at all.","One must know that his spear could pierce through an ordinary Heavenly Region. Even Yan Immortals of the same realm could only avoid it. No Yan Immortal had ever dared to face it.","But now, not only did his attack not work, but he actually caught his spear.","This Yan Immortal, who was able to stand at the forefront, was definitely not ordinary.","Looking at the quivering spear in his hand, Jian Wushuang said loudly, “If this is all you have, you should go back.”","Zhang Tian’s face darkened, and killing intent burst out from his eyes. “Go back? Who will pay for my son’s life? Even if I have to die today, I’ll make Prince Yan pay the price and suffer the consequences!”","“Prince Yan, you cowardly rat! Come out and pay for my son’s death!”","Prince Yan followed after Jian Wushuang and stood side by side with him.","He looked at Zhang Tian with a faint smile. “Only a fool would do something stupid. You should know how many times I’ve warned you in the open and in the dark, but you’ve never taken it to heart.”","“The reason why your son Zhang Chen is where he is today, other than his own fault, is also related to your actions.”","Hearing this, Zhang Tian said in pain, “But even so, you shouldn’t have killed him! I’ve endured Fujie’s death in the Heavenly Court, but the consequences of Zhang Chen’s death will definitely be a fight to the death between the entire Celestial Region and you!”","The Young Emperor slowly raised the corners of his mouth, “So what? I’ve been waiting for this day for a long time. I’d like to see how good Prince Jiu’s dogs are at biting people.”","Zhang Tian was so angry that he laughed. “Fine, fine. Even if I die today, I’ll take you, Prince Yan, with me!”","As he spoke, he suddenly drew the True Sword hanging on his waist. “All sects in the Celestial Region, listen up! Kill all of Prince Yan’s forces and leave no one alive!”","The void trembled, and the bloody battle began!","Almost at the same time, Jian Wushuang said loudly, “All Yan Immortals, form six columns and fight with me!”","The 60 over Yan Immortals split into six rows.","Jian Wushuang led a group, Young Emperor Prince Yan led another group, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and Wei Liujia each led a group. They spread out and surrounded the enemy as they charged forward.","Jian Wushuang was like an unparalleled True Sword, carrying a great power that could cut through the ages, and he hacked into the formation in front of him!","Pushing out with both palms, the unparalleled force forced the 20 Yan Immortals to take a few steps back.","Then, Chen Qing’s True Sword arrived and shattered a Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source. At the same time, he charged forward fearlessly with his mountain-like body.","Chun Qiu wielded a short black dagger and had the support of the eight-armed Arhat puppet. He was also extremely fast.","Cui Jing had always been fierce and combative. Even in the Sand Demon Cave, he was able to take charge of one side when he was in the Ancestor-level cultivation realm. Now that he had recovered to the strength of a Yan Immortal, his fierceness had not decreased. On the contrary, he was the most destructive existence besides Chen Qing.","As for Wei Liujia, his realm and strength had just recovered. Naturally, he could not gain any benefits from the bloody battle. If it were not for Jian Wushuang’s help from time to time, he would have died on the spot.","In fact, at the beginning, when Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others wanted to come together, Jian Wushuang did not agree. However, under their incessant coaxing and pestering, he finally let them come.","Di Qing’s True Life was damaged and his strength had not recovered yet. He was placed in Little Lonely Heaven by Jian Wushuang to rest. Zhao Ting was too uncontrollable, so he did not let her come.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang brought the four of them.","It was a battle of more than a hundred Yan Immortals, it was extremely brutal.","After all kinds of moves were used, Immortal corpses with shattered Immortal sources fell one after another.","Jian Wushuang’s destructive power was too strong. He just reached out his hand and a Yan Immortal died.","He was invincible below Grand Yan Immortal!","With the support of the Immortal Style, Little Mountain River, no Yan Immortal could last several rounds with Jian Wushuang. He was already several times stronger than when he had attended the feast in the Heavenly Court.","He was moving forward with determination, and behind him was the Young Emperor, Chen Qing, and the others. They were full of unstoppable momentum.","He closed his five fingers and killed a Yan Immortal in front of him. Then, he looked at the towering figure sitting on the Heavenly Steed.","“If you don’t want to die, then retreat,” his voice passed through the earth-shaking battle and entered Zhang Tian’s ears."]},{"number":4860,"title":"Chapter 4860 The Fish Dies and the Net Breaks","paragraphs":["4860 The Fish Dies and the Net Breaks","Zhang Tian’s body trembled slightly as he looked at the young Yan Immortal walking towards him. He felt an indescribable pressure.","Jian Wushuang held an Invisible Sword in his right hand and a three-meter-long golden spear in his left hand, which was full of intimidating power.","Even the Yan Immortals who were in the middle of the chaotic battle, intentionally or unintentionally, kept their distance from this god of killing, creating a path for him.","However, very quickly, Zhang Tian’s eyes were filled with hatred and madness. “My son, Zhang Chen, died for no reason. As his father, can’t I even take revenge?! Even if Prince Yan is the Young Emperor, I’ll get justice for him today!”","“You won’t be able to get justice. Take the remaining forces and retreat to recuperate,” Jian Wushuang said. “Zhang Chen deserved his death.”","“How dare you say that? Who in the world would dare to convict my son!” he roared in anger and struck his palm directly at him.","The sky-covering palm formed by Yan power smashed down. Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and directly stabbed forward with his spear.","The two attacks collided, and layers of golden light surged.","His spear pierced through the sky-covering palm, but his momentum did not decrease. His entire body seemed to have become one with the spear in his hand. With an indomitable aura, he stabbed toward Zhang Tian!","Zhang Tian was secretly shocked, and the towering figure on the back of his Heavenly Steed almost subconsciously leaned back.","The long spear arrived, and the Heavenly Steed neighed.","With just one spear strike, the incomparably sharp tip of the spear pierced through the steed’s thick neck, completely embedding itself in it.","When the spear was only one finger away from Zhang Tian’s throat, it stopped.","The Heavenly Steed neighed one last time and dropped to the ground like a collapsing mountain.","Zhang Tian’s eyes were filled with regret as he flew off his Heavenly Steed. His hand gripped the blood-stained spear as he thrust it back.","Jian Wushuang blocked it at the right time and a violent boom resounded.","Zhang Tian’s spear attack was so powerful that Jian Wushuang felt a sharp pain in his palm.","“Don’t be Prince Yan’s accomplice anymore. Since you didn’t kill my son, leave now!” He held a long spear and went forward to fight with Jian Wushuang.","The void around him could not withstand the power and shattered.","One sword move released 3,000 Sword Intents, and the majestic sword move rose up to the sky. With an unstoppable momentum, it forced Zhang Tian to retreat.","Then, Jian Wushuang stood with his sword in hand, his eyes calm and deep.","“There are only two possibilities for those who go on the battlefield. One is to die in battle, and the other is to win. Which do you think I will choose?”","Zhang Tian’s expression turned serious as he looked straight at the man.","He could see many things from that gaze. It was determined, calm, and composed, as if everything was clear to him.","It felt as if they were all in the palm of their hands.","Who was this person? Even Prince Yan, the Prince, would listen to his orders on the battlefield?","He had a premonition that if they continued fighting like this, the Celestial Region would eventually shatter.","However, Zhang Tian was not willing to accept this. The death of his son, Zhang Chen, was like a thorn in his heart. He only had one son, and now that his son was dead, how could he shake hands and make peace with the enemy who killed his son?","He had already made up his mind that he would cut off a piece of Prince Yan’s flesh even if the Celestial Region was going to be shattered!","“I don’t care which type you are, all of you will die in battle today!” Zhang Tian shouted angrily as he raised the spear in his hand.","“The Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sects are not afraid of this war. Even if all of us fall, there will still be Last Flames left!”","The high-pitched voice was like thunder, pouring into the hearts of every Yan Immortal and top cultivator in the Celestial Region, and suddenly exploded with the fiercest counterattack!","Even if he was at the peak of the Ancestor-level, he would not be able to cause any effective damage to Yan Immortal, who had Immortal Source and Immortal roots.","Therefore, they made a move. Nearly 100 of them charged at the group of Yan Immortals as one, and then spontaneously self destructed their Life Source, causing a tragic explosion.","For a moment, the disadvantageous situation was alleviated.","The void shook and shattered.","Thousands upon thousands of top cultivators had broken their Life Source, which had already transcended their knowledge.","Even if Yan Immortals could still survive this explosion, after their minds were disturbed, it would be extremely easy for the Yan Immortals to destroy their Immortal Source.","The Yan Immortals from the Six Jeavens Realm and the Ancestor-level cultivators began to suffer casualties.","The 10 Yan Immortals on the outside were all killed in an instant, even the formation showed signs of collapsing.","“Wushuang, this is an emergency!” the Young Emperor sent a voice transmission, his voice anxious.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and a seven-star system quietly flowed between his eyebrows. Then, he suddenly raised his arms.","As he raised his palms, countless craggy divine mountains rose up from the void without any warning.","One, ten, a hundred!","Every divine mountain separated the originally ferocious Yan Immortals from the Celestial Region, leaving the Yan Immortal camp in the Six Heavens Realm breathing room.","Seeing this, Zhang Tian could not help but be shocked. If this young Yan Immortal was not killed, it would definitely have a great impact on the entire Celestial Region.","Thinking of this, he no longer hesitated. He pointed his spear forward and launched the fiercest attack on Jian Wushuang.","With the Invisible Sword in his hand, Jian Wushuang walked forward slowly. He was not afraid of Zhang Tian, who was half a body taller than Chen Qing and looked like a giant.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","First form, Star.","When the sky-breaking and brilliant move lit up, it meant that Jian Wushuang had started to get serious.","This sword move was the foundation of the entire Wushuang Sword Dao, and its original intention was to be majestic.","Zhang Tian, who had been charging over with his spear in hand, hurriedly switched from attack to defense when he saw this scene. He responded with all his might.","Hundreds of beams of light tore the void apart. With Zhang Tian as the leader, they exploded in the camp of the Celestial Region and forcibly tore open a hole.","“Full force charge!” Cheng Qing raised his True Sword high and roared, then he advanced forward.","The Young Emperor held a soft sword in his hand and continued to harvest Yan Immortal’s Immortal source that dared to approach.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing’s shoulders were pressed against each other, and with the eight-armed Arhat’s support, they were also charging forward.","Only Wei Liujia, who looked like a dejected scholar, seemed to be struggling during the battle. He was in danger several times, but he still gritted his teeth and walked toward Jian Wushuang.","The advantage of the Celestial Region was no longer there, and it was being forced back rapidly.","After the attack of the Sword Intent, Zhang Tian’s armor was damaged in several places.","Jian Wushuang did not stop at all. He held an Invisible Sword and flew into the void, fighting with him.","Jian Wushuang’s sword moves were majestic and each move was more powerful than the last.","Every time he slashed down, it was as if he was forging a Sword Embryo. Sparks flew everywhere, and his aura was overwhelming."]},{"number":4861,"title":"Chapter 4861 Selfless True Shadow","paragraphs":["4861 Selfless True Shadow","Under such an attack, Zhang Tian could only defend. He could not even counterattack.","He could only raise his spear to block the sword strikes one after another, feeling extremely aggrieved.","In just ten breaths, Jian Wushuang had slashed more than 36,000 times, causing divine blood to drip from Zhang Tian’s palm that was holding the spear.","He said calmly, “Release your Immortal Style. Otherwise, with your current situation, I’m afraid it will be extremely difficult for you to even protect yourself.”","Zhang Tian’s eyes flickered, and the aura around his body suddenly changed from the previous calm to sharp.","Tens of thousands of scarlet-golden rays burst out from the golden spear in his hand, bringing with it a majestic pressure.","Jian Wushuang was forced to retreat and his eyes were solemn.","“I don’t know how many years I’ve spent comprehending the Immortal Style, but I still swing my spear 3,000 times a day, all for the sake of this day.”","“In short, there’s a blood feud. No matter who tries to stop you, there’s only one outcome.”","Zhang Tian seemed to have become one with the spear in his hand, and a pillar of light that almost devoured the void shot up into the sky.","At this moment, the Great Dao order flowing in the void began to collapse.","My Immortal Style is called the ‘Wheel of Suffering’. You are not the first Yan Immortal you have seen, and you will definitely not be the last.","“At the same time, I also have a premonition that if you die under my Immortal Style. My Immortal Style will be integrated, and I will also step into the realm of Grand Yan Immortal.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and the Invisible Sword in his hand slanted. “It’s useless to say more. Come on.”","A golden pillar of light shot up into the sky, dispersing the violent wind in the air. Zhang Tian’s hair danced wildly behind his back, and the golden spear in his hand let out a clear cry. A golden wheel over a million feet tall materialized behind his back, emitting a powerful and untouchable aura.","“All Yan Immortals and peak cultivators, back off!” Jian Wushuang shouted loudly.","The Yan Immortals that were fighting did not hesitate and immediately retreated.","At this moment, Cheng Qing’s eyes turned serious. He could feel that even he would not be able to withstand Zhang Tian’s attack.","Can Jian Wushuang withstand it?","All of the Yan Immortals and top cultivators looked at this scene with serious expressions. This move would determine the outcome of the battle. No matter who won or lost, it was of utmost importance.","“Wheel of Suffering, cover the sky!”","With Zhang Tian’s roar, the light wheel behind him, which was more than a million feet tall, fell heavily. The void collapsed. All the top cultivators and even Yan Immortals were shocked to see this.","This light wheel was too vast. The moment it touched the ground, it covered millions of miles of the void. Even Yan Immortals would be destroyed by this Immortal Style.","Jian Wushuang stood still and looked at the descending light wheel with a calm gaze.","Buzz...","A bell-like hum resounded in the void, and the red-gold radiance seemed to devour everything in an instant.","The Young Emperor’s pupils suddenly shrank, and he subconsciously wanted to run forward.","Cheng Qing pulled him back. “Young Emperor, calm down. Brother Jian can’t just die like this.”","“Even if he can’t die like this, it’s too risky.” The Young Emperor took a deep breath and looked ahead.","As the million-foot halo of the Wheel of Suffering completely engulfed Jian Wushuang, Zhang Tian’s arm suddenly shook and he threw the long spear into the void.","In an instant, it split into 100,000 long spears, each of which was buzzing.","“Go!” he shouted.","100,000 long spears shattered the void and stabbed at the center of the Wheel of Suffering from all directions.","In the eyes of all the top cultivators, the outcome had already been decided.","Even the Sect Master of the Celestial Region, Zhang Tian, revealed a smile at this moment.","However, this smile froze before it could be fully revealed.","In the next moment, the 100,000 spear shadows stopped on the Wheel of Suffering, unable to move an inch forward.","Immediately after, a True Shadow that was also over a million feet tall appeared!","It was a True Shadow with long hair and eyes full of divine power. A seven-star system was slowly rotating between its eyebrows, which was determined and magnificent to the extreme.","It was Jian Wushuang’s True Shadow, the Selfless True Shadow.","Every time he breathed, it was like a reincarnation of the universe. His appearance was like the realization of the Heavenly Dao’s order, making Yan Immortals feel pressured.","Then, the magnificent True Shadow slowly stretched out its palm. With a light wave, the 100,000 spears suspended in the void were all destroyed.","Wheel of Suffering, which had restrained Jian Wushuang’s True Shadow, could not withstand the pressure and started to crack.","With an extremely dazzling light, the Wheel of Suffering was broken!","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals and top cultivators covered their eyes.","When the light dissipated, everything was dim.","The giant True Shadow looked down, and its eyes exuded a divine might. There was no joy or sorrow in them.","In his palm, a toothpick-sized golden spear had been broken into two.","All the surviving Yan Immortals and top cultivators of the Celestial Region subconsciously retreated, their faces ashen.","Zhang Tian’s expression changed again and again. His originally arrogant face had also lost all color.","Then, he suddenly opened his mouth and vomited a large mouthful of thick divine blood!","The destruction of his golden spear was related to his Immortal Source, and he had suffered an unimaginable blow!","The True Shadow dissipated slowly and Jian Wushuang descended from the sky.","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals and top cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm were extremely excited.","The Young Emperor raised the soft sword in his hand high and his voice resounded through the void. “Follow Heavenly Official Jian and charge!”","Jian Wushuang looked at Zhang Tian, who looked extremely dispirited, and threw the long spear that had been broken into two in front of him.","“You guys have already lost.”","Zhang Tian looked at him in a daze, not saying a word.","At this moment, a middle-aged Yan Immortal beside him suddenly took a step forward and said, “No, we didn’t lose!”","“The Celestial Region was formed when the Emperor first established the Great Si Region. It has a strong foundation, and it’s blessed with great fortune. It has been through many disasters and has not been destroyed. Even if it can’t defeat the Emperor today, it will be able to rise again in the future.”","Looking at the middle-aged Yan Immortal, who was neither humble nor arrogant despite the imminent disaster, Jian Wushuang could not help but think highly of him.","After saying that, the middle-aged Yan Immortal supported Zhang Tian and said softly, “Sect Master, the rest of the brothers will cover for you. You must return to the Celestial Region immediately and ask for help from the Emperor. Remember, only when you are alive can you achieve anything.”","Zhang Tian looked at him, but before he could say anything, he was pushed into the Immortal formation in the void. The Immortal formation disappeared.","After that, the middle-aged Yan Immortal pulled out his True Sword and faced Jian Wushuang without fear.","“What’s your name?”","“It doesn’t matter if I tell you. I’m going to die now. My name is Song Xin.”","“Not bad, I’ll remember you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and formed an Invisible Sword in his hand."]},{"number":4862,"title":"Chapter 4862 Annihilate the Celestial Region","paragraphs":["4862 Annihilate the Celestial Region","The Yan Immortal named Song Xin was beheaded by Jian Wushuang and his Immortal Source was shattered.","This was like the final beginning, marking the ultimate defeat of the revenge of the Heavenly Sects in the Celestial Region.","A total of 72 Yan Immortals from the Celestial Region, none of them survived, all of them perished.","With the death of Yan Immortals, the top cultivators from the Celestial Region all fled, fighting to be the first to escape into the teleportation array.","The broken void was covered with broken Immortal corpses and divine blood.","Standing in front of the Immortal array formation, Jian Wushuang stopped.","The Young Emperor, who was covered in divine blood, came to his side, his chest heaving.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Wei Liujia, and the others also rushed over, all in a sorry state.","The Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing still, and he understood something.","After a moment, he said softly, “Brother Jian, it wasn’t my intention to destroy the Celestial Region, but when Zhang Tian returns, he will definitely side with Prince Jiu. I’m afraid that the Six Heavens Realm will end up like the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.”","“The beginning of this battle means that it will not end well.”","After a long while, Jian Wushuang said, “Let’s go.”","The teleportation Immortal array formation built by the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sects could teleport tens of thousands of top cultivators at a time and was extremely stable.","When the remaining top cultivators of the Celestial Region fled back to the Celestial Region in a sorry state, they did not know that a doomsday had quietly come.","As the first Yan Immortal from the Six Heavens Realm stepped into the Celestial Region, the cold-blooded killing began.","Blood and fire erupted in the Celestial Region that spanned nearly ten Super Heavenly Regions.","Countless living beings were crushed into dust by the Yan Immortals.","The Heavenly Plates were destroyed, and the mountains and rivers were cut off.","Dark clouds loomed in the sky, and the sky began to rain.","There were nearly ten Super Heavenly Regions, including nearly 100 Heavenly Planes. Each plane was a world.","And in the aftermath of this battle, everything was shattered.","Chen Qing held a True Sword and destroyed a Heavenly Region all by himself.","However, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and Wei Liujia did not make a move. Instead, they stood quietly behind Jian Wushuang.","The entire Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sects were being destroyed rapidly.","Located on top of a tall divine mountain in the clouds, there was a quiet and secluded hall. It was the most mysterious place in the entire Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect, and it was the Dao Field of the entire sect.","However, it was already chaotic.","“Sect Master, let’s go. We have to leave quickly and seek refuge with the Second Prince!”","“As long as there’s life, there’s hope. Rather than living and dying with the Celestial Region, it’s better to leave as soon as possible and make plans!”","In the dim hall, more than ten Elders were anxiously discussing the figure that was half-lying in the hall.","That figure was Zhang Tian, who had escaped back to the Celestial Region. At this moment, he seemed to have aged to another state, and his eyelids were drooping.","After a long while, he said in a hoarse voice, “You guys can leave first. I’ll be there soon.”","All the Elders stopped talking. They looked at Zhang Tian with similar looks, but also uncertainties.","“Let’s go, it’ll be too late if we don’t.”","“Then Sect Master... We’ll go ahead first and be the vanguard for you.”","...","When the dark hall returned to silence, Zhang Tian slowly raised his eyes and looked outside the hall.","Six figures appeared and slowly stepped into the hall.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor walked in front and finally stood in front of him.","A sneer flashed in his eyes. “I really didn’t expect that the son of the Emperor would be so ruthless to a Heavenly Sect in the Celestial Region. You are indeed vengeful.”","“You only have yourself to blame for all of this. You should have expected this to happen when you started a war against me.”","“But is the price reasonable? It’s too heavy! You shouldn’t have destroyed my entire Celestial Region!” Zhang Tian said dejectedly. “I will destroy my Immortal Source now in exchange for the Celestial Region’s safety. How about it?”","The Young Emperor slowly squatted down and looked at him. He said slowly, “You must die. As for the Celestial Region, I will make it an existence that will not be a threat.”","Zhang Tian shuddered and closed his eyes as if he had accepted his fate. “Prince Yan, remember what I said. One day, you’ll make the same mistake as me!”","Jian Wushuang slowly turned around and walked out of the hall, no longer looking at the scene.","The Sect Master of a Heavenly Sect, Zhang Tian, had unraveled his Immortal Source and died.","The Young Emperor stood up and turned around. He looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression in his eyes.","With more than 40 Yan Immortals and countless Ancestor-level cultivators, the Heavenly Sects of the Celestial Region, which included nearly ten Heavenly Regions, had become a dead land and no longer posed any threat.","Walking on the scorched earth, Jian Wushuang did not say a word.","Just as they were about to leave, a half-grown figure suddenly ran out from a dilapidated wall. She was trembling, but she still stood firmly in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Did you... Did you destroy this place? did you kill my father?”","Chen Qing was about to wave his hand to disperse the dusty little girl, but he was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","Then he bent over slightly and looked at the little girl who was trying her best not to let her tears fall. He asked, “What’s your name?”","The little girl took half a step back and sniffed hard. “I won’t tell you. If I do, I’ll be killed.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “You have to remember that my name is Jian Wushuang. If you want to take revenge for what happened today, you can find me.”","After he finished speaking, he took Cheng Qing and the others and left the Celestial Region that had already been reduced to scorched earth.","Standing in the middle of the ruins, the little girl stared at Jian Wushuang’s back without blinking, as if she was trying to imprint all his characteristics into her mind.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll remember this. I’ll definitely kill you with my own hands in the future!”","...","When the Immortal array formation that connected the Six Heavens Realm was destroyed, the bloody battle ended.","There were more than 60 Yan Immortals under the Young Emperor, but they only lost about 20. This was a great victory, and compared to that Heavenly Sect, the losses were almost negligible.","The victory was won so quickly by Jian Wushuang’s power alone.","According to the Young Emperor’s previous plan, the 100 Yan Immortals under him would have been almost wiped out, and they would not have been able to crush the Heavenly Sects in the Celestial Region.","However, everything changed the moment Jian Wushuang joined the battle.","He had almost eliminated a dangerous place with minimal losses. This was undoubtedly adding fuel to the fire for Prince Jiu who was far away in the Great Mi Heaven.","...","In the Heavenly Palace, on the roof.","The Young Emperor sat on the glazed tiles, looking somewhere.","A skinny purple-robed figure appeared behind him.","“Da Ban, the results are pretty good, but I’m a little worried.”"]},{"number":4863,"title":"Chapter 4863 Changes in the Black Mountains","paragraphs":["4863 Changes in the Black Mountains","The skinny purple-robed man said, “Are you worried that Jian Wushuang will grow to the point where even you will be afraid of him?”","The Young Emperor nodded. “That’s right. I have a feeling that that day will come soon.”","“Your Highness, there’s no need to worry. Although I’ve only met him a few times, Your Highness must know that we’ve been together for decades.”","“I can’t guess his nature and personality, but I can see that he is very indifferent to seeking hegemony and the Emperor’s fate energy. He seems to have some purpose, like a passer-by, no one can guess what he is.”","The skinny purple-robed man slowly pulled down his hood, revealing a face full of wrinkles. he is an existence that can reverse any situation. His appearance will only benefit His Highness.","“I understand.” The Young Emperor nodded slightly. “But I have a feeling that he’s very mysterious, as if he came here from nowhere. It would be great if we knew his origin and weakness.”","“Your Highness, now is not the time to think about this. Since he has agreed to help you fight for the throne, you have to do your best to do some things in this time.”","The thin purple-robed man bowed slightly. “Now that the Fifth Prince Mo is dead and the Second Prince’s Great Mi Heaven has been destroyed, the situation has changed. I think the other princes will make their next move.”","“Those guys?” The Young Emperor sneered. “They’re just a bunch of motley crew.”","“There’s one more thing.”","“What’s the matter?”","Emperor Zhen Wuyang sent an envoy to invite the rest of the Princes to the Heavenly Court for a birthday banquet.","“Birthday banquet? I thought the Emperor never celebrates his birthday. Why did it have to be this Hua Year?”","“Perhaps it’s because of the Fifth Prince’s death.”","“How much more time do we have?”","“Three years.”","“Then let’s get ready, we’ll go to the Heavenly Court when the time comes.”","...","After returning to Little Lonely Heaven from the destroyed Celestial Region, Jian Wushuang sat in the center of the square in front of the hall.","He had vaguely touched the second from of the Immortal Style.","According to the guidance of the Stone Bead, there seemed to be a total of seven forms of the Immortal Styles.","The first form was called ‘Little Mountain River’.","As for the second form, he had comprehended it not long ago when he fought with Zhang Tian’s Immortal Style.","The True Shadow that was more than a million feet tall was different from the image form that appeared when Jian Wushuang released the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent. It was extremely unique.","When Jian Wushuang released his True Shadow, his Immortal body was empty and turned into nothing. However, his divine sense was still clear and coexisted with his True Shadow.","Moreover, with the support of the True Shadow state, all of his skills reached a transcendent level.","Therefore, after practicing the second Immortal Style tens of thousands of times in his divine sense, Jian Wushuang called it the Selfless True Shadow.","Now, he had two Immortal Styles in his hands, and his strength was even more unfathomable. He even had the thought of fighting against the Grand Yan Immortal, who was of a higher level.","However, after that battle, the number of Grand Yan Immortals in the entire Great Si Region could be counted with just one hand. Perhaps only Zhen Wuyang had a Grand Yan Immortal under him.","After consolidating the Ancestral Skills, Sword Dao, and Immortal Styles, Jian Wushuang started to meditate again.","Now that more than half of Great Mi Heaven had been destroyed, it would be as difficult as ascending to heaven to find Yin Ling again, and the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in her hand would probably not be seen again for a long time.","At present, Jian Wushuang was holding two pieces of Heaven-patterned Bone Armor, but he could not crack the secret text on them.","He planned to travel the world soon and find a great expert who could decipher the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor’s code.","Not long after he sat down, the entire Little Lonely Heaven and the hall trembled. Although it was very slight, everyone could still feel it.","Cheng Qing, who had been sleeping soundly on the roof, jumped down.","Chun Qiu and the others also ran out of the hall.","“What happened?” Cui Jing tightened his belt, his face solemn.","“Damn it, it can’t be that something has happened in the Lower Three Heavens.” Cheng Qing scratched his head.","“What can happen in the Lower Three Heavens? Could it be that the Lower Three Heavens will collapse from the digging?” Chun Qiu frowned slightly. He did not have a good impression of the Lower Three Heavens at all. In fact, he even wanted to destroy them.","Chen Qing did not hear the displeasure in his words and explained, “The situation that will occur in the Lower Three Heavens is much more serious than a collapse. Every time it happens, many prisoners will die. It’s quite troublesome.”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and looked at Chen Qing. He asked, “What will happen?”","When Cheng Qing heard this, he did not hide anything, “Black energy, it can devour Yan power. The deeper we mine the crystals of the Black Mountains, the more black energy is released from the excavation.”","“This black energy can devour Yan power. Even Yan Immortals can only wait for death when they come into contact with this black energy. It’s extremely terrifying.”","“But fortunately, not much black energy was excavated. As long as it is sealed in time, it will not be a big problem.”","“However, such a situation would never have happened before. I don’t know what’s going on in the past few years, but everything is getting more and more chaotic.”","Jian Wushuang did not think too much about it and prepared to continue meditating.","However, just then, several figures like flowing lights entered Little Lonely Heaven and came directly in front of him.","The leader was the Young Emperor, and his expression changed slightly.","“Brother Jian, there’s something going on in the Lower Three Heavens. I’d like to invite you to go and have a look.”","Cheng Qing was also anxious. “Something has happened in the Lower Three Heavens again? Didn’t it just calm down a few days ago?”","The Young Emperor shook his head. “I’m afraid this is the most dangerous one.”","“Then let’s go together,” Cheng Qing said and took the lead to fly out.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “Let’s go and take a look.”","The Young Emperor nodded and led the way.","At this moment, Chun Qiu came behind Jian Wushuang and whispered, “I’ll go too.”","“This time, you don’t have to go. Just stabilize your Immortal Source.” Jian Wushuang patted his shoulder and then stepped onto the air.","He flew out of Little Lonely Heaven and under the guidance of the Young Emperor, he began to fly towards the Lower Three Heavens.","The Six Heavens Realm that the Young Emperor was in charge of was the Black Mountain territory. Countless prisoners were in charge of extracting the Black Mountain Crystals.","When he first entered the Great Yan Domain, Jian Wushuang had been trapped and inexplicably became a prisoner for half a day. As a result, he was extremely repulsed by the entire Lower Three Heavens.","This time, it was the first Heavenly Region of the Lower Three Heavens.","He learned from the Young Emperor that the first Heavenly Region had gone through great changes. Almost all the prisoners and supervisors in charge of mining crystals had been swallowed by the black energy that came out of the abyss.","The entire first Heavenly Region became a dead zone."]},{"number":4864,"title":"Chapter 4864 Black Abyss Prison","paragraphs":["4864 Black Abyss Prison","Cheng Qing’s expression was extremely grave. He naturally knew the severity of this matter.","He had been the one to deal with the black energy that had burst out of the Black Mountains several times before. Each time, the scale of the black energy was extremely small. At most, it had only devoured an entire batch of prisoners and supervisors.","However this time, the black energy had devoured all the living beings in the Heavenly Region!","From this alone, one could see how serious the situation was.","Thinking of this, he reminded Jian Wushuang, “Brother Jian, the black energy can easily be contaminated by Yan power. Once it’s contaminated, it’s difficult to get rid of it. So, when we reach the place later, try not to use Yan power if you can.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and looked through the void at the Heavenly Region that was emitting dark energy.","As soon as he stepped into the first Heavenly Region of the Lower Three Heavens, an indescribable, rotten aura of death hit him in the face.","As far as the eye could see, there were layers of Black Mountain that stretched out to the end of the horizon.","The dark clouds devoured every inch of space, making it hazy and chaotic to the extreme.","The four figures all withdrew their Yan power and walked forward step by step.","Both the Young Emperor and Cheng Qing looked like they could not bear it, as if they were being suppressed by some unknown force.","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang looked calm, as if he was not affected at all.","As he walked in the sky that was high up in the clouds, the aura of death was dense.","The corpses of prisoners could be seen everywhere. They were all sprawled on the ground, and when the wind blew, they all turned into black dust. It was extremely strange.","“Young Emperor, it seems like the first Heavenly Region has been completely destroyed.” Cheng Qing looked ahead and said. “If that’s the case, I’m afraid it’ll be extremely difficult to find the source.”","The Young Emperor who was walking in front did not say anything. He also felt that it was tricky. This was the first time he had encountered such a situation.","He had taken over the Black Mountain area in the Lower Three Heavens since he was young, and there had been no bad signs.","However, in the past few years, black energy had started to appear in the Black Mountain area. Each time, the black energy did not appear in a large area, only spreading to one of the Black Mountains.","However, today, the black energy that came out of nowhere had devoured an entire Heavenly Region, and none of the living beings here survived.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, who had been silent all this while, said, “I think we should be able to find the source by following the direction of the prisoners’ corpses on the ground.”","The Young Emperor looked over and saw the corpses of the prisoners lying on the ground. They were like a path that stretched into the distance.","“We can’t stay here for long, let’s finish this quickly,” he said, and then took the lead.","As he was unable to use Yan power, his speed was quite slow.","The further they went, the more shocking scenes appeared.","Countless corpses of the prisoners were piled up like a mountain, almost spreading into the distance.","Moreover, these prisoners had all died in a very strange way. Their clothes had all disappeared, and their exposed bodies had become bones covered in black threads.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. What was the so-called black energy that could affect living beings so much?","One had to know that the prisoners trapped in the Black Mountain were at least Half Ancestors. Even though they were bound by the chains around their necks, they did not do anything to resist. This was too strange.","“Could it be that this black energy has a restraining effect on Yan power?” He slowly stretched out his palm and touched the black energy flowing in the void.","The black energy was dry and cold, with a certain kind of heart-palpitating aura. It did not seem to be a product of this Heavenly Region.","They gathered their thoughts and continued to pass through the mountains of corpses piled up by the corpses of prisoners.","When he passed the highest mountain of corpses, a black abyss appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Endless black energy spurted out from the vast and endless abyss.","Even Yan Immortals felt tiny before this abyss.","The Black Mountain that had collapsed long ago slanted into the abyss, and the abyss continued to expand. The corpses of the prisoners fell into it.","“Since when did the first Heavenly Region have an abyss like this?” Cheng Qing said in shock.","The Young Emperor frowned. “It seems that all the black energy came from the collapsed underground.”","“What do we do next?” Cheng Qing asked again. “I’m afraid that with just the few of us, there’s no way we can seal such a deep abyss again.”","In the end, the Young Emperor shook his head in disappointment. “That’s all we can do. Let’s go back.”","He did not even dare to investigate the strange destruction of the first Heavenly Region in the Lower Three Heavens.","After making their decision, they prepared to leave.","However, just as he turned around, he felt his heart palpitate and he turned around subconsciously.","The dense black energy in the air quietly turned into a vortex and began to slowly rotate.","“Quickly run!” He suddenly shouted and warned.","However, it was too late. Almost at the same time as Jian Wushuang’s words, the vortex formed by the black energy started to spin madly.","The towering Black Mountains suddenly broke apart and were sucked into the madly swirling vortex.","Jian Wushuang and the others were also swallowed by the unimaginable suction force.","The dark clouds connected to the ground, the entire Heavenly Region seemed to be falling into the black abyss prison.","As he was sucked into the vortex, Jian Wushuang felt the world spinning around him. As he could not use Yan power, he was in a passive position.","The Young Emperor, the skinny purple-robed man, and Chen Qing were not any better off. They disappeared almost at the same time they were swallowed.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes in the vortex while suppressing the dizziness of his divine sense.","As far as the eye could see, it was endless darkness.","This surging vortex kept falling, and the entire black abyss seemed to have no end. No one knew where it led to.","After an unknown period of time, when he felt a hard and cold touch under his body, everything seemed to return to silence.","The vortex slowly dissipated, leaving only an ancient, silent, deep sound in the surroundings.","“Aiyo, damn it, my waist...” Cheng Qing’s painful curses resounded in the abyss.","An indescribable echo reverberated in the abyss like a deafening thunder that shook the Nine Heavens.","“Be quiet.” The young Emperor’s voice rang out.","As he stood in the black source, a golden light flashed in the depths of Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Even though he was in the unknown world of extreme darkness, he could still clearly see every inch of the ground and every inch of space.","The bottom of the abyss was completely made up of black and irregular strange rocks, which were dense and cold."]},{"number":4865,"title":"Chapter 4865 The Source of Darkness","paragraphs":["4865 The Source of Darkness","What was even more strange was that there were also leg-high weeds growing on these irregular rocks.","Although the abyss was extremely dark, the Young Emperor and the others quickly noticed their own existence and started to move closer to Jian Wushuang.","“My God, what is this place? Are all the Black Mountain on the ground suspended in the air?” Cheng Qing looked at the scene in front of him and said in shock.","“It seems that this place was once an above-ground world. For some reason, it was buried in the core,” The Young Emperor analyzed.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He squatted down and touched a weed with his hand. In an instant, it turned into a puff of ashes.","Cheng Qing continued, “It’s indeed a little strange, but fortunately, it’s not a threat. As long as we don’t release Yan power, we’ll be able to leave this place.”","At this moment, the skinny purple-robed man who had been silent all this while said, “The path we took to come here has disappeared.”","Everyone subconsciously looked up. As expected, there was a strange stone dome above them. However, there wasn’t an exit.","The Young Emperor then looked at Jian Wushuang, “Brother Jian, what do you think?”","“Let’s move forward,” Jian Wushuang looked forward and said in a deep voice.","The group of four walked down the abyss.","It was an ancient, desolate silence that was extremely strange.","Jian Wushuang walked at the front and his eyes became more and more serious.","He felt an inexplicable throbbing in his heart, as if something was about to happen.","The strange rocks under his feet rose and fell, and it was extremely chaotic.","As he was at the forefront, he quickly understood why his heart was throbbing.","In front of the hazy black energy, in the center of a collapsed rock, there was a kneeling figure. It was an extremely strange figure.","Even Jian Wushuang could not see the figure clearly.","It was the source of the first Heavenly Region’s destruction. Boundless black energy was surging out from the front.","The Young Emperor and the others also saw the kneeling figure, and their faces turned grave.","“Don’t tell me that fellow is the source of the chaos in the first Heavenly Region,” Cheng Qing said in a low voice.","“Don’t act rashly first. That figure likely won’t be as calm as it is now,” Jian Wushuang reminded.","A being that could draw out so much black energy... How could he be dead?","In the next moment, as if to confirm Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, the sound of bones cracking rang out in the abyss.","As the voice rang out, the figure kneeling on the rocky ground suddenly trembled.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and he hurriedly asked the Young Emperor and the others to retreat.","“It can’t be, right? he can still be revived?!” Cheng Qing was dumbfounded as he looked at the scene in disbelief.","As the sound of bones cracking continued to reverberate, the figure that had been buried in the abyss for countless years slowly stood up.","It was a figure covered in hideous wounds. The armor on his body made of an unknown material had been completely damaged, revealing a body that had long lost its flesh.","Two black lights shot out from the helmet on his head.","Facing such a dead creature, even Jian Wushuang felt his heart palpitate.","He also realized that when the Yan power in his body faced this dead creature, it was out of control, like it was afraid.","This was too strange.","Could it be that this dormant living being was also an Emperor when he was alive? Was he killed and buried here by Zhen Wuyang?","However, Jian Wushuang quickly rejected the idea. He had been in close contact with the four Emperors and naturally knew about the unique fate energy that the Emperors had.","However, this living being did not have any Emperor’s fate energy. There was not even a trace of Yan power’s fluctuation.","Around his body, there was only that terrifying black energy surging.","He seemed to have woken up from his ancient deep sleep, and two black lights immediately locked onto Jian Wushuang and the others.","Then, the dead creature slowly raised an arm and clenched his broken palm.","The void suddenly collapsed, and an indescribable force squeezed in all directions.","Other than Jian Wushuang, the Young Emperor, the skinny purple-robed man, and Chen Qing groaned at the same time, as if they were severely injured. Divine blood flowed out of their mouths.","“Damn it, it’s really strong...” Chen Qing’s aura was weak, but he did not dare to release Yan power to resist.","This was because the black energy’s restraint on Yan power had almost reached the point of no solution. As long as there was a trace of Yan power released, the black energy would definitely trace its origin and severely injure the user.","The prisoners and supervisors who had already died were the best examples.","To Yan Immortals, not being able to use Yan power was an unimaginable thing, because even the simplest activation of Immortal Source would consume Yan power.","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang was less affected by this.","Other than the two Ancestral Skills and the Immortal Style, which required Yan power, he still had his Sword Dao.","The Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, and the second Immortal Style, Selfless True Shadow, did not require Yan power.","Therefore, he immediately used the Selfless True Shadow to enhance himself to deal with the following situation.","After severely injuring the Young Emperor and the others with one strike, the dead creature walked toward them.","The extremely dense black energy was continuously absorbed by him, and then it repaired the hideous and terrifying wounds on his body.","Jian Wushuang was moved and he directly slashed forward.","He released the first move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent!","An incomparably brilliant Sword Intent rose up and swept up. In an instant, it illuminated the entire abyss and then slashed toward the figure of the dead creature.","In the next moment, a scene that no one had expected occurred.","The vast Sword Intent slashed forward and cut the dead creature into two as easily as breaking dry weeds and smashing rotten wood...","It was so easy that Jian Wushuang did not even have time to react before his body fell to the rocks.","“That... that’s it?” Cheng Qing’s gaze was a little dull. “Is he too weak, or is Brother Jian too strong...”","Jian Wushuang shook his head slowly. He could feel that it was not that he was too strong, but that the dead creature was too weak. It could not even withstand a single blow.","He seemed to have aged too much, as if he had gone through endless years, making his body extremely weak."]},{"number":4866,"title":"Chapter 4866 The Black Bead","paragraphs":["4866 The Black Bead","The extremely dense black energy was still in the form of a vortex as it madly surged into the broken body that was lying on the ground.","The broken body that had been cut in half was wriggling non-stop, as if it was slowly healing.","“Brother Jian, we can’t let him recover!” the Young Emperor said coldly. He then drew the soft sword from his waist and nailed half of his body to the ground to stop his recovery.","Cheng Qing also stepped forward and asked in shock, “What is this guy? could he be a Yan Immortal who died in the ancient battlefield?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said softly, “It’s definitely not a Yan Immortal. Even if the Immortal Source is broken, Yan Immortals who have their obsessions will have Yan power fluctuations. This one doesn’t have any at all.”","“That’s strange.” Cheng Qing scratched his head.","Then, Jian Wushuang looked at the broken figure.","As he was wearing a dark and heavy mask, his face could not be seen. Only two black lights shot out of his eyes with some kind of soul-shaking power.","Inexplicably, Jian Wushuang subconsciously reached out his palm and wanted to take off his mask.","“Brother Jian!” The Young Emperor suddenly took his arm. “Be careful.”","He nodded, then slowly squatted down and touched the dead creature’s mask with his palm.","It was bone-chilling to the touch. With the sound of gears crisscrossing, the complicated and intricate facial cover split open from the nose, revealing a face.","To be more precise, it was a well-preserved and determined face.","No one had expected that this dead spirit, whose body was about to turn into bones, would still have such a face.","As the complicated and sophisticated mask was opened, the determined and heroic face turned slightly and finally looked at Jian Wushuang in front of him.","This glance seemed to pass through the ancient galaxy and go back in time.","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","After a long time, Jian Wushuang said softly, “It’s all in the past. The present no longer belongs to the past.”","His determined and heroic face seemed to be moved. He opened his mouth as if he was trying very hard to speak. “Why do I feel a sense of familiarity from you?”","As soon as he finished speaking, his body, which had been cut in half, quickly dissipated into a puff of dust.","This was because when the undead finally disappeared, he moved his lips and said something.","...","Then, his body and the surging black energy were reduced to ashes.","The surging black energy dissipated, and the entire unknown abyss world began to collapse rapidly. The stone dome above them began to crack.","“Let’s go, this place is about to collapse,” the Young Emperor reminded him in a deep voice. The abyss, which had no exit, cracked open not far away. It was the exit.","Now that the source of darkness that had destroyed the first Heavenly Region of the Lower Three Heavens had been eliminated, there was no need for him to stay here.","The Young Emperor and the others were all ready to leave.","Jian Wushuang also came back to his senses. He looked at the place where the dead creature had disappeared and suddenly saw a dark bead lying quietly under the helmet.","His heart was moved, and he directly stretched out his hand from afar, and the Black Bead and the mask fell into his hand.","“Brother Jian, leave quickly. This place can’t hold on for much longer.” Cheng Qing’s voice came from far away.","“I’m coming,” After Jian Wushuang stuffed the Black Bead and the mask into the Boyang Bottle and flew forward.","As the black energy had completely disappeared, he could naturally circulate Yan power again.","With Yan power’s help, the four Yan Immortals easily flew out of the abyss.","When he stood on top of the abyss again, the Young Emperor heaved a sigh of relief.","The source of the black energy that had tainted the entire Heavenly Region was removed, and all the dangers were resolved.","In the following days, the mining operations would resume in the Black Mountains.","Looking at the Black Mountains under the hazy sky, Jian Wushuang vaguely felt that there were still many mysteries that had not been discovered and solved.","The originally tricky matter was easily solved. After leaving the Lower Three Heavens and returning, the Young Emperor immediately made a decision and ordered more than 10 Yan Immortals to bring 20 carriages of treasures into Little Lonely Heaven and give them all to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not refuse and let Chen Qing and Cui Jing take over. The good things were left in the hall while the rest of the treasures were taken to the auction house.","After returning to Little Lonely Heaven from the Lower Three Heavens, Jian Wushuang directly jumped onto the eave and began to think about the meaning of the words of the source of darkness.","Not long after, the three Emperors who had been silent all this while appeared for the first time. They looked at Jian Wushuang with grave expressions.","“Little friend, you can’t joke about this.” Yang Jun, who looked like a tall and thin old man, was the first to speak. His face was filled with seriousness and vigilance.","Daogong and Su He also nodded in agreement with solemn expressions.","Yang Jun did not say much. He extended his hand and a pitch-black object wrapped in dense Yan power flew out of the Boyang Bottle.","“This is it. Where did you get it, Little Friend?” Yang Jun said seriously.","Looking at the Black Bead that was still emitting a strange aura, Jian Wushuang did not hide anything and told him everything that had happened in the Lower Three Heavens.","In the end, he said, “This Black Bead and that mask were both found in the abyss. Could it be that this thing will have some effect on you?”","Yang Jun nodded his head, “Not only did it affect us, we also discovered that this thing can eat away at consciousness and Yan power. We are no exception.”","It was a short sentence, but it contained so much information that Jian Wushuang was shocked.","The Black Bead produced by the seemingly vulnerable source of darkness in the abyss could even devour the divine sense and Yan power of an Emperor!","The Emperor was currently the highest power that Jian Wushuang knew. Although he had not taken the step of Grand Yan Immortal, he was an existence that could easily crush a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. An Emperor was the creator of a Heavenly Court.","Even Uncle Yu, a subordinate of Emperor Zhen Wuyang, could kill Di Qing, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, with one finger, let alone an unimaginable existence like the Emperor.","Even though Yang Jun, Dao Gong, and Su He’s Emperor bodies had been destroyed, they were still blessed by Emperor’s fate energy and were true Emperors.","Now that the Black Bead could actually cause actual damage to the Emperor, it was simply too unbelievable.","“This thing will have a huge impact on us.” Dao Gong, who had been silent all this time, also added at this moment."]},{"number":4867,"title":"Chapter 4867 The Eve Before Leaving","paragraphs":["4867 The Eve Before Leaving","Su He pushed him away and said unhappily, “You’re always playing tricks. Let me do it.”","“We’ve all carefully examined the bead just now. It’s extremely strange, and we can’t even guess what it is. As a result, it’s best to throw it away as soon as possible to avoid being heavily injured in the future.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned. Even the Emperors were afraid of the Black Bead, and it could kill all the prisoners in the Heavenly Region by itself. It seemed to be an ominous item.","“My Young Friend,” Yang Jun stepped forward. “You must take precautions. I have a feeling that this thing is not as simple as it looks.”","With the third Emperor’s reminder, Jian Wushuang realized the severity of the situation. “In that case, we can only destroy it.”","As he spoke, he reached out to grab the floating Black Bead.","“You can’t!” The three Emperors shouted at the same time, as if something terrifying was about to happen.","However, the scene that they had imagined did not happen. Jian Wushuang held the Black Bead in his hand and looked at the three of them with a puzzled expression.","“Little Friend, listen to me. You must not release Yan power. This item is extremely effective against Yan power. If you’re not careful, you’ll get yourself burned,” Yang Jun said nervously.","Jian Wushuang was still confused. After the Black Bead fell into his hand, it was like a pot of boiling water being frozen. There was no difference, “It seems... Nothing happenned...”","“How can he be fine?” The three Emperors looked at each other, unable to believe what they were seeing.","“Could it be that this Bead will choose to devour people?” Su He was not sure.","Daogong also said, “No matter what, Little Friend, you should get rid of this thing as soon as possible. But remember not to throw it away casually, so as not to let living beings suffer.”","After reminding and giving some advice, the three Emperors returned to the Boyang Bottle.","Jian Wushuang nodded and then carefully observed the strange Black Bead, trying to find something from it.","However, other than the dense Yan power in the surrounding air being completely devoured by the Black Bead, there were no other changes.","He was still confused about the Black Bead in his hand, but he still found some redeeming points from it.","According to the characteristics of this Black Bead, if he were to face a more powerful opponent in future battles, could he release this Black Bead to devour the opponent’s Yan power? Would it achieve an unexpected effect?","Jian Wushuang pinched his chin and pondered.","It was also at this moment that the Young Emperor stepped into Little Lonely Heaven.","After sensing his aura, he stuffed the Black Bead into his arms and then got up to greet him.","“It’s fine, it’s just a small matter,” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said. “What’s the matter, Young Emperor?”","He shrugged his shoulders. “Of course you can. Shall we go to the hall together?”","The Young Emperor hesitated for a moment and finally said, “Actually, Brother Jian, I’m here to discuss something important. My Imperial Father’s birthday is in less than three years. I would like to invite you to attend the banquet with me in the Heavenly Court.”","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He heaved a sigh of relief. “Brother Jian, I thank you again.”","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang asked, “Can I enter the Heavenly Dao Library again when I go to the Heavenly Court this time?”","“Of course,” the Young Emperor said. “Brother Jian, do you want to go there again to find the bone armor?”","Jian Wushuang did not hide anything, “Yes, rather than aimlessly searching, it’s better to go there and try my luck.”","“Alright, I’ll be waiting for Brother Jian’s arrival in three years.” The Young Emperor cupped his hands again.","...","When he returned to the hall, Di Qing had woken up from his sleep. He stretched his body and came to Jian Wushuang, saying, “Looking at your complexion, you seem to have been constantly on the move. It’s time for you to take a rest.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “It’s fine. I’ll have to leave again soon. I’ll leave this place to you.”","Di Qing raised his eyebrows and said, “That Young Emperor really has a full schedule for you. Do you want me to teach him a lesson for you?”","He did not know whether to laugh or cry. “Why would I teach him a lesson? You can just rest here and recuperate. I won’t trouble you with other things.”","At this moment, Wei Liujia also stepped forward and said, “Lord Jian, I’ll go with you. We can take care of each other.”","“No need, there won’t be any twists and turns on this trip. Too many people will only delay things.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and then looked at the hall.","Cheng Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing had been busy at the Wushuang Auction House, but one of them was missing in the hall.","“Liujia, have you seen Zhao Ting?” he asked.","“You mean Heavenly Official Zhao? I just saw her a few days ago, but she’s gone again.” Wei Liujia was also a little uncertain. “But thinking about it, Official Zhao shouldn’t have gone far.”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. If what Wei Liujia said was true, it would be fine. He was afraid that Zhao Ting had returned to the Great Mi Heaven and told Prince Jiu about the situation here.","Zhao Ting was a mysterious woman. She was the former Great Heavenly Official who served Prince Jiu. Her actions were always unpredictable. Even Jian Wushuang could not figure out what she was thinking.","Hence, he was still extremely worried about her.","Just as he was about to use this time to search for Zhao Ting’s traces, she quietly returned. The wounds all over her body had yet to completely recover, and it seemed like she had just experienced a bloody battle not long ago.","Jian Wushuang did not say much, but just gave Di Qing a look.","Di Qing got the hint and said in a voice that only the two of them could hear, “Don’t worry. With me here, no one can cause any trouble.”","...","Three years passed by in the blink of an eye. Compared to the first time, the second time was much more low-key.","Except for some of his close confidants, the entire Six Heavens Realm was quiet. It seemed that the news had not been made public.","Without the Imperial Carriage, without a Yan Immortal leading the way, everything was extremely quiet.","There were only two Young Masters in plain clothes, who looked like they were traveling the world. They stepped on the clouds in the void and flew forward."]},{"number":4868,"title":"Chapter 4868 Heading to the Heavenly Court Again","paragraphs":["4868 Heading to the Heavenly Court Again","The Six Heavens Realm was definitely not a good place in the Great Si Region. Some super Heavenly Regions were even better than it.","Not to mention, the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture of the late Prince, Prince Mo, and the Great Mi Heaven of the Second Prince, who were both blessed and important places in the Heavenly Prefectures.","Moreover, the Six Heavens Realm was located in a very remote corner, and it was the furthest Heavenly Region from the Heavenly Court among the seven Princes.","Jian Wushuang guessed that the Young Emperor had chosen the Six Heavens Realm because of the countless resources in the Lower Three Heavens.","Jian Wushuang’s guess was right. The Young Emperor had chosen the Six Heavens Realm for a large reason, which was the countless resources.","It was also because of these resources that he was able to catch his breath in the secret competition between the Princes.","As the most remote area, even with Yan Immortal’s traveling speed, it would take close to a year to reach.","This time, there were no more assassinations and the journey was smooth.","As the number of Super Heavenly Regions increased, the Yan power between Heavenly Regions became more and more solid, and they arrived at the Heavenly Realm where Emperor Zhen Wuyang was.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor stepped into the extremely vast Heavenly Realm.","Compared to the first feast of the Heavenly Court, the Heavenly Court this time was much more deserted. Even the guards of the Heavenly Court were extremely cold.","And all of this was definitely because of Prince Mo’s death.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang was also thinking that since the Fifth Prince, Prince Mo, had died not long ago, Zhen Wuyang would definitely not gather the other six Princes to the Heavenly Court to celebrate his birthday at this time.","He must have used the birthday celebration as an excuse to gather the six to discuss some matters.","After passing through the Nine Heaven Realms and stepping on the Heavenly Road, Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor soon arrived in front of the Heavenly Court.","The great gates of the Heavenly Court were opened, and a guide was brought into the Heavenly Court.","The other five Princes also arrived and entered the Heavenly Court.","Immortal clouds rose in spirals in the Heavenly Court, making it more solemn and less peaceful.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang was still sitting on the throne, and Uncle Yu was standing behind him.","The 99 seats on both sides of the Heavenly Court were empty, and the Elders who had accompanied Zhen Wuyang to this day were not present.","The entire Heavenly Court was silent.","The Young Emperor was the first to arrive at the Heavenly Court. After bowing to Zhen Wuyang, he sat on the side of the Imperial throne.","After that, Prince Jiu, Prince Yu, Prince Hua, and the other Princes also entered the Heavenly Court. After bowing to each other, they brought their Yan Immortal trusted aides to their seats.","Seeing this, none of the six Princes dared to say a word. They all lowered their heads and sat down.","This was not a birthday celebration. It was more like a Memorial for the fifth Prince, Prince Mo.","After a long while, Zhen Wuyang, who was sitting on the Emperor’s throne, said, “Yan ‘er, how long has it been since we last met?”","“Less than 30 years, Imperial Father,” the Young Emperor replied.","“It’s been less than 30 years, and it happened in the blink of an eye.” Zhen Wuyang looked tired. “So many things have happened in less than 30 years...”","“I’ve never had a birthday celebration before. Today, I’ve used this as an excuse to invite you all over, but it’s actually just to have a moment together.”","“In less than 30 years, such a drastic change has happened. It made me realize that we have never been alone.”","“Mo’er’s departure makes me want to make up for it, but it’s too late for me to regret it.”","Zhen Wuyang stood up slowly and glanced at the Princes. “Mo’er is dead. I don’t want to see any of you repeat his mistakes.”","“Remember, you are brothers, not blood enemies!”","At this moment, all the Princes’ expressions changed, but they quickly returned to normal.","However, the changes in their expressions did not escape Jian Wushuang.","Among the Princes, the one whose expression changed the most was not Prince Jiu, but the third Prince, Prince Yu.","He appeared to be very flustered, but he quickly regained his calm.","For a moment, the Fourth Prince’s eyes gloated.","The Sixth Prince, Prince Hua, and the Seventh Prince, Prince Lin, were a little sad.","As for the mastermind, Prince Jiu, he was completely expressionless. There was even sadness in his eyes from time to time, which made Jian Wushuang have a different opinion of him.","After the drastic change that had taken place in the Great Mi Heaven earlier, combined with the change in Prince Jiu’s current mood, there was no doubt that he was an extremely terrifying opponent.","In the future, he would definitely have a bloody battle with the Young Emperor.","If that day really came, it would probably be time for a reshuffling of power in the Great Si Region.","He sat back on the Emperor’s throne and patted the warm jade armrest. “Anyone can be the Emperor, but not everyone can have the Emperor’s fate energy.”","“There might only be one Emperor in the Great Si Region.”","Looking away, Zhen Wuyang seemed to have aged a lot at this moment. “That’s all I have to say. You all have to take care of yourselves.”","All the Princes cupped their hands. “We will obey your teachings, Imperial Father.”","However, Emperor Yang continued, “I called you here to tell you something. I need to leave the Great Si Region for a period of time. Take care of yourself.”","All the Princes were stunned, clearly in disbelief.","One must know that ever since the Great Si Region was established and the Heavenly Court was established, Emperor Zhen Wuyang had never left the Great Si Region. It had been countless years.","However, he had left the Great Si Region at this time, which confused the Princes.","“Imperial Father, where are you going?” The Young Emperor asked.","“An unknown place...” Zhen Wuyang’s deep eyes looked into the distance. No one knew what he was thinking.","The lecture in the name of birthday celebration lasted for a very short time. It ended in less than half a day, which was beyond Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","Zhen Wuyang and Uncle Yu left first.","For a moment, only the six Princes and their trusted aides looked at each other in the entire Heavenly Court.","Jian Wushuang sat still, but at least two eyes were fixed on him.","One of them was from Prince Jiu, while the other was from Prince Yu.","He remained silent and returned the same calm gaze.","No matter if it was in the Great Mi Heaven or in Emperor Liu Ya’s former Heavenly Court, Jian Wushuang had changed his appearance. Even his body shape had been adjusted, which was almost completely different from his original self.","Even Chun Qiu, who had been by his side for the longest time, could not tell, let alone these guys.","Jian Wushuang was very sure about this.","As expected, Prince Jiu’s gaze, which was as sharp as a knife, disappeared very quickly. It was replaced by a look of uncertainty and doubt."]},{"number":4869,"title":"Chapter 4869 Undercurrent","paragraphs":["4869 Undercurrent","However, he still looked at Jian Wushuang from time to time, as if he was trying to find any clues.","He had a feeling that he had seen Jian Wushuang somewhere else, and that Jian Wushaung had something to do with something.","Prince Yu also had the same feeling.","After being beaten up and almost killed in the Heavenly Court that he found by accident, Prince Yu returned to his Heavenly Region. He had been lying there until today and had barely recovered.","After looking into Jian Wushuang’s eyes, he had a faint illusion that he had seen him before.","However, Jian Wushuang had hidden it perfectly. He did not even use his signature Immortal Style. Even if the two of them were sitting in his arms, they would not be able to detect anything.","However, he was still worried that he would be exposed if he stayed any longer, so he looked at the Young Emperor.","The Young Emperor understood tacitly and got up to leave.","At this moment, Prince Jiu suddenly stood up. With his trademark amiable smile, he said, “Big Brother, you came in such a hurry and left in such a hurry. Don’t you want to catch up with your younger brothers?”","The Young Emperor’s body froze for a moment, then he stopped in place and said coldly, “Don’t call me Big Brother.”","Hearing this, Prince Jiu shrugged his shoulders nonchalantly. “It seems that the Young Emperor really doesn’t care about the feelings of being from the same lineage.”","“Shameless!” He said coldly and was about to leave with Jian Wushuang.","“Hey, I say, you can leave if you want, but you have to leave the congratulatory gift for Imperial Father!” Prince Jiu said loudly. It was obvious that he did not intend to let him leave.","The Young Emperor stopped, turned around, and sneered, “Who do you think you are? How dare you ask me for a gift? Even if I’ve prepared it, do you dare to take it?!”","With that, he turned around and left.","Prince Jiu’s expression was dark, and his eyes were almost dripping with tears.","“Useless thing, you’ll kneel down and repent one day!”","...","After leaving the Heavenly Court, the Young Emperor brought Jian Wushuang straight to the Heavenly Dao Library to continue searching for the bone armor.","This search took more than ten days.","To Jian Wushuang’s disappointment, the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor did not appear again. He and the Young Emperor searched almost every corner of the Heavenly Dao Library, but there was no trace of it.","“It seems that I can only rely on luck to obtain this kind of thing in the future.” He sighed and looked at the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in his hand.","The Young Emperor said, “Even if you can’t find the other dominoes for now, why don’t you change your way of thinking and try to decipher the password of the dominoes you have?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. The Young Emperor’s method was indeed a good idea.","Even if he could not find the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor, it would be easier to find someone who could understand the code.","He then asked, “Do you know anyone who is proficient in this?”","The Young Emperor thought for a moment and said, ” I don’t know, but there are many Yan Immortal mighty figures in the Great Si Region who are proficient in strange Dao. From what I know, there should be a divine craftsman who is proficient in this Dao. He might be able to decipher the secret text on the bone pendant.”","“What’s the divine craftsman’s name and where does he live?” Jian Wushuang was a little anxious. After all, the secret text on the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was too important to him. Old Master and Xuan Yi’s information was likely to be on it.","The Young Emperor did not keep him in suspense. “There are more than a thousand famous craftsmen in the Great Si Region, but only a few of them can be called divine craftsmen. Among these divine craftsmen, there is one who likes to study the art of the ancient metal runes and has a strange style. I have had some interactions with him in the early years, so he should give me some face.”","“This divine craftsman’s name is Xu Tuo. He lives in the Three-Inch Mountain and possesses heaven-shaking and earth-shattering abilities.”","“Xu Tuo,” Jian Wushuang muttered and repeated the name again. He felt that the name was somewhat familiar.","Then, he suddenly recalled that he had heard of the divine craftsman Xu Tuo’s name in Prince Jiu’s Great Mi Heaven.","Back then, the first Lord of the Blessed Land under Prince Jiu had presented a Clear Avoidance Ruyi Scepter forged by the divine craftsman Xu Tuo, which was a work of great craftsmanship.","Jian Wushuang looked at the Young Emperor and said, “It seems that I’ll have to go to the Three-Inch Mountain to find Xu Tuo after this.”","He nodded and said, “I’ll go with you.”","It was a pity that he could not find the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in the Heavenly Dao Library again. However, he obtained another piece of news that pointed out a new path.","Walking out of the Heavenly Dao Library, the Young Emperor stood under a tree and took out an Immortal cloud, turning it into an Immortal crane.","“This is my Imperial Father’s first birthday. No matter what, I have to send a congratulatory gift.”","He seemed to be talking to both Jian Wushuang and the red-crowned crane. Then, he placed an exquisite box on the back of the red-crowned crane.","“Go. You must deliver the gift before my Imperial Father leaves the Great Si Region.”","As the crane left, the Young Emperor made a gesture of invitation. “Brother Jian, please follow me for a walk.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and they traveled in the Heavenly Realm together.","“Ever since my Imperial Father divided the borders of the Great Si Region and established the Heavenly Court, he has never left the Great Si Region. However, he left at this time and gathered us here to give us a warning. Brother Jian, can you see what my Imperial Father’s intentions are?”","The Young Emperor looked at him and asked.","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and then said, “I think there are two reasons for this. The first possibility is that he used the excuse of leaving to test if you brothers would really fight each other.”","“As for the second possibility, he really has to leave the Great Si Region for some time, not just for a short period of time. He’ll also take all the ministers and Elders with him, so he has no time to care about what’s going to happen in the Great Si Region. That’s why he’s giving you a warning.”","The Young Emperor took a deep breath and his eyes turned serious.","“Brother Jian, if it’s the second possibility, then I’m afraid that the battle between us will begin from now on.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly, “What if it’s the first possibility? Wouldn’t that be falling into your Imperial Father’s trap?”","“I’m afraid it’ll only be the second possibility this time,” the Young Emperor said in a serious voice. “It seems that the battle between us will be much faster than I thought.”","As he spoke, he looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “I was originally the weakest among the other six Princes. Regardless of whether we start a war or not, I have to increase my strength urgently. I can’t wait any longer. Otherwise, I will end up like Prince Mo.”","The Young Emperor took a deep breath and said solemnly, “Brother Jian, if there’s a way, do you want to become a Grand Yan Immortal?”"]},{"number":4870,"title":"Chapter 4870 The Black Ocean Treasure","paragraphs":["4870 The Black Ocean Treasure","The short sentence was like a thunderbolt that exploded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The moment one stepped into the Grand Yan Immortal realm, it was the true beginning.","Comprehending the Emperor’s fate energy, fighting for the throne, everything was in the Grand Yan Immortal cultivation realm!","Similarly, the difficulty of the cultivation path to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal realm was far beyond imagination.","This was no longer something that could be achieved through years of cultivation. Instead, it required an ethereal fate energy and opportunity to break through to that cultivation realm.","Countless Yan Immortals could only be trapped in the Yan Immortal realm in despair for their entire lives.","The most typical example was Chen Qing. Even though he had already comprehended the Immortal Style, he still had not touched the barrier, so breaking through to the Grand Yan Immortal was an unimaginable hope.","Seeing that he was silent, the Young Emperor repeated, “Brother Jian, do you want to reach the Grand Yan Immortal realm?”","The reason why Jian Wushuang did not answer was that there would be too many implications if he agreed.","In layman’s terms, it was an irrefutable principle.","“It’s not that easy to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal stage,” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","“As long as Brother Jian agrees, I’m 99 percent sure that I can help you become a Grand Yan Immortal,” the Young Emperor said seriously.","Seeing the confusion in his eyes, the Young Emperor’s eyes flashed with a touch of sadness, and then he said, “The reason why I am so confident is that an Elder under the Imperial Father turned his lifetime’s Enlightenment into an inheritance and left it in the Six Heavens Realm, waiting for a Yan Immortal to accept his inheritance.”","“Due to my Immortal body’s flaw, I can’t cultivate. I can only be in the Yan Immortal stage for the rest of my life. Naturally, I can’t obtain that inheritance.”","“But now, we can’t wait any longer. The Six Heavens Realm must have a Grand Yan Immortal to protect it in the next battle.” As he spoke, he reached out and held Jian Wushuang’s arm tightly.","“I’ll try my best.” Jian Wushuang finally answered.","The Young Emperor smiled in relief. “Alright, then I’ll do my best to wish Brother Jian the best for your promotion to the Grand Yan Immortal!”","After leaving the Heavenly Court, the two of them headed straight back to the Six Heavens Realm.","That old Elder under Zhen Wuyang was at the peak of Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, and he had followed Zhen Wuyang to conquer all Heavenly Regions. Even Grand Yan Immortals of the same realm had the fear of dying when facing him.","He learned from the Young Emperor that such a Grand Yan Immortal had died of his own will.","He voluntarily dispersed his Immortal Source and shattered his Immortal body, leaving only his inheritance in the Six Heavens Realm.","Before he died, he said something about how boring it was, and then he died.","Listening to his continuous introduction, the image of a well-developed, flesh-and-blood Grand Yan Immortal appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","He even wanted to meet this Grand Yan Immortal with a rather unique personality.","This unknown Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s inheritance was left in the third Heavenly Region of the Lower Three Heavens. No one else knew about it except for the Young Emperor.","After nearly a year’s journey, they finally returned to the Six Heavens Realm.","Under the Young Emperor’s guidance, the two of them headed straight for the third Heavenly Region in the Lower Three Heavens.","As the barrier around him rippled, the scene of the third Heavenly Region appeared in his eyes.","An ocean, a pitch-black ocean. An ocean so black that stretched as far as the eye could see.","It was like the night had gathered on the ground, the black color seemed to be able to absorb all light, making the entire third Heavenly Region chaotic.","Along with the boundless black ocean, there were many tall Black Mountains that slanted in the black ocean.","Eeriness, deathly stillness, and desolation were the main colors here.","“This is where the Elder’s inheritance is.”","The Young Emperor pointed ahead and said, “As the third Heavenly Region is almost entirely covered by the black ocean, it is very difficult to mine the Black Mountain Crytsals. So after I took over this Heavenly Region, no one else has set foot in it and it has remained the same until today.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, “Where will his inheritance be?”","“It seems to be in the Nether Abyss Continent. It’s been so long that I’ve forgotten about it. Let’s go and check it out first,” the Young Emperor said with an embarrassed expression.","After he finished speaking, he waved his hand and threw out a ray of clear light, which turned into a wooden boat and settled in the black ocean.","“This miasma can easily affect one’s mind. Let’s take a boat there, it’s safer.”","After the two of them sat on the wooden boat, it spontaneously broke the surface of the sea and sailed forward.","“Before the Elder decided to die, he intended to pass on all his insights to me. However, I was born with a defect, so I couldn’t cultivate and have Immortal roots. Naturally, I couldn’t get his inheritance.”","Sitting on the wooden boat, the Young Emperor told Jian Wushuang calmly with a faint smile.","“Other than my companion and my so-called brothers, you’re the only one who knows that I have a flaw.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked, “Why are you telling me this? You can keep it a secret.”","“Of course I’m trying my best to keep this a secret. After all, if the news that the Great Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s eldest son is a good-for-nothing who can’t cultivate were to spread, it would have a very bad impact.”","“But I also want to confide in someone else,” the Young Emperor said with a smile. “And you are the only friend I want to confide in.”","“Thank you. I will keep this a secret,” Jian Wushuang nodded and said solemnly.","He continued, “This secret is my biggest weakness. Anyone who knows about it can easily injure me.”","“I can’t cultivate. Even if I’m a Yan Immortal now and have mastered an Immortal Style, I can’t hide the fact that I don’t have Immortal roots or Immortal Source.”","“Everything I have now was given to me by my Imperial Father using a secret technique. Hence, the Yan Immortal cultivation realm is my limit. Even if I spend my entire life, I will never be able to break through.”","“I thought that I would die in the assassination, but Brother Jian’s arrival has given me hope.”","The Young Emperor said solemnly, “So, no matter what, I have to make you the Grand Yan Immortal in this period of time!”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He had been thinking about a problem since a while ago.","From the Young Emperor’s performance and what he said, he knew that his Immortal body had a huge flaw and that he was unable to form Immortal roots and Immortal Source.","This was a fatal point. In layman’s terms, it was a body that was born with no way to cultivate.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang could not figure out how such a useless body could become a Yan Immortal and master an Immortal Style. It was simply incredible.","He was also thinking about whether he could open up another path, a path of cultivation that was different from ordinary cultivation."]},{"number":4871,"title":"Chapter 4871 Obtaining the Inheritance","paragraphs":["4871 Obtaining the Inheritance","However, creating another cultivation system was like a fantasy to Jian Wushuang. It was something that he could not even imagine. He could not even understand the origin.","However, Jian Wushuang had the courage to think about this because he had been an inverse cultivator before.","What was the complete cultivation system of the Great Yan Domain? Could he comprehend a different Dao path?","The wooden boat was extremely fast as it broke through the water in the black ocean.","The water in the black ocean was viscous, like some sort of mucus, and one could feel a lot of resistance.","The nether abyss continent was the only continent in the third Heavenly Region, and it was very likely the place they were looking for. The inheritance of the Elder who had died willingly was probably there.","As they continued to advance, the number of Black Mountains in the black ocean gradually decreased, and the sea began to become as smooth as a mirror.","The ink-black ocean connected to the chaotic sky, and in the middle was a small boat breaking through the water.","When a continent appeared in front of them, it meant that they had arrived at the Nether Abyss Continent.","He stepped onto land from the wooden boat, and the land made of craggy and strange stones came into view.","This boundless continent seemed to have been contaminated by the black water. It became black and rough, and there were strange rocks protruding everywhere.","Even the weeds that were as tall as one’s legs were dry and black.","“The inheritance should be here. Although the Elder’s Immortal Source has been dispersed, I think there are still some obsessions left here. When the time comes, I will personally guide our party, and we will definitely succeed,” the Young Emperor said in a serious voice and took the lead.","The entire Nether Abyss Continent was vast, but it was nothing compared to the inheritance of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Hence, the moment he stepped onto the continent, Jian Wushuang felt a vast and exuberant aura of Yan power.","He did not even need the Young Emperor to search for it. He had already locked onto a location.","It was a naturally dangerous place with eight pitch-black mountains that looked like swords and sabers. They were aligned in a formation like stars surrounding the moon, giving off an extremely powerful aura.","In the center of the mountain, there was an extremely pure halo of Yan power.","“It seems like it’s there. Let’s go,” the Young Emperor said and ascended.","Under the mountains and rivers with a single thought, Jian Wushuang arrived in front of the Halo of Yan power in an instant.","All kinds of Yan power’s light beams interweaved within it, and countless rainbow shadows began to cycle back and forth. Just the light that was revealed seemed to be filled with an aura that could destroy the world.","The Young Emperor took a deep breath and said, “It seems that this is the Patriarch’s Comprehension of the inheritance. Brother Jian, can you feel anything different?”","“It’s the Comprehension that has transcended the Yan Immortal stage,” Jian Wushuang said with certainty.","With Di Qing, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, by his side, Jian Wushuang had gained some familiarity and understanding of the Grand Yan Immortal cultivation realm.","He was sure that this halo of Yan power was not much weaker than Di Qing’s.","“Since that’s the case, I’ll be waiting for your good news, Brother Jian.” The Young Emperor smiled.","However, Jian Wushuang was not excited because he felt that it was too rushed.","He was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage, but he had to Comprehend and control the inheritance of the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, which was almost a whole cultivation realm. He was afraid that some accidents might happen.","But now the arrow was nocked on the string and had no choice but to fire.","Jian Wushuang looked at the ball of light that was emitting a brilliant aura and slowly stretched out his palm to touch it. At that moment, a strange aura from the ball of light made him suddenly alert.","The strange aura was black in color. Although it was only a flash, it still made Jian Wushuang subconsciously want to withdraw his palm.","A sudden change occurred. Almost at the same time when he retracted his palm, the Yan power light ball changed its shape and suddenly shot out more than ten rays of black light. They stuck to his arm and then dragged him into the light ball.","The entire process took less than a breath’s time and Jian Wushuang disappeared without a trace.","The Young Emperor also reacted and reached out to pull him, but he was pulled in by the huge force.","The astral wind raged and the entire black ocean of the third Heavenly Region started to shake, creating huge waves.","Jian Wushuang felt an uncontrollable force dragging him into a certain realm. Then, the scene in front of him changed dramatically.","The mountain rocks under his feet were no longer there. In their place was a vast square that was like a chessboard.","In front of the vast square was a magnificent and oppressive giant Hall.","Jian Wushuang’s face was extremely grave. The aura that was emitted here was gloomy, cold, and full of killing intent.","This place did not seem like the place where the inheritance was located, but more like an Asura Arena where people were fighting.","The Young Emperor was also dragged into this, and his eyes were full of doubt.","“Brother Jian, what is this place?” he quickly came to Jian Wushuang and asked.","Jian Wushuang said in a low voice, “We were all dragged to this place by that Yan power light ball. It’s very likely that we’re in a certain unknown realm now.”","The Young Emperor said uncertainly, “Could it be in the Heavenly Abode left behind by the Elder?”","“If this is really the Senior’s Heavenly Abode, I’m afraid that he’s definitely not a good person,” Jian Wushuang’s gaze gradually turned solemn. “This is not a land of inheritance, but a trap.”","“A trap?” He was shocked. “It can’t be. When this Elder was still alive, he treated me very well. He even asked Imperial Father to become my companion. He would never harm me.”","“You don’t know if it’s a problem or not, but the most important thing now is to leave this place unscathed,” Jian Wushuang said as he started to operate Yan power.","At this moment, the door of the grand and oppressive hall suddenly opened, and a hurricane rose from it.","The pitch-black hurricane instantly crushed over with terrifying momentum.","Jian Wushuang also used his Ancestral Skill in an instant.","The Transcendence Heavenly Gate rose majestically, like hundreds of suns shining down.","A giant finger that reached the sky also blocked the black hurricane.","However, it was only blocked for a moment before it shattered.","“Let’s go!” Jian Wushuang shouted.","However, it was too late. The unstoppable hurricane swept over.","However, the pain that he had imagined did not come. The hurricane quietly stopped in front of Jian Wushuang and did not move an inch further.","Jian Wushuang quickly retreated more than 100 feet and then looked over.","The hurricane that had stopped was several feet tall. When the layers of ashes fell off, a black-robed figure gradually condensed.","It was a black-robed old man with a black beard and hair. His face was pale and withered, and his eyes were like two black balls without any white. It was extremely strange.","“Who are you? How dare you come here and disturb my slumber?”","The voice that seemed to have come from all directions was extremely low, and it seemed to have a bloodthirsty tone."]},{"number":4872,"title":"Chapter 4872 Sir Yuan","paragraphs":["4872 Sir Yuan","Jian Wushuang retreated slowly and the Invisible Sword had already formed quietly.","At present, this old man who was more than ten feet tall, as if he had walked out of the black fog, did not have any surging force around his body, but the great momentum that he exuded was indeed not to be underestimated.","He also realized that although this old man did not show his strength, he would probably not be at a disadvantage against Di Qing, and might even end up in a draw.","The Young Emperor stepped forward and stood in front of Jian Wushuang. He said nervously, “Sir Yuan?”","“What?” The black-robed old man looked at the Young Emperor with doubt in his eyes.","“I’m Prince Yan,” The Young Emperor added.","The black-robed old man’s eyes suddenly focused, “You are Little Yan?!”","The Young Emperor heaved a sigh of relief and said with a bitter smile, “It’s me. I thought you had forgotten about me.”","“Good kid. You’ve changed a lot since we parted.” The black-robed old man’s figure suddenly dispersed and then condensed in front of him again. His eyes could not help but reveal a look of joy.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief and put away the Invisible Sword.","It was a good result to avoid a battle that would cost a great price.","The Young Emperor scratched his head. “It’s been too long. If I didn’t remember what you looked like when I was young, I’m afraid I would be in trouble today.”","The old man known as Sir Yuan raised his head and laughed. Then, he said, “Don’t worry, Little Yan. Even if you don’t remember what I look like, I will always remember what you look like.”","“I understand,” the Young Emperor also smiled.","“Alright, since you’ve come to see these old bones of mine, then come to my palace and have a seat,” Sir Yuan said with a wave of his sleeve.","The Young Emperor nodded and looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang shook his head discreetly and a flash of vigilance appeared in his eyes.","He could smell danger from the open hall. If he rashly entered, he was afraid he would encounter an uncontrollable crisis.","“This is?” He looked at Jian Wushuang.","The Young Emperor hurriedly added, “This is my close friend, Brother Jian.”","Sir Yuan nodded, “Since you are Little Yan’s best friend, I will not banish you for now. Come in with me.”","With that, his figure was like mist, floating towards the main hall.","Seeing that he had left, Jian Wushuang looked at the Young Emperor and frowned. “How much do you know about him? Do you know how many things he has been hiding from you?”","The Young Emperor was a little dumbfounded. After a while, he said, “Sir Yuan was one of the only two founding Elders who followed me closely when I was young. Although he resolved his Immortal Source not long after, I’ve always known how protective he was of me. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have left his inheritance to me.”","As he spoke, he stretched out his palm and placed it on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder. “Brother Jian, trust me this once. Sir Yuan would never have any ill intentions toward us.”","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth but did not say anything in the end.","The two figures then entered the awe-inspiring giant hall together.","What he did not say was actually quite important.","If what the Young Emperor had said was true, that Sir Yuan had died from unsealing his Immortal Source and only left behind a trace of obsession, then the current situation was completely different from what he had said.","Sir Yuan did not die at all. In other words, he still had an abundance of Immortal Source. The figure that appeared was not his last obsession, but a real Immortal body that had not been broken.","This was also why Jian Wushuang hesitated. After all, it was the right thing to do when facing an extremely powerful existence who was hiding something.","As soon as he stepped into the giant hall, the dark and gloomy aura dissipated a lot.","The first thing that entered his eyes was a series of elegant-looking pavilions and terraces, not the solemn and cold deathly silent hall.","“Little Brat Yan, Come, come, come, fish with this old man.”","On a pitch-black Immortal pavilion in the sky, Sir Yuan sat on the roof and raised his fishing rod.","“I’m coming,” the Young Emperor answered and stepped into the pavilion with Jian Wushuang.","After handing him a fishing rod, he looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Boy, do you like fishing?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “It’s alright. I was addicted to it for a while when I was killing time.”","“That’s good. A steady heart with good composure is a good seedling for being able to keep her composure.” After throwing him a fishing rod, he began to fish excitedly.","The Young Emperor sat in the middle and wanted to ask about the situation, but he did not know how to start, so he hesitated.","However, it was Sir Yuan who spoke first, “Little Brat Yan, is there any change in Emperor Zhen Wuyang?”","The Young Emperor replied, “My father is still the same. He said that he settled down after establishing the Great Si Region and has been living in the Heavenly Court.”","“That’s good. His mission is complete. It’s time for him to take a break,” Sir Yuan nodded. “Tell me, why did you think of seeing me?”","“Um, that...” The Young Emperor scratched his head awkwardly. “I was here to accept the inheritance...”","When Sir Yuan heard this, she hurriedly sized him up. “Little Yan, is your Immortal body better?”","“No, I still have a flaw. I still can’t cultivate. After my father used a secret technique to raise me to the Yan Immortal level, I can’t advance any further,” the Young Emperor said.","“Damn it! You have the bloodline of a first-generation legendary Emperor. How could this happen?” Sir Yuan frowned. “Is there no chance of change?”","“Sir Yuan, I’ve accepted it. Even my father can’t do anything about it. It’s not to bad after all,” The Young Emperor smiled and said. “The reason I came here is not for myself, but to let Brother Jian accept the inheritance of Sir Yuan.”","Upon hearing this, he looked at Jian Wushuang again, “For him?”","“That’s right, I’m just a Yan Immortal who can’t cultivate. If it wasn’t for Brother Jian’s protection, I would’ve died in the assassination attempt.”","As he spoke, he told her about the complicated relationship between the Princes.","In the end, he said faintly, “In the end, our generation will only end the war with killing.”","Sir Yuan was silent. He reached out and patted the Young Emperor’s shoulder. “It’s been hard on you.”","“But my inheritance is gone.”","The Young Emperor did not understand what he meant, and his eyes were filled with doubt.","“If you had accepted my inheritance after I destroyed my Immortal Source, you would have been able to see it. But now, everything has changed.” Sir Yuan sighed. “Even though I can’t explain what has happened, it has really happened.”","Jian Wushuang also perked up his ears at this moment. He knew that Sir Yuan was about to reveal the real secret.","“The so-called Yan Immortal and even the Grand Yan Immortal are ultimately nothing more than the word ‘Immortal source.’”","“The Immortal Source is the true foundation, and it complements the Immortal root. It is the most important thing to a Yan Immortal. The shattering of the Immortal Source means the complete death of a Yan Immortal.”"]},{"number":4873,"title":"Chapter 4873 I Have a Deal to Make","paragraphs":["4873 I Have a Deal to Make","At this point, she paused and slowly stretched out her left palm. A wisp of pure Yan power condensed.","“After Emperor Zhen Wuyang established the Great Si Region, the wars and killing stopped. I grew tired of it and destroyed my Immortal Source to seek eternal rest.”","“Whether it’s an external force destroying the Immortal Source or self-destructing the Immortal Source, it’s an irreversible injury. I successfully destroyed the Immortal Source, so naturally, my death is irreversible.”","“My self-destruction was extremely thorough. Other than leaving behind an inheritance for you, I didn’t even leave behind a single bit of my obsession. Just like that, my consciousness also withered and fell into emptiness.”","“However, my death seems to be a little different. Although my consciousness has withered, it seems to have been tirelessly awakened by some kind of power.”","“I don’t know how many years passed like this. The originally broken and withered divine sense recovered. I woke up and was surprised to find that even the Immortal Source had condensed again.”","“After that, I completely recovered, but because I was tired of the great world, I simply stayed here until I met you again today.”","His voice stopped abruptly.","There was not much information in his words, but they were extremely profound. Even Jian Wushuang was a little confused.","Destroying one’s Immortal Source and Immortal body was an irreversible injury. Not to mention ordinary Grand Yan Immortals, even Di Qing, who had nine True Lives, would not dare to do this.","While Jian Wushuang had no Immortal Source, he had the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body. Other than Jian Wushuang, any other Grand Yan Immortal would die if they tried this.","Moreover, it was obvious that neither of the two special cases existed, so it was a little confusing that she was resurrected.","A hint of disappointment flashed in the Young Emperor’s eyes, but he immediately smiled and said, “It seems that you’re lucky to live again, Sir Yuan. Don’t do anything stupid again and pursue a higher realm.”","Sir Yuan smiled and nodded. “I’ll listen to you. Since luck is with me, I’ll pursue the Great Dao.”","After chatting for a long time, the Young Emperor was ready to leave.","“Little Brat Yan, I can’t leave this place yet, but once you’re in danger, I’ll definitely come to your aid,” Sir Yuan said solemnly.","The Young Emperor nodded. “Alright. If that day comes, I’ll definitely come and ask you for help.”","The guarantee of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was extremely important.","Jian Wushuang finally understood that Emperor Zhen Wuyang had arranged several Grand Yan Immortals to be around each Prince.","The fallen Prince Mo had a black-robed Grand Yan Immortal and Di Qing as his subordinates.","Prince Jiu was also supported by a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","There was also a Sir Yuan beside the Young Emperor.","In that case, the other Princes would probably have Grand Yan Immortals accompanying them. Once they started a war with each other, it would probably be extremely tragic.","After that, the two of them prepared to leave.","However, at this moment, Sir Yuan suddenly called out to Jian Wushuang, “Are you in such a hurry to leave, boy?”","Jian Wushuang stopped and there was some doubt in his eyes.","“Although my inheritance has disappeared, this doesn’t stop me from passing it down step by step.” Throwing away the fishing rod in his hand, he said proudly, “I’ve seen you before. Stay and let me teach you personally.”","The Young Emperor was surprised to hear this. “Brother Jian, quickly thank Sir Yuan.”","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Forget it, Senior. Although the inheritance can change greatly in a very short time, there are also some disadvantages. I’ll try to comprehend it by myself.”","“Are you looking down on this old man?” Sir Yuan’s voice turned serious, and his black robe fluttered without any wind. “Since you’re Little Yan’s best friend, I’ll do my best to cultivate you. You have to agree whether you want to or not. It’s a deal!”","With that, he reached out and grabbed Jian Wushuang, who was defenseless, and went to a Dao Field.","The Young Emperor clapped his hands in excitement, as if he was even happier than getting the inheritance himself.","Jian Wushuang stood still in the vast Dao Field that was like a chessboard. It was obvious that he had accepted the reality. Opposite him, Sir Yuan stood with his hands behind her back, looking like a lofty mountain.","“Kid, let me ask you, How long have you been in the Yan Immortal stage?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. From the Divine Power Universe to the Great Yan Domain, he reached the Ancestor realm and became the Cosmos God. Now, he was a Yan Immortal. The time he took was less than ten million years.","For the Supreme experts in the Divine Power Universe, tens of millions of years was just a few rounds of closed-door cultivation, let alone Yan Immortals, who had already transcended the Heavenly Dao and was measured in Hua Years.","Time was meaningless to them, but to measure a top cultivator’s or a Yan Immortal’s potential, time was indeed needed.","In order to avoid unnecessary trouble, Jian Wushuang directly swallowed the ten million years and casually made up a Hua year period that was similar to the Young Emperor’s age.","Upon hearing this, Sir Yuan nodded. “Not bad. To reach the top of the Yan Immortal at such a young age, you are indeed a talent that can be molded. If you were to live in the same era as us, you would probably be a Grand Yan Immortal by now.”","“There’s very little I can teach you, and I can’t even teach you anything,” he said bluntly. “But because I promised Little Yan, I decided to teach you even if it means gritting my teeth.”","“However, before that, you have to promise me one thing. In the future, when I’m not by his side, you have to protect him no matter what.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head slowly after a moment of silence. “I’m sorry, but I can’t agree.”","The Young Emperor, who was watching this scene with a smile from outside the Dao Field, was stunned. Even Sir Yuan’s eyes turned cold in an instant.","“Why?”","“I can’t stay in the Great Si Region for long. I have many important matters to deal with, so I can’t agree to it.”","“What an arrogant brat. Do you know who you are bargaining with?” The hair behind Sir Yuan’s back danced wildly, and the great momentum belonging to the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal pressed down in an instant.","“Sir Yuan, please hold back!”","The Young Emperor, who was outside the Dao Field, rushed over and blocked him.","“Don’t block me, let me first break the spirit of this junior,” he said angrily.","“Sir Yuan, there’s nothing wrong with what he said. We’ve already made a promise,” the Young Emperor forced a smile. “It’s unfair to force him to protect me from now on.”","Sir Yuan calmed down and frowned. “But if he leaves without notice, and I’m not by your side, you’ll be in a passive and dangerous situation at any time.”","The Young Emperor smiled and raised his eyebrows at Jian Wushuang. “He won’t leave without notice. You know, we agreed to protect me for 70 years. It seems that it’s not even halfway through.”"]},{"number":4874,"title":"Chapter 4874 The Decisive Battle","paragraphs":["4874 The Decisive Battle","Sir Yuan was displeased. only 70 years? Even my breath is longer than this!”","“This 70 years will be the time to lay the foundation. Its value is immeasurable.”","“That won’t do either!” Sir Yuan’s voice was indignant. “It’s not worth it for me to cultivate a Grand Yan Immortal for a mere 70 years!”","At this time, Jian Wushuang said, “Senior, there is no need to cultivate and pass on the inheritance.”","“No, you must accept this old man’s inheritance!”","“...”","In the end, he said, “On top of the original 70 years, I want you to protect the Young Emperor five times in the future no matter where you are.”","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Okay.”","After some haggling, the final result was achieved.","The Young Emperor left with a smile, but when he turned around, his eyes were filled with loneliness.","Only two figures were left in the huge Dao Field.","“From the Entry Yan realm to the Yan Immortal realm, it’s actually a harsh selection. To my understanding, that’s the real threshold. It’s the real test from nothing to something, the real test of being reborn from the mortal world to obtain the Dao.”","“In my understanding and perception, the realm above the Grand Yan Immortal is actually like the sound of a clear spring, and it is natural.”","“What I want to say is that those who are trapped in the Yan Immortal stage and are unable to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal stage are all extremely stupid fools. They are fools with their heads growing on their butts.”","After a round of scolding, he added, “Of course, the Young Emperor is an exception. He can’t cultivate because of the lack of innate fate energy.”","“In short, any Yan Immortal who has some Enlightenment will not be trapped in the Yan Immortal realm.”","“Now, tell me, how do you want to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal and rely on my inheritance?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and said calmly, “Let nature take its course.”","“Oh, you think it’s that simple?” Sir Yuan sneered. “Do you know how I broke through to Grand Yan Immortal?”","He said, “You stopped the conflict with war. Ther was no end to your killing.”","Sir Yuan was slightly taken aback. Then, he praised, “You have a good eye.”","“Now, one of the inheritances I’m giving you is how to kill Yan Immortals in a short time and turn a part of the Immortal Source into your own.”","“But before that, I’m going to give you a good beating!”","Sir Yuan shouted coldly. At the same time, he moved like lightning, bringing with him the power of heaven and earth.","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a bitter smile. It seemed that a beating was inevitable.","However, he was not easy to compromise. Even if he was an entire cultivation realm higher than him, he still dared to collide with the old man.","The Invisible Sword in his hand moved forward.","At the same time as the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent burst forth, the Immortal Style Little Mountain River also covered it.","The Selfless True Shadow was added to his body in an instant, and he exploded with the most brilliant attack.","The most unusual battle had begun on the chessboard training hall.","In the entire Heavenly Region, the black ocean was rumbling.","After coming out of the Lower Three Heavens, the thin purple robe was the first to meet the pale Young Emperor and put the cloak on him.","“Your Highness, there are some changes in the Six Heavens Realm.”","The skinny purple-robed man said with a serious expression.","The Young Emperor raised his eyes and looked at the deep void ahead. “They’re here?”","“Yes, we’ve already gathered quite a number of Yan Immortals.”","“Good, good, very good!” he said, his pale face turning even redder. “My father has just left, and these Good Brothers of mine can’t wait to hang me in the hall!”","“Your Highness, our strength has already been damaged when we destroyed Celestial Region. I’m afraid we might at a disadvantage here,” the skinny purple-robed man said in a low voice. “Shall we invite Heavenly Official Jian here...”","The Young Emperor interrupted him and said with a dark look in his eyes, “Are we so helpless without him? How did we survive without him?”","“This time, even if I have to destroy their foundations, I will skin them alive!”","“Yes.”","As the astral winds raged, streaks of flowing light gathered from all directions in the void that had been torn apart by the battle with the Celestial Region.","There were at least hundreds of Yan Immortals.","They all stopped in the void outside the Six Heavens Realm. All kinds of flowing lights dyed the entire void with rainbow shadows.","At the front of the group of top cultivators, there were dozens of Yan Immortals. They all looked serious.","There were hundreds of thousands of top cultivators, and they were filled with unimaginable pressure.","But in the eyes of the hundreds of Yan Immortals, it was laughable.","They only needed to charge back and forth once, and the camp formed by the top cultivators would probably be shattered.","The next moment, a pale and gloomy figure in luxurious clothes walked out of the Six Heavens Realm and ascended to the front of the camp.","After seeing this, the expressions of the 200 Yan Immortals changed slightly. They never thought that the Young Emperor would come out in person.","The Young Emperor pointed the soft sword forward and looked ahead coldly.","After the initial chaos returned to peace, the leader, a Yan Immortal shrouded in dark light, stepped forward and said, “Your Highness, you can leave now. We are not here for you, but for your Six Heavens Realm.”","“As long as we destroy one Heavenly Region, we will have completed our mission. Don’t make things difficult for us.”","Hearing this, the Young Emperor sneered, “You are just one of Prince Jiu’s broken dogs. Since he still won’t be obedient after suffering such a heavy injury, I’ll make him suffer again today!”","More than 200 Yan Immortals stepped forward with cold faces, aiming for the Six Heavens Realm.","This was Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s first test after leaving the Great Si Region. A battle that would determine the outcome had quietly begun.","...","“Did you see that? Prince Yan seems to have been surrounded outside the Six Heavens Realm.”","In the brightly lit hall, where Immortal clouds curled up, Cui Jing rushed in to convey the message.","Chun Qiu, who was sorting out some Emperor-grade pills, looked up at him and went back to his work.","“What? the Young Emperor is surrounded?!” Chen Qing, who was sleeping on the desk, heard this and instantly flashed out of the hall."]},{"number":4875,"title":"Chapter 4875 Fall In Six Days","paragraphs":["4875 Fall In Six Days","Wei Liujia, who was meditating at the side, slowly opened his eyes. He looked around and said, “Should we go and help?”","Finally, she could not help but ask, “Aren’t you going to help?”","“Help? Help with what?” After Cui Jing delivered the message, he took an Immortal fruit from the desk like a monkey in a hurry. He leaned against the corridor pillar and began to chew leisurely. He mumbled, “It’s not like something happened to Brother Jian. What do the others have to do with us?”","Zhao Ting originally wanted to speak, but after looking around, he swallowed his words.","She finally understood that they all followed Jian Wushuang’s lead. They did not even care about the Young Emperor who ruled the Six Heavens Realm.","‘Aren’t they afraid that Prince Yan will be angry and attack them?’ This was what Zhao Ting thought, but she quickly denied this thought.","Other than the unclear relationship between Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor, the mysterious Di Qing alone was extremely attractive.","Zhao Ting had an intuition that Di Qing was definitely directly involved in the destruction of more than half of Prince Jiu’s Great Mi Heaven.","If he wanted to drag all of them to the battlefield, he was afraid that only Jian Wushuang could do it.","She decided not to care about this matter anymore and continued to sit up with her eyes closed. After all, even if the entire six days fell, Jian Wushuang and the others would still be in front of her.","...","“I want your lives!”","With one strike, he pushed back several Yan Immortals. Wisps of black and white aura surged around the Young Emperor, carrying an unrivaled power.","It was his unique Immortal Style, and it was once capable of fighting against Prince Jiu.","Once a Yan Immortal comprehended an Immortal Style, it was equivalent to touching the realm of the Grand Yan Immortal with one hand. To ordinary Yan Immortals, it would be an existence that could crush them.","The skinny purple-robed man led the dozens of Yan Immortals. Their losses were the least.","However, the number of top cultivators was decreasing rapidly.","Against the encirclement of over 200 Yan Immortals, even 100,000 peak cultivators would be forced to retreat.","Immediately after, Cheng Qing’s participation in the battle forcefully blocked another wave of unstoppable attacks.","“Your Highness, leave quickly. Leave this to me,” Chen Qing shouted in a deep voice, his powerful Yan power blocked the ten Yan Immortals behind him.","“The Six Heavens Realm is right behind me. Where can I retreat to? Tell me!” the Young Emperor said angrily. “Even if we all die in battle today, don’t even think about retreating!”","However, the current situation was obviously aimed at destroying the Six Heavens Realm. How could they stop it? Other than that person.","Hearing this, the Young Emperor reached out and grabbed his collar. “Don’t look for him. Can’t we win without him?”","Cheng Qing wanted to retort, but when he saw his cold expression, he could only grit his teeth and say, “Then we can only fight to the death!”","The Young Emperor let go of him and charged forward. Facing the Yan Immortal army, he drew his sword.","“Young Emperor, don’t force us!”","A dark palm that covered the sky forced him back. Yan Immortal, whose face was hidden by the dark clouds, said coldly, and his two red eyes shot out.","“We’ll only destroy the Six Heavens Realm. You can leave.”","He spat on the ground and wiped the divine blood off his face.","“Did the Prince send you here?” the Young Emperor asked coldly.","“So what if he did? So what if he didn’t? Your Six Heavens Realm will be destroyed today!” the Yan Immortal leader said coldly. “What do you have to stop me? The army behind you is only there to make up the numbers.”","The Young Emperor sneered, I can guarantee that if you take one step into the Six Heavens Realm, none of you will be able to leave alive.”","Ignoring his threat, the Yan Immortal leader led close to 100 Yan Immortals and charged forward.","In an instant, a great power that could destroy hundreds of Heavenly Regions rose up, giving off an extremely bright light, and exploded in front of the Six Heavens Realm.","In just one attack, one-tenth of the entire army of top cultivators was wiped out.","Every Yan Immortal that came to this Heavenly Region was extremely cold and brutal.","Every time they attacked, they could wipe out dozens of top cultivators, and countless top cultivators died quickly.","All kinds of powerful moves were irresistible divine punishments for top cultivators. Just touching them would easily destroy their Life Source.","“Motherf*cker, a bunch of trash!” Chen Qing fought valiantly, wiping out a Yan Immortal with a single palm strike. Behind him, thousands of rays of light suddenly condensed, and a hazy image form appeared.","He controlled the giant image form, which was like a divine mountain, and held back the attacks of more than ten Yan Immortals. “All of you, die!”","The skinny purple-robed man also led less than 50 Yan Immortals to fight back.","However, even so, it still could not stop the decline.","Over 200 Yan Immortals were like an unparalleled arrow, ruthlessly piercing into his heart, unable to pull it out.","Furthermore, as these Yan Immortals went deeper, more streams of light appeared from all directions.","The Young Emperor’s heart sank. There were more than 100 Yan Immortals in the Six Heavens Realm this time!","They stood still in the air and joined the bloody battle!","Close to 400 Yan Immortals!","It was a scene of destruction.","The Young Emperor was stunned, and his face was so red that it looked like it was about to bleed.","Who in the entire Great Si Region could have such power to mobilize 400 Yan Immortals?","The fall of the Six Heavens Realm was a foregone conclusion.","This was no longer a force that only Prince Jiu could mobilize. There must be other forces sent by the other Princes.","As these hundreds of Yan Immortals joined the battle, they crushed the top cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm like crushing dry weeds.","Countless top cultivators had died, and the gates to the Six Heavens Realm had opened!","Cheng Qing’s precious image was instantly smashed to pieces, and all kinds of light rays that shot into the sky illuminated the void.","This battle, which involved more than 500 Yan Immortals, was the biggest battle ever since Emperor Zhen Wuyang established the Great Si Region.","Their goal was to completely destroy the entire Six Heavens Realm.","The void collapsed, and the gate to the Six Heavens Realm was wide open. No force could stop them anymore.","The first to bear the brunt was Big Lonely Heaven.","“Your Highness, please retreat. The Six Heavens Realm is no longer safe,” the skinny purple-robed man had appeared behind the Young Emperor and said in a hoarse voice."]},{"number":4876,"title":"Chapter 4876 I Want You Dead","paragraphs":["4876 I Want You Dead","After withstanding the violent attacks of over 20 Yan Immortals, Cheng Qing’s Immortal body was on the verge of shattering.","From the initial 100,000-strong peak cultivators, less than 10,000 was left.","Out of the dozens of Yan Immortals, only 10 remained.","After opening the gate to the Six Heavens Realm, the first to bear the brunt, the Big Lonely Heaven was on the verge of destruction.","All sorts of powers that shook the Heavenly Region exploded.","With the combined power of more than 400 Yan Immortals, they tore the entire Heavenly Region apart.","The fate energy of the Heavenly Region, the land, the earth, everything was turned into dust.","At this moment, a few figures were standing outside the hall, all of them looking up at this scene with grave expressions.","Looking through the dark clouds, he saw the continents floating in the void after being destroyed. It was an indescribable tragedy.","Cui Jing looked a little nervous. “It seems that they are serious this time. Even the Big Lonely Heaven has been shattered. How many Yan Immortals have come?”","“Looking at the situation, I’m afraid there are at least 200 of them,” Zhao Ting said in a rare nervous tone.","“How, how much? 200?” Cui Jing’s mouth was wide open, as if he had heard the most ridiculous words.","“I’m afraid there are far more than 200 Yan Immortals here,” Chun Qiu said at this moment. Then, he stretched out his palm and pointed at the void above his head.","As expected, streams of light of various colors gathered in the void, and there were no less than 300 to 400 of them.","Each ray of light represented a Yan Immortal.","In just an instant, they had completely destroyed the Big Lonely Heaven, and were now attacking the next Heavenly Region.","“Good Lord, they can’t be coming for us, right?” Cui Jing’s expression turned ugly. “A few hundred Yan Immortals, I’m afraid we...”","As the atmosphere turned heavy and deathly silent, Di Qing walked out of the hall while stretching. “What’s all the fuss about? It’s even disturbed my good sleep.”","When Chun Qiu and the others saw Di Qing wake up from his deep sleep, they felt an inexplicable sense of peace.","Although they did not know Di Qing’s cultivation realm, they all heaved a sigh of relief.","Di Qing came to the outside of the hall and looked up at the sky.","“Wow. It seems like the number of people who want to kill Prince Yan is no less than the number of people who want to kill Prince Mo.” Di Qing slowly raised the corners of his mouth.","Cui Jing asked, “Are we preparing to run now?”","“Run, run to where?” Di Qing glanced at him, then looked at the Yan Immortals that were about to descend from the sky. “Wushuang is not back yet. If we leave now, it will cause a lot of unnecessary trouble.”","“We’ll guard this place. No matter how many Yan Immortals come, we’ll kill them all!”","Di Qing’s golden eyes suddenly turned sharp, and layers of golden ripples surged around him, bringing with them a trembling aura.","Then, he directly soared into the sky.","“He... Is he crazy...” Cui Jing was dumbfounded.","“He’s not crazy. Prepare to fight,” said Chun Qiu as he pulled out a dagger formed by Yan power from his waist.","Cui Jing gritted his teeth. “Then I’ll be crazy for once!”","In the dark sky, nearly 100 Yan Immortals stepped into Little Lonely Heaven at the same time.","Looking at the Heavenly Region that was filled with Yan power, they did not hesitate at all. They activated Yan power and prepared to destroy it.","At this moment, a lazy and cold voice suddenly rang out from all directions. “A group of blind b*stards, get lost!”","All the Yan Immortals gathered here focused their gazes and looked straight ahead.","Di Qing stepped in the air, and the Yan power released from his body was all restrained, like the most inconspicuous top cultivator.","Upon hearing this insult, the leader, an old Yan Immortal, narrowed his eyes and shrieked, “You’re looking for death!”","With that, an earth-shaking image of a black tower came crashing down from his hand.","Di Qing did not even bother to lift his eyelids. Facing the black tower that had grown a million feet in the wind, he made a shocking move.","He raised his head, opened his mouth, and spat.","That mouthful of saliva was like a divine arrow against the wind, and it suddenly landed on the black tower.","Rumble...","The golden spittle easily shattered the black tower, and then shot towards old Yan Immortal without losing momentum.","Sizzle...","From the neck down, the entire stomach of the Immortal body disappeared, and even the Immortal source was destroyed into nothingness.","“What, what’s going on?”","Even when he died, he still could not believe that he was killed by a spit.","The sky fell into a dead silence, and all the Yan Immortals took a step back, looking at Di Qing vigilantly.","“I’ve said it before. You can destroy anywhere in the Six Heavens Realm, but not this place,” Di Qing looked at them and said lazily. “B*stards, did I make myself clear enough? Do you need me to repeat it?”","After a brief silence, a clean-faced, beardless, middle-aged Yan Immortal stepped forward and said, “Who are you? We came here to destroy the Six Heavens Realm, including this place. If you leave now, we won’t make things difficult for you.”","“You won’t make things difficult for me?” Di Qing raised his eyebrows and said, “You little b*stards, is this how you talk to me?”","As Di Qing said this, he reached out and clenched his fist. The middle-aged Yan Xian could not speak. His face turned purple and black, and even Yan power was extinguished.","Then, his head exploded without any warning, and his entire Immortal body was shattered.","“I’ll repeat it for the last time. Leave this place now and I’ll let you go. But if you insist on destroying this place, I’ll take your lives!”","Di Qing flicked his sleeve, his face extremely dark.","At this moment, all of the Yan Immortals felt unparalleled pressure.","The pressure made them hesitate. For a moment, no one dared to step forward.","However, as more and more Yan Immortals ascended into Little Lonely Heaven, the atmosphere began to turn from dead silence to restlessness.","Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Zhao Ting, and Wei Liujia, the other Yan Immortals, also rushed over. They all looked at the overwhelming number of Yan Immortals with serious expressions.","In the face of such a situation, Di Qing was calm as if he did not care at all, but then a secret voice came out of his mouth.","“Hey, listen to me. I haven’t fully recovered yet. I’m afraid it’s hard for me to deal with so many Yan Immortals. So, if you don’t scare them away, run as far as you can. Do you understand? ”","“...”","“...”","Chun Qiu and the others turned from shock to helplessness. They felt like they had boarded a broken ship.","Cui Jing’s face was bitter. “So, you put on such a strong aura just to scare them away?”"]},{"number":4877,"title":"Chapter 4877 The Great Heavenly Official Jian","paragraphs":["4877 The Great Heavenly Official Jian","The entire sky was covered by Yan Immortal’s light. The power gathered by more than 400 Yan Immortals was unimaginable.","The atmosphere was getting more and more restless.","The leading 10 Yan Immortals also looked at each other and tried to attack.","Yan power surged and rushed towards Di Qing like a dragon.","He laughed coldly and suddenly put his palms together. Thousands of golden rays shot up like a huge net and came down.","The dozen Yan Immortals did not even have the time to retreat before they were all ground into dust by the golden light.","“Anyone who dares to take another step forward will die!”","Di Qing shouted coldly, and at the same time, an invisible image form that covered a million miles appeared.","All of the Yan Immortals were shocked, but after looking at each other, they all released their Yan power and attacked together.","Di Qing, who was originally extremely arrogant, immediately shouted after seeing this scene, “Run!”","A moment ago, Chun Qiu and the others had still been displaying unparalleled courage, but in the next moment, they had turned around and fled without a trace.","“Catch up and crush them!”","As the earth-shaking sound rang out, the entire Little Lonely Heaven began to fall apart.","The continent plane was shattered, and Little Lonely Heaven, the most vast Heavenly Region in the Six Heavens Realm, was also shattered.","Wherever the hundreds of Yan Immortals passed, Heavenly Regions were destroyed.","At this point, two parts of the entire Six Heavens Realm had been destroyed.","“Your Highness, let’s go find Brother Jian. Otherwise, the entire Six Heavens Realm will be destroyed.” Chen Qing’s face was tired, he was already an arrow at the end of its flight.","Outside the void of the Six Heavens Realm, the Young Emperor was in a daze.","“Your Highness, let’s look for Heavenly Official Jian. The Six Heavens Realm has been destroyed, and all of our heritage is gone,” the skinny purple-robed man said.","The remaining Yan Immortals around him did not dare to speak.","At this time, the Six Heavens Realm was almost wiped out, and even Heavenly Official Jian. would not be able to save them.","A stream of divine blood gushed out of the corner of his mouth without any warning, and the Young Emperor’s body swayed.","The skinny purple-robed man reached out to support him and then handed him a square towel.","Slowly wiping away the divine blood at the corner of his mouth, the Young Emperor’s eyes seemed to be compromising.","“Let’s go to the third Heavenly Region, we’ll welcome Heavenly Official Jian. there.”","...","“Where are we running to? There are so many people chasing us.”","Cui Jing’s panting voice resounded in the void. Chun Qiu and the others followed Di Qing and fled for their lives.","Di Qing, who was at the front, closed his eyes tightly, as if he was trying to sense something.","“Don’t say anything. I’m trying to sense where Wushuang is.” Di Qing said, and then opened his eyes to look at the deep void in front of him.","That was the third Heavenly Region of the Lower Three Heavens.","After Little Lonely Heaven was completely destroyed, the hundreds of Yan Immortals did not stop, they also followed Di Qing and the others, gathering in the Lower Three Heavens.","“Won’t anything happen if we bring so many Yan Immortals to Big Brother Jian?”","Cui Jing stopped in the void of the third Heavenly Region and said nervously.","“Of course something will happen. So, the most important thing now is to call Wushuang out and we will leave this place together,” Di Qing frowned and said. “You guys go in and find Wushuang. I’ll hold them off for a moment.”","Chun Qiu nodded. He was not an indecisive person, so he immediately ascended to the third Heavenly Region.","With the arrival of Di Qing and the others, the Young Emperor, Chen Qing, and the others also came to meet them.","When Cheng Qing saw them, he was instantly overjoyed, “Great, I knew that you guys were fine.”","“You’re also here to find big Brother Jian?” Cui Jing welcomed them.","“Motherf*cker, there are too many of these b*stards. I’ll come here and leave with Brother Jian before I make any plans,” Cheng Qing gritted his teeth and said.","Just then, the group of Yan Immortals arrived.","The remaining 400 or so Yan Immortals were like the sun and stars. The aura they gave off was extremely oppressive.","Even in the entire Great Si Region, 400 Yan Immortals was an unimaginable number.","Apart from the Grand Yan Immortal, they were the most powerful force in the entire Great Si Region. They could destroy stars with a wave of their hands and destroy the Heavenly Region with a flick of their fingers.","They were so arrogant that they could beat the Eldest Prince of Zhen Wuyang like a stray dog.","“Get out of the way. We are only here to destroy the Six Heavens Realm. The other Yan Immortals will not be affected,” The black-robed Yan Immortal shrouded in dark clouds said in a low voice, “Otherwise, all of you will be buried with him!”","Di Qing’s face turned cold, and a touch of disgust appeared in his eyes. “What if I don’t give in? What should I do?”","“Then die!” the black-robed Yan Xian shrieked. With his surroundings as the origin, the void quickly collapsed. At the same time, nine netherworld pythons-like bolts of silk drilled out of the collapsed void and went straight for Di Qing.","As he made his move, the 100 Yan Immortals also released their full power.","All kinds of forces that could easily tear apart the laws of the Heavenly Dao came down with billions of rainbow shadows.","“Damn it!” Di Qing gritted his teeth. Before he could recover from the loss of one true life, he was afraid that he would be seriously injured again.","The Yan Immortal was above the Heavenly Dao, an existence that had transcended the shackles. Even the most ordinary Yan Immortal could create the Heavenly Dao with a wave of his hand.","Thus, the combined attack of the 100 Yan Immortals could not even be withstood by the laws of the Heavenly Dao.","The collapse of the endless void caused a tremor that could even turn the Lower Three Heavens into dust.","However, in the next moment, something happened.","That terrifying strike had yet to land. Time seemed to have stopped, and even the collapsing void was closing.","Di Qing, who was gritting his teeth and about to explode, was also stunned when he saw this.","Everything was eerily silent.","Then, a mysterious scene appeared. A bright river that stretched for billions of miles quietly floated in the void and easily devoured the attack that gathered nearly 100 Yan Immortals.","All the Yan Immortals looked towards the source of the river.","A naked figure with Blood Qi rising around him slowly walked out of the barrier.","With every step he took, there would be strands of extremely dense Blood Qi surging under his skin, which was extremely breathtaking.","Behind this figure stood a figure in a black robe that was as tall as a divine peak.","Ink-like droplets of water dripped into the void through the black robe.","He slowly raised his head, and his originally golden eyes began to emit a blood-red light.","“H-Heavenly Official Jian!”","The remaining Yan Immortals and tens of thousands of top cultivators behind the Young Emperor all widened their eyes at this moment, their hearts beating like drums.","The Young Emperor’s lips curved up slightly, but he returned to his calm state.","Di Qing also raised his eyebrows slightly and heaved a sigh of relief. Even he himself did not realize that he would be completely relaxed after seeing Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4878,"title":"Chapter 4878 The Dao of Slaughter","paragraphs":["4878 The Dao of Slaughter","Wisps of Blood Qi were like ravines in the mountains, surging in his naked upper body. Even the void seemed to be trembling.","Jian Wushuang felt that the Yan power surging in his meridians seemed to have reached a certain critical point and needed to be completely burst out.","The uncontrollable heat seemed to burn his Immortal body completely.","The mountain-like figure behind him was a part of Sir Yuan’s True Shadow, which was completely attached to Jian Wushuang’s back.","When the phenomenon of the Heavenly River disappeared, the hundreds of Yan Immortals were still in shock as they looked ahead with lingering fear.","Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the rest had also calmed down from their previous panic.","When Yan Immortal army was attacking the Six Heavens Realm, Jian Wushuang, who was in the third Heavenly Region of the Lower Three Heavens, had vaguely sensed it. However, because he was in the inheritance realm of Sir Yuan, the passage of time was different, so he naturally could not sense the outside world.","If he had not heard Chun Qiu’s voice, Jian Wushuang would have only woken up when the third Heavenly Region was destroyed.","“Since you’ve come out, it’s easy. Should we run or fight?” Di Qing looked at him, and an inexplicable desire to fight rose in his heart.","“Of course we’re fighting back.” Looking at the Yan Immortals in the sky, Jian Wushuang had no fear in his eyes, and he had even activated Yan power to its peak.","The Blood Qi around him was too strong and terrifying, he was like a completely different person from before he went to the third Heavenly Region.","And all of this was because of the inheritance of Sir Yuan.","Although he had been in Sir Yuan’s cultivation realm for less than a month, the passage of time inside was completely different from the outside world. Jian Wushuang had roughly calculated that one day was at least equivalent to 100 years outside.","In other words, Jian Wushuang had been in the realm for at least 2,000 years.","2,000 years of constant fighting had turned the Karma and killing tribulation in his body into Blood Qi.","Sir Yuan stopped killing with battle and Ascended to the position of Grand Yan Immortal with endless slaughter. His Dao was simple and pure, with only the word ‘slaughter’.","He gave Jian Wushuang four words.","‘The Dao of Slaughter.’","Now, Jian Wushuang wanted to try to loosen the bottleneck and break through to the Grand Yan Immortal!","He stepped forward slowly.","Di Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the others were no longer prepared to escape. They all followed behind him, facing the Yan Immortals in the sky without fear.","Jian Wushuang was invincible below the Grand Yan Immortal.","Between his brows, a seven-star system flowed slowly, and the Selfless True Shadow supported his body.","“You’re acting mysterious!” A Yan Immortal shouted and then led the ten over Yan Immortals away.","All kinds of overwhelming Yan power forces bombarded over, and there were even Immortal auras among them!","Jian Wushuang suddenly stepped forward and stretched out his right palm. Facing the Yan Immortal who was pouncing at him, Jian Wushuang put his fingers together like a sword and lightly chopped downward.","A Scarlet sword radiance expanded millions of feet in the wind, cutting the void into two and shattering crazily.","Seeing this, the Yan Immortals in front of him hurriedly released their Yan power and tried to cut down the sword light.","However, this scarlet sword radiance was simply too vast and majestic. Even the laws of the Heavenly Dao were easily shattered. The void ripples that it stirred up wrapped them up in an instant.","Pfft...","A total of 13 Yan Immortals exploded into clouds of blood mist under the million-foot scarlet sword radiance.","A single sword strike easily killed 13 Yan Immortals. Such a shocking scene once again shocked all the Yan Immortals in the sky.","They could not believe that this guy, who was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage, could kill a Yan Immortal who was dozens of times stronger than him with one strike!","Not only did it shock them, but even Di Qing’s eyebrows twitched.","He felt that Jian Wushuang’s change was a little too fast.","When he first met him in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, he was just a slightly outstanding Yan Immortal. Then, he mistakenly entered the Heavenly Court of the past, went to war with the Great Mi Heaven, and stepped into the Immortal realm. After this series of events, he seemed to have completely transformed and grown.","However, the speed of his growth was a little too fast, even Di Qing was a little moved.","This slash was made with his hand as a sword, but it still released 100 percent of its power.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s Sword Dao and Sword Intent were unconsciously immersed in the Slaughter Dao and became bloodthirsty.","The depths of his eyes were no longer pure red gold, but mixed with traces of scarlet.","Whoosh...","As if it was raining ink, the body of Sir Yuan behind Jian Wushuang seemed to wake up and shook off the raindrops from her black robe.","“A bunch of bugs. They’ve only eaten luck for a few years and haven’t fully matured yet, but they’re already walking down the wrong path. Since that’s the case, let’s all stay here!”","With the muffled voice of Sir Yuan’s True Shadow, the originally broken void began to be covered by dark red tides.","Under this dark red tide, all the Yan Immortals felt their Immortal source throb and their Yan power flow faster. There was an uncontrollable restlessness in their meridians.","“Kid, I’ll leave these bugs to you. You can only acknowledge me after you’ve removed all of them.”","After releasing the dark red tide, the True Shadow of Sir Yuan exhausted all its energy and then dissipated with the wind.","Looking at the Yan Immortals in the sky, Jian Wushuang’s mouth turned bitter and then cold again.","In the next moment, facing the Yan Immortals that filled the sky, he made the first move.","His figure broke through the void and two huge palms came crashing down.","The few Yan Immortals who tried to stop him had their heads smashed into pieces just as they were about to activate their Yan power.","“Let’s all go and exterminate the Six Heavens Realm!”","The leader of the black-robed Yan Immortals roared and a long and narrow red tassel shot out from his sleeve and went straight for Jian Wushuang!","“B*stards, I’ll teach you a lesson today!”","Di Qing shouted coldly. At the same time, the void within a million miles collapsed, and from a huge vortex, a giant claw with golden light descended!","Following the descent of this giant claw, the entire void space was in complete chaos. All sorts of Heavenly Dao laws were thrown into disorder, and boundless squalls surged from the shattered areas.","The giant claw with every single golden scale was extremely clear as it ruthlessly grabbed down. Some Yan Immortals were unable to dodge in time, and their divine souls and Immortal Sources were directly destroyed!","With Di Qing joining the battle, the pressure on Jian Wushuang was relieved.","He drew his sword, and the Invisible Sword in his hand also turned dark red due to the immersion of the killing intent.","After destroying a middle-aged Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source, Jian Wushuang started to kill crazily.","In Sir Yuan’s Domain, Jian Wushuang fought with Sir Yuan for 1500 years without stopping. In the remaining 500 years, he had only done one thing, which had nothing to do with comprehending the way of the sword.","He used himself as the hammer and everything as the Sword Embryo. He mechanically and repeatedly pulled out the sword in the most primitive way, completely abandoning any sword form.","The reason he did so was because of the principles he had learned from Ding Beichun, who had been forging swords day after day in Sword Heaven for countless years.","The Great Dao was simple, but the Great Yan Domain was complex."]},{"number":4879,"title":"Chapter 4879 The Immortal Trapping Array","paragraphs":["4879 The Immortal Trapping Array","The birth of the billions of worlds and the countless cycles of destruction the universe had gone through had long surpassed imagination.","However, all Great Daos were pure and simple from the moment they were born.","The way of the sword was no exception. It also conformed to the principle of the Great Dao being the simplest. The various Sword Dao, Sword Intents, and sword forms that were derived later conformed to the principle of the most complex.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang began to comprehend the original true meaning of the Sword Principle from Ding Beichun’s simple movements.","Perhaps only Jian Wushuang himself knew why he had done so.","The way of the sword was his foundation, his Great Dao. If he went back to the source and sought the ultimate true meaning, he might be able to open up a true path.","He repeated the same numbed movements as he charged into the Yan Immortals and completely messed up the situation.","Di Qing followed closely behind, with ten-sided wings on his back, shooting out fatal golden feathers.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing also followed closely. They were in danger, and they kept on charging.","A look of worry flashed across Wei Liujia’s face, but he did not hesitate to charge forward.","Zhao Ting wanted to stop him, but she retracted her palm. Looking at the extremely unequal situation in front of her, she sighed faintly and then circulated Yan power to join in.","The five Yan Immortals led by Jian Wushuang and one Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal tore a hole in the encirclement.","Of the 400 Yan Immortal camp, in this battle, almost eighty were killed!","“Your Highness, the Six Heavens Realm is fine.” the skinny purple-robed man leaned over and said. “It’s time for us to do something for Heavenly Official Jian and the others.”","The Young Emperor looked at the back of the god-like figure and a trace of fatigue flashed in his eyes. “Go.”","“Yes, Sir!” Chen Qing could not wait any longer. He really wanted to fight alongside Jian Wushuang. Even though his Immortal body had only recovered slightly, he still rushed out in an instant.","“The remaining Yan Immortals of the Six Heavens Realm, go and follow Heavenly Official Jian,” the skinny purple-robed man flicked his sleeve and said in a serious tone.","The remaining ten or so Yan Immortals looked at each other, then gritted their teeth and charged forward.","Jian Wushuang cut off Yan Immortal’s head and then cast an Ancestral Skill, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","The vast heavenly gate opened, illuminating the entire void. A giant finger that seemed to carry tens of thousands of Suns came pressing down.","In an instant, several Yan Immortals were heavily injured.","This was the most mysterious Ancestral Skill that the Cosmos God had given him. It had allowed Jian Wushuang to fight against Void God’s True Shadow even when he was a Half Invincible Supreme.","But now, after entering the ultimate Great Yan Domain, the ancestral Skill had already shown signs of fatigue, especially when facing Yan Immortals. Although it could still achieve the ideal effect, if Yan Immortal tried his best to protect himself and avoid, he could still offset the heavy damage caused by the Ancestral Skill.","However, Jian Wushuang could feel that the Transcendence Heavenly Gate and Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate were definitely not the limits. There should be two more moves.","However, he did not know if it was because he had entered the final realm of the Great Yan Domain, or if his Comprehension of the Cosmos God had completely dissipated, but the ancestral Skill’s space for Ascension had been completely sealed. In the end, only these two techniques were left.","“Brother Jian, Chen Qing is here to help you!”","With a loud laugh, Chen Qing’s mountain-like figure flew to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Be careful.” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and laughed as he slashed at Yan Immortal who was chasing after him. Then, he continued to fight.","The Yan Immortal’s camp began to fall into chaos. They were not sent by a single force, but by at least two forces. Naturally, they began to collapse.","However, 400 Yan Immortals were too vast and terrifying. Even under the joint attack of Jian Wushuang and Di Qing, they did not panic and began to fight back.","Of the 400 Yan Immortals, only 300 remained.","Without Di Qing’s pressure, he would not have been able to kill nearly 100 Yan Immortals in an instant.","Under the cover of Sir Yuan’s killing intent, Jian Wushuang completely activated the Slaughter Dao. For a moment, no Yan Immortal could get close to him.","In the Domain of Sir Yuan’s inheritance, he was able to comprehend his killing intent in a short period of thousands of years, which was also a coincidence.","This was because in the Sand Demon Cave, the Master of the Sand Demon Cave, Sha Qing, had set a plan and planted Karma inside Jian Wushuang.","It was because of this that Sir Yuan noticed the thick Blood Qi hidden in Jian Wushuang’s body and directly transformed the Blood Qi that could not be dispelled into killing intent.","This allowed him to comprehend the Slaughter Dao in a short thousand years.","Now, Jian Wushuang had three Great Daos. The main one was the Sword Dao, the other two were Protection Dao and Slaughter Dao which he had obtained from Sir Yuan!","The Dao of Protection was a Great Dao that he had obtained when he became Cosmos God. Although it had been sealed up, it still existed and provided Jian Wushuang with a steady stream of fate energy and Comprehension.","He had already exceeded the limits of an ordinary Yan Immortal. Even Yan Immortals who also mastered Immortal Styles could not gain any advantage against him. They could even be killed if they were not careful.","Not a single Yan Immortal could stop Jian Wushuang’s attack. Even with more than ten Yan Immortals working together, they could only be defeated.","Against such an unbelievable enemy, the Yan Immortals that had gathered here had become live targets.","However, this situation was soon reversed.","“Form the formation!”","A deep voice reverberated through the void, carrying a terrifying aura.","With this shout, the 60 Yan Immortals released a vast amount of Yan power.","As Jian Wushuang and Di Qing were too deep in the Yan Immortal camp, they were the first to be affected.","The Heaven Revolting Array Formation rose up grandly, with a total of 60 Yan Immortals as the base of the formation, forming a six-sided formation.","The moment the formation was completed, everything seemed to be set in stone.","“You dare to stop me with such a small trick?!” Di Qing was furious. He flapped the ten-sided wings on his back, and thousands of golden feathers shot out at the boundary of the formation.","Clang, clang clang!","The golden feather directly entered the barrier. Not only did it not break the barrier, but it was also absorbed and strengthened the array again.","Di Qing frowned. “This formation seems to be able to absorb damage.”","Jian Wushuang also frowned. He disliked breaking formations the most. It was a waste of time and energy, especially at such a critical moment. It was almost fatal.","There were only two ways to break a formation that could absorb damage and convert it.","The first was to break through the formation’s critical point with one’s own strength and escape. The second was to use an external force to destroy the formation.","However, this formation was formed by 10 Yan Immortals at each foot. It was impossible to break the formation from the outside with just Cheng Qing, Chun Qiu, and a few others.","The only way was to break the formation from the inside!","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other and made up their minds.","The Selfless True Shadow condensed again and turned into the appearance of an image form."]},{"number":4880,"title":"Chapter 4880 Battle Against Great Yan Immortal","paragraphs":["4880 Battle Against Great Yan Immortal","This was the second time Jian Wushuang had condensed the image form of the Selfless True Sadow.","The first time he condensed it was when he completely defeated the Sect Master of the Celestial Region’s Heavenly Sect, Zhang Tiantian, and used the Selfless True Sadow to burst his Wheel of Suffering Immortal Style.","This was Jian Wushuang’s second Immortal Style. It was a special Immortal Style that was independent of Little Mountain River.","As a carefree, god-like True Shadow image condensed, Jian Wushuang’s Blood Qi burst forth.","Di Qing did not stop either, and a black image gradually formed, which kept expanding in the formation.","Cheng Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others also retreated, nervously watching this scene.","Through the formation with seven colors flowing, one could see a precious image and a black crow that was growing rapidly. In just tens of breaths, it had expanded to a million feet.","However, the array formation showed no signs of breaking.","With 60 Yan Immortals as the foundation, the formation was too solid.","Even though every Yan Immortal’s face was red, the endless energy still firmly trapped Jian Wushuang and Di Qing.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s Selfless True Sadow had grown to a height of hundreds of millions of feet, which had exceeded the height when he had fought with Zhang Tian of the Celestial Region. However, it still could not blow up the formation.","Di Qing’s celestial form of black crow had also reached a critical point.","“Motherf*cker, wait for me to get out of here, I’ll crush these b*stards into meat paste!” Di Qing’s face turned red. His True Life had just been damaged, and his strength was far from fully recovered, which was why he was trapped by this formation.","Jian Wushuang frowned. If the Selfless True Sadow could not tear the formation, he would have to think of another way.","With the completion of the formation, the remaining 200 Yan Immortals began to set off for the Lower Three Heavens of the Six Heavens Realm.","It was obvious that before they came to the Six Heavens Realm, they had been ordered to destroy the Six Heavens Realm at all costs.","Just as the formation was completed, the mysterious Yan Immortal, who gave out orders from time to time, flew to the top of the formation. A pitch-black dagger the length of an arm appeared in his hand.","The Young Emperor, who was watching from a distance, suddenly focused his eyes. The next moment, he jumped up and rushed toward the formation with his soft sword.","The thin purple-robed man also moved at this time and followed the Young Emperor.","The group of Yan Immortals that acted as the base of the formation constantly changed positions and released their Yan power to reinforce the formation.","When the next Yan Immortal exchanged positions, a silent, empty, black-and-white aura quietly rose.","It was the Young Emperor’s Immortal Style, a full-power Immortal Style. It exploded at the weakest point of the array.","It was not an easy task to use all his strength as the base of the formation, and it was impossible to stop this Immortal Style.","Of the ten Yan Immortals, four died on the spot, and the remaining six were all heavily injured.","At this point, one of the six array legs had been broken by the Young Emperor’s full-force attack.","It was also because of this attack that the entire array formation was on the verge of destruction.","Jian Wushuang and di Qing, who were trapped in the formation, also sensed it. They directly raised their Selfless True Sadow and black Crow celestial form again, finally breaking the entire formation!","“You’re looking for death!”","The black-robed Yan Immortal holding a black short sword fell from the top of the array formation. He looked at the Young Emperor angrily and then suddenly disappeared into a cloud.","By the time the Young Emperor noticed it again, the black-robed Yan Immortal had already reappeared in front of him.","The long and narrow dagger that was condensed with dark Yan power fell down and easily cut into his heart.","That place was where most Yan Immortals condensed their Immortal Styles.","This sword strike was aimed to kill.","The Young Emperor’s pupils suddenly narrowed and then slowly dissipated.","“Your Highness!” At this moment, the skinny purple-robed man completely lost his composure. He flew over, his palm condensed with Yan power and struck toward the black-robed Yan Immortal.","The black-robed Yan Immortal was also stunned. After he came to his senses, he threw the Young Emperor’s Immortal body away like trash and ran away.","The thin purple-robed man caught the Young Emperor. His haggard and calm face was filled with helplessness. “Your Highness, Your Highness, you...”","“My Companion, tell... tell Jian Wushuang to run.” The Young Emperor barely opened his eyes and passed out after uttering the last sentence.","The skinny purple-robed man nodded. He held him tightly in his arms and flew towards Cheng Qing.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold as he saw the scene. He chased after the Yan Immortal without hesitation.","He was like a sword of slaughter stained with divine blood, and no Yan Immortal could stop him.","Di Qing followed closely to cover Jian Wushuang’s back. The strength of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was fully revealed at this moment.","With the mountains and rivers in a single thought, he caught up with the black-robed Yan Immortal in a few breaths and stabbed him with his sword.","“Uh-ah!”","The black-robed Yan Immortal had no time to dodge and his right arm was cut off by Jian Wushuang.","Feeling the pain, he turned around and struck out with his palm.","Jian Wushuang did not dodge. After taking the blow, he stabbed again.","The black-robed Yan Immortal cried out in pain. The Sword Intent contained in the Invisible Sword instantly surged into his meridians and wreaked havoc.","“Damn things, today, none of you will live!” Jian Wushuang said coldly. The Invisible Sword in his hand shook and the Sword Intent finally tore it into powder.","The next moment, an ethereal voice rang out in the shattered void.","“What an extremely arrogant junior. Whether it’s his words or his style of doing things, he’s full of hostility.”","Heaven and earth were silent as all Yan Immortals looked toward the source of the sound.","Di Qing’s face was solemn, as he smelled the aura that only belonged to Grand Yan Immortal.","A crack appeared in the dark red void, and a middle-aged man with his hands behind his back walked out.","The energy around him was purer and more unfathomable than Yan Immortal’s. As he walked, even the broken Heavenly Dao began to repair slowly.","This middle-aged man was dressed in a scholarly long robe. He had a clean face and no beard, and he looked extremely refined.","After he arrived, he looked at Jian Wushuang and shook his head slowly, “I don’t like the hostility that you’re giving off. But in order not to waste my time, you should leave now and I’ll let you live.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and the corners of his mouth rose. “Who are you? You’re probably useless, huh?”","The scholarly middle-aged man was stunned. He did not expect a mere Yan Immortal to humiliate him.","By the time he reacted, his elegant robe suddenly trembled. An unimaginable power that exceeded the Yan Immortal realm covered the entire broken void.","Under such pressure, all the Yan Immortals felt a sense of suffocation. Their Immortal Source was crumpled and even the Yan power circulating in their Immortal bodies had slowed down to a certain extent.","“What a brat. You don’t have a filter on your mouth. Since you wish to die, then I will agree to send you to your death!”"]},{"number":4881,"title":"Chapter 4881 Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens","paragraphs":["4881 Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens","Grand Yan Immortal!","That was an aura that only a Grand Yan Immortal could possess.","The scholarly middle-aged man’s black hair was currently dancing in the wind. Layers of deep blue diamond-shaped armor covered his long robe.","All of the surging Yan power in the void poured toward him and continued to grow.","Looking at this scene calmly, Jian Wushuang’s heart surged with a high-spirited emotion.","“Wushuang, retreat, he is a Grand Yan Immortal,” Di Qing’s voice came from behind.","Jian Wushuang looked back at him and said with a smile, “I know what I’m doing. I need this battle to know how far I’ve grown.”","Back when he was in the Divine Power Universe, he was able to kill an Invisible Supreme expert as a Half Invisible realm cultivator, trampled on Snake God, and killed Bahuang. He even fought against Virtual God.","Now, in the Great Yan Domain, he was still the same Jian Wushuang, the Jian Wushuang who had dominated the world!","“Is this guy crazy?” Di Qing frowned and murmured softly. “Does he not know the gap between the two, or is he confident that he can defeat the Grand Yan Immortal?”","“No, that’s impossible.” Di Qing shook his head and denied it in his heart. Even though Jian Wushuang’s rapid growth shocked him, it did not mean that he believed that Jian Wushuang could defeat a Grand Yan Immortal with the power of a Yan Immortal.","Even in the entire Great Si Region or even the Great Yan Domain, there was no such precedent.","The gap between each realm was like a heavenly chasm.","Although he thought this way, Di Qing still looked at the back of the man who was as tough as a mountain.","“Damn it, what am I looking forward to...”","Di Qing was not the only one who had such an incredible thought. All the Yan Immortals in the sky looked at Jian Wushuang as if they were looking at a fool.","A Yan Immortal immediately recognized the middle-aged man who had rushed to the Six Heavens Realm. He was Chang Duoling, known as the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, who had been famous for a long time but had been traveling around the Great Si Region for dozens of years.","Almost all the Yan Immortals in the Great Si Region had heard of him.","Chang Duoling was known as the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens because on the day he became the Grand Yan Immortal, he had single-handedly destroyed the vast Jiufang Immortal Domain!","One must know that the Jiufang Immortal Domain could be considered as one of the top superpowers in the entire Great Si Region. Each Immortal Domain had no less than 50 Yan Immortals.","But even so, the Jiufang Immortal Domain was annihilated by Chang Duoling alone, and not a single Yan Immortal peak cultivator survived.","This battle was so earth-shattering that it shocked the heavenly court. Emperor Zhen Wuyang personally ordered for him to be captured and exiled to the Borderless Sea for several years.","It was after that battle, all Yan Immortals became familiar with Chang Duoling’s name.","And now, Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, had appeared in the Six Heavens Realm, causing quite a stir.","Jian Wushuang, who had been targeted, not only did not escape, but he also met the enemy head-on. This could no longer be described as an ant trying to shake a tree or overestimating his strength. To be exact, he was preparing to commit suicide.","Cui Jing rubbed his eyes hard and said in disbelief, “Brother Jian, are you preparing to fight with the Grand Yan Immortal?!”","Chun Qiu clenched the dagger in his hand tightly and did not speak.","It was as if the young man, who had been a man of few words ever since he was a prisoner of the Black Mountains in the Lower Three Heavens, had some kind of magical power that made those who followed him believe in him unconsciously, even if their goal was an insurmountable natural moat.","As he took a step forward, the thick Blood Qi around Jian Wushuang began to converge and was replaced by a clear and pure golden light.","He seemed to have entered a certain realm, his shoulder-length hair began to surge with golden light, so brilliant that even Yan Immortals could not look at it directly!","Chang Duoling, the so-called Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, was now covered in deep blue diamond-shaped armor leaves, and his aura had risen to a terrifying level.","“Junior, die!” He said coldly, as if he was sending down divine punishment.","The endless void shattered, and even the dark red tide domain set up by Yuan Jun’s true shadow was torn apart by this aura.","Dark blue torrents that were hundreds of thousands of feet thick came out of the broken void. Like True Dragons, they twisted and ran toward Jian Wushuang!","There were hundreds of these pillar-like dark blue torrents, and they descended from the cracks in the void, looking like they were going to destroy the world.","All of the Yan Immortals were shocked, this was an attack that did not discriminate, if they were to be touched, they would probably be destroyed.","Therefore, they had a tacit understanding at this moment and all retreated quickly to avoid being affected.","Di Qing and the others also held their breath and focused, extremely nervous.","A strike from Grand Yan Immortal was ten times, or even a hundred times stronger than Yan Immortal’s. Jian Wushuang might be in great danger!","The dark blue torrents that destroyed the void collided with each other and completely devoured him.","All that was left in every Yan Immortal’s ears was the sound of the torrent.","Seeing this, Chang Duoling smiled disdainfully. “Useless.”","However, in the next moment, a Sword Qi shot up into the sky with a loud bang. The Sword Qi, which was a million feet long, split the dark blue torrent in two and continued to attack Chang Duoling without losing momentum.","He raised his eyebrows and pressed down with one finger. With endless Yan power, he directly offset the million Sword Qi.","This happened too quickly, and by the time the spectating Yan Immortals reacted, it was all over.","The raging dark blue torrent dissipated, but the figure was still standing in the same place, not even making any movements.","The long hair behind his back fluttered rhythmically, and Jian Wushuang looked like the sun that could not be looked at directly. Then, he stretched out his right hand and pointed at Chang Duoling.","Boom boom boom!","A giant finger that reached the heavens appeared and pressed forward. Wherever it passed, a ravine that was a million miles long was plowed in the void!","Chang Duoling’s eyes narrowed. He had not expected this ant to attack him, but he did not hesitate and also struck out with his palm.","The two supreme Yan power forces collided, and astral winds swept through the void. Yan Immortals who were slightly closer were almost blown away.","Di Qing’s eyebrows twitched and he looked at Jian Wushuang’s back with a serious look.","After a few exchanges, he understood that Jian Wushuang would not do things he was not confident in. The outcome of the battle with Grand Yan Immortal might be reversed.","As a Yan Immortal against a Grand Yan Immortal, and not losing multiple times, this was already something unimaginable.","At this moment, even Chang Duoling could not help but wonder how this junior, who was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage, could withstand his attacks and even counterattack.","As for Jian Wushuang, he slowly let out a breath of turbid air. After several exchanges, he had figured out Chang Duoling’s real and fake realms.","Di Qing had said before that the Grand Yan Immortal had three most important realms, which were the Three Revolutions, Six Revolutions, and Nine Revolutions, and each transformation was a complete transformation.","However, from Yan Immortal to Grand Yan Immortal, one did not start at Three Revolutions, but was simply referred to as the Initial Stage."]},{"number":4882,"title":"Chapter 4882 Power Struggle","paragraphs":["4882 Power Struggle","The initial stage was also the initial stage of the Grand Yan Immortal.","Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, was at this level among the Grand Yan Immortals, which was still some distance away from the Three Revolutions Stage.","Even so, he was a genuine Grand Yan Immortal, which made Jian Wushuang feel an unprecedented pressure.","“Junior, it’s useless no matter how much you resist. I want you to die, and no one can save you now.” The corners of Chang Duoling’s mouth curled into a cold smile, as if he was showing his last bit of pity.","Jian Wushuang also sneered, “Really? Did the so-called Grand Yan Immortal only know how to fight with words? Are you planning to drown me with your saliva?”","Chang Duoling’s face turned cold. He suddenly pushed his palm forward, and thousands of dark blue leaves appeared on his body.","Every single shell leaf was filled with a violent Yan power.","Jian Wushuang raised his left hand high and a divine mountain appeared out of thin air, blocking his way.","Boom, boom Boom!","Every single shell leaf smashed into the divine mountain, causing a series of explosions.","He began to retreat, and the galaxy between his brows slowly rotated.","The sacred mountain only blocked it for a moment before a figure with supreme Yan power shot toward Jian Wushuang.","As the speed was too fast, when Jian Wushuang tried to resist, the uncontrollable huge force hit his Immortal body directly.","Ripples spread out in the shattered void.","Chang Duoling’s face was cold as he continued to punch Jian Wushuang’s stomach.","10,000 punches in an instant, each of which was enough to shatter the Immortal Source of an ordinary Yan Immortal.","Bang!","The last punch went through Jian Wushuang’s body, leaving a big hole in his heart. Then, Chang Duoling sneered and shot out hundreds of dark blue leaves from his back, all of which were aimed at Jian Wushuang.","The already shattered void was completely covered by the dark blue explosion once again.","Everything seemed to have become a foregone conclusion.","Chang Duoling retreated slowly, a hint of regret in his eyes, but before it could even fade away, a stream of light suddenly shot out from the center of the explosion and headed straight for his face.","The flowing light was Jian Wushuang. The wound on his stomach was still gaping, and his entire Immortal body was broken.","This was the last thing Chang Duoling saw, and then he received the most critical blow in his life.","His vision suddenly darkened, and the sky started to spin.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang gathered the two Ancestral Skills, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate and Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate into his fist and punched down fiercely.","The fist, which had gathered all the power of the Ancestral Skills, exploded in Chang Duoling’s face.","He punched again and again, over a thousand punches in an instant. The power of each punch could also cause serious damage to Yan Immortals.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to withdraw his hand, a big palm suddenly caught his fist and then crushed it into powder.","“Damn b*stard, who allowed you to do this?!” Chang Duoling roared in anger, and then subconsciously punched the man in the stomach.","However, the punch missed because Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body was broken. The punch went through his broken Immortal body and missed.","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold. He formed an Invisible Sword with his remaining right hand and stabbed it at Chang Duoling’s Immortal body.","Ding, ding, ding–","The Invisible Sword that would usually cut through the heavens was broken inch by inch at this moment and then shattered!","Chang Duoling was stunned at first, but then he smiled. “Your reaction is really fast. You’ve completed such an attack in an instant. If I wasn’t wearing the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, I’m afraid it would have been a bit troublesome.","“Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens?” Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled. He wanted to retreat, but he was too late.","Almost 1,000 dark blue leaves swept toward Jian Wushuang. Then, they passed through his Immortal body and exploded!","Pain, an unbearable pain, as if ten thousand insects were gnawing at his heart.","Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body, which was already extremely broken, was almost broken into pieces by the armor leaves.","In the middle of the explosion, he endured the pain of his Immortal body being crushed and stuffed dozens of pills into his mouth.","At once, layers of seven-colored radiance surged out from the explosion.","All the Yan Immortals held their breath as they watched this scene, as if they had forgotten their original purpose in coming to the Six Heavens Realm.","Di Qing, who had suppressed the urge to rush to help, frowned. But when he saw the figure appear again, he was secretly relieved, but at the same time, he was a little confused.","“What kind of physique does this guy have? his Immortal body is about to be shattered, but he’s still so lively?”","Jian Wushuang had swallowed dozens of supreme-grade pills and his body was wrapped in layers of seven-colored halos. His undying Immortal body had also recovered.","He even felt a little hot and dry, as if his meridians were about to explode and needed to be vented.","Looking at this scene, Chang Duoling’s eyes twitched. This guy was only a Yan Immortal, what was he made of?","One must know that if his attacks were to be used on an ordinary Yan Immortal, they would have been blasted into pieces and died thousands of times!","Then, Jian Wushuang charged at Chang Duoling again. He condensed the Invisible Sword again and released an earth-shattering Sword Intent.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","A ray of sword radiance tore through the sky and expanded with the wind. As it tore through the void, it brought with it thousands of beams of light that were tens of thousands of feet long.","Even Chang Duoling was a little moved by this scene.","Subconsciously, he no longer saw Jian Wushuang as an ordinary Yan Immortal, but an equal opponent.","Faced with such a sword technique, his expression turned grave. He suddenly raised his left arm, and instantly, billions of dark blue stars swept out.","“Even ordinary Grand Yan Immortals have no choice but to avoid my Heavenly Stars Transformation. I’d like to see how you’re going to break it!”","Chang Duoling looked ahead with a meaningful look.","Boom boom boom!","The void was illuminated for a moment.","The Sword Intent of the Star form clashed with the stars in the sky, creating the most brilliant scene.","This was their combined attack, and it made the Yan Immortals’ expressions change.","They could not believe that a Yan Immortal could fight a Grand Yan Immortal to the point of being on par with him, and even to the point of a power struggle!","How could this be possible? If they did not personally witness this scene, none of the Yan Immortals would believe it.","Even a Grand Yan Immortal at the initial stage could easily kill hundreds of them. It was a crushing existence.","But now, their deep-rooted thoughts were gradually being disintegrated by the figure who dared to compete with the Grand Yan Immortal.","“Damn it, what is this guy? Is there a Grand Yan Immortal impersonating him?”","Chang Duoling’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets as he watched the scene in front of him. He wanted nothing more than to swallow the figure whole to relieve the depression in his heart."]},{"number":4883,"title":"Chapter 4883 Advancing to Three Revolutions","paragraphs":["4883 Advancing to Three Revolutions","The Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent did not destroy his Stars Transformation easily. Jian Wushuang even came to him unscathed.","“Damn fellow, speak! Are you in the Yan Immortal stage or the Grand Yan Immortal stage?”","Jian Wushuang’s body was hot and his head was a little dizzy as if he was drunk, but he still pointed his sword at him.","“What does it have to do with you whether I’m a Yan Immortal or a Grand Yan Immortal? This doesn’t stop me from taking your life!”","Chang Duoling was so angry that he laughed. “Good, what an arrogant b*stard. You won’t be able to leave here alive today!”","“Star Obliteration!” He was furious and raised his hands.","In an instant, in the originally broken void space, pieces of nebulas quietly lit up.","In the seven-colored nebula, countless stars quietly lit up, drawing a large nebula map.","As soon as the nebula appeared, all the Yan Immortals’ expressions changed. Then, they all turned around and ran without any regard for their image.","Di Qing waved his hand and released a barrier that enveloped Chun Qiu and the rest, as well as the tens of thousands of remaining top cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm.","Then, the boundless nebula map in the void began to change color, as if it was a scene of destruction. The stars in it began to fall.","Under the nebula map, Jian Wushuang’s face was solemn. Then, he responded.","The form of the Selfless True Shadow appeared and instantly expanded to hundreds of millions of feet, directly blocking the falling nebula map.","Then, the Selfless True Shadow, which had its eyes tightly shut, opened its eyes. A brilliant divine might descended!","The falling stars were instantly destroyed when they touched the faint golden divine might, causing the void to tremble.","Jian Wushuang held his sword with one hand. Behind him was the Selfless True Shadow, and in front of him was the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, Chang Duoling.","For a moment, Chang Duoling’s heart chilled.","He could not understand why he was stopped and even suppressed by a Yan Immortal when he came to destroy the Six Heavens Realm!","This was simply a great humiliation. If this were to be spread out, he, who had once destroyed the Jiufang Region with his own strength, would definitely not be able to tolerate it.","Therefore, there was only one way to solve this, and that was to destroy the entire Six Heavens Realm and that Yan Immortal!","The entire nebula map was blocked by the Selfless True Shadow, which bought Jian Wushuang some time.","Chang Duoling did not try to dodge, and instead, he met the blade head-on.","The layer of Mystic Garb, which was formed by countless dark blue leaves, was a Supreme Treasure. Its origin was unknown, but he had obtained it in a broken Heavenly Abode when he was young and traveled around the world.","Even if a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal had a Supreme Treasure, it was impossible to break this Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, and he had always relied on this Supreme Treasure.","Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens was involved in another secret. The real reason why Chang Duoling had exterminated the Jiufang Region was that the found out about the Supreme Treasure in the Jiufang Region, so he had come to fight for it.","In a fit of anger, he fought his way up to the Jiufang Region and eventually annihilated the entire Jiufang Region with his own strength.","When he annihilated the Jiufang Region, he was wearing such a Supreme Treasure that offset the damage from all the Yan Immortals.","From this, one could see how mysterious and powerful the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens was.","Then, the Invisible Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand broke again!","Chang Duoling’s eyes flashed with ruthlessness, and just as he was about to attack, he felt a sharp pain in his neck.","The sword pierced through his neck, and divine blood gushed out!","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up. As he retreated quickly, he pulled back the other Invisible Sword with his left hand. “I have to thank you for your warning. Without your warning, I’m afraid I wouldn’t have thought of cutting your neck.”","Chang Duoling was so angry that he almost fainted. He never thought that a mere Yan Immortal could cause him such serious damage.","At the same time, he had a lingering fear. If he had not reacted in time, his head would have been chopped off on the spot.","The Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens could avoid being seriously injured by any Supreme Treasure. This was what Chang Duoling was proud of. He had accidentally mentioned it, but he did not expect Jian Wushuang, who understood it immediately, to understand that the sword that was aimed at his neck had almost seriously injured him.","The unbearable rage made him disregard everything.","“Star Obliteration!”","“Galaxy Backtrack!”","He unleashed an endless stream of Immortal Styles as if he had gone mad.","The Star River started to flow again in the void. Jian Wushuang’s Selfless True Shadow could not hold on any longer and it collapsed!","Hundreds of millions of stars descended, tearing apart all the laws of the Heavenly Dao.","The Heavenly Regions that were closer to the Six Heavens Realm were also affected.","In an instant, at least ten Heavenly Regions were destroyed!","Under the Star Obliteration move, Jian Wushuang had no choice but to release his Yan power boundary to resist it.","As he struggled to resist, Chang Duoling’s figure appeared before him.","“It’s a pity for a good seedling like you. If you didn’t oppose me today, you would definitely become a Grand Yan Immortal before within five Hua Years. It’s a pity that you’ll end up in my hands now.”","As he said that, he stretched out his hand and held Jian Wushuang’s neck tightly. The thousands of layers of Yan power in his left hand were condensed and then he suddenly smashed it on Jian Wushuang’s obviously bulging stomach.","Even a Grand Yan Immortal of the same realm would not be able to withstand this punch.","However, Jian Wushuang had completely endured it. He had a strange expression on his face, as if something was stuck in his throat. Then, facing Chang Duoling, he opened his mouth and spat out a rainbow-colored shadow.","Chang Duoling was caught off guard, and the things that Jian Wushuang had spat out splashed all over his face.","“Ah! Ah!”","Jian Wushuang seemed to feel extremely comfortable after spitting out the things. He suddenly kicked off Chang Duoling with both legs and instantly leaped a thousand feet away.","He was the only one left standing in the same spot. The rainbow-colored shadows on his head and face began to rapidly seep into every pore of his.","Then, a vast and unknown aura began to spread out from Chang Duoling’s body.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching this scene from afar, had a bad feeling.","The things that he had spat out earlier were because he had swallowed too many Emperor-grade pills and could not absorb them at the moment, so they had accumulated in his stomach.","He had never thought that Chang Duoling would land a punch on him, causing the pills in his stomach to mix. The medicinal effects of nearly 60 supreme-grade pills were all spat out, and then inadvertently absorbed...","With so many medicinal effects, if nothing unexpected happened, Chang Duoling would probably advance to Three Revolutions..."]},{"number":4884,"title":"Chapter 4884 A Grand Battle","paragraphs":["4884 A Grand Battle","One had to know that each of the supreme-grade pills was a treasure of Emperor Liu Ya. How could a pill that could be treasured by an Emperor be ordinary?","In a moment of desperation, Jian Wushuang swallowed nearly 60 pills. Even though he had the Undying Immortal Body, he could only absorb 20 pills.","As for the remaining 40 pills, Chang Duoling had completely taken advantage of them...","Chang Duoling retreated, his head full of what he thought was filth, but in fact the dregs of a great fortune. He roared in shock and anger.","“B*stard, you dare to insult me?!”","He did not know that a great fortune had already fallen on him.","Layers of seven-colored ripples surged out from his body. At the same time, hundreds of rainbow peaks crossed the void, and wisps of smoke-like Yan power gathered to form a storm.","Di Qing, who was watching from a distance, frowned. Even Chen Qing and the others felt an inexplicable sense of danger.","“Advancing to Three Revolutions, I am afraid Wushuang is in danger,” Di Qing murmured. He was already at Nine Revolutions, so he could naturally see the phenomenon that Chang Duoling had caused.","When one advanced from the Initial Stage to Three Revolutions, the heaven and earth would be united, and the flowing fate of the Great Dao would be added to one’s body, which was the Three Revolutions.","Chang Duoling, who was just about to wipe away the dregs on his face, also noticed the change in his body. His eyes were startled, and then he became bewildered.","“It seems like I’m about to advance!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his eyebrows as he felt the terrifying ripple of Yan power.","Chang Duoling, who was at the Initial Stage of the Grand Yan Immortal and had the Mystic Garb, was already extremely difficult to deal with. If he advanced to Three Revolutions, he would have no chance of winning.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang suddenly moved his body and a 100,0000-foot galaxy sword light surged out from behind him.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, second move.","River.","Compared to the Star-style Sword Intent, the River-style Sword Intent was more majestic and powerful. It could break through the sky and even crush 100,000 Ancestor-level cultivators. It was the foundation of the entire Wushuang Sword Dao, but it was not the most powerful sword move.","Chang Duoling, who was retreating in a hurry and preparing to advance to rank three, saw this scene and his expression changed slightly. He could feel that this sword move was even more unfathomable than before.","To be able to threaten a Grand Yan Immortal with the power of a Yan Immortal, that was absurd!","Chang Duoling was furious. He extended an arm, and an even more majestic Galaxy came crashing down.","Countless great suns and stars engulfed the area once again.","Then, under the gazes of all the Yan Immortals, he waved his hand lightly.","The waves surged, the river was high in the sky, and the endless Sword Intent rose up to meet the star.","Swish-","The void suddenly lit up as if there were a million suns in the sky. Everything was truly destroyed.","Bare-chested, Jian Wushuang met Chang Duoling head-on as if the heavenly Dao had descended!","The Sword River surged and swallowed everything in an instant.","The stars were destroyed, and the shattered void returned to silence. Even Chang Duoling’s Grand Yan Immortal aura had completely disappeared.","There was only the heaven-shaking, earth-shattering Heavenly River of swordsmanship that was like a ribbon that crossed the heavens and destroyed everything in its path!","It was a pure sword strike.","It was a sword strike without any power of the Great Dao.","All the Yan Immortals swallowed their saliva.","This sword was enough to leave the most profound and colorful stroke in their divine sense, and even in the endless years to come.","Who in the universe, among the countless geniuses, could use this sword move, and who could block it?","This sword was too Grand, even Yan Immortals, who cultivated the Yan power Great Dao diligently, found it hard to calm down.","It turned out that the way of the sword could be so unrestrained and unhindered?","Every Yan Immortal present had long since stopped thinking about the final outcome of this battle.","A Yan Immortal, against a Grand Yan Immortal with a long reputation, not only did he not fall into a disadvantage, but he also displayed his own Great Dao to the fullest.","This battle would be etched in their memories.","The result was no longer important, but it was still quite important.","Di Qing’s eyes were fixed on the front, and his hands under his luxurious clothes had unknowingly clenched into fists.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Wei Liujia, and the others all had heated gazes, wishing they could rush up and join in the battle.","Zhao Ting’s gaze was difficult to understand, disbelief and shock taking up more than half of it.","Jian Wushuang held an Invisible Sword in his hand and the tip of the sword was pointed forward.","His opponent was Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens.","Ding!","With a series of sounds, the Invisible Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand shattered and turned into powder.","Almost at the same time, Chang Duoling’s Immortal body, which was not covered by Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, shattered at the same time.","Divine blood gushed out, and even the dark blue Mystic Garb was covered with sword marks.","“The Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens? It’s really powerful,” Jian Wushuang murmured softly and a stream of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth.","Chang Duoling was like a man of blood, and not a single part of his face was in good condition. The only thing that remained intact was his eyes, which were currently looking at him with a complicated expression.","This situation only lasted for the space of a few dozen breaths. As the circles of rainbow shadows merged back into one, Chang Duoling, who had been on the verge of death, was completely restored in the blink of an eye.","His flesh and blood were back to normal, his Immortal body was flourishing, and even the Yan power aura that pulsed around him was strong to another state.","Chang Duoling had advanced to the Three Revolutions Stage.","“I’m really curious, how did you manage to shake the Grand Yan Immortal with the power of the Yan Immortal? One must know that the two of them are two completely different existences.”","“I can kill any Yan Immortal with a wave of my hand, even if he is the most powerful Heaven’s Favorite in the Heaven Region.”","“When I advanced to the Grand Yan Immortal stage, I annihilated the Jiufang Region with my own strength. There were no less than 50 Yan Immortals in each of the Heavenly Regions there, a total of more than 400 Yan Immortals were annihilated by my hands. There were countless top cultivators. This is the power of the Grand Yan Immortal.”","Chang Duoling looked at Jian Wushuang as he reminisced about the past.","“But today, you have changed my opinion.”","“If I had not advanced to Three Revolutions, I’m afraid I would have been killed by that sword strike. You make my heart palpitate. If it was not for Mystic Garb, I would have been seriously injured even if I was Three Revolutions. Now, I only have one question for you.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said, “Speak.”","“Are you a Yan Immortal or a Grand Yan Immortal?!”","Jian Wushuang said, “Peak of the Yan Immortal realm.”","The world was silent, and Chang Duoling’s eyes twitched violently. Even though he had heard it with his own ears, he still could not believe it.","Looking at the ancient times, even in the battle when Zhen Wuyang ascended to the throne, there were countless Heaven’s Favorites who appeared, but there was no legend of him killing someone who was above his cultivation realm."]},{"number":4885,"title":"Chapter 4885 Jian Wushuang Dies","paragraphs":["4885 Jian Wushuang Dies","Yan Immortal was Yan Immortal, and Grand Yan Immortal was Grand Yan Immortal.","Thus, Chang Duoling could not believe it. The corners of his eyes twitched, and in the end, his gaze turned cold. “That’s a pity. I won’t let you leave here alive today.”","Jian Wushuang’s mouth slowly curved into a cold smile, “I could threaten you the first time, but the second time will not be just a threat.”","Chang Duoling sneered as well, and in the next moment, his figure suddenly dissipated into countless wisps of smoke.","Standing still, Jian Wushuang instantly condensed an Invisible Sword and held it in front of him.","Bang!","With a muffled sound, the sword in his hand shattered, and he was forced back a thousand feet!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath to suppress the divine blood that was about to gush out.","This simple attack had severely injured him.","Chang Duoling, who had advanced to Three Revolutions, was completely different from before. Whether it was his control of Yan power or his use of Immortal Styles, they had all advanced to another level.","He was already determined to kill, and his attacks were several times more fierce and ruthless.","He stretched out his hand, and a starry halberd condensed from stars fell into his hand.","This was the true battle of power!","The endless void was torn apart, and all the Yan Immortals sighed.","The Young Emperor had also slowly woken up. He had survived because he could not condense Immortal Source. His face was not pale, but it was full of a sickly blush.","With the help of the skinny purple-robed man, he watched the battle without blinking.","This was a battle of unequal cultivation levels, yet it was a fierce battle.","Chang Duoling wielded the long halberd with flowing stars, and with every attack, Jian Wushuang was forced to retreat.","“I used to think of sword cultivators as a joke. I’ve killed no less than 50 Yan Immortals, and they were all just a motley crew. But now, you’ve changed my mind.”","“If you’re still alive, you’ll definitely become a Sword Immortal. You’ll be able to establish a sect or rule hundreds of Heavenly Regions. It’ll be easy.”","Chang Duoling’s voice was cold, and his eyes were dark. “So, you must die by my hands.”","The Invisible Sword shattered and Jian Wushuang’s chest was torn apart, leaving a long and narrow bloody mark.","Then, the starry halberd in Chang Duoling’s hand suddenly changed shape into a soft whip, which directly tied him up.","“Goodbye.” With a strange smile, he put his fingers together like a knife and cut off Jian Wushuang’s right arm with one palm.","The divine blood splattered in the air.","“Not good!” Chun Qiu shouted and was about to rush forward, but Di Qing stopped him.","Di Qing looked at him and said, “Even Jian Wushuang can’t deal with it. Even if all of you attack, you’ll only die.”","Of course, Chun Qiu understood that. However, if he did not save Jian Wushuang now, his body and soul would be destroyed.","At the thought of this, he seemed to have caught the last straw of hope. He looked at Di Qing and said, “Only you can save Brother Jian here.”","As a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, Di Qing was in the absolute peak of the cultivation realm. He had grown to the Nine Revolution Stage since the ancient age, and his Yan power realm had reached the peak. Naturally, he could easily defeat Chang Duoling, who had just advanced to Three Revolutions.","However, all of this had to be established before he lost his True Life.","He had already lost two of his True Lives, and the battle with Changfu had left him in a weakened state. Even so, he had still been able to save Jian Wushuang from Chang Duoling.","However, he did not plan to save Jian Wushuang at the moment. He could feel that Jian Wushuang needed to fight in such a bloody battle that was completely unequal.","“I’ll make a move when it’s necessary, but not now,” Di Qing said. “I have a feeling that this is definitely not his limit.”","“But...” In the end, Chun Qiu did not say anything. He looked at the void solemnly.","At that moment, the void seemed to be soaked in divine blood and Jian Wushuang was being tortured!","Chang Duoling crushed every inch of his Immortal body into powder without mercy.","“Let me guess where your Immortal Source is. Your heart? Head?”","Chang Duoling sneered. Wherever his palm touched, the Immortal body turned into dust.","Jian Wushuang could not move and could only let him dismantle his Immortal body.","The excruciating pain made him sweat profusely, but even so, he did not say a word. He only looked coldly at Chang Duoling.","Chang Duoling met his gaze and felt even more embarrassed and resentful. He loathed this extremely calm gaze. He was clearly about to die, but he was still so calm. It was simply against common sense.","This kind of look seemed to be filled with disdain and contempt, which made him even more murderous. He directly punched out and crushed Jian Wushuang’s stomach!","“It’s your misfortune to have met me. If there’s a reincarnation, remember to restrain yourself.”","Thousands of stars were destroyed at the same time. The power that was emitted from it crushed Jian Wushuang’s entire Immortal body.","The streaks of light disappeared and eventually dissipated into the air.","Seeing this, even Yan Immortals felt their hearts palpitate. This unfair battle had finally come to an end.","Then, Di Qing appeared in front of Chang Duoling with an extremely livid face. He was still a step too late.","“Damn b*stard, do you know the consequences?!”","Di Qing was furious, and his ten-sided wings suddenly spread out from his back, revealing his undisguised Yan power realm.","Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","The boundless pressure felt like 10,000 Heavenly Regions had descended upon him, and the bone-chilling coldness that came from the bottom of his heart caused Chang Duoling to shiver in fear.","He knew very well what this level of pressure represented. It was an existence that was even more terrifying than him.","At this moment, Di Qing was completely furious. He threw a palm at Chang Duoling, ignoring the damage to his True Life.","Although Chang Duoling had been prepared for this, he was still sent flying several hundred miles away by this attack.","“Trash, prepare to die.”","Di Qing slowly stepped forward. The Yan power around him seemed to be burning, and the ten-sided wings on his back were flapping rhythmically, giving off a powerful aura.","He had slept in the golden cage on the Fusang Tree in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture for countless years, but it seemed that he had not yet walked out of the ancient war.","It was not until the anxious-looking boy who seemed to have some kind of purpose appeared in front of him that he felt like a path had appeared in front of him.","Entering the Sand Demon Cave, breaking into the Heavenly Court of the past, going to the Great Mi Heaven, all of these gave him a different feeling.","And he was also unknowingly happy to do things that he should not have.","Perhaps it was because he had been silent for too long, and the endless years had been too long, that he had changed his mind."]},{"number":4886,"title":"Chapter 4886 Comprehending the Sword Intent of the Lake Style","paragraphs":["4886 Comprehending the Sword Intent of the Lake Style","Although Di Qing had destroyed two of his True Lives in a row, causing his cultivation to fall greatly, he was still willing to continue like this.","The man who was between calm and reckless had fallen, and everything seemed to have returned to dead silence.","He should not have died like this. Although he had stepped into the death realm several times, he had been fine. However, this time, he would probably die completely.","...","The pain was enough to penetrate every drop of divine blood. Even though Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body had been completely destroyed, his divine consciousness was still extremely clear.","He was like a wisp of divine soul floating in the broken void, able to see and hear everything that happened.","From a Perfect Chaotic Life Form to an Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, Jian Wushuang was not worried that he would die.","This was because the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was simply too heaven-defying. Even if it was just a wisp of obsession, it could be reborn in a short period of time. Even an Emperor might not be able to completely destroy it.","In addition, he had taken several pills in advance during his final battle with Chang Duoling, which allowed him to recover completely in an extremely short time without any weakness.","But now, he was not in a hurry to recover his Immortal body. Instead, he floated into the Boyang Bottle that was scattered in the broken void.","Jian Wushuang, whose Immortal body had been completely destroyed, felt an unprecedented Sword Intent.","That Sword Intent was the third move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","...","Chang Duoling, who had been slapped a thousand feet away by Di Qing, felt humiliated, but he did not plan to fight back.","This was because Di Qing’s aura was too terrifying, he was at least a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","At this moment, he was only thinking about how to escape.","With the Mystic Garb, Chang Duoling did not look too scared. He thought that Di Qing would not be able to stop him if he wanted to leave.","“You will die in my hands today. No one can save you!”","Di Qing was furious and approached him step by step. The ten-sided wings on his back stretched out rhythmically, and a huge black crow statue appeared in the void!","Chang Duoling gritted his teeth and retreated. Just as he was about to flee, an extremely familiar voice rang out.","A well-defined palm was gently placed on Di Qing’s shoulder. “Thank you. Leave the rest to me.”","“W-Wushuang!”","As he spoke, he walked past Di Qing and moved forward firmly.","At this moment, all of the Yan Immortals were shocked. None of them could believe that this guy who could not be more dead would appear again!","Everyone, including Chun Qiu and Cheng Qing, looked at the back of the figure in a daze.","Jian Wushuang walked slowly to Chang Duoling, who was also in a daze. He raised his eyebrows slightly and said in a low voice, “Continue.”","“No, impossible, how can you still be alive? Didn’t I crush your Immortal Source?”","Chang Duoling shook his head in disbelief.","Jian Wushuang glanced at him, “What you see may not necessarily be the final result. If you want to leave this place alive, kill me.”","After recovering from his shock, he quickly realized that Jian Wushuang must have used some Supreme Treasure to seal the Immortal Source and recover it.","Chang Duoling regained his composure, but he did not plan to attack again. If he was injured again, he might really not be able to escape.","However, Jian Wushuang did not give him time to think. He shook his right hand and an Invisible Sword was formed again.","His eyes narrowed, and he quickly said, “Why do you have to seek death? You can’t even break through my Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, so stop doing useless things.”","“Not being able to do it before doesn’t mean the final result. Today, you will definitely not be able to leave here alive.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold as he pointed the Invisible Sword forward.","In the next moment, the void suddenly fell silent, and boundless Sword Intent rose from behind him.","Countless Sword Intents gathered together, forming a grand and beautiful rainbow peak.","However, the scene only existed for a moment before it returned to Jian Wushuang’s body.","Chang Duoling involuntarily took half a step back. He had sensed that something was wrong.","If the previous Jian Wushuang was a True Sword that was full of sharp light, then at this moment, he had completely restrained all of his aura. It was as if the True Sword was in a box, hiding its sharp edge and weapon. However, it was also full of an indescribable sense of the unknown.","Facing a Yan Immortal who had almost killed him, he did not dare to be careless. He waved his hand and a starry halberd appeared again.","“I only need one sword strike!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was faint and his eyes that contained unparalleled Sword Intent froze.","The Sword Intent that had been contained in it all burst out at this moment.","The entire void was illuminated by the endless Sword Intents, as if millions of suns were rising into the sky. Even Yan Immortal could not look at it directly at this moment.","It was a Heavenly Gate, a magnificent Heavenly Gate that supported the void for hundreds of millions of miles.","It was constructed by countless Sword Intents, and could no longer be described as a magnificent fairy tale.","Jian Wushuang’s clothes fluttered in the wind as he stepped into the Heavenly Gate with an Invisible Sword in his hand!","The next moment, the dusty Heavenly Gate slowly opened. Countless Sword Intents gushed out and condensed into a quiet lake.","In the lake, there was a gurgling spring, and the sun, moon, and stars were born.","Then, an extremely pure and vast radiance bloomed like the brightest sun!","Jian Wushuang arrived from the Heavenly Gate with his sword in hand!","His radiance was so brilliant that even the Heavenly Gate, where the lake of life was flowing, had dimmed.","That sword strike was unstoppable. It was as if its birth had announced that this was a sword strike that could not be blocked, and could only be endured!","Even if the opponent was an Emperor, he would not be able to stop it!","Swish!!!","Chang Duoling’s spiritual sense was completely blank. He had already forgotten how to defend himself, and could only watch in a daze as the vast sword strike descended upon him.","No Yan Immortal would have thought of such a profound sword move. It was the ultimate radiant sword strike.","This sword strike had already surpassed their understanding.","It should not have appeared in the first place. It was not even a product of imagination. However, Jian Wushuang Comprehended it.","This sword strike had pushed the entire Wusuang Sword Dao and the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent to an unimaginable height. It was a sword strike that was at the peak.","Even now, Jian Wushuang was certain that he would not be able to break through to discover the final move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, Sea.","This sword strike was not even a product of imagination, but it was still bizarrely born in the end.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, third style.","Lake."]},{"number":4887,"title":"Chapter 4887 Only One Step Away From Sword Immortal","paragraphs":["4887 Only One Step Away From Sword Immortal","Everything was destroyed, and even the void was destroyed.","One must know that this was a Heavenly Region in the Great Yan Domain. Every Heavenly Region was permeated by the laws of the Heavenly Dao, and its toughness was enough to support a battle between Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals.","But now, they were all destroyed.","The entire Six Heavens Realm was protected by Di Qing’s Yan power.","Some of the Yan Immortals who did not manage to dodge in time were also completely annihilated by this Sword Dao.","This sword strike was too powerful, it could cut the sky, destroy Domains, and destroy the enemy. It was as if no Yan Immortal could block this attack, not even a Grand Yan Immortal!","The vast Sword Intent of the Lake Style lasted for a long time.","The Heavenly Gate was magnificent, and the lake flowing out of it was quiet and peaceful.","Di Qing stared at the scene, and even he felt his heart palpitate.","The endless Sword Dao that stretched like a river finally retreated, and the dilapidated void finally revealed itself slowly.","Jian Wushuang stood still, surrounded by countless Sword Intents. No one dared to look at him directly.","He held his sword with one hand, his eyes indifferent to the extreme.","In front of him, Chang Duoling was still standing, his face a little pale.","“I, I lost? How is that possible?”","Jian Wushuang ignored him and slowly let go of him.","Chang Duoling lowered his head with difficulty, as if he had sensed something.","At his chest, an Invisible Sword surrounded by Sword Intent had pierced through his Immortal body.","The purest Immortal Source was quickly dissipating.","The Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, the Supreme Treasure that he was proud of, which could block the attack of a Grand Yan Immortal, was also broken by Jian Wushuang.","A single sword strike had exterminated a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","“Ughh... Ah.”","On the eve of his death, Chang Duoling made a move.","He used all his strength to throw the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavensto Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it and looked at him calmly.","“Your sword move is too powerful. It would be a pity if you die here... I’d like to see how much chaos you can cause in the Great Si Region.”","After saying these last words, Chang Duoling died!","Like falling stars, he quickly disappeared into the void, leaving no possibility of resurrection.","Jian Wushuang was still standing in the same place. After stuffing the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens into the Boyang Bowl, a touch of fatigue flashed in his eyes.","Eliminating a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal in one battle was something that had never happened before.","He was like a lonely Sword Immortal, standing in the void.","Jian Wushuang turned around slowly. As he took a step forward, divine blood gushed out from every inch of his skin!","Then, he fell straight into the endless void like a graceful swan!","The next moment, the Young Emperor and the others all flew up and caught Jian Wushuang, who was covered in blood.","Di Qing slowly let out a breath, turned around, and faced the remaining 200 Yan Immortals, he suddenly spread out his ten-sided wings.","“Let’s do it one way or another, you guys can stay here.”","A belated massacre quietly unfolded.","In the last battle, less than 20 of the 400 Yan Immortals who came to destroy the Six Heavens Realm escaped.","Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal Chang Duoling had also been completely annihilated in this battle.","...","“Argh...”","In the hazy chaos, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes with great difficulty.","His head was heavy, as if he could not remember anything.","In the chaos, he only heard an excited voice reverberating in the hall.","With the sound of hurried footsteps, Jian Wushuang felt many people surrounding him. At the same time, warm liquid dripped into his dry mouth.","The liquid contained an extremely pure medicinal effect, and once it entered his mouth, it restored his meridians.","After repeating this for a long time, Jian Wushuang finally managed to open his eyes.","What he saw was the Young Emperor, followed by Di Qing, Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and the others, who surrounded him.","“You’re awake, you’re awake. Brother Jian, your Immortal body is truly terrifying. You’ve suffered such a heavy internal injury, yet you’re able to wake up in such a short time.”","Cheng Qing said with a loud voice, his eyes full of admiration.","“It’s good that you’re awake,” the Young Emperor nodded and handed the porcelain bowl to him.","Jian Wushuang took it and drank it up. Then, he asked, “How long have I been sleeping?”","“Less than ten years,” Di Qing crossed his arms and said. “I thought you would sleep for tens of millions of years.”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist. After finding that his Immortal body was fine, he said, “It’s alright. The injury is not too serious. I’ll recover completely after resting for a while.”","Everyone looked at him as if he was a monster.","To be able to kill the most difficult Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal with the power of a Yan Immortal and even recover in such a short time... This could not be predicted with common sense.","Cheng Qing came over again and said excitedly, “Brother Jian, I’m afraid you’re already a Sword Immortal now, right? Ten years ago, I don’t think I could have blocked that sword strike.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang slowly shook his head, “No, I’m afraid I’m still far from a Sword Immortal.”","“It can’t be. Even such a powerful strike can’t break through to the threshold of a Sword Immortal? It’s so difficult.” Cheng Qing was a little shocked.","The so-called Sword Immortal was an illusory level, and this level was not related to the Yan Immortal.","So far, the only Sword Immortal that Jian Wushuang had acknowledged was Ding Baiyi.","He was the real master of the Sword Principle. With just one stroke of the Extinctive Sword, he had shocked Jian Wushuang.","If he wanted to become a Sword Immortal, he might have to use the last Sea Style and merge the entire Star River Lake Sea Sword Styles.","However, Jian Wushuang was now confident that he could definitely fight against Ding Baiyi with the Sword Intent of the Lake Style.","After all, even he himself was amazed by the Sword Intent of the Lake Style.","The Young Emperor pondered for a moment and said, “Then, Brother Jian, have you touched the opportunity of Grand Yan Immortal?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head again, “It’s the same as before. I’ll stop at the peak of the Yan Immortal. I’m afraid it’ll take a long time to reach the Grand Yan Immortal.”","This was the truth. Even though he had comprehended the most powerful sword technique in that earth-shattering battle and killed a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he still did not have the opportunity to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal realm.","It was as if the way up had been sealed.","Jian Wushuang guessed that the reason why he did not realize the opportunity to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal was most likely related to his inability to condense the Immortal Source.","If he needed the most basic Immortal Source to advance to the Grand Yan Immortal, he was afraid that he would not be able to advance any further."]},{"number":4888,"title":"Chapter 4888 World Tree Building a Heavenly Region","paragraphs":["4888 World Tree Building a Heavenly Region","Even though Jian Wushuang had not found the opportunity, he was not too worried.","Back then, the advancement to the Supreme level was a huge threshold. Now, it was likely that the advancement to the Grand Yan Immortal level was also a huge threshold, and it might even be a hundred times more difficult than the advancement to the Supreme realm.","From a Perfect Chaotic Life Form to an Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, it would be much more difficult to advance to the next level than ordinary Yan Immortals.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang’s cross-realm combat strength was still there.","The battle with Chang Duoling, the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, had allowed Jian Wushuang to comprehend his most powerful sword move. At the same time, it also allowed him to know his current strength.","Without the Sword Intent of the Lake Style, his strength was enough to fight with an early-stage Grand Yan Immortal. If he used the Sword Intent of the Lake Style, Jian Wushuang could kill a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","In the Great Si Region, apart from the ancient Elders around Zhen Wuyang and the Nine Revolutions Di Qing, there would be very few Yan Immortals that could threaten him.","It had been almost ten years since his battle with Chang Duoling, and he had been unconscious for ten years, but everything that had happened was as vivid as if it had happened yesterday.","Two of the Six Heavens Realm’s Heavenly Regions were destroyed. Although the foundation of the Lower Three Heavens was not destroyed, the Young Emperor’s forces suffered heavy losses and were almost completely destroyed.","There were less than 10 Yan Immortals and more than 9,000 peak cultivators left. Even some of the super forces in the Great Si Region were many times stronger than the Young Emperor’s forces.","This was a war that had been planned for a long time. 400 Yan Immortals and one Grand Yan Immortal. Such a large-scale war was probably planned by the other Princes.","“Accompany me for a walk,” the Young Emperor looked at him and said, then turned around and walked out of the hall.","Jian Wushuang did not say much. He got up from the bed and walked out.","At that moment, there were more than 10,000 top cultivators standing outside the hall. When they saw the Young Emperor and Jian Wushuang, they immediately stood still and became nervous.","“Heavenly Official Jian-”","They all called out this official title spontaneously. Jian Wushuang waved his hand and walked into the dilapidated and desolate Heavenly Region.","“This place used to be the ruins of Little Lonely Heaven, and Big Lonely Heaven is right above us.”","The Young Emperor pointed to the top of his head and said, “Now they’ve all been destroyed. This is the first time I’ve suffered such a serious blow since I took control of the Six Heavens Realm. If it weren’t for you, Brother Jian, I’m afraid the entire Six Heavens Realm would have been completely destroyed.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him, “Do you know who did it? To be able to gather so many Yan Immortals this time, I’m afraid the power behind them is not small.”","The Young Emperor nodded and said, “When you were breaking the array formation, I found a familiar face among the many Yan Immortals. It was one of the Yan Immortals under Prince Jiu. However, after the previous incident in Great Mi Heaven, it was impossible for prince Jiu to gather more than 400 Yan Immortals in such a short time.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything, but he could guess who the two Princes were.","“But even so, the battle will not stop. It will only become more and more intense.”","The Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and said softly, “Brother Jian, I gave you Little Lonely Heaven back then. I’m now giving it to you again.”","As he spoke, he took out a lustrous green seed from his bosom and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","“What is this?”","“It’s the seed of the World Tree. You only need to throw it into the void and it will grow into a Heavenly Region.”","“Then what about your Big Lonely Heaven?”","“I still have another seed.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He waved his hand and threw the emerald-green seed into the void.","In an instant, the seed expanded against the wind and instantly expanded to a distance of ten million miles.","The canopy of the tree, which was extremely green, formed the sky, and the strong roots turned into the earth.","Even the mysterious Heavenly Dao laws were born from it.","From the seed, it eventually transformed into a vast Heavenly Region.","It was a miracle, and even Jian Wushuang was shocked.","At this point, Little Lonely Heaven was constructed.","What surprised Jian Wushuang even more was that the most primitive creature was being nurtured in it, and the degree of Yan power was several times stronger than Little Lonely Heaven.","“Brother Jian, Little Lonely Heaven is back in your hands,” the Young Emperor said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang shook his head slightly, “It’s just a temporary residence. This place is still yours.”","His eyes flashed with a touch of sadness.","The wind blew gently.","“Brother Jian, how many more years is there to our agreement? It seems like it’s less than 30 years, right?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly, “I can’t remember clearly. Let’s take it one step at a time.”","The Young Emperor looked up at him and smiled after a while. “Brother Jian, thank you.”","“No need to thank me. If there’s any news of what I’m looking for, I’m afraid I’ll have to leave.”","The Little Lonely Heaven was reconstructed, and the Young Emperor also reconstructed the Big Lonely Heaven with the last seed of the World Tree. At this point, the Six Heavens Realm was restored to its original state.","However, nearly 90 percent of Yan Immortals and top cultivators had fallen. The remaining Yan Immortals and top cultivators were not enough to deal with the upcoming war.","“Brother Jian, I still want to ask you for a favor.”","“What is it?”","I just want to ask you to teach the remaining Yan Immortals and top cultivators in the Six Heavens Realm. If you can help them improve, do it.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, “If it’s about the growth of Yan power and the advancement of the cultivation realm, I’m afraid it won’t work. Every Yan Immortal has their own Great Dao to go through. If I change the path by force, I’m afraid it will backfire.”","“I know that. What I’m thinking is, can Brother Jian give them some pointers on their Sword Principle and Sword Intent?”","“I’m afraid that’s impossible. If he’s not a sword cultivator, the effort he’s putting in now and the reward he’s getting will be very disproportionate.”","The Young Emperor smiled. “Don’t worry, Brother Jian. Among the remaining top cultivators, there are nearly 3,000 sword cultivators and 3 of the Yan Immortals specialize in Sword Dao.”","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched. He felt that no matter what he said, he would not be able to escape.","However, he did not dislike preaching and teaching.","When he was in the Divine Power Universe, he had opened a praying mat in the Heavenly Cloud Palace and taught many Inivnicble Supremes when he became Cosmoso God.","That feeling seemed to be quite good."]},{"number":4889,"title":"Chapter 4889 Discussing the Way of the Sword in the Dao Field","paragraphs":["4889 Discussing the Way of the Sword in the Dao Field","His control over the Great Dao and his unique comprehension allowed him to easily condense and organize them.","If he really liked books, he could probably stuff half of the Heavenly Dao Library into them.","Jian Wushuang agreed to the Young Emperor’s invitation after a moment of consideration.","After a few months of rest, he set up a vast Daoist field in the southernmost region of Little Lonely Heaven as a place for sword sparring.","In order to join in the fun, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Zhao Ting, and Wei Liujia followed Jian Wushuang to the southernmost border of Little Lonely Heaven. Even Di Qing followed with interest and was ready to listen.","There were more than 4,000 sword cultivators, but in fact, there were nearly 10,000 top cultivators, including the remaining 9 Yan Immortals.","What was certain was that all the remaining forces under the Young Emperor were present.","Standing in the middle of the training hall, Jian Wushuang’s mouth twitched as he looked at the overwhelming number of excited top cultivators.","However, this was not enough to make him nervous. After sighing helplessly, he quickly got into the mood.","“Those who have cultivated the way of the sword for 1 Hua Year, step forward.”","“Those who have cultivated the way of the sword for 2 Hua Years, step forward.”","“Those who have cultivated the way of the sword for 3 Hua Years, step forward.”","...","Jian Wushuang waited for the result after he finished speaking.","Soon, some top cultivators stepped out of the ranks and stood in their respective positions.","After dozens of breaths, almost 3,000 sword cultivators were divided into three camps. The 3 Yan Immortals who specialized in Sword Dao have all cultivated Sword Dao for 3 Hua Years.","This was not out of Jian Wushuang’s expectations. The path of sword cultivation had never been orthodox. It was already a great perseverance for them to persist in cultivating Sword Principle for 3 Hua Years.","Even though there were thousands of True Swords in the Great Yan Domain, they were only a medium to release the Yan power Immortal form.","“Now, who can tell me what the way of the sword is?” Jian Wushuang looked at them and asked in a clear voice.","All the sword cultivators looked at each other, including the 3 Yan Immortals. They all frowned and fell into deep thought.","At this moment, an ordinary-looking swordsman, who was not too eye-catching, took a step forward and said nervously, “The way of the sword is the path of improvement.”","The moment he said this, everyone, including the top cultivators in the outer field, laughed.","The sword cultivator’s face instantly turned red, and he wanted to shrink back.","Di Qing, who was in the outer field, saw this and immediately released Yan power to maintain order, making the Dao Field quiet down.","Jian Wushuang smiled. “You’re right. I also think that Sword Principle is a path for improvement.”","As soon as he said that, all the swordsmen became restless.","“No way, it’s that simple?”","“How can such a complicated thing as swordsmanship be summarized in two or three sentences...”","After getting Jian Wushuang’s approval, the swordsman immediately nodded his head and his face turned even redder.","After hearing the whispers, Jian Wushuang continued, “Who defined Sword Principle? Who could define it? It’s an ethereal Dao to begin with, and it’s not even as practical as cultivation.”","“What I want to say now is that no one can define the way of the sword, because there are thousands of ways of the sword. Every swordsman is just searching for a way to go up, to improve.”","“At the same time, I can also tell you clearly that the way of the sword is lonely. Everyone can define it at will. Even if you spend an entire Hua Year doing the simplest sword movement, it is still a part of the way of the sword.”","“There’s no need to refute others, and there’s no need to refute yourself. The way of the sword is impermanent, and it’s enough to summarize it with a path that leads upwards.”","All the top cultivators and sword cultivators had calmed down and were listening to Jian Wushuang’s discussion.","He continued calmly, “Now, regardless of whether you understand or not, I will tell you what I mean by the way of the sword in my heart.”","“The so-called Sword Dao, in my opinion, can only be described with eight words.”","“The Great Dao is simple, Yan is most complicated. These eight words can summarize it.”","“The first way of the sword must be the simplest. Even a strike of the wooden stick may be the source of the way of the sword. This is what is called simplicity.”","“After that, the first iron plate forged from iron ore completed its first mission of killing enemies. In fact, it was a simplified and complex process.”","“After the birth of the sword, the so-called Sword Intent and Sword Dao make the Sword PPrinciple became complex.”","“I’ve said a lot of things, but only eight words and one more sentence are useful. I won’t say more about the rest.”","There were no more than five people who could understand such a profound Sword PPPrinciple discussion.","However, Jian Wushuang obviously did not intend for them to understand. What he wanted to do now was to let them feel and Comprehend their own Sword Intent, and force-feed them with some Comprehension.","Di Qing and the others sitting outside the Dao Field did not say anything. They all frowned, as if they were thinking and recalling some principles.","After a brief summary of Sword PPrinciple, Jian Wushuang said, “I suddenly thought of another question. Can anyone tell me what a sword cultivator is?”","This time, no sword cultivator spoke.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to speak, the ordinary-looking sword cultivator spoke again, “Sword cultivators are sword cultivators. Every sword cultivator with a different purpose will cultivate a different sword.”","This sentence seemed to be nonsense, but it had a unique understanding.","Even Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “That’s right. What’s your name?”","“Heavenly Official Jian, my name is Xu Jin.” The ordinary-looking sword cultivator replied.","“It’s a good name,” Jian Wushuang said. “Xu Jin, I want you to do something for me. Go to any mountain in Little Lonely Heaven, find a weed, and give it to me.”","He did not hesitate at all. After agreeing, he turned around and left the training hall, heading for the mountains.","Then, Jian Wushuang said, “The so-called True Sword cultivator is able to completely abandon all external objects and feel the strike of ordinary iron with the Dao of the Heart. He can release the Comprehension of sword moves and Sword Intents in his heart.”","“Compared to the top cultivators, even to Yan Immortals, the path of the sword is a dead end. Only those with great determination will gradually become clear of their goals.”","“Who among you has comprehended your own Sword Dao? Even the framework is fine.”","All the swordsmen lowered their heads. They were the most mediocre sword cultivators and could only barely condense their own Sword Intents. Even as the top cultivators who cultivated Yan power, they were not outstanding.","Those who could comprehend their own Sword Dao were all Heaven’s Favorites."]},{"number":4890,"title":"Chapter 4890 Flowing Cloud Grass Sword (1)","paragraphs":["4890 Flowing Cloud Grass Sword (1)","Therefore, Jian Wushuang’s question was in vain. Even the three Yan Immortal sword cultivators lowered their heads in embarrassment.","This result was similar to what he had guessed. It would be surprising if a sword cultivator had comprehended his own Sword Dao.","“Since there’s none, it means that they’re still highly malleable. It’s not a bad thing.” Jian Wushuang continued, “How many of you specialize in sword cultivation?”","All the sword cultivators looked at each other. Just like the previous times, no one stood up.","More than 3,000 sword cultivators, in the end, still mainly cultivated Yan power. Their ultimate goal was to produce the Immortal Source and become Yan Immortal.","Compared to the illusory Sword Immortal, becoming a Yan Immortal was much more reliable.","Just as Jian Wushuang had said before, using the sword as the way was too illusory. Even if there were top cultivators who insisted on it, they would eventually give up due to various results.","The path of sword cultivation could not be achieved overnight. It was not a clear goal to begin with, and it could only be clear on the road of continuous progress.","Even if there were thousands of True Swords in the Great Yan Domain, they were just mediums for Yan Immortal to increase the damage of his moves to the peak.","These sword cultivators had also become sword cultivators because of this principle.","In simple terms, they cultivated the sword to serve the Yan power Dao.","At this moment, one of the three Yan Immortals said, “Heavenly Official Jian, according to your standards, I’m afraid we are just the bottom of the barrel. I’m afraid we will never be able to comprehend the True Sword Dao in our entire lives.”","“But now that the Heavenly Official Jian has appeared and showed us the true art of sword cultivation, I can’t help but be moved. I only hope that the Heavenly Official Jian can give us some insight so that we can find the right path.”","After he finished speaking, he bowed to Jian Wushuang solemnly. The 3,000 sword cultivators followed suit.","The path of sword cultivation was too vague and ethereal. It was already quite an amazing thing that they could persist until now.","After hearing this, Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He released his Yan power and lifted them up like a breeze.","“I’ll agree to everything you’ve said.”","All the sword cultivators were extremely excited at this moment. “Thank you, Heavenly Official Jian!”","To be able to kill a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal with a pure sword strike without any Yan power, such a shocking and unprecedented event had long been deeply imprinted in their minds.","It turned out that the Sword Dao was so powerful.","In fact, from the moment he stood in the sword discussion arena, Jian Wushuang had already planned to create a Sword Principle that could be controlled by these top cultivators who insisted on the path of sword cultivation.","After lifting up all the sword cultivators in the training hall, he stood quietly in the center of the training hall, as if waiting for something.","The training hall was extremely quiet. Not a single top cultivator spoke. They all looked at Jian Wushuang in anticipation.","As time passed, Jian Wushuang was puzzled. Xu Jin, who he had asked to pick a weed, should have returned a long time ago. He had not returned yet. Could it be that he had encountered some mishap?","Just as he was bewildered, an extremely powerful and vigorous flowing light flashed over from the horizon, filled with a majestic momentum.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He sensed that the person was not friendly.","In the next moment, the powerful and thick stream of light suddenly arrived!","Boom!!!","The entire training hall shook.","The newcomer was a brawny bald man with a fierce face. He was bare-chested and only had a large animal skin tied around his waist. His entire figure looked wild and full of oppression.","In his left hand, Xu Jin, who had a bloody nose and a swollen face, was on the verge of passing out.","Seeing this, Cheng Qing, who was outside the training hall, cursed in his heart. He was about to go up and smash this troublemaker to the ground.","However, Di Qing pulled him back. “Don’t go yet. Wushuang can solve it.”","When Cheng Qing heard this, he did not force it. He just stared at the bald man with his ox-like eyes, ready to fight at any time.","Before Jian Wushuang could speak, the bald man who was holding Xu Jin shouted, “Who is the guy who killed Chang Duoling? Who is the guy who killed Chang Duoling...”","He shouted so loudly that Jian Wushuang’s eardrums were buzzing.","His expression gradually turned unkind. “It’s me. I killed him.”","The bald man was stunned. He sized up Jian Wushuang and did not believe him at all, “You? A mere peak of the Yan Immortal realm killed Chang Duoling?”","“What, you want to try it too?” Jian Wushuang’s voice gradually turned cold.","Hearing this, the bald man laughed, “Of course, I’m here today to test your limits!”","Looking at the burly man in front of him who looked like a maniac, Jian Wushuang was obviously disinterested. “I don’t have time now. Stand aside first. Maybe after I finish teaching, I might exchange a few moves with you.”","“I don’t want to, I want to compete with you now!” he said impatiently.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and he suddenly took a step forward. Immediately, millions of flowing light Sword Intents shot up into the sky and caused a great change in the world!","“I’ll say it again, if you dare to be unreasonable again, don’t blame me for throwing you out!”","Looking at the majestic Sword Intent that shot into the sky, the bald man subconsciously swallowed his saliva. “Alright, I’ll wait for you for a moment...”","Jian Wushuang withdrew his Sword Intent and said in a bad mood, “Also, let him go. He is my disciple now.”","The bald man immediately threw Xu Jin to the side.","Xu Jin wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth and stood up with difficulty. Then, he walked to Jian Wushuang with light steps.","Then, he trembled as he took out a blade of grass with sharp leaves and forced a smile. “Heavenly Official Jian, I’ve brought the weed here. It’s a good thing it’s not damaged.”","Reaching out to take the weed, Jian Wushuang asked, “Is he the one who beat you?”","Xu Jin’s eyes flashed with a touch of embarrassment and sadness, and he nodded.","Jian Wushuang did not speak anymore. He waved his hand and released a wisp of breeze to carry him to the edge of the Dao Field. Then, he began to do the next thing.","Looking at the Seven-Leaf Weed in his hand, Jian Wushuang casually broke off a leaf and put it in his hand.","“Next, I’m going to teach you the Sword Intent, ranging from the simple principle to complex moves. This Sword Intent is something I comprehended on the spot. For you, it should be a new starting point.”","“This Sword Intent consists of nine sword forms, and they are all arranged in sequence. Although each sword form seems to be completely unrelated, they complement each other. It is also the principle of going from shallow to deep and from simple to complex.”","Jian Wushuang picked up the leaf and pointed it at the sky.","“For now, let’s just call it ‘Flowing Cloud Grass Sword’.”","The four simple words completely summarized the nine Sword Intents. Even Jian Wushuang now probably did not know how terrifying and far-reaching the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword he created would be in the future."]},{"number":4891,"title":"Chapter 4891 Flowing Cloud Grass Sword (2)","paragraphs":["4891 Flowing Cloud Grass Sword (2)","The Flowing Cloud Grass Sword would eventually become a sword manual that could help a sword cultivator avoid losing his way on the path of sword cultivation.","The entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword was a sword technique that had a total of nine moves, which were extremely smooth and classic.","The first six moves or forms were all the most basic sword theories, including sword strikes, horizontal slashes, and blocking. These were the most common sword forms.","It was only at the beginning of the seventh move that the entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword form could be considered to have gone from simple to complex. The seven sword forms were combined into one, releasing an endless great power.","The first six forms were simple. They were formed by the six forms of Star Bind, Moon Link, Water Travel, Clear Return, Long Mountain, and Flat Pavilion.","The last three moves were complex, consisting of Folding Grass and Leaves, Cutting the Four Seasons, and Flying Birds to Stop.","Jian Wushuang took great pains to break down and analyze each sword move again and again, trying to crush each sword move and send it to their minds.","All of the sword cultivators went from their initial doubts to deep contemplation, and then their eyes lit up. They wished they could empty their minds, and only instill this Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique in their minds.","Even Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others who were sitting in the void were digesting this knowledge.","“It’s over, it’s over. Not only is Brother Jian’s actual combat heaven-defying, but even his theory has reached an unimaginable level,” Cheng Qing held his forehead and sighed. “This group of brats has really made a big profit. What Brother Jian said will probably change them completely.”","This Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique had a total of nine forms, and could be said to be a complete sword form from the beginning to the end.","This completely changed the dazed state that sword cultivators were in before they obtained a certain Sword Dao inheritance. This allowed every sword cultivator to not be confused in the early stages.","It was foreseeable that this Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique would have a very far-reaching impact.","Di Qing, who had been looking at Jian Wushuang without saying anything, took a deep breath and made a conclusion.","“In less than a year, all sword cultivators, including but not limited to the Great Si Region, will know Wushuang’s name.”","Such shocking words came from Di Qing, who was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, shocked Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and all the other Yan Immortals.","However, none of them retorted, as if they all thought that this sentence was extremely correct.","“As long as this Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique is launched, Brother Jian will definitely be supported by all sword cultivators,” Cheng Qing murmured. “Thinking of this, he is too terrifying...”","Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the others did not speak. Instead, they subconsciously clenched their fists, their eyes burning.","“Brother Jian is truly a Heaven’s Favorite,” Wei Liujia muttered, his eyes similarly burning.","When Jian Wushuang performed the last move, the Flying Birds to Stop, a total of nine Flowing Cloud Grass Sword moves were all demonstrated.","The training hall was deathly silent. Every sword cultivator had a different expression. They were doing their best to remember the complete sword manual.","At this moment, they clearly knew that this was a new starting point. It was a great fortune!","If they did not grasp this opportunity, it would forever be an unimaginable loss.","Slowly exhaling, Jian Wushuang felt that even the battle with Chang Duoling had not been as tiring as today.","It seemed that teaching was really tiring. He should do less in the future.","Then, the 3,000 sword cultivators all knelt down on one knee and bowed to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not like such formalities, but he did not stop them. After they all saluted, he said, “You have to practice the nine sword moves diligently. As for how far you can reach, it depends on you.”","“Yes!” The voices of the 3,000 sword cultivators shot into the sky, their auras majestic.","At this point, Jian Wushuang’s teaching of Dao had completely ended. He left behind nine moves of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique.","And in the midst of this excited crowd, there was one guy who was not in his right state the entire time. He did not know whether to leave or not. He stood there like a tree, quite embarrassed.","Jian Wushuang finally looked at him and asked, “Hey, bald man, how did you know that I killed Chang Duoling?”","The bald man sized him up again and said, “You don’t know? The entire Great Si Region is going crazy right now, saying that a Yan immortal from the Six Heavens Realm killed Chang Duoling by himself. I don’t believe it, so I came here to fight with that guy and see if he’s real.”","“Aren’t you afraid that the guy who killed Chang Duoling will kill you as well if he’s in a bad mood?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I’m not afraid. I have my own immortal techniques. Even if I have to face Chang Duoling, I’m confident that I can still run away if I can’t beat him,” the bald man patted his chest confidently and said. “Tell me the truth. Did you really kill Chang Duoling?”","“Of course.”","“That’s good. I’ll have a match with you now.” The bald man’s eyes were filled with excitement.","Jian Wushuang did not refuse. Instead, he turned to the three thousand Yan Immortals in the Dao Field and said, “Now, I will show you the real Flowing Cloud Grass Sword moves with this leaf.”","“Enough with the nonsense. Let me see if the Yan immortal who killed Chang Duoling exists or not.”","The bald man laughed, and then thousands of dark yellow Yan power forces surged out from under his feet like True Dragons, rising up into the sky!","The peak of the Yan Immortal realm was revealed. At the same time, the bald man’s body suddenly expanded several times, like a real divine mountain.","Even Cheng Qing, who was over 10 feet tall, appeared handsome in front of this bald man.","Jian Wushuang was interested in the giant.","He held a blade of grass in his right hand and floated forward.","“Die!” The bald man shouted and slammed his fists on the ground of the training hall. At once, more than ten dark yellow True Dragons condensed by Yan power flew up and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, even the sky was covered by the dark yellow energy.","All the sword cultivators and top cultivators looked at this scene nervously.","“A clown.” After Di Qing came to such a conclusion, he was already disinterested, so he simply closed his eyes and rested.","Cheng Qing also pouted, “I thought that this troublemaker was also a Grand Yan Immortal. I never thought that he was only a Yan immortal. He’s really asking for a beating. He’s asking for it.”","Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and the rest had similar expressions. They looked at the bald man who was working hard in the training hall as if he was an idiot.","Jian Wushuang held the grass in his right hand, and his long black hair fluttered behind him along with the hem of his clothes.","Facing the dark yellow Yan power True Dragon that was charging at him, Jian Wushuang’s palm that was holding the grass only made a downward slashing motion.","“Break!”","Like water splitting apart, the ten over True Dragons that were carrying Yan power with them were cut off from the middle without any warning!"]},{"number":4892,"title":"Chapter 4892 Beating up the Bald Man","paragraphs":["4892 Beating up the Bald Man","As if it had been cut open by some kind of enormous force, the bald man’s attack was directly shattered.","The gazes of all the sword cultivators and top cultivators who were watching suddenly froze!","They could clearly see that Jian Wushuang’s blade of grass had condensed into a sword light that was ten thousand feet long and easily shattered the bald man’s attack!","Could it be that even grass and leaves could release such a powerful Sword Intent?","Flicking the grass in his hand, Jian Wushuang said faintly, “If you can’t threaten my attack, I advise you to go back to where you came from, so that I don’t throw you out.”","“There’s a price to pay for your arrogance!” The bald man was furious. His body grew several meters in size again, and the dark yellow Yan power around him became even more powerful and terrifying.","“Giant Desert Sky!”","As he roared, the entire Dao Field was covered in a layer of dust.","As he stood in the dust, Jian Wushuang could feel that his Yan power was slowly fading away.","This was an Immortal Style used by the bald man.","However, after his battle with Chang Duoling, he could sense that his perception had reached a whole new level.","This included the purity of his Yan power and his control of the Sword Dao.","If it had been before, the bald man, who had grasped the reality, might have been able to fight with Jian Wushuang for a few rounds. But now, everything had changed.","In fact, he could completely defeat the bald man with just one move from the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","However, Jian Wushuang did not do so. In order to better integrate knowledge and action, and to better guide the sword cultivators present, he used the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword moves.","The seventh move, Folding Grass and Leaves.","The smile on the bald man’s face did not even disappear completely. In the next moment, his Immortal Style, Giant Desert Sky, was completely broken by seven vast Sword Intents.","These seven Sword Intents were the shadows of seven blades of grass. After easily breaking the Immortal Style, they all slashed at him without losing momentum.","The bald man’s reaction was half a beat slower and he could not dodge in time. He was slashed seven times in a row, leaving a shocking wound.","“Damn it, you’re using strange tricks!” He was shocked and angry, and he released his Immortal Style again.","“Mountain Transformation!”","As the bald man’s voice fell, his incomparably sturdy figure swelled to an unimaginable extent once again. His entire skin appeared a grayish-yellow color, like a protruding rock.","Then, like a walking mountain, he crashed into Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang obviously did not want to engage in this meaningless battle. He immediately released the eighth move of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword, Cutting the Four Seasons.","The leaves in his hand slashed forward. This sword move was more precise and complicated than the seventh move. It was the peak move of the entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique.","There were a total of eight sword moves in this sword attack, which was the peak sword attack that combined the first seven moves. The eight sword moves combined into one, and it was enough to make the Four Seasons lose their color.","A million wisps of Sword Intent appeared on the blade of grass and slashed forward.","The bald man, who was running madly, felt a great danger flash through his heart. Then, he made a prompt decision and directly defended on the spot.","However, the eighth move of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword was too vast. Especially when it was performed by Jian Wushuang, its power was infinite.","In just a single exchange, the bald man was swallowed by the endless Sword Intent.","Bang! Bang! Swish! Clang–","In this entire Dao Field that was completely condensed by Yan power, an earth-shaking collision sound rang out.","A web of cracks appeared where the bald man was standing.","The eight powerful Sword Intents slashed down one after another, and even Yan Immortals would have died long ago.","However, this bald man was different. His ability to resist attacks had almost reached a terrifying level. Even if the Sword Intents left inextinguishable heavy injuries on his body, he did not say a word.","The training hall was collapsing.","When the last supreme Sword Intent landed, everything returned to calm.","When the dust settled, the scene that appeared caused all the sword cultivators to go crazy.","It turned out that the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique would have such power when it reached the peak!","Half of the bald man’s body had been smashed into the training hall. He was lying on his back, and it was unknown if he was dead or alive.","Jian Wushuang walked forward slowly and looked at the bald man in surprise.","He knew very well how powerful the Sword Intent released by him was. As long as it was below the Grand Yan Immortal stage, no Yan Immortal could withstand it.","However, this guy had endured it. Although it was a little tragic, his Immortal Source was not damaged at all.","Jian Wushuang finally understood why this guy came to challenge him without fear. It was because he was too thick-skinned, and other Yan Immortals would not be able to beat him.","After sighing in his heart, he directly pulled the bald man out of the training hall and threw him out of Little Lonely Heaven with a little force.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang looked at all the top cultivators in the Dao Field and said calmly, “This is the power of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword moves after it has been mastered.”","As he spoke, he stretched out his hand and threw the leaf in his hand. Like a stream of light, it fell in the center of the entire training hall.","When the leaf fell to the ground, it stood upright in the center of the training hall like a small sword. 99 streams of light surged out of the leaf and turned into seven-colored rays that covered the surroundings.","“These 99 Sword Intents are the entire Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique. You can comprehend it at any time. Now, I’ll tell you another thing.”","“I have hidden a wisp of my own Sword Dao in that leaf. If someone can pull out that leaf, that wisp of Sword Dao inside will belong to that person.”","As soon as he said this, all the sword cultivators were extremely fanatical as they looked at the leaf that stood in the center of the training hall.","Jian Wushuang smiled and stretched out his right palm. A flying bird condensed by Sword Intent started to chirp and jump.","This was the ninth move of the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword technique, Flying Birds to Stop.","This was the most exquisite sword move, the simplest sword move, but at the same time, the most complicated sword moovoe.","The bird flew out of Jian Wushuang’s hand, chirping and flapping its wings in the air. Finally, it landed on the grass leaf in the center of the Dao Field and began to sleep.","“Perhaps some people might ask if the Flowing Cloud Grass Sword can be cultivated to the realm of great success. Now I’m telling you, of course it can.”","“When this bird is willing to rest on the tip of someone’s sword, that person’s sword cultivation will be accomplished.”","After finishing his last sentence, Jian Wushuang left the sword discussion Dao Field.","Xu Jin hurriedly got up and followed him for dozens of steps before he finally stopped.","He stared at Jian Wushuang’s back until everything disappeared. Then, he came back to his senses and his eyes became determined."]},{"number":4893,"title":"Chapter 4893 The Moonless and Windy Night","paragraphs":["4893 The Moonless and Windy Night","After returning to the hall from the southernmost area of Little Lonely Heaven, Jian Wushuang finally relaxed.","After the battle with Chang Duoling, he had been in a deep sleep for nearly ten years, and had no time to sort out his own situation. So what he needed to do now was to sort out the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent and the Immortal Styles.","After returning to the hall, Jian Wushuang did not rush to sit down. Instead, he sat on the roof of the hall and looked down at the reconstructed Little Lonely Heaven.","Di Qing, who was following behind him, seemed to have something to say. He looked at Jian Wushuang from time to time.","“Do you have something to tell me?”","“Yes, I do.” Di Qing was a little surprised, but he still asked, “Did you go somewhere before the last war?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded, “I gained some Enlightenment in the Lower Three Heavens.","“The Yan Immortal who gave you Enlightenment is not simple, ” Di Qing said slowly, his voice was a little serious. “I can feel his aura, and I can also feel his power.”","Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised. He knew Di Qing’s pride. For him to say such a thing, it meant that the strength of Sir Yuan was probably above his.","Above the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, there was probably only the peak Grand Yan Immortal.","the hostility in his body is also too strong. This is the first time I’ve seen a Yan Immortal with such strong hostility. Di Qing looked at him, “The reason why I’m telling you this is that I hope you can stay away from him.”","Jian Wushuang said, “He cultivates the Slaughter Dao, so it’s normal for him to have a huge amount of hostility.”","Di Qing turned his eyes to the void, “In addition to the hostility, I also felt some inexplicable aura from him.”","He nodded. “I’ll be more aware and alert.”","Di Qing wanted to say something, but in the end, he said nothing.","The two of them stood on the roof for a while more before returning to the hall.","Sitting on the jade seat at the head of the table, Jian Wushuang was still thinking about Di Qing’s words, and he felt that what he said made more sense.","Due to the difference in the flow of time, he had stayed in Sir Yuan’s Domain for nearly 2,000 years and fought with him for more than 1,000 years.","During this time, he did not sense any thoughts from Sir Yuan, which was extremely mysterious.","The reason why Jian Wushuang felt that Di Qing’s words made sense was that he had also noticed the inexplicable strange aura of Sir Yuan during the time he had spent with him.","The strange aura was very sudden and mysterious. Even though Jian Wushuang had paid close attention, he could not guess what it was.","“Don’t tell me that he has other plans?”","Jian Wushuang was deep in thought with his eyes closed.","Di Qing thought he had fallen asleep, so he waved his hand and used the supreme rules of the Great Dao to extinguish all the light in Little Lonely Heaven.","Little Lonely Heaven entered the deep night, and it was silent.","Time passed by, and just as Di Qing was about to have a good sleep, he was alerted by an unstable aura.","In the next moment, his figure disappeared and appeared outside the hall. Then, he looked at the side of the hall, where the fluctuation of aura came from.","It was a moonless and windy night, and they were sneaking around.","In the hazy night, a naked figure with a strange luster on its buttocks was climbing up the wall.","“What’s wrong? You have nowhere to vent your energy, so you’re going to run around naked?”","A light inquiry was heard.","The burly man who was climbing the wall did not even turn his head. He subconsciously said, “What business do you have...”","Then, he seemed to have realized something. His body shook and he turned his head stiffly.","Di Qing smiled coldly, raised his fist and punched directly.","...","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and heard the sounds of fighting outside the hall. Then Di Qing appeared in the hall with a mountain-like figure.","After a loud boom, he saw an eye-piercing scene.","In the middle of the hall, a naked burly man was lying on his back. His face was swollen and he had obviously been beaten up.","The corner of Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched. Although the man’s face was swollen, he could tell at a glance that he was the bald man who had fought with him in the sword discussion dojo not long ago.","“Didn’t I throw this guy out Little Lonely Heaven?”","Di Qing curled his lips. “Who knows? He’s sneakily lying outside the hall. I don’t know what he’s thinking.”","The bald man who had been beaten up by Di Qing shook his head hard, then looked around in a daze.","As soon as he saw Jian Wushuang sitting at the head of the table, his eyes suddenly narrowed. Then, he stood up at a very fast speed and knelt down on one knee. He cupped his hands and shouted, “Feng Shan greets Your Excellency!”","The corner of Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched again, “You, didn’t I throw you out of Little Lonely Heaven? why are you back? Could it be that you’re not willing to accept your loss?”","When the bald man heard this, he hurriedly waved his hand. “No, no, My Lord, you’ve misunderstood. Feng Shan lost wholeheartedly. The reason why I came back is that I’ve thought it through. From today on, I’ll follow My Lord.”","After hearing this, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly, “You plan to follow me? Why?”","He touched his head and smiled naively. “Since I became a Yan Immortal, you are the only one in the same realm who can beat me so hard that I can’t fight back. So, it’s not embarrassing for Feng Shan to follow you!”","Jian Wushuang laughed. He was obviously amused by this silly guy’s straightforward words. Then, he reached out and took out a casual outfit from his storage ring and threw it to him. “Put on some clothes first.”","The bald man took the clothes and smiled awkwardly, “When I was thrown out, I fainted. When I woke up, I was like this.”","After he put on his clothes, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “Hurry up and go back. I’m a solo ranger. You won’t be able to achieve anything by following me. You’ll only be a burden.”","When he heard this, he hurriedly said, “My Lord, I’m not afraid. As long as I can be by your side, it’s fine. I have sat for many years to achieve my current achievements. Even if I don’t achieve anything great in the future, I’ll be able to travel the world with you!”","Seeing his determined face, Jian Wushuang did not know how to refuse. He could only say, “Why don’t you stay with me for the time being? I won’t stop you if you want to leave in the future.”","Before the bald man could be overjoyed, Di Qing, who was standing beside him, kicked him out of the hall and closed the door.","Jian Wushuang was stunned, “Di Qing, what are you...”","“Why should we bother with such an inflexible fool?” Di Qing clapped his hands. “Once we beat him up twice, I’m sure he’ll stop bothering us.”"]},{"number":4894,"title":"Chapter 4894 Prince Qian Arrives","paragraphs":["4894 Prince Qian Arrives","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. Although he did not agree with Di Qing’s method, it was a permanent solution.","Right now, Di Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Zhao Ting, and Wei Liujia were already with him. If more and more followed him, it would be a burden to him.","He had no intention of establishing his own faction in the Great Yan Domain, so he did not want to develop in this direction.","What he wanted to do was to explore the ultimate regions of the Great Yan Universe alone and find the whereabouts of Xuan Yi and Old Master.","As Di Qing had closed the door of the hall and set up a Divination Barrier, no matter how hard the bald man slammed the door, there was no way to enter the hall.","Jian Wushuang sat down and began to organize his Sword Principle and Immortal Styles.","Now, he had three Daos. They were the Dao of Protection, the Dao of the Wushuang, and the Dao of Slaughter that he had comprehended from Sir Yuan.","The Great Dao fate energy that was derived from the three strands of Qi was extremely abundant. It nourished Jian Wushuang endlessly and enriched his Comprehension.","As the Dao of Slaughter was formed from the blood and Qi of the Sand Demon Cave, the Karma and the great killing tribulations did not disappear and were still attached to his body.","This gave Jian Wushuang a headache. If there was really no way to resolve it, he would have to go to the so-called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm in the future to find a solution.","Other than the unfathomable Slaughter Dao, Jian Wushuang could clearly feel that after the battle with Chang Duoling, his own Immortal Styles and the Wushuang Sword Dao had undergone a complete and thorough transformation.","“Could it be that every time the Immortal body is completely destroyed, it will strengthen itself again?”","Jian Wushuang was a little puzzled. From the looks of it, it was indeed possible.","If the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body really had such an effect, then it would probably be the true heaven-defying and terrifying part.","If he died hundreds or thousands of times...","Just as he was secretly calculating the possibilities, Chen Qing’s voice suddenly came from outside the hall.","Immediately after, Di Qing extended his hand to remove the barrier. Chen Qing hurriedly pushed open the door and entered. “Brother Jian, the Young Emperor has invited you to Big Lonely Heaven. He has something important to discuss with you.”","As he spoke, he walked quickly to Jian Wushuang and whispered, “It’s Young Emperor’s fourth brother, Prince Qian.”","Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. He was afraid that Prince Qian had some ulterior motives for coming to the Six Heavens Realm at this point.","Then, he nodded. “Alright.”","Chen Qing seemed to have thought of something as he scratched his head and said, “Oh right, who was that guy sleeping outside the palace door? I kicked him but he didn’t react. I thought he was dead.”","Jian Wushuang was speechless. Then he said, “Leave him alone. Let’s go.”","With Di Qing accompanying them, the three of them left Little Lonely Heaven and headed straight for Big Lonely Heaven.","When he was about to leave the palace, Jian Wushuang saw the bald man sleeping outside the palace. He had no choice but to throw him into the palace.","At this moment, the newly reconstructed Big Lonely Heaven was extremely somber. Nearly a hundred Yan Immortals formed an array and appeared. Each of them wore a white robe with the word ‘Qian’ carved on their chest with golden threads. Clearly, they were brought here by Prince Qian.","After a glance, Jian Wushuang went straight to the palace where the Young Emperor was.","The Heavenly Palace was very strict. The Young Emperor’s companion, the thin purple-robed man, had been waiting outside the palace for a long time. When he saw Jian Wushuang, he led them into the palace.","Immortal clouds rose up. Although there were very few Yan Immortals in the hall, it was filled with an oppressive feeling.","As soon as he stepped into the hall, Jian Wushuang’s eyes locked onto the handsome figure sitting at the side.","Among the seven Princes under Zhen Wuyang, the Young Emperor was undoubtedly the most handsome, followed by Prince Qian.","Prince Qian also locked his eyes on Jian Wushuang at the first moment, his eyes full of meaning.","The Young Emperor stood up slowly and walked towards Jian Wushuang.","“Even Big Brother has to stand up to welcome me. It seems that Fourth Brother has to treat you with courtesy.” Prince Qian laughed and stood up.","Jian Wushuang randomly picked a seat and sat down with Di Qing. The Young Emperor returned to his original spot and looked at Prince Qian with a dark expression.","“Tell me, what are you doing here?”","Prince Qian smiled again, “Of course, I’m here to visit you. Since we went to our respective Heavenly Regions, this is the first time I’m here to visit you.”","“Don’t beat around the bush. If you have something to say, say it.” A hint of impatience flashed in the Young Emperor’s eyes.","“I do have something to discuss with Big Brother, and this matter is also harmful to Big Brother,” Prince Qian said straightforwardly. “I want to form an alliance with Big Brother.”","When the Young Emperor heard this, he gave him a sideways glance. “Not interested. If you’re only here for this matter, then scram back to where you came from.”","Prince Qian grinned and looked at Jian Wushuang, “If I’m not mistaken, he must be the Heavenly Official who killed Chang Duoling, the Nine Heavens Immortal Lord, with the power of the Yan Immortal. He’s famous in the Heavenly Regions in the past ten years.”","Jian Wushuang did not answer and continued to look down.","At this moment, the Young Emperor said coldly, “So what if he is? So what if he’s not? I’ll count to three. If you don’t scram, don’t blame me for being impolite!”","“Big Brother, don’t be so impatient. The alliance that I’m talking about will only be beneficial to the current you!” Prince Qian stood up and said in a deep voice, “The foundation of your Six Heavens Realm must have been exhausted in that battle. You’re at the end of your rope.”","“What I want to tell you now is that even after hundreds of Yan Immortals died in that battle, it did not affect them. The real battle has yet to begin.”","The Young Emperor looked at him and sneered. “Those guys? Are you telling me you’re not involved with Prince Jiu and Prince Yu?”","“Of course, I’m not involved. I just happen to know everything,” Prince Qian smiled secretly. “As long as we’re allies, I’ll tell you everything I know.”","“It’s not impossible to form an alliance. Tell me your purpose,” the Young Emperor said. “I want to hear the truth.”","Prince Qian spread out his hands. “It’s not as complicated as you think. It’s purely because I want to be an ordinary Emperor and don’t want to get involved in this complicated dispute.”","The Young Emperor said coldly, “State your motive.”","“Alright, as expected, I can’t hide anything from Big Brother.” He smiled. “I only have one request. From now on, if anything happens to my territory, all of you from the Six Heavens Realm must come to my rescue.”","“As repayment, all the Yan Immortals and peak cultivators under me will help Big Brother get through this calamity. It will be enough to last until Imperial Father returns.”"]},{"number":4895,"title":"Chapter 4895 Armadillo Bull","paragraphs":["4895 Armadillo Bull","After saying this, Prince Qian waited for a reply.","The Young Emperor did not answer him and continued to ask, “How many more Yan Immortals do you have?”","He added, “300, no more, no less. If I give it my all, it will be even more.”","Finally, the Young Emperor said, “We can form an alliance.”","“I’ve told you before,” Prince Qian said comfortably. “This alliance will definitely be beneficial to you, Big Brother.”","“But how can I believe that you’re not Prince Jiu’s henchman to lure me into the trap?” the Young Emperor asked again, looking at him with a faint smile.","“Since things have come to this, I’ll tell you everything. You don’t have to worry that I’m on the same side as Prince Jiu and the others,” said Prince Qian generously. “Because right now, I’m voluntarily withdrawing.”","“Because be it me or my Ethereal Immortal Province, they are relatively weak. In the beginning, for self-protection reasons, I formed an alliance with Prince Jiu.”","“However, in the following period of time, I discovered that Prince Jiu was intentionally or unintentionally depleting the foundation of my Ethereal Immortal Province. He even directly took over my Yan Immortals and tried to make me powerless.”","“After I noticed it, I directly broke off the alliance with him until today.”","After the Young Emperor heard this, he said slowly, “Then, you were afraid that Prince Jiu would turn around to find trouble with you after he completely defeated me, so you struck first and gained the upper hand, and came to form an alliance with me?”","Prince Qian nodded, looked at him, and said, “That’s right. It looks like I’m helping you, but I’m actually helping myself.”","“From what you’re saying, there are two other Princes on Prince Jiu’s side?”","“That’s right. After Fifth Brother died, only Prince Yu and Prince Hua are following him.”","“Then what about Prince Lin?” the Young Emperor asked, intentionally or unintentionally.","“Him?” Prince Qian asked. “He’s just a young kid. No one cares about him.”","The Young Emperor slowly stood up and paced around the hall.","“What did you mean when you said that the real war hasn’t started yet? Would they do it again in such a short time?”","Prince Qian nodded, his eyes solemn. “That’s right. They are doing all this to defeat you before Father returns to the Great Si Region. They might even kill you.”","“They sure have guts. It seems like Prince Mo’s death has boosted their morale.” The Young Emperor sneered.","...","In front of the gate of the Six Heavens Realm, the nearly 100 Yan Immortals that Prince Qian had brought were all releasing extremely powerful energy to construct the Immortal formation.","Prince Qian said, “Big brother, in less than half a day, the Immortal Array Formation from the Ethereal Immortal Province to the Six Heavens Realm will be completed. At that time, all the Yan Immortals will be under your command.”","The Young Emperor did not answer him. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang and asked in a low voice, “When do you think Prince Jiu will make trouble again?”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to speak, the entire shattered void shook as if something had hit it.","Just then, at the end of the endless void, a giant object that could not be described with words tore through the void and appeared.","This giant thing floated in the void and was even bigger than a Heavenly Region Plane. It looked like a giant turtle, but its raised head had four sinister-looking horns and six eyes. Its entire back was big enough to fit a Heaven Region.","When all the Yan Immortals in the void saw this huge thing, they all gasped.","“Armadillo Bull? Wasn’t this kind of mutated beast extinct? Why did he appear again?” Prince Qian frowned and said.","“Armadillo Bull?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled. He looked at the huge thing that had no edge and felt something was wrong.","Following that, the Young Emperor explained, “This is a product of my Imperial Father’s youth. It is called the Armadillo Bull, and it feeds on Heavenly Regions and all living beings. For an Armadillo Bull to grow to adulthood, it would need to eat at least 10,000 Heavenly Regions, which is why it is a huge threat. There was once an Emperor who used this as a mount to conquer realms. It is extremely ferocious.”","“Rumor has it that the four limbs of the Armadillo Bull have the ability to stabilize the Heavenly Region Plane. It seems like it’s true.”","Just as they were conversing, another Armadillo Bull of the same size appeared from the end of the void.","“I’m afraid that the appearance of such a strange beast is not a good sign,” Prince Qian said nervously. “Do you think that this is sent by Prince Jiu?”","As soon as he said this, everyone became vigilant.","After each Armadillo Bull reached adulthood, it was extremely difficult to kill them. Even if dozens of Yan Immortals attacked them together, they would not be able to cause any substantial damage.","If these Armadillo Bulls were really sent by Prince Jiu to stir up trouble, the situation would be quite troublesome.","As if to confirm their guesses, when the second Armadillo Bull appeared from the end of the void, the third Armadillo Bull also appeared.","They were all like Heavenly Region Planes that roamed in the void. With unimaginable power, they crashed into the Six Heavens Realm.","“No way, Prince Jiu really sent them?!” Prince Qian’s face was ashen. He had never thought that he would start a war just after forming an alliance with the Young Emperor.","Once the battle started, all the Yan Immortals under him would probably die in this battle.","Thinking of this, he wanted to slap himself.","A total of four Armadillo Bulls charged toward the Six Heavens Realm. As these Armadillo Bulls appeared, streams of light leaped from the backs of the Armadillo Bulls and gathered in the void.","At a rough glance, there were no less than 300 Yan Immortals.","“Dammit, these idiots, are the Yan Immortals just some trash that can be found on the streets? Sending them here in batches!” Prince Qian gritted his teeth.","His heart was bleeding. They had only formed an alliance for less than a day and they had already encountered this battle. He was already thinking about how to minimize the casualties of his subordinates.","Just then, Jian Wushuang said, “Give me 100 Yan Immortals.”","“What? Only 100?” Prince Qian did not know what to say."]},{"number":4896,"title":"Chapter 4896 The Battle Begins","paragraphs":["4896 The Battle Begins","The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and looked at him. “Why? Do you think it’s too little? Why don’t you pull all your assets over?”","Then, he flew towards the group of Yan Immortals who were still building the Immortal Array Formation, shouting angrily, “You still want to build the Immortal Array Formation? Hurry up and gather!”","Nearly 100 Yan Immortals heard this and did not dare to disobey Prince Qian, they quickly stopped building the Immortal Array Formation and gathered together.","Prince Qian was still worried, so he directly released his Yan power to destroy the nascent Immortal Array Formation.","Jian Wushuang found his action funny.","He did this to prevent the flames of war from spreading to his Ethereal Immortal State through the Immortal Array Formation.","However, Prince Qian’s actions were understandable, he could not be blamed. After all, at this juncture, he had not abandoned the alliance and gathered close to 100 Yan Immortals.","To the entire Six Heavens Realm, this was like sending charcoal in the snow and the capital to counterattack.","If not for Prince Qian’s arrival, the entire Six Heavens Realm might have been destroyed.","Four Armadillo Bulls that were even larger than the Heavenly Region Plane appeared, almost squeezing the shattered void.","Jian Wushuang saw it the most clearly. On the back of each Armadillo Bull, there was an Immortal Array Formation that was enshrouded in energy!","This was too crazy, four Armadillo Bulls that were even more vast than the Heavenly Region were carrying the Four Directions Immortal Formation!","Other than the 300-plus Yan Immortals who were already here, this Immortal Array Formation that could connect to the Void Heavenly Region was the scariest part.","This battle would be a battle to the death.","Prince Qian’s face turned pale. He had also witnessed this terrifying scene, “It’s over, it’s over. It seems like all my hundred over Yan Immortals are going to die here...”","Four completely constructed Immortal Array Formations, how many peak cultivators and Yan Immortals could be sent out, this was unimaginable.","It could be said that as long as the mastermind wanted to, he could even send an entire Heavenly Region to destroy the Six Heavens Realm.","The Young Emperor frowned and looked at Jian Wushuang with a heavy expression. “Brother Jian, this battle...”","With the current situation, with four mutated Armadillo Bulls carrying four Immortal Array Formations and fighting against over 300 Yan Immortals, there were already so many that could be seen, how many could not be seen?","For a moment, even Jian Wushuang was extremely solemn.","Currently, only the 100 or so Yan Immortals under Prince Qian were able to show their strength in the Six Heavens Realm. It was simply unfair.","The Young Emperor did not reply. He looked at Jian Wushuang as if waiting for him to make a decision.","“Could it be...” Prince Qian swallowed the second half of his sentence, his face turning extremely ugly.","“This battle is unavoidable. Give me 100 Yan Immortals,” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","Prince Qian nodded. “How about you leave some for me?”","Ignoring him, Jian Wushuang looked at Di Qing, “I’ll leave the 100 Yan Immortals to you. You hold them back while I break the Immortal Array Formation.”","Di Qing nodded. “Don’t worry.”","“Brother Jian, I’ll go with you!” Chen Qing said in a deep voice, “I, Chen Qing, can fight and resist. I will help you break the formation!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not refuse.","The Young Emperor also looked at Prince Qian. “You don’t plan to leave?”","“All of my Yan Immortals are here, where can I run to?” Prince Qian’s eyes twitched. “I only hope that I can suffer fewer losses.”","The Young Emperor was also surprised by this. He looked at him deeply before looking forward.","As the four gigantic Armadillo Bulls stopped in front of the entrance to the Six Heavens Realm, a huge battle was inevitable.","Nearly 300 Yan Immortals covered the sky and earth, each of them raised their cultivation to the peak, all sorts of energy rushed into the sky, filled with a terrifying aura.","At this moment, there were only 100 or so Yan Immortals from the Six Heavens Realm. The gap between the two was too big. They were not even on the same level. Once the battle started, it was expected that the situation would not be optimistic.","In front of these 300-plus Yan Immortals, 6 figures wearing black robes walked out slowly.","Furthermore, each of the mysterious figures held a black scepter in their hands. This made all the Yan Immortals feel an invisible pressure.","In the next moment, the six black-robed figures raised their scepters at the same time. Six boundless and boundless energies shot out from the top of the scepters and condensed into a beam that pierced through the void!","Unimaginably violent gales instantly raged, tearing and distorting the void.","“Pay attention, there are two Grand Yan Immortals among the six black-robed men,” Di Qing quickly reminded Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked at him and nodded, “I will.”","Prince Qian’s expression changed drastically. He was obviously extremely regretful. The current situation was no different from sending himself to his death.","“Big Brother, if you don’t leave now, it’ll be too late. When the Immortal array opens, even if Imperial Father wants to protect you, it’ll be too late!”","The Young Emperor glanced at him.” Shut up. No one knows what the outcome will be until the last moment.”","Prince Qian was already anxious and angry, but he could not lose his temper. He could only say angrily, “Damn it, I’ll go all out!”","As the six black-robed figures shot out beams of light at the same time, the entire void dome condensed into a vortex. There were thousands of feet of lightning clashing within, and it was extremely terrifying.","At the same time, the four Armadillo Bulls, which were even larger than the Heavenly Region Planes, raised their heads and neighed.","That strange voice made the heart of those who heard it beat violently, and their hearts palpitated to the extreme.","When the spinning vortex on the void dome expanded to the extreme, four light pillars suddenly descended from the center and enveloped the Immortal Array Formation on the backs of the four Armadillo Bulls.","Buzzz...","Layers of energy ripples spread out like a sealed door that was slowly opening.","The Immortal Array Formation spun quietly, releasing billions of rays of light that lit up the void.","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals did not stop. They controlled their extremely powerful Yan power and crushed toward the Six Heavens Realm."]},{"number":4897,"title":"Chapter 4897 Destroying the Immortal Array Formation","paragraphs":["4897 Destroying the Immortal Array Formation","In order to give himself some leeway, Prince Qian, who had already changed his appearance, suddenly raised the true sword in his hand, “All Yan Immortals, follow the Heavenly Official Jian closely. If you go against my orders, die on the battlefield!”","After exchanging a glance with Di Qing, Jian Wushuang took the lead.","Facing the huge Yan Immortal army, he held an Invisible Sword and walked forward, as if nothing could stop him.","Behind him were over 100 Yan Immortals.","Di Qing also moved at this moment. He shook his arms and a pair of magnificent wings spread out from his back.","He was like the Heavenly Dao that had descended into the world, and an extremely beautiful light shot out from behind him.","Tens of thousands of golden feathers with boundless power tore through the void and poured toward the Yan Immortal army.","The entire void seemed to have been completely burned. The golden feather swept over and instantly contained the impact.","A Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent burst forth, the incomparable sword intent exploded in front of them, and several Yan Immortals were exhausted from dealing with it and were crushed into dust on the spot.","In just one exchange, the combined power of Jian Wushuang and Di Qing turned the tables. Nearly 30 Yan Immortals were killed on the spot!","Prince Qian, who was at the back, saw this shocking scene and his eyebrows twitched. He never thought that the Six Heavens Realm would have such a terrifying killing move.","He looked at the ten-winged Di Qing in the air and could not help but swallow. He was already drooling.","However, Prince Qian quickly regained his composure. This was just the beginning. Nothing was set in stone. He could not let his guard down.","Just as he was about to find a safe place to hide, the Young Emperor beside him suddenly raised his sword and joined the battle!","“Prince Yan, do you want to die? They’re all here for you!” Prince Qian shouted anxiously, but the Young Emperor had already left and ignored him.","“Damn it, they’re all a bunch of idiots!” He was furious. At the same time, he was nervously watching this battle. It should have been a crushing defeat, but it had fallen into a stalemate.","With Di Qing backing him up, the pressure on Jian Wushuang’s body was relieved. His entire body was like a True Sword that was showing off its sharpness. Nothing could stop him.","The four Armadillo Bulls were spread out in a triangular formation. What Jian Wushuang needed to do now was to destroy them one by one before the transmitting Immortal Array Formation was fully activated!","The 100 or so Yan Immortals behind him instantly clashed with the Yan Immortal army.","The battle of close to 500 Yan Immortals was even more terrifying than the last battle, shaking the heavens and earth.","The first Armadillo Bull was the closest to Jian Wushuang and the Immortal formation was about to open.","Under the close to 100 Yan Immortals’ fierce battle, a hole was forcefully torn open in the encirclement.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang released the second move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","River.","As if descending from the sky, the long river of Sword Dao with endless power poured down.","When all the Yan Immortals saw this scene, they were shocked beyond words, they hurriedly scrambled to make a way out.","Jian Wushuang was confident that he could destroy the transmitting Immortal Array Formation with this Sword Intent!","However, in the next moment, something unexpected happened.","In the void in front of Armadillo Bull, a deep red barrier that was more than a million feet tall suddenly condensed!","The earth-shaking River Sword Intent collided with the dark red barrier, and endless derivation force gushed out crazily.","Under such a terrifying impact, the dark red barrier began to crack, as if it would shatter in the next moment.","However, at this moment, a figure in a wide black robe quietly appeared behind the barrier. At the same time, he stretched out a palm and placed it on the barrier.","In an instant, a dense, spiderweb-like dark red thread clung to the barrier and quickly repaired the cracks.","The two counteracted each other. In the end, the Sword Intent of the River Style dissipated completely, but the barrier remained intact.","Jian Wushuang looked at the black-robed figure with a serious expression.","Waving his hand to remove the barrier, the black-robed figure held the scepter and said coldly, “Go back to where you came from. We want to kill Prince Yan, and it has nothing to do with you.”","“F*ck you, old bastard. You’re old and weak. Do you only know how to talk?” Chen Qing, who was standing beside Jian Wushuang, shouted and wanted to slash him with his sword.","“Stinky-mouthed junior!” The black-robed figure coldly shook the scepter in his hand. Immediately, a violent gale slashed toward Chen Qing.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang slashed out and cut off the violent astral wind. He glanced at him coldly and said, “Move aside if you want to live!”","“Ignorant!” The black-robed figure slammed the scepter in his hand again and roared angrily.","In an instant, tens of thousands of dark-red flows of energy gushed out from his black robe and spread out in the void like the petals of a lotus.","As the black robe moved, a thin and haggard face was revealed. Two dark red lights shot out from his pupils, which was extremely strange.","Even Jian Wushuang felt uncomfortable when he saw that face and that gaze.","“You’re not his match, he’s a Grand Yan Immortal,” Jian Wushuang reminded.","Chen Qing was startled, but he did not dare to say anything, “Damn it, when did so many Grand Yan Immortals pop up in the Great Si Region?”","Jian Wushuang frowned as well. He remembered that Chen Qing had told him that other than the Elders under Zhen Wuyang, there was only a handful of Grand Yan Immortals in the Great Si Region.","From the harsh conditions of advancement and the environment of the Great Si Region, what Chen Qing said was correct. There were indeed very few people who could advance to the Grand Yan Immortal realm.","But now, there were two Grand Yan Immortals participating in this battle. This was truly terrifying.","Adding on Chang Duoling from before, to be able to mobilize three Grand Yan Immortals in a row, the strength that Prince Jiu was hiding was far more terrifying than what he had shown.","Right now, this early-stage Grand Yan Immortal had not reached the Three Revolutions stage, but the aura he gave off was extremely strange. It was different from Blood Qi and Vicious Qi, it was the purest Death Qi.","He was like a lifeless dead Immortal.","It was an unchanging principle that delay would lead to change. Therefore, Jian Wushuang raised his sword and moved forward to welcome the attack.","He had to end this battle as soon as possible. He did not dare to imagine how many troops would be sent out to crush the Six Heavens Realm if the Immortal Array Formations on the backs of the four Armadillo Bulls were all opened.","At that time, once the Immortal Array was completely activated and opened, it could be imagined that the Six Heavens Realm would definitely be destroyed!"]},{"number":4898,"title":"Chapter 4898 Death Sentence Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["4898 Death Sentence Heavenly Dao","A puny little Yan Immortal wanted to fight against a Grand Yan Immortal, it was simply laughable, he was overestimating himself!","“I’ll count to three. If you retreat, I’ll let you live. If you insist on advancing, you can all stay here!” He shouted coldly, “One!”","Before he could finish his sentence, a sky-piercing sword light slashed down at him.","The sword light expanded a million feet in the wind and devoured it in an instant.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s expression changed, and he hurriedly extended his skinny palm to release his Yan energy to offset it.","Jian Wushuang, who had started this, arrived quietly at this moment. He raised the Invisible Sword in his hand and slashed down again.","“Junior, you overestimate yourself!” He was furious and waved his robe, trying to suppress Jian Wushuang with his pressure.","However, he had clearly underestimated Jian Wushuang’s strength. The black-robed Grand Evolution Immortal’s pressure did not deter him at all.","Jian Wushuang slashed his sword down and cut off his sleeve, exposing a large part of his arm that looked like a skeleton.","Seeing that the situation was not right, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal retreated a thousand feet. He looked at his torn sleeve and then at Jian Wushuang, who had a cold expression.","He seemed to have remembered something, his dark red eyes suddenly focused, his voice raised, “You are the Yan Immortal that was rumored to have killed Chang Duoling?!”","“So what if I am? If you leave now, I can let you live,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What a joke! Let’s not talk about whether Chang Duoling died in your hands or not, just based on the current situation, is it something a puny Yan Immortal like you can stop?” the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal said coldly. “That Chang Duoling is an insignificant existence compared to me. Even if you really killed him, it doesn’t prove anything.”","“Listen to my advice. If you leave or submit to me, I can guarantee your survival.”","Jian Wushuang was getting impatient. He raised his palm and the Invisible Sword was aimed at him. Obviously, he did not want to talk nonsense with him anymore.","A Star Sword Intent slashed out, illuminating the entire shattered void.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was even more shocked. Although he had doubts about Jian Wushuang killing Chang Duoling, it did not mean that he underestimated his enemy.","Therefore, he was going all out to deal with it.","Immediately, countless wisps of Death Qi that seemed to have come from the abyss surged up from under his black robe and turned into a skull that was thousands of feet in size. It opened its huge mouth and swallowed the sword strike.","Jian Wushuang stood rooted to the ground and frowned slightly. He could feel that the sword strike did not cause any substantial damage to him.","“You really have some skills, but these two skills are not enough to let you live. This seat will definitely not let you die a good death today!” The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s voice was gloomy.","After saying this, his body suddenly grew several feet, like a thin skeleton. Endless black Death Qi crazily seeped out.","The entire shattered void seemed to boil, turning even darker and more chaotic.","“Brother Jian, it seems like this fellow is going to use his trump card.” Chen Qing had a grave expression on his face.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Instead, he reached out and pushed Chen Qing thousands of feet behind him, away from this area.","“Brother Jian...”","He looked at the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal. At this moment, only the two of them were left in this area.","The void under his feet was already covered by the thick and solid Death Qi, and even the void around him was blocked.","Jian Wushuang stood in the Death Qi Formation. Although his eyes were solemn, he was not afraid!","The reason why he was not afraid was that after comprehending the Lake Style Sword Intent, it was actually a watershed.","After that, all of his Sword Intent, all of his Immortal Styles, and even his Ancestral Skills had sublimated to another level.","It could be said that the Wushuang Sword Dao and the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent were a form of comprehension and sublimation.","Jian Wushuang was no longer the same as before. He had the strength to fight against the Grand Yan Immortal.","This was also why he had insisted on fighting Chang Duoling back then.","Only that battle could allow him to transform. Fortunately, he succeeded.","Facing the Grand Yan Immortal once again, he was somewhat calm, but he also knew his own shortcomings.","If he wanted to kill a Grand Yan Immortal again, he could only use the third move, the Lake Style Sword Intent.","However, the consumption of the Lake Style Sword Intent was too great. After using this Sword Intent, he would probably not have the strength to fight anymore.","Therefore, the Lake Style Sword Intent could only be used in the most urgent situation.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal seemed to have become the sole ruler of this deathly array. All the deathly energy had become his extended arms.","Two dark red lights shot out from his shriveled eyes. “Junior, become my nourishment today.”","With a cold snort, Jian Wushuang held his sword with one hand and looked at him disdainfully, “Come down and fight if you have the guts.”","Then, he raised his hands high. “A bloody battle is the most foolish method. I have never resorted to it. I control the Heavenly Dao and play with the Heavenly Dao laws, let alone a junior like you.”","“In this Immortal Death Array Formation, I am above the Heavenly Dao. I can kill you with just a thought. Now, you should obediently become my nourishment.”","Jian Wushuang felt a little unnatural when he heard the strange and excited voice.","“Next, as the Heavenly Dao, I will pass judgment on all of you!”","“Sentencing your Immortal bodies to age, from life to death. Such is irreversible!”","As the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s Death Sentence incantation was uttered, the entire Heaven Death Immortal Array and his domain began to distort and fluctuate.","Jian Wushuang felt an indescribable feeling from the bottom of his heart. At the same time, an even more mysterious and terrifying scene appeared.","His Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was aging at an extremely fast pace. Fine and dense wrinkles appeared on his body. At the same time, his internal organs, which could not be seen, were weakening at the same speed!","How was this possible? At this moment, even the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was aging at an astonishing speed!"]},{"number":4899,"title":"Chapter 4899 I Am Above the Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["4899 I Am Above the Heavenly Dao","One had to know that the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was transformed from a super Perfect Chaotic Life Form.","However, the Immortal Body was aging at an irreversible rate under the hands of an unknown Grand Yan Immortal.","Old age was a sign of death!","Jian Wushuang could clearly feel that his life was also disappearing at an extremely fast speed.","The feeling of having his life being played around by others was too strange and terrifying. Even he could no longer maintain his composure.","Not only did his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body begin to age, but even the energy in his meridians began to dry up.","And all of this was irreversible.","Jian Wushuang wanted to break free from the binding, but he found that the Invisible Sword in his hand had dimmed and finally shattered.","He wanted to release the Immortal Style, but he was shocked to find that the Yan power in his meridians was already extremely weak and could not support him to do anything.","He could not even hold onto the Boyang Bottle at his waist.","It had only been a few dozen breaths since the Death Sentence was uttered, but Jian Wushuang had already aged beyond recognition. Although his figure was still straight, he was already on the verge of death.","As if he had just been fished out of the water, he began to pant heavily.","When the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal saw this scene, he seemed to be extremely excited. “Junior, be at ease and become my nourishment.”","Chen Qing, who saw this scene from afar, felt his heart tremble. He hurriedly flew over. Facing this Immortal Death Formation, his full-powered attack could not even deal any serious damage!","“Brother Jian, you must hold on!” Chen Qing shouted anxiously, then turned around to call for reinforcements.","However, immediately after, close to 30 Yan Immortals quietly surrounded him from all directions, and then the most intense battle erupted.","A black and white sun rose slowly. As the sun rose, a man and a sword appeared. The extremely lonely Young Emperor appeared.","He held the True Sword in his hand, sending the few Yan Immortals surrounding Chen Qing flying with one strike, at the same time resolutely joining the battle.","Chen Qing, who was covered in blood, was pleasantly surprised. “Your Highness, why are you here?”","“If I didn’t come, wouldn’t you have died here?” the Young Emperor said solemnly.","The 30 plus Yan Immortals that had surrounded them quickly disappeared under the two of them’s battle.","Furthermore, there were very few Yan Immortals who had mastered the Immortal Style. Therefore, even though there were only the Young Emperor and Chen Qing, they were able to easily crush them.","When the last sword attack shattered the Immortal Source of a Yan Immortal, the Young Emperor rushed to the front of the Immortal Death Array Formation without stopping.","When he saw Jian Wushuang in the formation, he frowned.","“Young Emperor, I’ve tried to break this Immortal Array. I can’t break it at all...” Chen Qing wiped the divine blood off his face and said nervously. “I’m afraid that no one can break it apart from the one who has been following Brother Jian.”","The Young Emperor then said, “Go and invite him over immediately. Tell him that Wushuang is trapped and I will stay here to guard him.”","“No, Your Highness, you have to come with me. This place is too dangerous!” Chen Qing said anxiously.","“Hurry up and go!” he said in a deep voice, his words filled with irrefutable words.","Chen Qing had no choice but to leave quickly.","Then, the Young Emperor pulled out his flexible sword and stabbed it fiercely at the Immortal Death Array Formation in front of him.","However, the Immortal Formation did not move at all, as if it was not injured at all.","However, the Young Emperor did not seem to notice this scene. He only stabbed at the Immortal Array Formation again and again, trying to open a gap in it.","At the same time, in the Immortal Death Array Formation, Jian Wushuang had aged to the extreme. His Immortal Death Array Formation was covered in cracks.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal cackled and descended from the sky. He slowly walked to Jian Wushuang.","“Junior, this is the price you have to pay for provoking me!”","As he spoke, he slowly stretched out his well-defined palm and parted the black robe on his body from the middle, revealing the contents inside.","Under the black robe, it was not a full Immortal body, but a pale skeleton without any flesh and blood.","Around his skeleton, there was an uncountable amount of death energy, as well as fingernail-sized shiny stones.","Immediately, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal took out a shiny stone from his bosom and gradually approached Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang, who was already old and decrepit, regained his sharpness at this moment, like the sharpest True Sword.","It was as if a divine blade had descended into the world, and his unparalleled gaze forced him to retreat.","“No, how, how is that possible? Didn’t I already give you the Death Sentence?” The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was extremely shocked.","His white hair came back to life, and all the aging on his Immortal body disappeared in an instant. He turned back into the handsome young man.","His black waterfall-like hair was surging with incomparably majestic divine patterns, making him look like a god.","As Jian Wushuang spoke, he walked forward while the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal retreated step by step. His expression changed continuously.","“Do you think that just because your Immortal Death Array Formation can derive Heavenly Dao laws, it will be used on me?”","“Foolish! You dare to call yourself the Heavenly Dao?”","Time seemed to have frozen. The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal suddenly realized that he could not move. It was as if he was being suppressed by an even more ancient Heavenly Dao, making him unable to move at all.","Then, Jian Wushuang stretched out his palm and held his neck tightly, “I’ll let you see who is above the Heavenly Dao.”","The Immortal Death Array Formation began to shatter uncontrollably, and ravines and cracks covered the enchantment.","At the same time, an even more profound Heavenly Dao power descended!","The Immortal Death Array Formation that could control the Heavenly Dao suddenly shattered!","“No, no, I was wrong. Let me go. I won’t dare to call myself the Heavenly Dao anymore!” The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal was suppressed by that special energy until he could not move.","The aura of death that he had not felt for a long time made him panic and tremble. He had never felt that True Death was so close to him.","He also believed the fact that this young Yan Immortal had killed the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens, Chang Duoling.","“Now tell me, who is above the Heavenly Dao?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and his voice was like the punishment of the Heavenly Dao. It was filled with indescribable majesty.","The black-robed Grand Yan Immortal, whose neck was tightly gripped, had only fear left in his eyes. “My Lord, it’s you. You’re the one who’s truly above the Heavenly Dao!”"]},{"number":4900,"title":"Chapter 4900 The Immortal Array Formation Will Be Destroyed in the Six Heavens Realm","paragraphs":["4900 The Immortal Array Formation Will Be Destroyed in the Six Heavens Realm","Jian Wushuang shook his head slowly and said softly, “Unfortunately, I don’t want to be above the Heavenly Dao.”","He did not even make a sound. His entire skeleton Immortal body was devoured by the light and turned into dust!","A Grand Yan Immortal in the early stage had died in Jian Wushuang’s hands without any suspense.","Jian Wushuang took back his palm and let out a long breath. It seemed that he was still afraid of what had just happened.","He was almost certain that if he did not have an Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, he would definitely die this time.","A method that could derive the Heavenly Dao and make the Heavenly Dao for its own use was truly too terrifying.","If it was not for the fact that his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body had transcended the limits of the Heavenly Dao that the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal could control, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","Even if it was an ordinary Grand Yan Immortal, they would probably fall into his trap if they were not careful and turn into a pile of bones.","Putting aside such terrifying methods, the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal’s main body was actually quite weak. It was almost on a different level from Chang Duoling from before.","This was also why Jian Wushuang could easily destroy him after breaking through his Heavenly Dao binding.","Fortunately, he succeeded in the end.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang secretly decided that he would try his best not to be involved in this alone in the future.","At the same time, he became even more vigilant toward the Grand Yan Immortal. Indeed, those who could ascend to the Grand Yan Immortal realm were definitely not mediocre. It was fine if they did not attack, but when they attacked, they would definitely use a devastating killing move.","After killing the black-robed Grand Evolution Immortal, Jian Wushuang turned around and saw the Young Emperor in his black uniform.","He smiled wearily and cupped his hands. “Brother Jian.”","Jian Wushuang frowned and shot out a beam of Yan power light at him.","The Young Emperor did not dodge and stood on the spot.","The intense energy beam passed by him and blasted towards his back, directly crushing several Yan Immortals into dust.","“Be careful, the battle has just begun.” Jian Wushuang flew in front of him and said.","The Young Emperor nodded. “What’s the next step?”","Over there, there was an extremely powerful energy.","The battle, which was already at a disadvantage, fell into an extreme disadvantage with the opening of the first Heavenly Gate!","Roughly counting, there were close to 100 Yan Immortals who joined the battle once again. At the same time, there were countless top cultivators who walked out of the Immortal Array Formation and joined the battle!","Just one Immortal Array Formation was able to send out such a terrifying amount of energy. If four Immortal Array Formations were to be opened at the same time, this battle would probably have close to 1,000 Yan Immortals fighting!","“I will destroy the Immortal Array Formation. From now on, you will follow Di Qing and do not leave,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","However, the Young Emperor did not move. Instead, he held the sword in his hand horizontally. “Rather than following him, I might as well follow you.”","After he finished speaking, he raised his sword and flew towards the Armadillo Bull.","Jian Wushuang was helpless. He stopped and rushed to the first Immortal Array Formation.","Not long after they left, an illusory figure that fluctuated unevenly quietly condensed at the spot where the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal had disappeared.","...","An endless stream of Yan Immortals and peak cultivators walked out of the Immortal Array Formation. Looking at the chaotic void, they quickly joined the battle.","In such an unfair battle, even if one side had several more Yan Immortals, it would be a decisive victory.","If it was not for Di Qing’s protection, the 100-over Yan Immortals that Prince Qian brought would have been devoured long ago.","Right now, there were miraculously close to 60 plus Yan Immortals left, and the Yan Immortal army that had appeared with the Armadillo Bull had suffered heavy casualties. Almost half of the opposing Yan Immortals had died, leaving only over 100 of them.","However, after the Immortal Array Formation opened and the constant influx of Yan Immortals and peak cultivators, there was a subtle change.","Even Di Qing felt an inexplicable pressure.","He had withstood and protected the entire battlefield of the Six Heavens Realm alone. As long as he was defeated, the Six Heavens Realm behind him would instantly be devoured.","It had only been a few decades since his second True Life had fallen. Di Qing was still in a weakened state and it was already a little strenuous for him to resist the attacks of hundreds of Yan Immortals.","At the same time, he was still worried that the black-robed Grand Yan Immortal who had disappeared without a trace from the beginning would give him a thunderous blow.","However, he still gritted his teeth and endured, the remaining 60-plus Yan Immortal surrounded him, barely able to share some of the attacks.","Prince Qian, who had originally planned to hide, had also decided to join the battle after much consideration. He followed closely behind Di Qing, almost sticking onto his body.","Di Qing’s gaze was solemn as he looked ahead through the shattered void.","There, a sword-like figure with endless power broke through the void and rushed toward the first Immortal Array Formation!","The Armadillo Bull, which had been sleeping with its eyes closed, seemed to have sensed a threat. Its six huge eyes, which were like suns, opened and looked at the figure that had suddenly appeared.","A sound wave that could even shatter the void exploded. Armadillo Bull raised its unimaginably large head and opened its huge mouth to swallow Jian Wushuang.","Even the void dimmed under this bite, but Jian Wushuang did not dodge and was swallowed into its mouth resolutely.","In the next moment, thousands of beautiful lights suddenly shot out from the huge mouth of the Armadillo Bull.","A hint of doubt flashed in its six huge eyes, and then its mouth exploded.","The Armadillo Bull’s enormous head was also blasted away by the most magnificent beam of energy.","It was as if the Heavenly Region had fallen. It could not even make a sorrowful sound. Its entire head had completely turned into dust in the void.","Jian Wushuang looked back and continued to move forward.","With just one sword strike, it destroyed an Armadillo Bull that required over ten Yan Immortals to barely restrain. This was an unimaginable scene.","This shocking scene was taken in by the dozens of Yan Immortal experts. They all retreated in unison and joined the chaotic battle.","Jian Wushuang’s feet landed on Armadillo Bull’s back and he slowly exhaled a mouthful of turbid breath. In front of him was an Immortal Array Formation that was constantly exploding.","Countless Immortal patterns were flowing and dense. This was the most basic source to ensure the endurance of the Immortal Array Formation. It also provided provide the normal transmission of the Immortal Array Formation.","One could imagine how powerful it was to be able to transfer nearly 10,000 top cultivators.","Jian Wushuang stepped forward quickly. Facing the endless stream of top cultivators, he kicked them with great force.","“Where did you come from? Get lost!”"]}]);
